window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2201,"title":"Chapter 2201 Absolute Cold Garden!","paragraphs":["2201 Absolute Cold Garden!","At that point, Luo Lan paused and was silent for a moment before she said nostalgically, “Frankly, I haven’t been to the Absolute Cold Garden behind the palace in two and a half years, even though it’s only a 10-minute walk away. I do miss it!”","Sha Sha and Ni Xing both looked shocked when they heard what Luo Lan said.","They did not know if Luo Lan was reminiscing about the previous court or missing her father. Nonetheless, they could sense that something was off with Luo Lan. Really wrong!","Could she have given up on taking control of the situation? But this was not like her.","But if she had come up with a plan, they could not tell what it was despite spending every day by her side.","When they saw the relaxed expression on her face, neither of them could say anything. All they could do was allow themselves to be dragged to the Absolute Cold Garden.","The Iron Hammer Federation’s terrain was uneven. The area at the border of the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation was unkempt and barren. Only a few weeds were growing in the cracks of rocks and tiny patches of grass.","This was partly due to the geographical position but also because of the Divine Wood Federation.","Plants in the Iron Hammer Federation had to be rare in order for the imports from the Divine Wood Federation to fetch higher prices there.","It went without saying that the same went for metal resources in the Divine Wood Federation.","As a result, it was difficult for there to exist a garden in the Iron Hammer Federation that thrived all year round, much less in the Freezing Hammer Tribe, which was at the foot of Snow Celestial Mountain.","The Absolute Cold Garden was the most beautiful place in the Freezing Hammer Tribe and where Luo Lan played during her childhood.","A garden like this that even the disciples of veteran elite families had no access to was a mystical existence in the minds of the Iron Hammer Federation’s people. This was akin to how people from the north felt bothered by the snow, but people from the south were fascinated by it.","The Absolute Cold Garden could provide a conducive environment for plants to grow because there was a top-grade strange flame, the Spring Bedding Dawn Fire, there.","Amongst all of the top-grade strange flames, the Spring Bedding Dawn Fire was one of the rare ones that could facilitate the growth of plants and had healing abilities.","The Absolute Cold Garden’s construction began from the moment the Iron Hammer Federation’s imperial court obtained the Spring Bedding Dawn Fire.","Since then, more than 170 years had passed.","Normally, the Iron Hammer Federation was very short on resources.","Any ruler with burdens and a sense of responsibility would not try to build a place of enjoyment when resources were in such short supply.","There was a more important significance behind the Absolute Cold Garden’s existence, which was to use the Spring Bedding Dawn Fire to nurture a large amount of plant-type feys.","There was nothing rarer in the Iron Hammer Federation than plants. The main reason was that plants could not survive in such a cold climate.","But if the plant-type feys were contracted by spirit qi professionals, they would live in the spirit qi professionals’ spiritual spatial zone. This would solve most of their problems for survival.","There was no better breeder in nature than plants.","When plant-type feys had sufficient nutrients, they would reproduce after set periods of time.","After many years of hard work, the Iron Hammer Federation’s imperial court’s support of spirit qi professionals who were affiliated with plant-type feys finally paid off.","Alas, such a payoff was insignificant in consideration of the entire Iron Hammer Federation.","Moreover, Luo Cai’s series of despicable actions had damaged the Iron Hammer Federation’s fundamental profits. During the long winter, his actions had caused many spirit qi professionals affiliated with plant-type feys to die.","After all, the spirit qi professionals who were in charge of food production were the first to use up their spiritual power.","If the entire group was healthy, the spirit qi professionals’ lost spiritual power could be replenished.","But if the entire group was already at the end of their wicks, these spirit qi professionals would have no chance to recover and would become the weak links of the entire group.","Luo Lan had not felt much when she had been the First Princess of the Iron Hammer Federation.","But in the two weeks that she had occupied the throne, Luo Lan had come to fully understand the meaning of ‘a million things to do.’","If the entire Iron Hammer Federation could run like a well-oiled machine and all the tribes to be united in the same goal, Luo Lan was confident that prosperity would arise from millions of things to do. But that said, there was also the condition of the Iron Hammer Federation being able to smoothly trade resources with the Divine Wood Federation.","But Luo Lan had forgotten that after solving the issue of hunger, the issues of corruption and greed would rear their ugly heads.","Luo Lan had always been soft-hearted and rarely did things that could be called cruel.","Ever since she gave the order to kill her relatives from the Freezing Hammer Tribe, Luo Lan had been carrying a heavy burden on her shoulders.","The discomfort only started to subside a few days ago.","But now, in order to wipe out the poverty and destitution that ran rampant on the streets of the Iron Hammer Federation, Luo Lan decided to personally hand out the knives.","After making this decision, Luo Lan found peace and could start planning for further in the future. She started thinking about how the development would carry on after the Iron Hammer Federation was cleansed.","Sha Sha and Ni Xing were well aware of the urgent situation in the Iron Hammer Federation.","Sha Sha and Ni Xing used to be elites from Black Gold tribes and had learned all the tribes’ scheming ways.","But ever since they became Luo Lan’s attendants, their angle changed from that of the tribes to the entire federation.","Now, both of them felt a deep sense of responsibility. It was this sense of responsibility that led Luo Lan to pick them.","Sha Sha and Ni Xing shared a look before they turned to watch Luo Lan leisurely stroll through the Absolute Cold Garden.","Ni Xing, who always acted decisively, spoke resolutely. “Your Majesty, you are the only one who can find a way to help the Iron Hammer Federation out of its crisis. You had a discussion with the six of us. No Black Gold tribe would have a legitimate reason for stepping in. The Platinum tribes that have become arrogant after all the fighting are showing clear signs of wanting to break free from the Black Gold tribes’ control. You—”","Before Ni Xing could finish speaking, Luo Lan waved her hands and said, “I already said that the issue will be solved without a hitch in the next few days. For the past two weeks, I’ve asked you to keep watch of the changes to Snow Celestial Mountain and record them all down. Bring these records to me now.”","Ni Xing bit her lip at Luo Lan’s change of topic. A moment later, she bowed to Luo Lan and left to fetch the information on Snow Celestial Mountain.","Sha Sha was not as brave as Ni Xing, but she was more introspective. She could sense a deeper meaning behind Luo Lan’s words."]},{"number":2202,"title":"Chapter 2202 Fly Into a Rage?","paragraphs":["2202 Fly Into a Rage?","The most prominent sight in the Freezing Hammer Tribe was Snow Celestial Mountain.","In fact, the main palace faced the Snow Celestial Mountain, and the snow-capped mountain could be faintly seen from the entrance of the palace.","Sha Sha had never heard of someone paying attention to the changes that happened on Snow Celestial Mountain.","It could be understandable if Luo Lan just asked someone to note the changes once a day. But Luo Lan had asked them to record the changes hourly. This is very unusual.","Suddenly, a thought struck Sha Sha’s mind.","After Luo Lan became ruler of the Iron Hammer Federation, she asked every tribe to worship a statue of that mystical young man.","If some tribes voiced that they wanted to worship her, Luo Lan would state that the statue of her had to be smaller and positioned below the one of the young man.","In the past, only the statue of the celestial being on Snow Celestial Mountain was permitted to be positioned above the statue of the ruler of the imperial court. But both had to be the same size.","But under Luo Lan’s rule, the statue of the young man not only sat above the one above that of the celestial being but was even larger.","This meant that Luo Lan wanted to change the object of the Iron Hammer Federation’s faith.","Since the young man had rescued all of them, the Iron Hammer Federation’s tribe members were very accepting of this change.","Luo Lan’s order was carried out smoothly.","Sha Sha took time every day to pray to the statue of the young man.","At first, she had not thought much of it. But now, taking into consideration what was happening in the Iron Hammer Federation, they were essentially committing blasphemy against the celestial being on Snow Celestial Mountain.","There was no way that Luo Lan was paying attention to the changes to Snow Celestial Mountain to plead for help from the celestial being. A more likely reason was that she feared punishment coming from the celestial being.","Luo Lan was not the type to lose heart in the face of challenges.","The change in her demeanor was likely due to her decision to let the young man who the entire Iron Hammer Federation was worshiping now step in and handle the situation.","With that thought, Sha Sha relaxed slightly.","She did not know Lin Yuan well, but she knew he possessed a lot of power.","Power was the only way to quell chaos.","Soon, Ni Xing returned to the Absolute Cold Garden with a thick booklet in her hands.","Luo Lan had asked for detailed reports on the situation in Snow Celestial Mountain and said that the more thorough the information was, the better.","As a result, the attendants in charge of the recording had paid extra attention.","One reason for this was that the attendants wanted to leave a good impression on this new ruler of the imperial court. If Luo Lan found them to be incompetent, their chances of being promoted in the future would be dashed.","Luo Lan would definitely follow up on a task she had given out personally.","Another reason was that the attendants believed that the change in the Iron Hammer Federation’s object of faith would draw out a reaction from Snow Celestial Mountain.","After all, the attendants had heard Snow Celestial Mountain’s legends ever since they were children.","Ni Xing handed the thick booklet to Luo Lan and said, “The attendants who did the recording are much too detailed. They recorded the hourly wind direction, the size of snowflakes, and the direction that the snow peak was leaning in. A single day’s records take up a full 30 sheets of paper. For your convenience, I made some markings of the important content.”","When Ni Xing handed the booklet to Luo Lan, she noticed that Sha Sha’s looked more relaxed than she previously did.","Ni Xing was shocked by this. She did not know what had transpired in the short 20 minutes that she had been absent.","But out of respect, Ni Xing could not ask Sha Sha about it now when they were right in front of Luo Lan and her imposing authority.","Luo Lan received the booklet from Ni Xing and sat down on a stone bench before she started to flip through the records.","Previously, Luo Lan had been focused on the Iron Hammer Federation’s development and management. Thus, this was the first time that she was reading the records.","All she had done was tell Ni Xing to report to her if there were any unusual occurrences.","Since she had not received any reports from Ni Xing about Snow Celestial Mountain, Luo Lan had not expected anything from the booklet to catch her eye.","Luo Lan knew that Lin Yuan was about to arrive at any moment.","Lin Yuan had a clear interest in Snow Celestial Mountain and was only coming to the Iron Hammer Federation because of Snow Celestial Mountain.","Thus, Luo Lan decided to familiarize herself with Snow Celestial Mountain’s situation before Lin Yuan arrived so she could answer whatever questions he had.","As such, Luo Lan started to read through the entire report rather than just the parts that Ni Xing had marked out.","When they saw Luo Lan immersing herself in the booklet, Ni Xing and Sha Sha stood next to her silently for fear of disturbing her.","When she reached the middle of the booklet, Luo Lan’s brows slowly knitted into a frown.","There was a sea of information about Snow Celestial Mountain recorded in the booklet, but the parts that Ni Xing had marked out were trivial pieces, such as the wind speed and size of snowflakes. She had completely ignored the recording attendants’ notes that they could clearly feel themselves getting increasingly colder.","Most of the Iron Hammer Federation was blanketed in snow, even during summer. Thus, there was no habit of recording one’s own temperature.","All of the attendants were in the pink of health and wearing the same clothes throughout. Yet, they could clearly feel themselves getting colder.","This meant that the temperature around Snow Celestial Mountain was dropping.","Although very few people paid attention to Snow Celestial Mountain in the past, no experts had ever reported temperatures dropping while they were hunting for resources nearby Snow Celestial Mountain.","The more of the booklet Luo Lan read, the deeper her frown became.","The two attendants today observing Snow Celestial Mountain and recording the changes stated that their hands and feet had suffered different degrees of frostbite.","Both of these attendants were pinnacle king-class experts, and temperatures had to be sub-60 degrees to result in them suffering frostbite.","Given the abrupt drop in temperatures around Snow Celestial Mountain, Luo Lan could be certain that the celestial being on Snow Celestial Mountain had flown into a rage."]},{"number":2203,"title":"Chapter 2203 Solution!","paragraphs":["2203 Solution!","In the past, Luo Lan had revered and put her faith in the celestial being on Snow Celestial Mountain. As the First Princess of the Iron Hammer Federation, she had stuck close to the tradition of worshipping Snow Celestial Mountain’s celestial being.","But as strong as her faith had been, she became just as disappointed and angry when her father died, and the Iron Hammer Federation fell to ruin.","All of her disappointment and rage soon morphed into hatred and disrespect.","Furthermore, when her previous faith had plummeted to the lowest depths, she found a new belief in the Astronomical Parliament.","Thus, the Luo Lan of today was no longer afraid of angering Snow Celestial Mountain’s celestial being.","Rather, she hoped that Lin Yuan could get rid of the legend once and for all.","As a member of the Iron Hammer Federation’s royal family, Luo Lan only placed her faith in and respected whatever could protect her and the entire Iron Hammer Federation, not a celestial being that basked in being worshipped but did not lift a single finger when it was needed.","Luo Lan closed the booklet and handed it back to Ni Xing as she said, “Ni Xing, I was willing to leave the task in your hands because I trust you. I hope you understand this. No matter the reason, you should do your best after receiving an order from me. I hope you won’t disappoint me again next time!”","Ni Xing froze, and her body slumped.","Through their interactions, Ni Xing knew what kind of person Luo Lan was and what character she had.","Once Luo Lan felt that she was incompetent and lacked effort when performing her assignments, she would soon be eliminated as one of Luo Lan’s close aides.","She had been picked to be one of Luo Lan’s close aides because of Sha Sha and Qi Si.","Qi Si had been negligent when carrying out an order from Luo Lan. As a result, she had not only failed to become one of Luo Lan’s close aides but had been kicked out of the six-person group completely.","Ni Xing was terrified that she would end up with the same fate.","However, she did not think that she had done anything wrong or been negligent in any way.","Could it be that Luo Lan had gleaned something from the information in the booklet?","While Ni Xing was thinking, Luo Lan said, “Go to the treasure vault and take out two high-grade strange flames that are stored within the Spirit Crystal Gold. The observers will need them to keep warm!”","Luo Lan stood up from the stone bench and elegantly brushed her skirt off before walking off in the direction of her bedroom.","She was going to inform Lin Yuan of the temperature abnormality surrounding Snow Celestial Mountain.","After Luo Lan left, Ni Xing could not help but place a hand over her heart. All she could hear was the rapid beating of that organ hidden deep in her chest. Her heart rate had to have reached 140 beats per minute, at least.","Luo Lan had only given her instructions but said nothing else. This meant that Luo Lan had no intention of punishing her for this failure.","But if such a thing happened again, she could not say for sure what the consequence would be.","While Ni Xing was studying the booklet, Sha Sha leaned her head over.","Ni Xing could not help but sigh. “These people who recorded the information are horrible! They write over 1,000 words of content for each hour so that it turns more into a report! How am I supposed to wade through all this to grasp the key points? The fights between the Platinum tribes have captured all of my attention of late.”","While Sha Sha was reading the booklet, she managed to pick up what the issue was.","She sighed deeply. The issue that Ni XIng had missed was by no means small!","“Ni Xing, you should be glad that you’ve been focused on the reports coming in from the Platinum tribes. Otherwise, Her Majesty would never have forgiven you so easily for such a huge mistake!","“Quickly, go and fetch the two strange flames! We have redirected our faith. The fight that is about to ensue might lead to a new legend for this era of the Iron Hammer Federation!","“You, me, and the rest of the citizens of the Iron Hammer Federation will be witnesses to the creation of this new legend.”","Ni Xing was from an elite family and had received the best education. Thus, she had always been proud.","But at the same time, she always knew that Sha Sha had better foresight and was more capable of looking at the larger picture. This was why Ni Xing was willing to listen to her despite her prideful disposition.","A thought suddenly came to Ni Xing’s mind, and her breath hitched.","Next, she asked the question that she most wanted to know the answer to, “Sister Sha Sha, when I returned, I saw that you were much more relieved. Has Her Majesty come up with a solution?”","Sha Sha had no immediate reply to Ni Xing’s question because Luo Lan had not outlined a clear solution.","All that Sha Sha had now were guesses. Hence she could only reply hesitantly to Ni Xing, “Do you remember the person who stood next to Her Majesty during that period of starvation? The one who killed the sinner with one casual attack?”","Sha Sha felt that with Ni Xing’s comprehension skill, she would be able to read between the lines of what she was saying.","Ni Xing’s expression changed drastically when she heard what Sha Sha said.","Eventually, her expression morphed into a mixture of 1/5 delight, 1/5 hope, and 3/5 surprise.","This was such a radiant expression that Sha Sha could not help but avert her gaze.","Ni Xing remembered Luo Lan’s order and rushed off from the Absolute Cold Garden.","Sha Sha thought back to the changes to Ni Xing’s expression as well as that flash of crimson. She instantly realized what was running through Ni Xing’s mind.","The young man who stood next to Luo Lan had been outstanding and a beacon of hope. He had saved them all and provided them with new life while they were wilting away from despair and starvation.","All of the girls in the Iron Hammer Federation who were of age felt at least slightly the same way that Ni Xing did. Even Sha Sha could not say that she was the exception.","But Sha Sha felt that she was better than Ni Xing at controlling her emotions.","By the time Lin Yuan received the news from Luo Lan, he was only an hour away from the Freezing Hammer Tribe.","In his previous life, he had lived in the north when he was a child, but his parents had relocated to Hangzhou before he was even ten years old.","He had an impression of what a landscape of ice and snow looked like, but the image was not vivid.","In this life, he had been born in the Xia Region’s Redbud City, which was in a warm climate close to the sea. Not a single snowflake fell in Redbud City the entire year.","Thus, Lin Yuan still felt fascinated when he saw snow, bringing him back to the early childhood days of his previous life.","Lin Yuan felt a burst of sentiment.","On the Thoughts Letter Paper, he wrote back to Luo Lan with his estimated time of arrival.","Lin Yuan turned to look behind Blackie, at the stones bare of snow and could not help but gasp."]},{"number":2204,"title":"Chapter 2204 Eternal Weapon One!","paragraphs":["2204 Eternal Weapon One!","“Big Brother Liu, your Ice Bite should be able to handle thousands of troops in a battle on snowy terrain with ease.”","Liu Jie smiled and replied humbly, “In order for Ice Bite to unleash its full power, it needs some time to get its engine running. Otherwise, it won’t be able to reach the scale you’re seeing now.”","Su Yiren’s lips twitched.","Back when she was in the Seven States of Darkness, she never thought that there could be so many members of the younger generation who could match up to her.","Her grandmother had been a Class 5 Creation Master, and with her background, she had free use of the Dark Continent’s resources.","But ever since she joined Lin Yuan, she noticed that the talent and power she had always been proud of did not count for much.","Lin Yuan and Liu Jie had surpassed her. Even Wen Yu, with her talent for governance and the strategic significance of her Elemental Paper, was standing at the peak that most geniuses could never hope to reach.","Su Yiren felt that all geniuses should be proud and arrogant. But Liu Jie and Lin Yuan could not be more down to earth.","“As long as there is snow and ice, it will take less than five seconds for Ice Bite’s engine to warm up. As long as some snow and ice is preserved, there is no way even thousands of troops will stand a chance. Plus, Ice Bite is just one of your many insect-species carcinoma feys that have transformed into fairies. The rest of them aren’t shabby either.”","Su Yiren remembered the capture-the-flag games that were trendy in the Dark Continent.","This version of capture-the-flag needed at least eight participants. There was no maximum number of players.","One of the players could draw the Boss card, while the rest only had player cards.","Liu Jie was currently progressing like how the Boss player would.","Before witnessing this for herself, Su Yiren had never imagined such progression.","Liu Jie smiled gently and said, “Yiren, you don’t have to belittle yourself. If I get close to you, I will immediately fall under the spell of your Absolute Love Poppy and become your puppet. I won’t have any chance of unleashing my power.”","While Liu Jie was speaking, he had no idea what was going through Su Yiren’s mind. If he did know, he would immediately correct her way of thinking.","If anyone had drawn the Boss card, it would be Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan did not like to show off, so not even Liu Jie knew the full extent of his feys’ abilities.","But only those who were trying to chase after Lin Yuan knew how impossible it was just trying to catch up with him.","After receiving Lin Yuan’s reply, Luo Lan immediately changed her clothes and went through the special tunnel to fetch Lin Yuan and his group.","Frankly, Luo Lan wanted to hold a parade and sound all the sirens to welcome Lin Yuan.","This was not only Luo Lan’s selfish desires.","But Lin Yuan made it clear in his message on the Thoughts Letter Paper that he wanted to keep a low profile and cause as little of a stir as possible.","The icy wind was bracing, and the cold from Snow Celestial Mountain caused many people from the Freezing Hammer Tribe to unknowingly wear more layers than usual.","Many families who were more affluent started searching for tailors to add down feathers, wool, and animal skin to their clothes. Some of them even made new cold-weather clothes.","As a result, many tailors ended up overwhelmed with work.","The people from the Freezing Hammer Tribe did not think much of these changes.","Lin Yuan could already see signs of the Freezing Hammer Tribe in the distance as well as the towering Snow Celestial Mountain that stood behind the Freezing Hammer Tribe.","Lin Yuan thought, This should be the spot to do what Luo Lan mentioned in the Thoughts Letter Paper about killing the rotting elites who are holding the tribes’ growth back.","If the Astronomical Parliament was a traditional cultivation game, Lin Yuan would have already successfully brought up and transformed the previously fallen princess Luo Lan into a legitimate queen.","Luo Lan had stated a location in the message on the Thoughts Letter Paper and Blackie flew to that exact spot.","When Lin Yuan, Su Yiren, and Liu Jie’s feet hit the ground, they saw Luo Lan, who had passed through the tunnel.","Su Yiren frowned slightly when she saw that.","“Luo Lan, you might have become the ruler of the imperial court, but your throne would still be shaking if you didn’t have Lin Yuan’s help! What you should do now is to pay attention to your safety! What if someone found out that you came alone and tried to assassinate you?”","Luo Lan was shocked when she heard what Su Yiren said.","It was true that she had been overjoyed with the knowledge of Lin Yuan’s arrival, but she also had her own frustration of not having any experts by her side who she could trust wholeheartedly.","All of the leaders of Black Gold tribes supported her, but there was no way she could place her full trust in them.","The crisis had come about from her father trusting Luo Cai too easily.","Her past experience caused Luo Lan to be on guard.","When Lin Yuan saw the bitter smile on Luo Lan’s face, he could guess the reason behind it.","Red Thorn had grown a new Tongue of Relinquish that Lin Yuan had already used to take control of one of the Truth Association’s experts.","This expert had reached Eternal power, and his main fey was a defense-type fey that had reached advanced Eternal.","This expert had been killed by the Goddess of Mercy.","All of the Truth Association’s experts who the Goddess of Mercy had killed had utterly broken bodies. This expert was the only one with a relatively more complete corpse that the Tongue of Relinquish could release scars into and take control of.","Di Wanmi was a Creation Master, and Lin Yuan had not given her a number.","But Lin Yuan intended on giving numbers to the combat line of experts Red Thorn had taken control of.","This expert from the Truth Association would be Eternal Weapon One.","Since Lin Yuan had Begin Lady, Eternal Weapon One would not have great importance to Lin Yuan.","As the Red Thorn’s Tongue of Relinquish regrew, the second, third, fourth, and fifth places could make up for the potential loss of Eternal Weapon One.","Lin Yuan decided to place Eternal Weapon One by Luo Lan’s side to protect her.","By protecting her, the foundation of the entire Iron Hammer Federation and one of the pillars of the Startling Lines Continent would be safeguarded.","Just as Lin Yuan made his decision, Luo Lan felt exceptionally bitter.","Compared to Jin Qianxun and Yi Huailong, she had spent the longest time with Lin Yuan. She was even a member of the Astronomical Parliament, meaning that she had an advantage over Yi Huailong and Jin Qianxun. She also had more of Lin Yuan’s trust than they did.","But compared to both of them, she had a shortcoming that could not be overlooked."]},{"number":2205,"title":"Chapter 2205 Population Number Limit!","paragraphs":["2205 Population Number Limit!","This shortcoming was that she lacked the strong power that Jin Qianxun and Yi Huailong had.","Lin Yuan was one of the reasons for Jin Qianxun and Yi Huailong being able to sit securely on the thrones of their respective federations. Another reason was that both of them had the power to back it up.","But the only thing she could rely on was Lin Yuan’s help. Once she was apart from him, she would not even have the confidence to protect herself.","This was a source of anxiousness for Luo Lan.","With Luo Lan’s pride, there was no way she could make the first move to ask Lin Yuan to give her an expert who could remain in the Iron Hammer Federation to protect her.","At that moment, Lin Yuan gently waved his hand,, and a thin figure dressed in white robes with gold patterns and blue clouds appeared.","This figure was wearing a large hood that covered almost his entire face. There was the rune of a sharp sword drawn on the hood.","Luo Lan felt that there was an aura of magnificence coming from this attire.","At that moment, Lin Yuan said, “Luo Lan, I didn’t consider every angle. From now on, Eternal Weapon One will stay here to protect you. If you need any martial force, you can let Eternal Weapon One know. He will do all that he can to the best of his abilities!”","When Luo Lan heard Lin Yuan say that this figure who he had suddenly summoned was going to stay here to protect her, she felt a burst of delight that soon morphed into shock.","Eternal Weapon One?","As the First Princess of the Iron Hammer Federation, her father had mentioned to her before that there was a level above Immortal. However, not even he knew the name of that level.","When Luo Cai was hunting her, in order to make her lose hope and sink into despair, he had revealed to her that the name for the level above Immortal was Eternal.","When she joined Lin Yuan, Luo Lan came to fully understand what power beyond Immortal was like. She finally had a clear idea of what Eternal power meant.","There was no doubt that Lin Yuan’s subordinate had Eternal power.","Lin Yuan said that he would be leaving Eternal Weapon One with her. Was Lin Yuan really going to assign an Eternal expert to guard her?","More importantly, she could even order the Eternal expert around while he was protecting her.","If Lin Yuan had placed such a powerful figure by her side earlier on, she would not have been so troubled by the Iron Hammer Federation’s current circumstances.","Previously, Lin Yuan had sent a figure cloaked in black to receive her.","Luo Lan clearly remembered that the black-cloaked figure had been called a thearch-class weapon and indeed had possessed therach-class power.","Luo Lan was slightly speechless. After all, Lin Yuan had given her a gift immediately after they met!","It would clearly be too shallow just to say thanks.","Given how generous Lin Yuan was to Luo Lan, it was likely that he would do the same for Su Yiren once she started recovering the Dark Continent!","Lin Yuan’s actions showed how much he cared for the members of the Astronomical Parliament.","This treatment was comparable to Yi Huailong and Jin Qianxun’s benefits.","The Insect Queen’s voice appeared in Liu Jie’s mind,","“Master, because of the limited snow, Ice Bite has reached the maximum population number. It cannot grow its army anymore. Please give the order to use up some of the mature Polar Region Frost Pupas.”","Liu Jie immediately said, “Lin Yuan, the best way to settle the fighting Platinum tribes is to use Ice Bite’s army of insects to stop them. On our way here, we have taken control of a total of 31 tribes. But this is just one aspect. If the other aspects aren’t controlled soon, some problems might arise.”","When Liu Jie was in the Divine Wood Federation, he heard that the tribes had united during the Iron Hammer Federation’s time of crisis.","But the truth was that the tribes were just as bloodthirsty and merciless when they fought with each other over profits.","Liu Jie knew that the Iron Hammer Federation was on the weak side.","When two Platinum tribes fought, it always ended in one of the tribes being exterminated.","Given the situation, every minute in advance that the fighting could be stopped could save thousands of lives.","Lin Yuan did not react immediately after hearing what Liu Jie said. Rather, he cast his gaze at Luo Lan.","Luo Lan was the ruler of the Iron Hammer Federation, and this could be considered the Iron Hammer Federation’s personal matter. This was not part of the deal between Lin Yuan and Luo Lan.","Hence, Lin Yuan needed to seek her opinion on what to do. This was also Lin Yuan’s way of respecting her.","When Luo Lan saw Lin Yuan looking at her, she said with sincerity, “Young Master, for now, I have no means of handling the situation in the Iron Hammer Federation. Since I’m so helpless, I could only wait for you to step in and help me. Big Brother Liu, please help to stop the fighting between the tribes and preserve the Iron Hammer Federation’s experts.”","Liu Jie gently lifted his hand toward Luo Lan and gave an order to Ice Bite through the Insect Queen.","The weather was freezing, yet Luo Lan could feel the snow around her halting.","A wave of white was rushing over from a distance.","Soon, the wave of white split off into numerous streams of white that traveled in different directions. They were almost like a disciplined army that a general had organized.","After some movement from the streams of white, the stone beneath was uncovered.","All Luo Lan did was blink, and she noticed that the sea of white actually consisted of translucent insects.","After living in the Freezing Hammer Tribe for so many years, regardless of the winter or summer season, this was the first time that Luo Lan saw the bare ground.","Liu Jie’s action went beyond Luo Lan’s understanding. It also gave her more assurance.","From the speed at which the white streams of insects flowed, Luo Lan estimated that all of the fightings in the Iron Hammer Federation would be eliminated within three days.","Luo Lan had always been passionate. She thought that as long as she was diligent and did her best, she would be able to achieve most things.","But now, she finally knew that power was the stepping stone to reaching all goals.","Luo Lan bowed to Liu Jie in gratitude before she hurriedly said."]},{"number":2206,"title":"Chapter 2206 Lin Yuan’s Support!","paragraphs":["2206 Lin Yuan’s Support!","“Young Master, Big Brother Liu, and Yiren, it must have been difficult rushing all this way. Why don’t you come with me to take a rest in the imperial court?","“Although resources are tight in the Iron Hammer Federation during winter, we have our fair share of delicacies. The dairy products from the Iron Hammer Federation have always stood above those from the Divine Wood Federation and Great Lush Federation.","“The veteran elite families from the Divine Wood Federation and secret aristocratic families from the Great Lush Federation always go crazy for our dairy products. The really outstanding dairy products come from the Ice-Stepping Snow Alpaca’s milk. It is frozen under thick ice for many years in order to produce that fragrant taste.","“I know that you might have eaten dairy products exported from the Iron Hammer Federation in the Divine Wood Federation and Great Lush Federation. But the dairy products made from the Ice-Stepping Snow Alpaca’s milk have never been exported.”","Luo Lan’s tone was friendly and earnest.","The Iron Hammer Federation had already passed through a trial and cut off all of its rotting parts.","It could be said that the dairy products from the Ice-Stepping Snow Alpaca were the most precious food items produced in the Iron Hammer Federation.","During winter, the Iron Hammer Federation did not have thriving resources like the Great Lush Federation and Divine Wood Federation did. As such, they had to be very careful when it came to food.","But when receiving guests like Lin Yuan, what mattered was not what was being eaten but the intentions behind the sentiment.","What she wanted was for Lin Yuan to see her sincerity.","Su Yiren’s heart ached when she heard what Luo Lan said.","“Sister Luo Lan, Listen has already planned out the new routes for the chambers of commerce. Young Master has adjusted the Great Lush Federation’s trade role. In the future, the movement of resources between the three federations will be managed by Listen.","“During winter next year, the Iron Hammer Federation will have just as much and whatever that the Divine Wood Federation and Great Lush Federation has.”","Lin Yuan had made a promise to Luo Lan long ago. But Luo Lan never expected Lin Yuan to fulfill his promise so quickly. This speed was astonishing!","In less than a year, all of the trading routes within the Startling Lines Continent would be smoothened, and all of the resources would be reorganized.","Luo Lan had not spent much time with Listen previously.","But the fact that he could achieve so much during the past year was proof that he was a talented individual worth investing in.","It would not be long before Lin Yuan and Liu Jie settled the situation in the Iron Hammer Federation.","From now on, the Iron Hammer Federation’s biggest issue of lacking resources would be solved.","Without Luo Lan doing anything, the Iron Hammer Federation would start to develop rapidly.","As they walked through the tunnel and headed toward the imperial court, Luo Lan was filled with gladness but also had not forgotten to report everything that she needed to report to Lin Yuan.","“Young Master, I have instructed people to observe Snow Celestial Mountain. It seems as though nothing special is happening, but the temperature has been dropping. I’m sure whatever is on the mountain has not been idle. Why don’t you stay in the Iron Hammer Federation’s imperial court for some time so you can be prepared when that being makes itself known?”","He did not want to waste time in the Iron Hammer Federation.","If Snow Celestial Mountain was not recorded in the Annal of Monster Information, Lin Yuan would not have traveled across half of the Startling Lines Continent to see Luo Lan.","He had already spent almost four months in the Startling Lines Continent.","The Radiance Envoy selection and Major Federation Meeting were about to begin.","During this time, Lin Yuan not only had to build Sky City atop Universe but also had to make a name for himself in the marsh world.","Thus, Lin Yuan needed to settle the issues in front of him quickly.","If he did not rush to the Marsh East Circle in the marsh world within a week, he would not make it in time for the Major Federation Meeting!","If Lin Yuan was lacking in power, the best thing to do would be to hide in the shadows to address the issue.","But now that Luo Lan had sufficient power, he could squash the problem instantly. This was the dominance that one needed to have when dealing with problems!","“After Liu Jie takes control of the fighting tribes, all of the ice on Snow Celestial Mountain will be eaten. The being on Snow Celestial Mountain won’t be able to hide. I won’t be staying in the Iron Hammer Federation for long. At most, I’ll only be here for a week.”","Luo Lan felt herself deflate when she heard Lin Yuan say this. But before her disappointment surfaced in her expression, Lin Yuan said, “During this week, I’ll provide you with more beneficial resources that you can use to develop the Iron Hammer Federation.","“As the ruler of the Iron Hammer Federation, you are its core. You have to build a network of power with yourself at the center. This network has to reach every corner of the Iron Hammer Federation. This way, you’ll truly be able to transform into the Iron Hammer Federation’s will.”","Luo Lan listened seriously to what Lin Yuan said and carefully contemplated his words.","Soon, she realized he was saying she needed to take real control of the Iron Hammer Federation.","Although she had Eternal Weapon One protecting her, she could not leave all problems to him. Otherwise, she would be no different from Luo Cai.","She needed to nurture some people from her federation into experts who were fully loyal to her. This was the only way she would be able to truly improve the Iron Hammer Federation’s overall combat power.","The culture of the Iron Hammer Federation had always been each individual only caring about themselves and not getting involved with others.","The Black Gold tribes had been providing the Freezing Hammer Tribe with less and less in recent years.","Due to the instability in the Freezing Hammer Tribe, they did not even have a single Class 4 Creation Master.","Knowing this, Luo Lan had never thought about this aspect. But now, Lin Yuan, the good samaritan, was carrying things through to the end.","He not only helped her to take back the throne of the Iron Hammer Federation but was even helping her to settle the conflict in the Iron Hammer Federation.","He not only provided her with martial force that she could depend on but was also sincere in his efforts to help her nurture her people.","There was actually no need for Lin Yuan to do all this.","According to the agreement, everything, including the Iron Hammer Federation, would belong to Lin Yuan once he helped her take the throne of the Iron Hammer Federation and set up all of the Iron Hammer Federation’s trading routes.","Luo Lan was extremely grateful to Lin Yuan and decided to heartily welcome him in the Absolute Cold Garden.","Luo Lan felt that the Absolute Cold Garden was the only place in the Iron Hammer Federation’s imperial court that was presentable.","Luo Lan did not intend to keep Lin Yuan from Sha Sha, Ni Xing, and the other four. She also did not plan on hiding him from the other servants of the imperial court.","Every tribe member of the Iron Hammer Federation knew that she was under Lin Yuan’s protection. Lin Yuan had also become the new object of the Iron Hammer Federation’s faith. There was nothing strange about him appearing in the imperial court."]},{"number":2207,"title":"Chapter 2207 Expanded Garden!","paragraphs":["2207 Expanded Garden!","All of the attendants in the Iron Hammer Federation, including Ni Xing, Sha Sha, and the rest, had been picked from the Black Gold and Platinum tribes.","These people could spread the news of Lin Yuan’s arrival.","Before the eight major Black Gold tribes boosted her bid for the throne, they always supported her.","But before Lin Yuan gave his help, Luo Lan had gone to seek help from them. All of them had used various reasons to reject them in the most courteous way possible.","The eight major Black Gold tribes knew that Luo Lan was lacking resources and that she had solved the hunger issue. Yet, the provisions they supplied were much lesser than in previous years.","This indicated that all of them had their own ploys in mind. They might not aim to rob her of her position. Rather they did not want her to possess too much power so it would be easier for them to control her.","Luo Lan was well aware of this. But as the ruler of the imperial court, if she could not control all the factions in the federation stringently and was weaker than them, she would not be able to achieve anything significant.","“Young Master, it is just as you said. I will do my best to become the will of the Iron Hammer Federation and serve you!”","Lin Yuan raised an eyebrow.","He had never requested any achievement from her. As long as the Iron Hammer Federation could progress steadily alongside the Divine Wood Federation and Great Lush Federation, the entire Startling Lines Continent would become increasingly stronger, and this would be the biggest help to Lin Yuan.","When he arrived at the imperial court, Lin Yuan saw six uniform-wearing attendants standing at the entrance of the imperial court. It was clear that they were here to greet him and his group.","From the moment that Ni Xing, Sha Sha, and the rest saw Lin Yuan, they found it impossible to drag their gaze away from Lin Yuan.","This was the second time that the six of them were seeing this god-like young man.","He had a calm expression, and a small smile was playing on his lips, giving him a natural and friendly demeanor.","He did not feel distant at all.","Luo Lan gave out instructions. “Go and set up a banquet in the Absolute Cold Garden and bring out all of the remaining dairy products made of the Ice-Stepping Snow Alpaca’s milk.”","Sha Sha, Ni Xing, and the rest hurriedly pulled their gazes away from Lin Yuan and headed to the Absolute Cold Garden to begin preparations.","When Su Yiren heard Luo Lan mention the dairy products made of the Ice-Stepping Snow Alpaca’s milk, she could not help but ask curiously, “Luo Lan, back when I was in the Dark Continent, I heard that the Ice-Stepping Snow Alpaca’s milk is the most valuable produce to come from the Iron Hammer Federation. I heard that the royal family has all of the Creation Breed Ice-Stepping Snow Alpacas. You must have as much of the Ice-Stepping Snow Alpaca’s milk as you want, right?”","Luo Lan smiled bitterly before saying in a slightly deadpan voice, “It is true that the Luo family owns all of the Ice-Stepping Snow Alpacas. My great-grandfather discovered it on Snow Celestial Mountain.","“It is precious because it contains water-, ice,- and wind-elemental energy. It has to live in a harsh climate like Snow Celestial Mountain when it’s young. Thus, the fluids from the female Ice-Stepping Snow Alpaca contain a large amount of these three types of elemental energy. The three types of elemental energy is the main reason for the flavor of the dairy products.","“Luo Cai offered the Ice-Stepping Snow Alpacas to the Truth Association’s envoy when he became their lapdog. The Truth Association’s envoy roasted the Ice-Stepping Snow Alpacas. As a result, there are only four child Ice-Stepping Snow Alpacas left. It will take at least 20 years before they grow up and become able to produce milk. So after this meal, it will be more than 20 years before more dairy products will be produced from the Ice-Stepping Snow Alpaca’s milk.”","At first, Luo Lan had not intended to reveal this. Saying this sounded too self-sacrificial.","But since Su Yiren had asked her, Luo Lan did not mind explaining.","As he walked to the Absolute Cold Garden, Lin Yuan immediately sensed a warm energy that could stimulate the growth of plants.","Lin Yuan looked around and was immediately attracted by the Spring Bedding Dawn Fire above the garden.","The Spring Bedding Dawn Fire could not match up to the top-grade Red Plum Falling Fire that Zong Ze had specially nurtured in terms of combat. But when it came to appearance and price, the Spring Bedding Dawn Fire was above the Red Plum Falling Fire.","Only an outstanding item like this could create a flowering garden in such a frigid environment.","But as rare of an existence as the Absolute Cold Garden was, the plant-type feys growing in it were not overly valuable.","This was similar to how there were not many overly valuable metal spiritual ingredients in the Divine Wood Federation.","The Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation had always held back when they traded plant-type feys.","Most of the plant-type feys in Absolute Cold Garden were obtained from the Iron Hammer Federation’s official robber groups.","It would take some time for the banquet to be set up.","But Lin Yuan had a large number of precious plant-type feys in both the spatial ring and the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Lin Yuan already had a large store of feys, even more so now that he had obtained all of Fifth Page Truth’s possessions.","At first, Luo Lan wanted to give Lin Yuan a tour of the Absolute Cold Garden. After all, Luo Lan’s impression was that the Absolute Cold Garden was one of the Iron Hammer Federation’s imperial court’s most important assets.","But before Luo Lan could say anything, she heard Lin Yuan’s pleasant voice say, “There is still some time before the meal begins. Why don’t you call some more people over and give the Absolute Cold Garden a makeover?","“The Spring Bedding Dawn Fire is a top-grade strange flame, and its effects can easily reach over 50,000 square meters. Although the effects will be weaker at the borders of this area, the plants that are more resistant to the cold will still be able to grow healthily if they are evolved to Platinum grade.”","Luo Lan could not help but gulp when she heard what Lin Yuan said.","The Luo family had possessed the Spring Bedding Dawn Fire for a very long time. As such, they had long tested the extent of the Spring Bedding Dawn Fire’s abilities.","More than once, Luo Lan’s father had expressed the wish to expand the current 5,000-square-meter Absolute Cold Garden. But this was not an easy feat due to the lack of precious plant-type feys.","In order to keep up the aesthetic, there was no way that the mundane plant-type feys could be planted in the Absolute Cold Garden.","But ever since the Absolute Cold Garden was constructed, the Luo family’s predecessors had considered the possibility that the Absolute Cold Garden could be expanded. Hence, they had left 50,000 square meters of space around the Absolute Cold Garden free.","But even after so many years had passed, the size of the Absolute Cold Garden had not changed at all."]},{"number":2208,"title":"Chapter 2208 Snow Celestial Mountain’s Anger!","paragraphs":["2208 Snow Celestial Mountain’s Anger!","Ever since Luo Lan took the throne of the Iron Hammer Federation’s imperial court, she had been engulfed in worries and troubles. She had not thought about expanding the Absolute Cold Garden at all.","But now that Lin Yuan was mentioning it, could it mean that...","Before she could form any thoughts, Lin Yuan started taking out precious flowering plant-type feys from the spatial ring one after another.","At that moment, Luo Lan felt like a garden had exploded before her. She had never seen such a parade of flowers.","Some of the plant-type feys that Lin Yuan took out came from the Divine Wood Federation, while others came from Condense Fairy Orchard.","These flowers not only captured Luo Lan’s gaze, but the eyes of Ni Xing, Sha Sha, and the rest who were setting up the banquet widened as well.","Lin Yuan did not stop what he was doing because of their reactions.","Soon, the flowers that he produced took up all the available space.","He smiled at the stupefied Luo Lan and waved his hand gently in front of her.","“Don’t just stand there. The issue that has been troubling you is going to be solved by Big Brother Liu. Since you have nothing to do for now, why don’t you expand the Absolute Cold Garden?","“It’ll also help you find peace and give you time to think about what to do from now on. The current Absolute Cold Garden is too small. The size is preventing me from providing even more plant-type feys even if I want to.”","Luo Lan did not try to be excessively courteous to Lin Yuan. Instead, she said to Ni Xing, Sha Sha, and the rest, “Go and gather all of the Spirit Craftsmen in the imperial court. Designate a space outside the Absolute Cold Garden to build a greenhouse.”","Sha Sha and Ni Xing look at each other. They could not be more aware of what was troubling Luo Lan.","From what Lin Yuan said, they finally understood why Luo Lan had become relaxed. It turned out that Lin Yuan and the rest were stepping in to help the Iron Hammer Federation.","Sha Sha and Ni Xing could not be more relieved.","As Luo Lan’s close aides, both of them had some sway in the Iron Hammer Federation’s imperial court. They almost had as much authority as the heads of their families.","Thus, both of them definitely wanted the Absolute Cold Garden to expand and improve.","Once the Absolute Cold Garden was expanded, more spirit qi professionals would be affiliated with plant-type feys in the Iron Hammer Federation. This would be nothing but beneficial for the Iron Hammer Federation, which lacked such spirit qi professionals.","After Ni Xing, Sha Sha, and the other four relayed the order, a large group of Spirit Craftsmen soon gathered around the Absolute Cold Garden.","It was known that the best material to build a greenhouse was the metal spiritual ingredient Transparent Annealed Crystal Iron.","The Transparent Annealed Crystal Iron was one of the rare metal spiritual ingredients that was transparent and could reflect 100% of the light that hit it.","Additionally, the Transparent Annealed Crystal Iron was even tougher than many Platinum metal spiritual ingredients.","But this was a much easier feat in the Iron Hammer Federation.","The Iron Hammer Federation had started mining in four mountains that produced the Transparent Annealed Crystal Iron.","Although the Transparent Annealed Crystal Iron was not commonly used, they had been stored up.","Now, the chance to use them had finally come.","The Transparent Annealed Crystal Iron had been cut into thin two-meter-long boards for convenient storage. They could be immediately used in their current state.","All that was needed was some special feys that the Spirit Craftsmen had contracted to join the boards together.","There were not many feys that were suitable to be contracted by Spirit Craftsmen and could join metal spiritual ingredients together.","Expanding the Absolute Cold Garden seemed to be monumental but was not difficult in the slightest.","Luo Lan started to give out orders to the servants to move all of the plant-type feys that were currently in the Absolute Cold Garden outside of the garden.","Next, she told the servants to plant the precious plant-type feys that Lin Yuan had taken out within the 5,000 square meters of the current Absolute Cold Garden.","After the Absolute Cold Garden’s expansion was completed, these beautiful flowers would become the core of the Absolute Cold Garden.","Lin Yuan shook his head and said, “These flowers aren’t very rare. They can be moved outside too. You must use the Absolute Cold Garden’s main space well.","“In the future, I will give you many plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline. There will be a lot of them. This 5,000 square meter garden won’t be enough. I think that you will need to reserve at least 15,000 square meters of space for these plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline.”","Luo Lan widened his eyes, and her breathing also became more ragged.","At that moment, she felt dizzy.","Her heart pounded so vigorously that it almost leaped out from its cavity.","She knew the significance of the plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline.","One’s rivals always understood one better than one’s companions did.","In the decades that the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation had been fighting, the Iron Hammer Federation had suffered significantly because of the plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline.","15,000 square meters of space! Just how many plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline could be planted in such an enormous space?","If she had the plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline, it would be much easier for her to nurture her subordinates.","When dealing with the tribes, the plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline could be the best leverage.","While Lin Yuan was speaking, a loud noise suddenly exploded in the air.","Lin Yuan could clearly sense the ground trembling violently.","The Gold Transparent Annealed Crystal Iron was very effective at absorbing shocks.","The tremors became increasingly violent, and the booming noises never stopped.","Liu Jie lifted his head to look at Lin Yuan and thought, It looks like the being on Snow Celestial Mountain can’t hold back anymore after sensing that the Iron Hammer Federation’s tribes have redirected their faith.","Only the being on Snow Celestial Mountain could produce such large-scale tremors.","Sounds of panic could be heard inside and outside the imperial court.","Lin Yuan stood up, and four pairs of wings appeared on his back. He injected spirit qi into the wings, and they turned from black to white.","He flapped his wings to leave the imperial court and check on Snow Celestial Mountain.","Six of the Lonely Night Hurricane Moths emerged from the Dimensional Light Moth’s abdomen.","Although these Lonely Night Hurricane Moths were very small, they could produce a shocking amount of wind-elemental energy when they flapped their wings.","The wind-elemental energy lifted Liu Jie and carried him off in the same direction Lin Yuan had flown in."]},{"number":2209,"title":"Chapter 2209 Another Faerie?","paragraphs":["2209 Another Faerie?","Although Liu Jie had instructed Ice Bite to send out a large number of the Polar Region Frost Pupas to settle the fights between the tribes, there was still a significant portion of the Polar Region Frost Pupas remaining.","Furthermore, Ice Bite was still producing more of the young Polar Region Jade Silkworms.","Since all of the snow around the Freezing Hammer Tribe had been eaten, Liu Jie instructed the Polar Region Jade Silkworms to target the snow on Snow Celestial Mountain.","The changes to Snow Celestial Mountain might be largely related to Ice Bite. Otherwise, there was no reason for such an abrupt change after all the gradual changes that Luo Lan had mentioned.","While Liu Jie was flying toward the imperial court, he realized that the towering snow-covered mountain in front of him had started to shake. It resembled a giant that had just awoken and was shaking off the thick blanket of snow that was covering its body.","Liu Jie had witnessed his fair share of monumental events.","But the sight of the shaking peaks that jutted thousands of meters up into the air still filled him with a strange sense of shocked marvel. This also caused Liu Jie to begin quivering, not out of fear but amazement.","No matter how powerful Liu Jie’s past opponents had been, they were all either humans, feys, or dimensional lifeforms.","But now, this enemy was a part of nature itself.","Liu Jie could not conjure up the image of a lifeform that could cause Snow Celestial Mountain to begin shaking and trigger such a violent snowstorm.","If this lifeform had earth-type abilities, it would be capable of activating not just Snow Celestial Mountain.","Although Liu Jie did not understand what was happening, this did not stop him from ordering Ice Bite to maneuver the Polar Region Jade Silkworms toward the avalanche.","The Freezing Hammer Tribe was in an uproar.","Only the king-class experts who could fly would be able to survive this avalanche.","Even if the spirit qi professionals with Gold avian-type feys sat on their backs and took to the sky, it would be difficult for the Gold feys to stand up to the force of the wind currents as well as the extremely low temperature.","But to the child Polar Region Jade Silkworms, this was nothing more than a luxurious feast.","The insects swarmed the snow at the bottom of the mountain.","The Polar Region Frost Pupas led the group to take on some of the impact for the Polar Region Jade Silkworms.","Once the Polar Region Jade Silkworms entered the snow, they began to guzzle down the snow.","As long as there was sufficient ice and snow, the Polar Region Jade Silkworms would be able to grow rapidly and transform into the Polar Region Frost Pupas.","The Polar Region Jade Silkworms had rushed to the front in order to shoulder the impact for the Polar Region Frost Pupas.","As the cycle of action continued, the army of Polar Region Jade Silkworms not only prevented the terrifyingly powerful avalanche from reaching the Freezing Hammer Tribe but had even pushed it back, uncovering the glimmering stone slabs at the foot of the mountain.","Cracks started to spread all over the mountain. Thousands of Polar Region Jade Silkworms were crushed each time the cracks closed up.","The Polar Region Frost Pupas that had only reached Myth Breed stood no chance against Snow Celestial Mountain’s counterattack.","This sight caused Liu Jie to furrow his brow deeply as he became even more suspicious of what was behind this strange phenomenon.","Lin Yuan did not share Liu Jie’s curiosity.","The change to Snow Celestial Mountain caused a faint smile to appear on Lin Yuan’s face.","He already had a guess of what the celestial being on Snow Celestial Mountain’s true form was. But he needed to ask Begin Lady in order to confirm his guess.","“Begin Lady, what do you think are the chances of the celestial being on Snow Celestial Mountain being a faerie?”","When the eight white wings appeared on Lin Yuan’s back, and he took off for the Iron Hammer Federation’s imperial court, Begin Lady started to keep its eye on Snow Celestial Mountain.","Begin Lady smiled and replied, “100%! But Snow Celestial Mountain still has a decently long way to go before it can turn into a faerie. You have yet to see my true form. The Sacred Wood Mystic Realm was just the remnant of my body after it was refined. I used to be an underground river. I was almost six million kilometers long and spanned across countless lands. Thus, my natural potential is far greater than this mountain.","“When I transformed into a faerie, my starting point was that of an intermediate fairy. Using this as a gauge, Snow Celestial Mountain will only be able to start off as a lower faerie at best after it passes Heaven’s Trial.","“Frankly, Snow Celestial Mountain has also been gifted with an opportunity. Just like how I changed from just being water-type to both water- and earth-type, its environment has also changed Snow Celestial Mountain to both ice- and earth-type. While I am skilled at support, it will be more skilled at combat.”","Lin Yuan cast his fiery gaze onto Snow Celestial Mountain.","A faerie was indeed deserving of being recorded in the Annal of Monster Information.","Lin Yuan had already verified the contents of the Annal of Monster Information more than once.","Not counting the parts that he was unfamiliar with and could not verify, none of the content that Lin Yuan had managed to verify had been inaccurate.","Lin Yuan could even go along with the Annal of Monster Information content to a tee.","“Begin Lady, if Snow Celestial Mountain successfully overcomes Heaven’s Trial and becomes a lower faerie, what will be the extent of its power?”","Begin Lady was silent for a moment before it responded, “Intermediate faeries can gain their spirit fires immediately after passing Heaven’s Trial, but I am not confident of saying the same for lower faeries. I think, at worst, it will only have awakened its birth horoscope.","“Every faerie’s bloodline has unique strengths. My bloodline can be used to produce plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline. I cannot visibly see what Snow Celestial Mountain’s bloodline abilities will be, but there is a high chance that you will be very pleasantly surprised.”","Lin Yuan’s eyes became even brighter when he heard what Begin Lady said.","Begin Lady kept mentioning the benefits that Snow Celestial Mountain could bring as a lower faerie. This meant that it really wanted him to help Snow Celestial Mountain to overcome its Heaven’s Trial.","Begin Lady already exhibited strong empathy even before it consumed Su Jian and Bai Dong’s souls. This empathy only became stronger after it consumed the two men’s souls.","It was likely that Begin Lady could see itself and the struggles it had faced back in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm in Snow Celestial Mountain.","Presently, Snow Celestial Mountain hated him and the entire Iron Hammer Federation. It was not hard for Lin Yuan to understand why."]},{"number":2210,"title":"Chapter 2210 Begin Lady’s Thoughts!","paragraphs":["2210 Begin Lady’s Thoughts!","The Snow Celestial Mountain had been happily enjoying the offerings from the Iron Hammer Federation’s tribes without a hitch. It basked in the power of faith and padded its foundation in preparation for its Heaven’s Trial.","It was much more difficult for natural landscapes to transform into faeries than it was for feys to undergo their own transformations.","Besides Begin Lady, there had never been a successful case in the main world. Even Begin Lady’s success came from the help of Lin Yuan’s secret weapons.","If Lin Yuan had lacked even one of his secret weapons, there was no way that Begin Lady would have been able to successfully overcome its Heaven’s Trial to transform into an intermediate faerie.","Lin Yuan wanted to gather faith power. For this, he had redirected the entire Iron Hammer Federation’s faith.","He had essentially cut off the road to the Snow Celestial Mountain’s future. It was no wonder that the Snow Celestial Mountain would use up so much of the energy it had been saving in retaliation.","However, it would not be impossible to ameliorate the relationship between him and the Snow Celestial Mountain.","Before a natural landscape transformed into a faerie, its mind was extremely pure.","All Lin Yuan needed to do was promise the Snow Celestial Mountain that he would help it to overcome Heaven’s Trial and transform into a faerie, and the Snow Celestial Mountain would no longer mind that the Iron Hammer Federation’s faith had been redirected. It would even begin to feel gratitude towards him.","When Lin Yuan had not responded, Begin Lady said with uncertainty, “Lin Yuan, do you remember the dark gold snake scale that descended when I passed my Heaven’s Trial? It’s highly likely that something similar will descend after the Snow Celestial Mountain’s Heaven’s Trial.”","Lin Yuan’s mind immediately went to the mysterious snake scale.","The Perfect Touch Wisteria was a fey that was not limited by the spirit qi professional rank of its contractor, so its power could grow endlessly. It did not possess the natural ability to roll grades to do battle.","It was both Green Vine’s exclusive skill Swallow Same Source and the dark gold snake scale that turned Green Vine into a legend.","Lin Yuan would be beside himself with elation if something similar could descend from the Snow Celestial Mountain’s Heaven’s Trial.","The dark black scale was clearly not from the main world. Lin Yuan needed to find more of such items to get a peak at the other worlds.","Previously, Lin Yuan had used Frigid and its Cold Season Poisonous Fish to boost the Fish World Sea Trump Card, produce the strongest attack he could with his mermaid emperor bloodline power, and fend off the last attack from the Heaven’s Trial.","Next, he used Morbius’ root power to capture the dark gold snake scale. Because of this, Morbius had used up 1/5 of its root power.","If he could obtain more items like the dark gold scale, using up another 1/5 of Morbius’ root power would be worth it. After all, Morbius’ root power could be recovered.","As Morbius’ grade continued to rise, it would be able to recover its root power even quicker.","It only took Morbius about two months to recover 1/5 of its root power.","But if he missed out on something like the dark gold snake scale, he might never be able to come across it again.","Even if no such item descended after the Snow Celestial Mountain passed its Heaven’s Trial, Lin Tuan would still gain a lower faerie and a powerful companion.","The mermaid emperor power that Lin Yuan used up in order to defend the last attack from the Heaven’s Trial for Begin Lady had not yet recovered.","Before Lin Yuan fully recovered all of that mermaid emperor bloodline, he would not be able to produce another attack like that.","Begin Lady would provide martial force while Lin Yuan just needed to provide all of the resources that the Snow Celestial Mountain needed","Lin Yuan had accumulated a large amount of spirit qi crystals after he helped the white-clothed followers increase their feys’ powers. Although a large portion of it had gone to increase Green Vine’s power, a small portion was still left.","The number of remaining spirit qi crystals was still more than the amount that Lin Yuan had when he was helping Begin Lady.","Thus, it would not be difficult for Lin Yuan to provide resources.","While Lin Yuan was communicating with Begin Lady, Liu Jie walked over to Lin Yuan.","Liu Jie had been instructing Ice Bite to fight the Snow Celestial Mountain.","Although each healed crack in the mountain resulted in the deaths of thousands of Polar Region Jade Silkworms, it was easy for a Myth Breed carcinoma fey to make up for such a loss.","After Ice Bite transformed into a fairy, it became intelligent to almost a fault.","Under Liu Jie’s orders, the Polar Region Jade Silkworms that were initially gathered together split up. This greatly increased the cost that the Snow Celestial Mountain had to bear when it attacked the Polar Region Jade Silkworms.","In the clash against the Snow Celestial Mountain, Liu Jie seemed to have the upper hand.","There was even a group of the Polar Region Frost Pupas that led the Polar Region Jade Silkworms and conquered the halfway point of the Snow Celestial Mountain.","After the constant fighting, Liu Jie realized that he might not be fighting a fey hidden in Snow Celestial Mountain but Snow Celestial Mountain itself.","The Snow Celestial Mountain that Liu Jie had pinned down was fully manic.","Lin Yuan turned and said, “Big Brother Liu, stop for now. Call Ice Bite back.”","Next, Lin Yuan said, “Begin Lady, go and have a talk with the Snow Celestial Mountain. In the state that it’s in, there’s no way it will listen to what I have to say.”","Begin Lady appeared next to Lin Yuan.","After shooting a look of amazement at Liu Jie, it turned into a pink and gold stream and flew towards the Snow Celestial Mountain.","From the knowledge of Su Jian and Bai Dong’s souls, Begin Lady knew how terrifying a carcinoma fey was when unleashed. Many disasters in the Divine Wood Federation had been due to the carcinoma feys.","Previously, Begin Lady had not paid much attention when Liu Jie used Ice Bite to consume the snow.","But now, Liu Jie had managed to stop a serious avalanche using Ice Bite. This was a completely different case.","Regardless of whether Ice Bite had transformed into a fairy, it still had Suzerain/Myth I power.","The avalanche triggered by the Snow Celestial Mountain could have caused the same damage as a Creation Breed fey. In fact, the scale would be much greater than that of a Creation Breed fey’s attack.","Yet, Ice Bite had easily subjugated such a large-scale attack and even had the upper hand.","Before a natural landscape transformed into a faerie, it had limited means of attacking and defending itself.","If Liu Jie was not willing to go easy to the Snow Celestial Mountain, Ice Bite could kill the Snow Celestial Mountain or, at the very least, cause it to suffer greatly."]},{"number":2211,"title":"Chapter 2211 Trigger the Heaven’s Trial Anytime!","paragraphs":["2211 Trigger the Heaven’s Trial Anytime!","The Snow Celestial Mountain could end up losing its ice-type because all of the snow on and around it had been consumed, leaving it as only an earth-type faerie.","Begin Lady went over to the Snow Celestial Mountain.","Begin Lady had been holding its aura back, so the Snow Celestial Mountain had not noticed its presence.","Begin Lady gently shook its head as it sensed the hidden despair amidst the mad franticness.","It released its intermediate faerie aura.","When Begin Lady released its intermediate faerie aura, Lin Yuan could visibly see the entire Snow Celestial Mountain freeze.","The mad frantic aura melted as though it was part of the snow and ice.","Begin Lady reached out its hand and gently touched the mountain as it said, “Silly child. The person you’re hating isn’t an enemy. He will lead you to your transformation and provide you with opportunities.”","The Snow Celestial Mountain started to tremble slightly and a cold but clear voice with a hint of bitterness rang out by Begin Lady’s ear. “If he can help me to transform and gain new opportunities, I am willing to do anything to thank him.”","When Begin Lady heard this, it immediately knew that the Snow Celestial Mountain was the same as it had been. It did not believe that it could succeed at Heaven’s Trial with just the preparation it had made so far.","If the Snow Celestial Mountain believed that it was capable of overcoming its Heaven’s Trial on its own, it would never give up on its hatred for Lin Yuan so easily.","This allowed Begin Lady to see even more similarities between itself and the Snow Celestial Mountain. It once again thought back to the terrible struggle and torturous experience of fighting against the heavens.","Begin Lady turned and looked at Lin Yuan. It now felt even more strongly that meeting Lin Yuan was a blessing.","Begin Lady patted the Snow Celestial Mountain.","“Although you haven’t created a spatial boundary, judging from the store of energy in your body, you shouldn’t be far off from your Heaven’s Trial.”","The Snow Celestial Mountain did not hesitate to reply, “I have reached the point where I’ll be able to trigger my Heaven’s Trial at any time. Even if I forcefully hold on, my Heaven’s Trial will undoubtedly be activated within ten years. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have reacted so violently over the energy offerings.”","Begin Lady immediately said, “Since you can trigger Heaven’s Trial at any time, bring up the spatial boundary now! Otherwise, the outside world will discover when you trigger your Heaven’s Trial. The lifeforms in over a 1,000-meter radius around your mountain will also end up hurt.”","After a natural landscape gained the opportunity to transform into a faerie, it would gain the ability to create a spatial boundary.","The Sacred Wood Mystic Realm was the spatial boundary that Begin Lady had created.","When the Snow Celestial Mountain heard Begin Lady’s suggestion, its body expanded and cracked.","The rocks covered with snow rolling down the mountain triggered the spatial energy of the surroundings.","As the spatial energy exploded all around, the Snow Celestial Mountain was eventually shrouded. It was as though the Snow Celestial Mountain did not belong to this world.","Luo Lan led Ni Xing, Sha Sha, and the rest to the Absolute Cold Garden so they could watch the Snow Celestial Mountain. This was when they noticed that the Snow Celestial Mountain had disappeared.","Luo Lan rubbed her eyes in disbelief but still could not find any trace of the Snow Celestial Mountain.","This filled her with shock and doubt. But she soon suppressed these feelings.","Ever since she joined the Astronomical Parliament, she had her horizons broadened more than once.","With Lin Yuan here, everything that seemed extraordinary and impossible became mundane.","Luo Lan calmed down quickly, but Ni Xing, Sha Sha, and the rest did not have the same experiences and strong stomach that Luo Lan had.","Given the states that Ni Xing, Sha Sha, and the rest were in, the members of the Freezing Hammer Tribe did not have to be mentioned.","After the members of the Freezing Hammer Tribe quelled the violent emotions that had arisen within them, they cast their gaze at Lin Yuan.","With the right giant wings behind him, Lin Yuan was drenched in a sacred brilliance.","All of the people of the Iron Hammer Federation had been rescued by Lin Yuan, including the members of the Freezing Hammer Tribe.","In order to express his loyalty to the Truth Association, Luo Cai had not even allowed the elderly and weak members of the Freezing Hammer Tribe to remain at home. All of them had been dispatched.","Thus, the members of the Freezing Hammer Tribe felt even more loyal to Lin Yuan than the members of the other tribes did.","After Luo Lan decided to create the statue of Lin Yuan, no one from the Freezing Hammer Tribe voiced any opposition despite being so near to the Snow Celestial Mountain.","The Snow Celestial Mountain had just caused a disaster that could have been akin to an apocalypse.","If the avalanche had been allowed to continue, the entire Freezing Hammer Tribe would have been buried.","Once again, this young man had stepped in to halt the disaster.","He had even used unknown means to cause the entire Snow Celestial Mountain to disappear.","At that moment, with his eight wings, Lin Yuan appeared even more like a god than when he first appeared on the sand statue.","The magnificence of gods did not come from how distant and untouchable they were but from their protection of mortals.","While Lin Yuan was observing the Snow Celestial Mountain, he waited for Begin Lady to return with the news after speaking with the Snow Celestial Mountain.","At that moment, Lin Yuan realized that the water spewing from the fountain of faith in his divine kingdom had increased significantly.","The glowing dots of faith within the fountain were also much brighter and purer than in the past.","More than 20 days had passed since Lin Yuan allowed the only holy spirit in the divine kingdom to use faith power to begin the derivation of the environment comfort level.","But the derivation of the environment comfort level had yet to be completed.","Lin Yuan had peeked into the divine kingdom more than once during this time.","Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom had already undergone enormous change.","After spending a large amount of faith power, Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom had turned into a world filled with water. The only land was around the altar.","The land was just as barren as it had been in the beginning.","But deep in the sea, there were numerous hotbeds for bacteria to be cultivated.","Many parts of the seabed had become underwater volcanoes, adding to the variety of the underwater environments.","The divine kingdom, which was only a few tens of square kilometers, was around the same size as Redbud City’s marine harbor.","Yet, there were already four different directions of currents in this territory of water.","All of these were the basic conditions for the derivation of life.","Lin Yuan had left a few drops of blood in the divine kingdom. As the master of the divine kingdom, the fresh blood would become the seeds of new life.","After the environment comfort level of the divine kingdom reached a certain extent, derivation would be triggered."]},{"number":2212,"title":"Chapter 2212 Split Up to Do Work!","paragraphs":["2212 Split Up to Do Work!","After the Snow Celestial Mountain used its energy to create its own spatial boundary, it said to Begin Lady,","“Frankly, I was planning on building the spatial boundary right before my Heaven’s Trial descended so I wouldn’t be disturbed and so other lifeforms wouldn’t get hurt. I didn’t intend to harm any humans or tribes with the avalanche. All I wanted was to give them a scare. The only way I’ll be able to stand a fighting chance is if the humans continue to worship me.”","Begin Lady did not interrupt the Snow Celestial Mountain, nor did it doubt anything that the Snow Celestial Mountain said.","Begin Lady did not express its attitude because the Snow Celestial Mountain had not tried to gain its favor.","Furthermore, a natural landscape’s thoughts were very pure before transforming into a faerie and absorbing other lifeforms’ souls. Thus, it would not try to hide its real thoughts.","More importantly, Begin Lady was more powerful than the Snow Celestial Mountain.","Since it had already set its spirit fire alight, it was easy for Begin Lady to see through a person’s feelings.","If the Snow Celestial Mountain was lying to it, there would definitely be some fluctuations in its emotions that would immediately become obvious to Begin Lady.","“Frankly, I am envious of you.”","This baseless statement from Begin Lady immediately stunned the Snow Celestial Mountain.","Begin Lady smiled at the Snow Celestial Mountain’s silence and speechlessness and said, “I was only saved by Lin Yuan and gained his help after I had resigned myself. You are ten years ahead of me. The most difficult thing would be to see your hopes being slowly dashed. That’s why I said that I envy you. I need to go back to tell the news to Lin Yuan.”","While it spoke, Begin Lady turned back into a pink and gold stream and flew back to Lin Yuan’s side.","Begin Lady smiled gently at Lin Yuan.","“The Snow Celestial Mountain can activate its Heaven’s Trial anytime. I have ascertained its condition. Since it is only a lower faerie, it won’t need as many resources as I did.”","Lin Yuan nodded gently.","Time was more valuable to Lin Yuan than resources were.","If Lin Yuan needed resources, he could get as much as he wanted from the Spirit Lock spatial zone. If he needed spirit qi crystals, he could use the resources from the Spirit Lock spatial zone to nurture the white-clothed followers.","Lin Yuan would be troubled if the Snow Celestial Mountain still needed five or more years before it could activate its Heaven’s Trial.","No matter how one looked at it, using resources to trade for an expert that had awakened its birth horoscope as one’s companion was very worth it.","Begin Lady had already communicated with the Snow Celestial Mountain.","As long as the Snow Celestial Mountain was not stupid, it would not feel any unhappiness or resentment for Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan said to Begin Lady, “Take me to see the Snow Celestial Mountain! Why don’t we help it to complete its transformation within these three days?”","Liu Jie did not insist on staying with Lin Yuan. He knew that Lin Yuan was rushing for time.","If he insisted on going with Lin Yuan, he would have to leave some matters undone for now. This would waste up to a day or two.","Although Liu Jie did not know how strong Begin Lady was, he could feel that it was hundreds of times stronger than him.","With Begin Lady by Lin Yuan’s side, there was nothing for Liu Jie to be worried about.","Liu Jie nodded and said, “Don’t worry, Lin Yuan. If you need three days, most of the matters regarding the tribes will be resolved by the time you return. At that time, all you’ll need to do is make a decision.”","Liu Jie instructed the Lonely Night Hurricane Moths to carry him off in the direction of the imperial court.","Before he joined the Astronomical Parliament, Liu Jie had been very curious about how Lin Yuan had come to know Su Yiren, Ta Lei, Luo Lan, and the rest. But after joining, many of his areas of confusion had been cleared up.","Since he was seated on one of the 12 golden thrones and was thus one of the main decision-makers of the Astronomical Parliament, Liu Jie knew that it was his duty to share the burden of helping the Astronomical Parliament’s members with Lin Yuan and Wen Yu.","If he disappeared with Lin Yuan, the unaware Luo Lan would lack any sense of security.","Due to the change to the Snow Celestial Mountain, the lunch that had been prepared in the Absolute Cold Garden did not carry on.","When he saw Luo Lan, Liu Jie said, “The situation has been settled. You don’t need to worry. Just tell the Spirit Craftsmen to continue building the Absolute Cold Garden.","“I have already gotten more than 40 of the Platinum tribes under control and did my best to keep the injuries and deaths to a minimum. However, it is impossible to avoid all bloodshed in battle. You have to be prepared for this.","“Of course, only a very small portion of this will be those who resisted too violently and had to be eliminated by Ice Bite. Most of the deaths and injuries came from the fighting between the two biggest tribes.”","Liu Jie’s return gave Luo Lan great ease.","Luo Lan had personally witnessed how terrifying the army of insects was. It was difficult to come up with the will to resist against such an army.","There were always accidental injuries that came out of fights, much less the battles between combatants that Liu Jie was trying to stop.","But the number of deaths was almost insignificant compared to the number that had been saved.","“Thank you, Mr. Vir— Big Brother Liu!”","Before Luo Lan and Lin Yuan were properly acquainted, she always addressed him as ‘Mr. Leo’.","Liu Jie occupied the Virgo throne but calling him ‘Mr. Virgo’ was too strange.","So despite not being very familiar with him, she addressed him the same way that Lin Yuan did.","Liu Jie called over Ice Bite, which had been flying around the Absolute Cold Garden, and said to Luo Lan, “Ice Bite is much smarter than regular people. I already told it to record each tribe that it takes control of. You can get your assistants to communicate with Ice Bite if you want to stay up to date on the situation. Even if you’re in the imperial court, you’ll still receive the clearest and newest reports.”","Before Luo Lan could make any arrangements, Liu Jie summoned the Dimensional Light Moth and started using it to produce insects to defend the imperial court."]},{"number":2213,"title":"Chapter 2213 Cusp of Transforming!","paragraphs":["2213 Cusp of Transforming!","Lin Yuan had left Eternal Weapon One with Luo Lan.","Even if any tribes decided to revolt in these three days before Lin Yuan returned, Eternal Weapon One could easily handle them.","But after seeing what Lin Yuan did to the Great Lush Federation, Liu Jie knew that not even the","Black Gold tribes would dare to truly rebel.","If special approaches were used, the Black Gold tribes could become part of Luo Lan’s power.","Thus, it would be slightly wasteful to use Eternal Weapon One to carry out a massacre.","If there were truly any issues, Liu Jie could take the opportunity to experiment what extent his power had reached after his series of opportunities.","But of course, it would be best if there were no issues.","Additionally, there was no way he would be able to hide the fact that Ice Bite was commandeering an army of insects to take control of the Platinum and Yellow Gold tribes from the eight major Black Gold tribes.","By now, Lin Yuan was standing in front of the Snow Celestial Mountain.","Lin Yuan was about to say something to the Snow Celestial Mountain when he heard its cautious and slightly incomprehensible voice say, “Thank you for being willing to help me. If you can help me transform into a faerie and successfully overcome Heaven’s Trial, I’m willing to do anything.”","Lin Yuan raised an eyebrow at the Snow Celestial Mountain’s words. Apparently, Begin Lady had explained everything to it clearly.","When Begin Lady saw the Snow Celestial Mountain’s candor toward Lin Yuan, it smiled and said, “I am planning on being with Lin Yuan from now on. Once you overcome Heaven’s Trial, you will be able to change form. When that happens, you should stay with Lin Yuan too! I am an intermediate faerie, so I’m stronger than you. I also changed my form sooner than you. There are many things that I’ll be able to teach you. Once you join Lin Yun, you’ll realize just how right this decision is.”","Begin Lady had spoken fully from the heart, but it did not tell the Snow Celestial Mountain about the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Begin Lady had already been with Lin Yuan for some time.","Besides Begin Lady, no other strangers had ever entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone. This meant that the Spirit Lock spatial zone was Lin Yuan’s secret.","Begin Lady was very happy that Lin Yuan trusted it.","Begin Lady would never reveal Lin Yuan’s secrets unless he did so himself first.","The Snow Celestial Mountain had always been rooted in the ground it was in now.","After it gained intelligence, it had drowned in loneliness. All it could do was silently listen to the sounds of the falling snow and whistling wind.","Begin Lady’s words gave Snow Celestial Mountain a place where it could go and belong.","The Snow Celestial Mountain nodded and said, “I’m willing to stay with you. Will we be companions from now on?”","Ever since the Snow Celestial Mountain gained intelligence, it often saw groups of animals on its body. Many of them were male and female animals leading smaller animals and trying their best to survive.","The Snow Celestial Mountain was very envious of that feeling of having someone to depend on.","Because of this, the Snow Celestial Mountain had helped many of the small animals when they were in danger.","But it did not help them to flee and survive but to push up little rocks to halt the animals’ movement when they lost their footing and were rolling down the mountain.","As a geographical structure, the Snow Celestial Mountain could not break the laws of nature. This was because the Snow Celestial Mountain knew that the animals’ fates could be changed by it taking pity on them and helping them out of danger.","The animals that were out hunting had to have families waiting for them back home.","With Lin Yuan and Begin Lady here, the Snow Celestial Mountain felt as though it had turned into one of those small animals and was about to receive selfless help from its companions.","Lin Yuan reached out and patted the rocks on the Snow Celestial Mountain as though he was shaking hands with it.","“I am not your only companion. There are many more of us. But you’ll only be introduced to them after you change into human form.”","At this point, Lin Yuan’s expression turned stern, and he seriously said to the Snow Celestial Mountain, “I heard from Begin Lady that you can trigger Heaven’s Trial any time. I have enough resources, while Begin Lady has sufficient power. Why don’t I help you to gather energy now so you’ll finish your transformation in the next three days?”","Begin Lady had already told the Snow Celestial Mountain this information, in doing so gave it hope.","But Begin Lady did not tell the Snow Celestial Mountain that it would be undergoing the transformation within three days.","At first, the Snow Celestial Mountain did not believe what Lin Yuan said.","But soon, its body started to tremble as it shook off all of the snow that Ice Bite had not eaten.","The Snow Celestial Mountain could tell that it had lost itself with excitement and hurriedly reabsorbed the snow it had shaken off.","Even with its pure mind, the Snow Celestial Mountain was sufficiently intelligent to trigger Heaven’s Trial.","The Snow Celestial Mountain knew that there was no need for Lin Yuan and Begin Lady to lie to it.","Both of them were within the spatial boundary it had created. If it died during Heaven’s Trial, Lin Yuan and Begin Lady would end up having to sustain the remaining attacks.","However, the Snow Celestial Mountain was well aware of how much energy it lacked.","The Snow Celestial Mountain dared not believe that Lin Yuan could make up for the energy it lacked and help it overcome Heaven’s Trial.","At this moment, Lin Yuan took out handfuls of the spirit qi crystals and tossed them into the cracks in the Snow Celestial Mountain as he said, “Quickly, crush these crystals. The spirit qi within these crystals will be very beneficial for you. It will definitely be just as if not more helpful than the faith power from the tribe members.”","After taking out many spirit qi crystals, Lin Yuan took out more handfuls of earth-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","When he last spoke with Begin Lady, Lin Yuan learned that once a natural landscape comprehended two types, it only needed one type of pure elemental energy to switch between them.","Although Lin Yuan could prepare ice-type pure elemental energy, it would be a challenge. It would definitely be easier to obtain earth-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","Thus, Lin Yuan did not bother the Ice Sealing Frozen Carp and only used earth-type elemental pearls.","When it heard what Lin Yuan said, the Snow Celestial Mountain gently moved its body and crushed the earth-type elemental pearls as well as spirit qi crystals.","The pure spirit qi and elemental energy that caused the entire mountain to tremble exploded within the Snow Celestial Mountain’s mountain and began to nourish it.","At first, the Snow Celestial Mountain was already convinced by what Begin Lady and Lin Yuan said.","But now that it was tangibly feeling the benefits, the Snow Celestial Mountain was looking forward and more hopeful of the future than ever."]},{"number":2214,"title":"Chapter 2214 Still a Blessing for Them!","paragraphs":["2214 Still a Blessing for Them!","Hearing something from others could never compare to experiencing it personally.","The Snow Celestial Mountain was extremely careful, absorbing the pure spirit qi and earth-elemental energy.","Pure spirit qi and elemental energy were the most basic sources of energy that the Snow Celestial Mountain needed.","With these, the Snow Celestial Mountain no longer cared about the offerings from the Iron Hammer Federation’s tribes.","The Snow Celestial Mountain was afraid of wasting even a smidge of the resources that Lin Yuan had provided.","The Snow Celestial Mountain was just as grateful to Lin Yuan as Begin Lady had been.","Begin Lady smiled.","At the same time, it also became very interested in finding out what abilities the Snow Celestial Mountain’s bloodline power had.","Every faerie had different abilities.","Begin Lady could use its bloodline power to create feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline and increase their talents. After it became a faerie, it could even forge precious instruments.","Begin Lady could sense that there were no lifeforms on the Snow Celestial Mountain that had been nurtured with the Snow Celestial Mountain’s bloodline power.","Even after sensing the Snow Celestial Mountain for so long, it had not figured out what effects the Snow Celestial Mountain’s bloodline power had.","But this was clearly not the time to ask.","Begin Lady decided to ask the Snow Celestial Mountain about it after it overcame Heaven’s Trial. It would also be able to find out what abilities the Snow Celestial Mountain gained after transforming into a faerie.","It was likely that Lin Yuan was just as curious as it was!","It was true that Lin Yuan was also extremely curious about the Snow Celestial Mountain’s abilities, but he had not immediately asked the Snow Celestial Mountain about it.","A person would reach completely differently when he knows that he is being helped unconditionally rather than with hidden motives.","The Snow Celestial Mountain was going to join him as a companion after it passed Heaven’s Trial. At that time, it would tell him everything without him needing to ask.","As Lin Yuan continued to produce resources, the Snow Celestial Mountain’s aura started to grow at a visible rate.","Morbius’ voice appeared in Lin Yuan’s mind, “Partner, you’re so lucky! You actually came across another faerie after Begin Lady! Do you remember me telling you that the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation have different environments? Now, I finally know why.”","When he heard what Morbius said, Lin Yuan immediately began to think.","When he came to the Startling Lines Continent and before the construction of the underground palace had been going on for long at the border of the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation, Morbius had become suspicious after Liu Jie was done scouting the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation’s environments.","If the sun was the boundary line with the Radiance Federation as the coordinates, the Iron Hammer Federation should not belong to the cold region. Even if it was topography was much higher than the Divine Wood Federation, the temperature should not drop below zero. With the sun as the center coordinates, the Iron Hammer Federation should have a similar climate to Ascending Dragon City.","At that time, Lin Yuan and Morbius had discussed this issue in depth but did not manage to come up with any useful possibilities.","It was possible that after the Snow Celestial Mountain overcame Heaven’s Trial and changed into a faerie with a human form, the temperature in the Iron Hammer Federation would rise until it matched that of the Ascending Dragon City.","Seeing snow in the Iron Hammer Federation would become a rarity if that happened.","Once the temperature in the Iron Hammer Federation rose, most plants could grow and thrive on their own there, just like they did in the Iron Hammer Federation.","Moments ago, Lin Yuan had been fully focused on the Snow Celestial Mountain’s evolution. If Morbius had not mentioned this, it would not occur to Lin Yuan at all.","Moreover, Lin Yuan felt that he was extremely lucky.","Whether it came from having such a good-natured sister like Chu Ci, a loving Master like the Moon Empress, or meeting dependable friends like Liu Jie and Wen Yu, Lin Yuan had been surrounded by luck on his entire journey, and he could not be more contented.","Lin Yuan did not verbally say this to Morbius, but both of their minds were linked. As such, Morbius could clearly sense what Lin Yuan was thinking.","Morbius seriously told Lin Yuan, “Partner, it’s not that you’re lucky. Even if anyone else was given the same chances, they might not have done as well as you have.","“Frankly, it’s those who have met you who are lucky. Even without them, and it was just the two of us, you would still be able to grow, just not as quickly.","“But if Liu Jie didn’t have you, the Insect Queen would have died, and he would be living like a walking corpse in some corner of Redbud City.","“Without you, Wen Yu would have lost the right to be a spirit attendant. Given the characters of the people who had been around her, she would not have gone on to lead a better life.","“If not for you, the Moon Empress would not have been able to take control of her birth horoscope and become a Class 6 Creation Master. Don’t discount yourself!”","Morbius was no different from Lin Yuan’s heart. It was only ever concerned with him and his benefits.","There were many times that Morbius felt that Lin Yuan was too kind. But perhaps it was this character of his that allowed him to form such close ties.","Luckily, after a year of non-stop training, Lin Yuan could finally kill without hesitation or mercy.","This change in Lin Yuan’s mindset made Morbius even happier than when it increased it grade.","Ever since it somehow gained a large amount of root power, Morbius had used some of it to try awakening a portion of his memories.","Morbius could not shake the feeling that many blurry memories were floating around, but it could not grasp them clearly.","After regaining some of these memories, Morbius became even more attached to Lin Yuan. It even started to feel a special type of possessiveness.","Morbius could not help but find this strange.","Ever since Lin Yuan helped Begin Lady to evolve, he had been more heavy-handed in using resources.","After a long time passed, the Snow Celestial Mountain that had been focused on accumulating energy finally said, “Lin Yuan, Senior Begin Lady, I have reached the limit of the amount of energy that I can absorb. When should I trigger the Heaven’s Trial?”","After saying this, the Snow Celestial Mountain fixed its eyes on Lin Yuan.","Five hours ago, after sensing the Snow Celestial Mountain’s condition, Begin Lady had said, “There is sufficient energy in the Snow Celestial Mountain’s body. I can help it to overcome its Heaven’s Trial. There is no need to fill up the energy in its body to the brim.”"]},{"number":2215,"title":"Chapter 2215 Glum Jia Ran!","paragraphs":["2215 Glum Jia Ran!","The Snow Celestial Mountain thought the same. Its years of accumulating energy could not even compare to the three hours Lin Yuan had provided it with resources.","It was clear to see how much Lin Yuan was willing to do for it.","Furthermore, Lin Yuan had not stopped providing it with energy and continued to provide more pure spirit qi and elemental energy.","“The energy in the Snow Celestial Mountain has only reached its limit. It will only be able to increase its potential to the greatest extent after it passes Heaven’s Trial. For the sake of helping it become an intermediate faerie as soon as possible, these spirit qi and elemental energy shouldn’t be skimped out on.”","Lin Yuan’s words caused the Snow Celestial Mountain, which had only just gained the ability to display its elementalized body, felt tears prick its eyes.","Its elementalized body was mostly comprised of earth-elemental energy, and it was dust that rolled out from its eyes. Thus, neither Lin Yuan nor Begin Lady noticed.","Begin Lady suddenly remembered that Lin Yuan had done the same when it was experiencing Heaven’s Trial. He had also filled its energy to the maximum before it underwent Heaven’s Trial.","When it saw that the Snow Celestial Mountain was done with preparations, Begin Lady said, “You can trigger Heaven’s Trial anytime. Once you feel that you can’t hold on any longer, I will step in to help you.”","The Snow Celestial Mountain unleashed its aura, and clouds soon gathered above it.","...","Inside a shining golden palace, a man wearing dark gold armor had melancholy draped on his face.","Because of his special eyes, he also appeared listless due to his melancholy. Numerous snake pupils were bumping into each other within his eyes.","Thoughts were flying through his head.","“What is wrong with this Class 1 world? Not only was a rare lifeform like an intermediate fairy born, but I even lost connection to one of my scales there.”","His pupils contracted, and the numerous snake pupils transformed into a menacing gaze.","He had been ready to report a workplace injury, but he did not do so because he had secretly tampered with the Heaven’s Trial.","His heart ached over the reverse scale that had taken over a thousand years to form. The more he thought about it, the sourer his expression became.","At this moment, a man wearing warm blue armor tugged at his hair that resembled tree vines and asked doubtfully, “Jia Ran, what kind of expression is that? I’m sure you aren’t suffering as my partner! With me by your side, my abilities can even nourish you. Even the captain is jealous of your position!","“Can it be that you’re envious of me because my power recently improved? We have been partners for so long. There’s no need for you to be so envious!”","The man wearing dark gold armor, addressed as Jia Ran, immediately looked vexed.","Yu Xin, don’t forget that you only managed to increase your power because of the treasure I gave you. Why would I be envious of you after I willingly gave you that treasure? Plus, the stronger you become, the easier of a time I’ll have when partnered with you.”","Jia Ran could not suppress his suspicions and asked Yu Xin tactically, “Yu Xin, do you think an intermediate faerie can appear in a Class 1 world?”","But after he heard what Jia Ran said, Yu Xin still could not help but roll his eyes.","“Jia Ran, you have been downtrodden recently. Did something happen that struck you dumb? Are you still hung up on missing out on the chance to enter Honor Absent Pool?","“It is a rare occurrence for even one intermediate faerie to appear in Class 2 worlds. Intermediate faeries are even rare in Class 3 worlds. How could one appear in a Class 1 world?","“A Class 1 world is basically a barren desert. Unless it is combined with the dimensional world it is linked to and is promoted to a Class 2 world, nothing rare will be produced there.”","Jia Ran drooped even more after he heard what Yu Xin said.","He hissed in his mind.","I thought so too! If an intermediate faerie hadn’t appeared in a Class 1 world, I wouldn’t have tried to investigate with a reverse scale! But I even ended up losing my reverse scale! Who is going to explain this to me? If I don’t report a workplace injury, I will lose a treasure that took a millennium to be produced!","Yu Xin was getting a stronger feeling that something was wrong with the sullen Jia Ran.","There was activity in the crystal ball in front of the two of them.","The image of a mountain bud appeared. It was covered with white snow.","This was usually a normal sight for Jia Ran and Yu Xin.","But this time, Yu Xin could not help but cry out, “Since when did lower faeries begin appearing in Class 1 worlds?”","This sight had gone against everything that Yu Xin had just said.","Jia Ran did not speak, but the snake pupils in his eyes flew apart swiftly, indicating his changing emotions.","Jia Ran could sense that this lower faerie had appeared in the same Class 1 world that the intermediate faerie had. Otherwise, the two auras would not be so similar.","Previously, Jia Ran had messed things up and ended up capsizing the boat in a sewer.","This time, Jia Ran was going to look at whether something wrong was happening in this Class 1 world.","Whe he made his decision, he heard Yu Xin say, “The chances of a lower faerie appearing in a Class 1 world are even lower than a Constellation Whale appearing in the Honor Absent Pool. I want to see what is different about this Class 1 world!","“A snowy mountain only has that much potential! From the size of the mountain on the crystal ball, this snowy mountain doesn’t have outstanding talent.”","When Yu Xin was about to input a response into the crystal ball to activate Heaven’s Trial for the Snow Celestial Mountain, Jia Ren said solemnly, “You have only just leveled up, so your well isn’t that deep yet. There was also that incident a few days ago. You should stabilize yourself. Let me do it this time!”","Yu Xin crinkled his nose and hurriedly pulled back his hand.","His error had resulted in the loss of an intermediate faerie. His entire team had been punished by Honor Residence Palace because of this.","As curious as Yu Xin was about how a lower faerie had been awakened in a barren land, he hastily gave up the chance to Jia Ren and said, “While you work, I’ll go and see the captain. He took the brunt of the responsibility for my mistake. I should make it up to him!”"]},{"number":2216,"title":"Chapter 2216 Four Snake Scales?","paragraphs":["2216 Four Snake Scales?","Jia Ran immediately looked cheered up.","Without Yu Xin with him, he would be able to properly investigate this Class 1 world. It would be best if he could find one of his treasures in the process.","While Jia Ran inputted a response into the crystal ball, he said to Yu Xin, “Go on. Nothing will go wrong with me here.”","After Yu Xin left, Jia Ran’s clenched fist finally relaxed.","Four snake scales burning with dark gold flames appeared in Jia Ran’s hand.","...","Lin Yuan and Begin Lady watched as the clouds in the sky changed continuously.","They could clearly tell that the Snow Celestial Mountain’s Heaven’s Trial was arriving much later than Begin Lady’s Heaven’s Trial had.","But Lin Yuan did not have much experience with helping natural landscapes transform into faeries.","Begin Lady’s experience could not be used as the standard.","But before Lin Yuan could ponder over it more, the clouds in the sky were immediately stained golden and changed into the shape of flames.","16 golden eyes appeared in the sky.","The 16 eyes still caused all the hairs to stand up on Lin Yuan’s body.","He was slightly curious.","There were many types of World Cleansings when Fantasy Breed feys evolved to Myth Breed.","So why were all the Heaven’s Trials for faeries so similar?","The 16 eyes opened simultaneously. There was an inexplicable ocean of powerful energy within the pupils.","Before the Snow Celestial Mountain had time to react, the first golden eye had already turned into a beam of light that shot toward the Snow Celestial Mountain.","The Snow Celestial Mountain knew that Begin Lady wanted it to experience Heaven’s Trial so it could train itself. As such, the Snow Celestial Mountain did not immediately ask for Begin Lady’s help.","Instead, the shaking mountain threw the snow-covered rocks at the beam of light.","The first attack from Heaven’s Trial was the weakest. The latter attacks would only become stronger.","Thus, the Snow Celestial Mountain did not need to try too hard to fend off the first attack.","However, Lin Yuan and Begin Lady’s expressions did not relax in the slightest. Rather, they became more stormy.","This was because they had realized that the first attack that the Snow Celestial Mountain had handled was stronger than Begin Lady’s Heaven’s Trial’s first attack had been.","This was definitely not normal.","Could it be because the Snow Celestial Mountain was only a lower faerie and only needed to face 16 attacks from Heaven’s Trial?","After fending off the first attack from Heaven’s Trial, the Snow Celestial Mountain fended off the second, third, fourth, and until the ninth attack in succession.","But the ninth attack had resulted in the Snow Celestial Mountain suffering serious injuries. There was now a giant crack left in the mountain.","The Snow Celestial Mountain used a significant amount of its root power to heal the cracks.","Previously, Begin Lady had managed to use its own power to handle 17 of Heaven’s Trial’s attacks.","But now, the Snow Celestial Mountain was slipping after only the ninth attack. Begin Lady would have to step in for the tenth attack. Otherwise, the tenth attack would either end up killing the Snow Celestial Mountain or cause it to lose most of its root power.","As an expert who had set its spirit fire alight, Begin Lady could easily produce astonishing power.","The stream of water from just one of Begin Lady’s fingers helped the Snow Celestial Mountain survive till the 14th attack.","After the 14th attack from Heaven’s Trial had passed, Begin Lady said in a low voice, “There is definitely something off about the Snow Celestial Mountain’s Heaven’s Trial! It is already stronger than the last attack of my Heaven’s Trial! I can bet with confidence that no lower faerie would be able to pass this Heaven’s Trial. Heaven’s Trial is meant to be a test not to kill.”","Lin Yuan nodded grimly. Even before Begin Lady said this, he had already sensed that things were definitely wrong.","A natural landscape did not possess strong power before it transformed into a faerie.","For example, Begin Lady had been close to reaching Eternal before it underwent Heaven’s Trial. But after Heaven’s Trial, its power shot past Eternal, took control of its birth horoscope, started walking down heaven’s path, and set its spirit fire alight.","The 14th attack of the Snow Celestial Mountain’s Heaven’s Trial had put some pressure on Begin Lady.","This had far surpassed the degree that natural landscapes were able to handle.","Luckily, only two attacks were left, and Begin Lady had not yet needed to use its spirit fire.","It was likely that regardless of the reason behind the Snow Celestial Mountain’s strange Heaven’s Trial, it would be able to pass with Begin Lady around.","When the 15th attack shot down as a beam of light, Begin Lady released its pink and gold spirit fire as a stream of water so as to not create more problems.","With Begin Lady’s spirit fire, the 15th attack from Heaven’s Trial did not pose any problems.","But after the 15th attack, a terrifying event took place in the sky.","This event had also taken place after the final attack of Begin Lady’s Heaven’s Trial.","The last eye in the sky had transformed into a giant dark gold snake. The snake was covered with fiery dark gold flames.","But this time, the last eye in the sky had transformed into not just one dark gold snake but four.","The four dark gold snakes intertwined around each other, and the dark gold flames set alarm bells off in Begin Lady’s mind.","The atmosphere turned extremely tense.","At this moment, Morbius’ voice appeared in Lin Yuan’s mind, “Partner, it’s a good thing we didn’t use too much root power recently. I previously used 1/5 of my root power to capture the dark gold snake scale.","“I only used a small portion of root power to deal with the Truth Association’s tower and the Secret of the Dead. But after so many days of recuperation, I have just enough to capture the four dark gold scales without falling asleep.","“But if I do this, we will have to push back the plan of going to the Banquet of Everything and combining two chosen sacred source lifeforms.","“Partner, it would be a calamity if Begin Lady wasn’t here. But with it here, this has become an opportunity for you instead. I can sense that the dark gold scales within the four snakes came from the same source as the dark gold snake scale that Green Vine used Swallow Same Source to absorb.","“Green Vine can absorb these four scales again. If the five dark gold scales are combined, there is a high chance that Green Vine will receive an unimaginable benefit.”","Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up, and he thought, Risk and opportunity really do come hand in hand. Now that opportunity is at hand, who am I to not seize it?"]},{"number":2217,"title":"Chapter 2217 Hang On For 15 Seconds!","paragraphs":["2217 Hang On For 15 Seconds!","Lin Yuan had been able to increase his power so quickly on his spirit qi professional journey because he had been willing to take on the risks that came with training.","Otherwise, with just Morbius’ special abilities, he would still be managing the small store in the Xia Region or attending the Intermediate Spirit Qi Profession School in Redbud City. There was no way he would be standing at the peak of the Radiance Federation’s younger generation like he was today.","But in spite of his willingness to take on the challenges, there was no way that Lin Yuan could take on the four dark golden snakes like he did in the past.","Morbius could only capture one scale at a time, and it took about five seconds to capture each scale.","While Morbius was capturing one of the scales, the other three flaming dark gold snakes continued attacking.","Even if Lin Yuan used up the remainder of his mermaid emperor bloodline power to use Frigid and the Cold Season Poisonous Fish to boost the Fish World Sea Trump Card, there was no way he would be able to hold the fort down.","Suddenly, a thought surfaced in Lin Yuan’s head.","Ever since he obtained Morbius, he had never removed it from his wrist. He even wore the bracelet when he was bathing.","But this did not mean Lin Yuan could not remove Morbius from his bracelet. He was perfectly capable of removing Morbius and handing it to Begin Lady.","While Begin Lady was taking on the four flaming dark gold snakes, Morbius would capture the scales one by one.","When Begin Lady unleashed its spirit fire, its body was enveloped in pink and gold spirit fire and started to transform.","A faerie could only unleash its strongest power after it had returned half of its body back to its natural state.","The dark gold flames could not only cause hurt to flesh and soul but even spirit attributes.","Begin Lady could sense that there was a strong energy core in each of the four giant dark gold snakes that supported the snakes and spewed out the dark gold flames.","Begin Lady could not be sure if this attacking method would work on the four giant dark gold snakes.","While its spirit attribute was being burned, Begin Lady could not wait until all of the energy cores in the four snakes had been drained.","When Begin Lady steeled itself and prepared to put its life on the line, it heard the Snow Celestial Mountain stutter, “Senior Begin Lady, if these four snakes cause you serious harm, you don’t have to help me. Apparently, this is the Heaven’s Trial that faeries need to pass in order to evolve. In the end, I’m not fit to be a faerie!”","Under the Heaven’s Trial’s attacks, the Snow Celestial Mountain had fallen deeper and deeper into despair.","It knew that the Heaven’s Trial would be extremely difficult and that it might be able to pass, but it never expected every attack after the 11th attack to be strong enough to kill it.","Begin Lady did not reply to the Snow Celestial Mountain.","Lin Yuan knew what Begin Lady was thinking from the spirit fire that had appeared all over its body.","Lin Yuan said to the Snow Celestial Mountain seriously,","Lin Yuan turned his gaze onto Begin Lady and asked in a low voice, “Begin Lady, will you be able to hold on against the Heaven’s Trial’s last attack for 15 seconds?”","A look of shock spread across Begin Lady’s face.","15 seconds? Could Lin Yuan have a way of dealing with the large dark gold snakes in the sky?","Begin Lady thought back to how Lin Yuan had helped it to defeat the giant dark gold snake that had appeared after its Heaven’s Trial. He had used a special method to make the giant dark gold snake disappear.","Begin Lady remembered that Lin Yuan’s wrist had lit up with a crimson bronze light.","If Lin Yuan asked Begin Lady to hold on until all of the energy in the four giant dark gold snakes’ energy cores had been used up, Begin Lady could only say no. But 15 seconds would not be an issue at all.","No matter how fearsome the dark gold flames were, Begin Lady would be able to preserve its spirit attribute as long as it was careful and did not allow the flames to touch it.","“15 seconds is fine. I am also confident that the last attack won’t be able to hurt me during these 15 seconds.”","Lin Yuan used his left hand to slide Morbius off his wrist.","The 15 seconds also came from his communication with Morbius.","Lin Yuan austerely handed Morbius to Begin Lady and said, “Begin Lady, just keep this in your hand.”","Begin Lady held Morbius and rode off towards the four giant dark gold snakes while enveloped in a roaring pink river.","The four giant dark gold snakes continued to spew out dark gold flames.","Just as Begin Lady’s enormous wave was about to clash against the flames, one of the giant dark gold snakes penetrated the wave and slammed into Begin Lady.","Begin Lady was about to defend itself when it realized that the giant dark gold snake in its vicinity had disappeared. Meanwhile, the crimson bronze bracelet with strange carvings all over it started to heat up.","Luckily, the heated crimson bronze bracelet would not burn it.","Begin Lady dared not express too much shock and refocused itself.","Begin Lady thought that it would have to fend off the four snakes’ attacks for 15 seconds. But now, it was only three instead of four giant snakes.","This had significantly decreased the pressure on Begin Lady. Now, it did not have to use its maximum power the entire time.","While it was fighting off the giant dark gold snakes, the burden on its back dropped continuously as one giant dark gold snake disappeared every five seconds.","The Snow Celestial Mountain’s Heaven’s Trial was finally over when the last giant dark gold snake disappeared.","After Heaven’s Trial ended, a mystical whirlpool appeared in the sky. This whirlpool was the Heaven’s Present from nature to the natural landscapes that became faeries.","Begin Lady had encountered this when it transformed into an intermediate faerie.","Lin Yuan had obtained significant benefits from this.","If Begin Lady had not left a portion of the spirit fire it was gifted with in Lin Yuan’s body, the shrine in his soul would never have transformed into a divine kingdom.","After stewing for a moment, Heaven’s Present descended.","At this moment, the Snow Celestial Mountain understood what ‘soldiers facing a battle of life or death would find the will to fight for survival’ meant.","Although it was Begin Lady who had stepped in to help it take on the Heaven’s Trial, it was Lin Yuan who used the crimson gold bracelet to resolve the situation at the most key stage.","From now on, the Snow Celestial Mountain was going to become Lin Yuan’s companion.","The Snow Celestial Mountain knew that it did not have much that it could use to repay Lin Yuan. All it could do was share this Heaven’s Present."]},{"number":2218,"title":"Chapter 2218 Stunning Features!","paragraphs":["2218 Stunning Features!","It could be said that the Snow Celestial Mountain had made the exact same decision as Begin Lady had.","When Heaven’s Present descended, the Snow Celestial Mountain first directed a portion of it into Lin Yuan’s body.","The second Heaven’s Present that Lin Yuan received did not lead to as much of a change as the first Heaven’s Present had.","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan still noticed that the shrine world had increased to twice the previous size.","Although increasing the size of the shrine world would cause the environment comfort level to fall, a larger shrine world was still a benefit. It meant that the divine kingdom’s territory had grown.","Lin Yuan had yet to try using the water from the fountain of faith to shower the divine kingdom’s ground.","But he knew that in order to increase the size of the divine kingdom’s territory, he would require a much larger amount of faith power than he would need to raise the environment comfort level.","Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom was currently being managed by the holy spirit Truth.","Truth had come from Fifth Page Truth’s spirit attribute and faith power.","Fifth Page Truth’s spirit attribute was like the bones and flesh, while the faith power from Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom was what gave the holy spirit consciousness.","From the start, Truth saw Lin Yuan as the ruler of the divine kingdom.","Truth’s mind had become increasingly more active. As it spent each day improving the divine kingdom and raising the environment comfort level, it formed images of Lin Yuan in its mind that it prayed to.","The sudden changes to the divine kingdom had astonished Truth.","The expansion of the divine kingdom was significantly beneficial to the lifeforms in the divine kingdom.","A holy spirit’s power was related to how prosperous the divine kingdom was.","Truth prayed to Lin Yuan in amazement.","Because of the increase of Truth’s power, the environment comfort level of the divine kingdom had quickly raised by a few points.","But since the divine kingdom’s size had doubled, it still needed much more time to raise the environment comfort level to a point suitable for the derivation of lifeforms to begin.","Lin Yuan had been looking forward to the divine kingdom’s changes but was in no rush. After all, the divine kingdom was rooted in his soul, and he could work on it anytime.","The Heaven’s Present that descended after Heaven’s Trial was just like the World Grace and Creation World Ley Line that descended for Myth Breed and Creation Breed feys.","When other lifeforms absorbed them, their bodies would have a strong rejection reaction.","After receiving the one benefit, the Snow Celestial Mountain’s Heaven’s Present left Lin Yuan’s body and entered the Snow Celestial Mountain’s own body.","Since Begin Lady had the potential to become an intermediate faerie, it changed into human form immediately after overcoming Heaven’s Trial.","But half of the Snow Celestial Mountain was still composed of rocks and snow.","But after absorbing Heaven’s Present, it was likely that the Snow Celestial Mountain would be able to truly transform into human form.","The light of Heaven’s Present spread out within the Snow Celestial Mountain’s body until its entire body was wrapped in white light.","After the Snow Celestial Mountain changed into human form, it raised its arms, and its massive original body faded into a phantom silhouette that fused with the Snow Celestial Mountain in human form.","As harsh as the environment had been on the Snow Celestial Mountain, there had still been many lifeforms living on it.","Before the Snow Celestial Mountain absorbed Heaven’s Present, it had created hands using its rocks and snow and shifted the lifeforms onto another 2000-meter-tall snowy mountain that was nearby.","After doing this, the parts of the Snow Celestial Mountain that had not changed into human form slowly fell off.","The sharp aura of the Snow Celestial Mountain became increasingly obvious. This was likely related to the Snow Celestial Mountain being both earth and ice-type.","Lin Yuan had not gotten a good look at the Snow Celestial Mountain in human form yet. But now, he could get as good of a look as he wanted.","The Snow Celestial Mountain in human form was over two meters tall and would be considered tall amongst spirit qi professionals. It was so tall that it was easy for it to give off the feeling of stockiness.","However, the Snow Celestial Mountain gave the feeling of handsome elegance and gentleness instead.","Its features were harmonious and exquisite.","This reminded Lin Yuan of the description of faeries recorded in the Annal of Monster Information.","The description of faeries stated that the features of higher faeries were even more stunning.","Stunning?","When Lin Yuan flipped through the Annal of Monster Information, he saw that there were many precious and mysterious creatures recorded within it. But the only creature described as stunning was the faerie.","Begin Lady’s appearance was outstanding, and it just barely managed to beat out the Moon Empress.","But frankly, Lin Yuan felt that Begin Lady’s aura still could not match up to the Moon Empress. This was not because he was biased toward the Moon Empress.","Although the Moon Empress was less powerful than Begin Lady, he had become used to the Moon Empress’ appearance. Thus, he was not overly stupefied by Begin Lady’s appearance.","Presently, Begin Lady’s appearance could not live up to the description of ‘stunning’.","According to what was written in the Annal of Monster Information, Begin Lady and the Snow Celestial Mountain’s appearances would change significantly once they evolved into higher faeries.","At that time, Lin Yuan would be able to see what warranted the description ‘stunning’.","As seconds passed, the Snow Celestial Mountain’s aura changed from uncontrollably leaking into the world to slowly gathering within its body.","This took half a day. During this time, Lin Yuan and Begin Lady became certain that the Snow Celestial Mountain had awakened its birth horoscope.","Lin Yuan and Begin Lady did not bother the Snow Celestial Mountain even after it had gathered all of its aura back into its body. Instead, they gave it sufficient time to stabilize itself.","Begin Lady had returned Morbius to Lin Yuan.","Begin Lady had witnessed Morbius’ strength and what made it special.","After Morbius subjugated the four scales that could even burn up spirit attributes, Begin Lady became even more curious about Morbius.","Begin Lady tried to investigate Morbius with its spirit sight but could not glean anything.","All that it saw was that Morbius was a regular crimson bronze bracelet. The only special part was the strange carvings on its surface."]},{"number":2219,"title":"Chapter 2219 Deep Stream!","paragraphs":["2219 Deep Stream!","After checking, Begin Lady noticed that Morbius did not have a shred of spirit light. It was no different from a regular accessory.","Since this crimson bronze bracelet belonged to Lin Yuan, Begin Lady suppressed its curiosity and did not delve deeper into the matter.","This was because doing so would be extremely rude and because Begin Lady felt there was no need for it to clearly grasp all of Lin Yuan’s secret weapons.","Thanks to Lin Yuan, it managed to become an intermediate faerie.","Begin Lady did not even fully trust Little Peach, which it had created out of its bloodline, but it did trust Lin Yuan wholeheartedly.","This was very strange psychology.","It was akin to a hunter having rescued a deer in the forest. The deer would then be willing to expose its back to the hunter and would not worry about being hurt by the hunter.","After receiving Morbius from Begin Lady, Lin Yuan put Morbius back on.","Before he could ask, Morbius started to explain the current situation to Lin Yuan, “Partner, there were no issues with my inspection. These four dark gold scales indeed came from the same source as the one that Green Vine had absorbed. They can also be combined. Green Vine is blessed!”","After hearing what Morbius said, Lin Yuan felt both happy and slightly worried.","This was because Morbius’ voice was extremely feeble.","Lin Yuan asked Morbius with his voice full of concern, “Partner, are you okay?”","When Morbius sensed the worry and concern in Lin Yuan’s voice, it answered with a hint of kindness, “Partner, don’t worry. I am completely fine. It’s just that I made some misjudgments about the four dark gold snake scales and used up more root power than I expected. But this is fine! I just need some rest, and I’ll be able to recover.”","Lin Yuan nodded slightly.","After two consecutive opportunities in the past three days, his improvement had been more than significant.","Lin Yuan noticed that creating opportunities for himself helped him improve much quicker than waiting for opportunities to knock on his door.","This was why Zong Ze, Gu Lang, and the rest always went out to train. Even the ultimate introvert and lazy An He did his fair share of training.","At this moment, Lin Yuan suddenly heard the sound of rushing water. He followed the direction of the noise and looked behind him.","After the Snow Celestial Mountain fully changed into human form, there was now a giant crater where the Snow Celestial Mountain used to sit.","The roots of a large tree that was 100 meters tall would stretch 150 to 200 meters underground.","However, what was under the Snow Celestial Mountain was even more terrifying than the roots of a tree.","The underground water that was rushing out of the ground was slowly filling up this crater.","Suddenly, Lin Yuan entered a mystical state.","A Willpower Rune filled with refreshing nourishment appeared in Lin Yuan’s mind.","This was not the first time that Lin Yuan comprehended a Willpower Rune. Thus, he recovered from the trance very quickly.","He gently lifted an eyebrow.","He had not felt any harbingers of nature’s will in the past six months","This was much slower than his previous speed of comprehending Willpower Runes.","Lin Yuan could not help but be discouraged by this.","Just as Lin Yuan decided to investigate what kind of mindset and emotional state was best for comprehending Willpower Runes, the opportunity had descended abruptly.","Lin Yuan was delighted and excited by this.","His comprehension of another Willpower Rune indicated that Morbius could increase its grade even quicker than before.","At that moment, Begin Lady’s voice of amazement appeared in Lin Yuan’s ear, “If the environment isn’t damaged, this deep stream lake will have the chance to go down the same path as the Snow Celestial Mountain has come some tens of thousands of years.”","Begin Lady suddenly felt that it was thinking about things too simply.","It was not easy for a natural landscape to gain intelligence and transform into a faerie.","It had managed to gain intelligence because of the many lifeform corpses that littered the bottom of the riverbed.","It was likely that the Snow Celestial Mountain’s gaining of intelligence had also been brought about by some unknown miracle.","Since it was a miracle, the Snow Celestial Mountain had used up all of it in order to benefit itself.","There was no way that any of the energy from that precious treasure would be left over for this deep stream lake.","When Lin Yuan heard what Begin Lady said, he smiled and said, “I can’t guarantee that the lake formed from the underground stream will be able to transform into a faerie, but there’s no way that this environment will be damaged.","“Previously, the people of the Iron Hammer Federation obtained water by evaporating the snow. But after the Snow Celestial Mountain leaves, the Iron Hammer Federation’s climate will become warmer, and the snow will start to melt.","“Its climate will slowly resemble that of the Divine Wood Federation. After losing this water collection method, it will be difficult for the tribe members to obtain drinking water.”","Humans always destroyed their surroundings in both his previous life and this one.","But humans also always safeguarded their sources of drinking water.","Lin Yuan recalled how troubled Luo Lan had been over food and cold.","Soon, the opposite trouble will plague her.","There were only a few large rivers in the Iron Hammer Federation. The currents of those rivers were extremely strong and home to many strong aquatic feys.","From now and for a long time, the people of the Iron Hammer Federation would have to create rivers and build embankments to provide a sustainable water system in the federation.","This would be a huge undertaking, and it would be difficult to benefit all the tribes in the federation. After all, many of the tribes depended on mining in the mountains and thus lived in far-flung regions. In order to deliver water to them, just relying on labor and mechanical forces would not be sufficient.","Luo Lan had been introduced to Peace in the Astronomical Parliament.","Although they had not interacted much, the members of the Astronomical Parliament all had a certain level of understanding of each other through the Thoughts Letter Paper.","Thus, Luo Lan’s mind easily drifted to nurturing “Rain Masters” in the Iron Hammer Federation that would be able to solve the issue of water scarcity.","All this time, the tribes in the Iron Hammer Federation had been in a messy conflict.","But once the rivers had been created and the embankments built, most of them would join forces. This was the result that Lin Yuan was hoping for."]},{"number":2220,"title":"Chapter 2220 Something on the List of Precious Treasures?","paragraphs":["2220 Something on the List of Precious Treasures?","If the tribes only acted as individual agents, it would be difficult for Lin Yuan to organize and control the entire Iron Hammer Federation through Luo Lan.","Begin Lady smiled at what Lin Yuan said.","The biggest kindness that could come from humans would be to not pollute this lake.","Whether the lake could awaken its intelligence and transform into a faerie thousands of years later would depend on its fate.","With this thought, Begin Lady decided it would help the lake.","It reached out its hand and released a pink and gold stream completely absent of its spirit attribute.","This would allow its root power to nourish the lake.","When Lin Yuan saw what Begin Lady was doing, he crushed two handfuls of spirit qi crystals as well as tens of water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","He was also willing to help the deep stream and dunk the pure water-element energy and pure spirit qi deep into the lake.","Without any lifeforms present to share in some of the energy, some spirit could definitely be borne out of the help that Lin Yuan and Begin Lady gave.","But this was far from enough spirit to enable it to transform into a faerie.","Nonetheless, the beginnings of the lake’s road to transforming into a faerie had been laid down.","Even if not for the deep stream, the spirit qi crystals and water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls that Lin Yuan provided would also improve the quality of the entire lake and benefit all the members of the Freezing Hammer Tribe.","While Lin Yuan and Begin Lady were doing this, the Snow Celestial Mountain had opened its eyes. It walked over to them and bowed deeply.","This two-meter-tall man bent over to 90 degrees.","“Thank you for both your help!”","It only straightened its back after a pause.","Highly intelligent lifeforms like faeries would name themselves immediately after transforming.","The name ‘Celestial Sight’, which the Snow Celestial Mountain had given itself, had its own deeper meaning.","Lin Yuan was about to raise his hand to pat Celestial Sight’s shoulder when he realized that with his 1.8-meter height, he was a dwarf in front of Celestial Sight.","With this, Lin Yuan’s hand froze in midair.","Celestial Sight hurriedly bent down so that Lin Yuan would be able to reach its shoulder.","But instead of placing his hand on Celestial Sight’s shoulder, he gripped Celestial Sight’s hand.","Begin Lady was curious about the reason behind Celestial Sight’s name and thus looked at it questioningly.","When Celestial Sight noticed Begin Lady’s gaze, it guessed what Begin Lady was thinking and explained, “Senior Begin Lady, I have already awakened my birth horoscope and started walking down heaven’s path. These beginnings are all because of you. My original name is the Snow Celestial Mountain, so I think this name suits me well.”","Begin Lady nodded and went on to ask, “Celestial Sight, your intelligence must have been awakened by something, right?”","Celestial Sight replied honestly, “There is an enormous cave where my base is. It is full of a translucent orange fluid. I absorbed the fluid when I gained my intelligence until only a few drops were left. I knew that the fluid would be extremely beneficial to me. My intelligence skyrocketed after I was done absorbing the fluid.","“But all the fluid did was increase my intelligence. It had no effect on my power. Otherwise, I would have accumulated more than just a quarter of root power after all these years of effort.”","Although Begin Lady had already set its spirit fire alight, all of the knowledge it possessed came from Su Jian and Bai Dong.","Thus, it did not know what the orange translucent fluid that Celestial Sight had been referring to was.","But after hearing Celestial Sight’s description, Lin Yuan’s mind immediately flew to the image of a treasure. If his guess was right, Celestial Sight had absorbed the Wisdom Stone Milk, ranked 29th on the list of treasures. It was a similar item to the Earth Center Fine Milk that Lin Yuan had consumed.","However, the Wisdom Stone Milk had different abilities from the Earth Center Fine Milk.","What shocked Lin Yuan was what Celestial Sight said about there being a large amount of the Wisdom Stone Milk in the cave.","A natural landscape needed an unimaginable amount of energy in order to awaken its intelligence.","There had not only been enough Wisdom Stone Milk in the cave to awaken Celestial Sight’s intelligence but also for a few drops to be left over.","This meant that there had to be something in the cave that was even more precious than the Wisdom Stone Milk, the Wisdom Heart Gem.","The Wisdom Heart Gem had the same ranking as the Wisdom Stone Milk, but its effects were much stronger.","Regular feys could not use the Wisdom Stone Milk because it could unlock explosive intelligence and was very difficult to control.","But there were no issues when it came to natural landscapes such as Celestial Sight.","The Wisdom Heart Gem that was produced alongside the Wisdom Stone Milk contained much gentler energy.","Although spirit qi professionals would be at risk if they used them, feys would be able to make use of the effects properly.","Genius had told Lin Yuan that besides paying the price of spiritual energy, it had to increase its intelligence in order to use Connected Tails to connect to higher powers and listen in to inspiration.","It was only when its intelligence reached a certain level that it would be able to communicate with higher powers and understand what they were saying.","Lin Yuan was unsure if the Wisdom Heart Gem still existed, but its shell had powerful aura-blocking abilities.","Celestial Sight might not have noticed the Wisdom Heart Gem’s existence.","Furthermore, the Wisdom Heart Gem was almost 100 times more concentrated than the Wisdom Stone Milk concentration.","If Celestial Sight had truly digested the Wisdom Heart Gem, its intelligence would not have been so low.","With this thought, Lin Yuan immediately asked, “Celestial Sight, can you still locate the cave?”","Celestial Sight nodded.","It had been rooted here for such a long time. It was well aware of every structure and geographical formation on itself and in the ground below it.","The shell of that cave was very tough. The cave would not suffer much damage even if Celestial Sight pulled out its roots.","Celestial Sight did not know why Lin Yuan was suddenly asking about the position of the cave, but since he had asked, Celestial Sight was not going to keep it a secret.","“If you’re interested in that cave, I can take you to it now!”"]},{"number":2221,"title":"Chapter 2221 It’s Over! It’s Over! It’s All Over!","paragraphs":["2221 It’s Over! It’s Over! It’s All Over!","Lin Yuan said seriously, “Sorry to trouble you! According to your description, there should be another treasure in the cave that you haven’t discovered.”","Lin Yuan did not hide this from Celestial Sight.","Even if there was the Wisdom Heart Gem in the cave, Celestial Sight no longer needed it.","After becoming a faerie, Celestial Sight now had sufficient intelligence, and there was no need to raise its intelligence even further.","Lin Yuan’s honest behavior filled Celestial Sight with delight.","If Lin Yuan wanted to keep it a secret, he could have led Begin Lady to search for it after it left.","Lin Yuan had already been of great help to it.","Now that it had transformed into a faerie, there was no need for Celestial Sight to evolve itself using any external items.","Celestial Sight was a faerie with both earth- and ice-type. Thus, it could change geographical structures easily.","Celestial Sight pulled Lin Yuan’s hand and opened a large hole in the ground before he even had the chance to react.","A tunnel leading to the cave appeared below the three of them.","Ever since Lin Yuan could create wings out of the Day and Night Spirit Silver, he became very familiar with the feeling of weightlessness.","The three of them fell rapidly but only reached the cave after three minutes.","This meant that the cave was almost 5,000 meters underground.","Spirit qi professionals always complained that it was difficult to search for natural treasures, especially those listed on the list of precious treasures. There was almost no chance of encountering them.","This was not surprising. After all, a regular person would never think of digging 5,000 to6,0000 meters underground to look for resources.","There was absolutely no light at that depth, and they could not even see their fingers. It would be very difficult to search for anything with their eyes.","But Lin Yuan was not worried about that.","With Purple Love’s blessing, Lin Yuan could see clearly even in a pitch-dark environment. In fact, he would be able to see more clearly than if he were in a brightly lit environment.","When Lin Yuan arrived at the cave, he did not start searching blindly. Instead, he used True Data.","No matter how impressive the Wisdom Heart Gem’s shell’s blocking abilities were, it could not hide from True Data.","After doing a simple sweep of the cave, Lin Yuan walked over to a large and hard stone before he let out the Source Sand so it could begin grinding down the part where the rock and wall were joined.","The Wisdom Heart Gem was hidden in that unassuming rock.","Lin Yuan did not immediately start stripping away the exterior of the rock.","After consuming a large amount of radium, it would not be difficult for the Source Sand to strip away the rock to reveal the Wisdom Heart Gem.","Genius did not forget to stock up on its own spiritual energy while it was commandeering the army of Hundred Questions Beasts.","Now that Genius was Diamond X/Fantasy V, it needed to consume 100 rainbow-colored fish coats per day.","It would not be too late to use the Wisdom Heart Gem when Genius decided to give up its tails to ask the heavens about the way to become a Class 5 Creation Master.","After storing the Wisdom Heart Gem inside the spatial ring, Lin Yuan said, “Celestial Sight, let’s go!”","Although Celestial Sight had already awakened its birth horoscope, it still could not see anything special about the large rock.","Celestial Sight was not a curious being, so it did not ask many questions.","The three of them went back through the tunnel to the surface.","Next, Lin Yuan, Begin Lady, and Celestial Sight left for the Iron Hammer Federation’s imperial court.","The spatial boundary Celestial Sight had created to experience its Heaven’s Trial undisturbed disappeared after it evolved into a faerie.","Luo Lan and the rest had to be aware of these changes.","Before coming to the Iron Hammer Federation, Lin Yuan never expected that the secret lifeform on Snow Celestial Mountain would be the Snow Celestial Mountain itself.","Lin Yuan finally understood what “plans can never accommodate changes” meant.","Many of Lin Yuan’s arrangements for the Iron Hammer Federation had changed.","Luckily, it only took two days for Celestial Sight to transform into a faerie.","Lin Yuan could spend another day discussing the Iron Hammer Federation’s development with Luo Lan.","The members of the Freezing Hammer Tribe saw it as a miracle that the disastrous avalanche from two days ago had been stopped.","Now, the Snow Celestial Mountain’s disappearance was another stupefying occurrence.","The Snow Celestial Mountain’s disappearance meant that all of the faith the Iron Hammer Federation had dedicated to it had disappeared.","Now, the statue of Lin Yuan that stood in front of the statue of Luo Lan had become the only object of faith in the Iron Hammer Federation.","At that moment, Lin Yuan could not be happier.","Both the companion he had gained in Celestial Sight and the Wisdom Heart Gem that would be extremely beneficial to Genius could not be encountered during regular training.","It was said that when someone was happy, there had to be someone someplace else that was sad.","While Lin Yuan was beaming, Jia Ran, who sat in front of the crystal ball, was in a daze.","He stared at the calm crystal ball in bewilderment and only snapped out of this state after Yu Xin’s voice rang out in his ear.","“Jia Ran, what’s wrong? Why are you in such a state?”","Yu Xin was in an exceedingly good mood. He had done all he could to make it up to the captain. The punishment from the captain had not been overly severe and had lifted a substantial amount of reproach off of Yu Xin’s heart.","But before Yu Xin could be relaxed for too long, Jia Ran’s expression caused Yu Xin to frown again.","Yu Xin and Jia Ran were old friends who had worked together as partners for more than 3,000 years.","During this time, they had tried looking for other teammates because their ways of working were different. But eventually, they still found working with each other the most comfortable. This was why Jia Ren had been willing to give Yu Xun such a precious spiritual ingredient.","While Yu Xin was increasing his power, when he reached a certain level, he could easily swap out the spiritual ingredient he was using for something more useful.","Jia Ran was famed for his rationality and was described as cunning during battle.","Yu Xin had never seen such an expression on Jia Ran’s face.","At that moment, Jia Ran looked as though he had lost all his protection and source of dependence.","Yu Xin had only been gone for a few minutes, and all Jia Ran had been doing was carrying out the job. Nothing should have happened!","Although Jia Ran had snapped out of his state after hearing Yu Xin’s voice, he was in no mood to chat with Yu Xin.","Jia Ran’s own voice reverberated in his head.","It’s over! It’s over! It’s all over!"]},{"number":2222,"title":"Chapter 2222 Honor Absent Palace and Faerie Institution!","paragraphs":["2222 Honor Absent Palace and Faerie Institution!","Jia Ran had produced a total of five life treasures. They were the five dark gold snake scales that Lin Yuan had stolen.","Without any of his life treasures, Jia Ran’s combat power would be greatly discounted. If he continued to partner with Yu Xin in his current state, he would be shortchanging him.","There were no shortcuts to forming life treasures.","Special precious spiritual ingredients could be used to speed up the formation of the first life treasure. But such methods were only useful a few times. Over time, the effects would dwindle.","In order to form these five life treasures, Jia Ran had spent a large portion of his finances on precious spiritual ingredients. But even after that, it still took him 3,200 years to form the five life treasures.","Without the help of precious spiritual ingredients, the formation process would be extremely slow. Essentially, it would take him a full 5,000 years in order to make up for his recent losses.","When Yu Xin saw how depressed Jia Ran was, he got a stronger feeling that something was wrong. He frowned and asked Jia Ran sincerely, “We have been partners for thousands of years. There isn’t anything you should be hiding from me! Jia Ren, I might be able to help you!’","Jia Ran was silent for a moment before he suppressed his emotions, lifted his head, and said, “Yu Xin, you can’t help me with this! No one can help me with this! I will request the captain to remove our partnership and assign me to a team that doesn’t do combat.”","Jia Ran’s voice was trembling slightly but was full of unmistakable bitterness.","Yu Xin’s eyes widened. “Jia Ran, you’ve gone insane! This isn’t like you at all! Isn’t it your dream to enter the Honor Absent Palace?”","Yu Xin knew better than anyone else how hard Jia Ran worked. Besides Jia Ran, not many people were willing to spend so many resources to purchase spirit attribute items to speed up the formation of life treasures.","Jia Ran was always extremely rational and responsible.","Yu Xin did not believe that Jia Ran’s mindset had changed during his absence. He was certain that Jia Ran had fallen into deep trouble that he could not resolve.","Yu Xin placed his hand on Jia Ran’s shoulder and pulled Jia Ran’s head toward him.","“Speak! What happened? If I can’t solve the issue, we can go and plead with the captain! He is connected to someone from the Honor Absent Palace. If you’re in trouble, the captain will definitely go and seek help from that person on your behalf! You know how well the captain treats us.”","Jia Ran understood Yu Xin just as well as Yu Xin understood Jia Ran.","Jia Ran knew that if he did not give Yu Xin an answer he found acceptable, Yu Xin would never let the matter go.","Jia Ran knew that he had not only lost all of his life treasures but also committed a grave crime. But he did need someone who he could vent to.","After their thousands of years of history together, Jia Ran knew that Yu Xin would never reveal this matter.","Jia Ran organized his thoughts and forced himself to calm down before he said in a hoarse voice, “Yu Xin, do you remember me asking you whether an intermediate faerie can appear in a Class 1 world? I encountered exactly that once. In order to investigate the reason, I decided to hide one of my life treasures in a Heaven’s Trial.”","Jia Ran could hear worry and admonishment in Yu Xin’s tone.","If Yu Xin had said that before anything had happened, Jia Ren might not have been so reckless as to use all of his remaining four life treasures at once to search for just one. But now, there was no point in saying any of this.","“Normally, I can’t use my life treasure to investigate a world during a faerie’s Heaven’s Trial. But if the faerie dies during its Heaven’s Trial, I will be able to do so. But, the intermediate faerie from that Class 1 world fended off its Heaven’s Trial that was emboldened by my life treasure, and I ended up losing connection with my life treasure after that Heaven’s Trial!","“The Class 1 world where the lower faerie was just born is the same Class 1 world where I lost my life treasure. This time, I hid four of my life treasures inside the Heaven’s Trial that the natural landscape had to face.”","Jia Ran’s words caused Yu Xin to frown. He never expected his longtime partner to do something so audacious.","More importantly, Jia Ran was clearly trying to say that the four life treasures had also ended up lost in that Class 1 world.","What Jia Ran said next confirmed Yu Xin’s guess.","Yu Xin looked at Jia Ran with a conflicted gaze for some time before he sighed. He finally knew why Jia Ran had said what he said.","No one could help Jia Ran with this matter. The only thing that Yu Xin could do was keep the secret for Jia Ran.","If this matter got out, it would just be a simple matter of Jia Ran dragging him in, but their entire team might be dispatched to the most chaotic districts.","If the Faerie Institution found out that one of the teams under the Honor Absent Palace had tried to kill an intermediate and a lower faerie just to try to find out the secret of a Class 1 world, it would definitely take great umbrage and react violently.","If the Faerie Institution turned its back on the Honor Absent Palace, it might even affect its position in the East Universe.","There were already more than 100 higher faeries in the Faerie Institution. Recently, the number of sacred faeries in the Faerie Institution had increased from seven to eight.","As a result, the Faerie Institution’s influence had expanded significantly.","Moreover, unlike the Honor Absent Palace, the Faerie Institution was not rooted in just one universe.","Due to their special nature, the Faerie Institution held authority in all four major universes.","There was no way they could ask the captain to beg for help from his connection in the Honor Absent Palace. If the captain learned about this matter, he would become so furious that even his tail would pop out."]},{"number":2223,"title":"Chapter 2223 True Silver Hall","paragraphs":["2223 True Silver Hall","After carefully considering the pros and cons, Yu Xin said to Jia Ran, “I hope you won’t go mad with boredom in a team that doesn’t do combat. Let me know if you ever need help with anything or any spiritual ingredients. Don’t hesitate to speak up! I hope you’ll be able to return to the team in another few thousand years.”","Yu Xin had given Jia Ran his sincere best wishes.","Yu Xin was never the type to pretend to be courteous. He was always straightforward about how he felt.","With Yu Xin’s temperament, he often offended his new friends. But once they got to know him over time, they would see that his character was very lovable.","Jia Ran knew what kind of person Yu Xin was. He was also grateful to Yu Xin for not blaming him after finding out the truth and for still being willing to continue being friends.","But Jia Ran also knew that, despite a few thousand years being insignificant to beings on his and Yu Xin’s level, root power was also needed to form life treasures. During this time, there was no way he could increase his power.","This was why so many experts were willing to spend resources to shorten the time needed to produce life treasures.","He would only return to his current state after another 5,000 years. But 5,000 years later, Yu Xin and the other members of the team would have already left him in the dust.","Although the captain would still be willing to accept him back into the team, Jia Ran would not want to become a burden on his team.","Jia Ran shook hands and walked despondently out of this large room.","As he watched Jia Ran leave, the calm Yu Xin felt his eyes brim with tears.","He knew that with this mistake, Jia Ran would never be able to achieve his dream of entering the Honor Absent Palace. This might be their final goodbye to each other.","Once any lifeform lost the life treasures they had painstakingly formed, they could even be chased out of their homes. This was a possibility for losing just one. But now Jia Ren had lost five.","One of Jia Ran’s life treasures was not strong on its own. But the effects would be startling when the five were used in conjunction.","Now, all of Jia Ran’s five life treasures had been lost in a Class 1 world.","Yu Xin prayed that no changes would happen to this Class 1 world as a result of this. Otherwise, they would definitely investigate the source of the five life treasures.","With the True Silver Hall around, all lies became transparent. Each of the four scholars from the True Silver Hall was capable of divination. They could use this divination to access the past or even the future.","With this thought, Yu Xin was gripped by anxiety.","...","Luo Lan had always been the steady type. But she had not been able to relax for even a single moment for the past few days.","This was partly because she was worried about Lin Yuan. After all, despite knowing how powerful he was and that there were people around him protecting him, the Snow Celestial Mountain was a celestial being.","Although Luo Lan had redirected the faith of the entire Iron Hammer Federation, she still felt some fear of the celestial being.","Additionally, Luo Lan was also looking forward to Lin Yuan’s return so he could help her smooth out all the kinks in the Iron Hammer Federation.","The past two days’ events caused the previously conflicted Luo Lan to become determined.","As she thought about the heads of the Black Gold tribes that had followed her on the journey back from the border of the Divine Wood Federation and how they were all plotting against her now, Luo Lan could not help but sigh.","When she asked the Black Gold tribes for help, she received almost simultaneous rejections from all of them.","This situation signaled to Luo Lan that the Black Gold tribes were exchanging secret correspondence.","The Black Gold tribes wanted to keep her under their thumb to expand their influence across the Iron Hammer Federation.","The Iron Hammer Federation’s longtime issue of food scarcity had been solved.","In such an environment, almost every Black Gold tribe had decided to charge ahead with their development.","It was evident that the structure of the Iron Hammer Federation was going to change.","With the changing times, anyone with the ability to back up their thirst for power would yearn to become the ruler.","This also went for the Platinum tribes, much less the Black Gold tribes, who were even better positioned.","However, the Black Gold tribes had forgotten that Lin Yuan was the one who had kicked off the changing times, while Luo Lan was just the medium that was seeing the process through.","The Black Gold tribes were not the ones who decided if this medium would continue to exist. The decision depended solely on Lin Yuan’s attitude.","The Black Gold tribes that did not understand this would end up suffering painful consequences.","Luo Lan’s thoughts had not only changed because of the Black Gold tribes’ insidious intentions but also because she found out about what was going on in the Divine Wood Federation and Great Lush Federation from Su Yiren.","Yi Huailong held absolute power in the Divine Wood Federation, and Yi Huailu had become a Class 5 Creation Master.","Although Yi Huailu had joined Lin Yuan, there was no way he would not help his family or federation.","Lin Yuan had placed Jin Qianxun on the throne through force. But with Lin Yuan’s help, Jin Qianxun had obtained the loyalties of all the Great Lush Federation’s secret aristocratic families, thereby gaining absolute power in the federation.","Lin Yuan had taken away the autonomy of the Great Lush Federation’s trading merchant groups but had given the Great Lush Federation a chance to do cross-ocean trading.","The 30 adult Island Whales would significantly raise the Great Lush Federation’s overall power.","The Startling Lines Continent was made up of the Iron Hammer Federation, Divine Wood Federation, and Great Lush Federation.","Luo Lan had no choice but to see Jin Qianxun and Yi Huailong as her potential competitors.","Given the current circumstances, Luo Lan felt that both sides were pressuring her. If this continued, she would not be able to face Lin Yuan.","Luo Lan thought, If Lin Yuan can help Jin Qianxun gain absolute power in the Great Lush Federation, he can help me too. Under my management, there’s no way the Iron Hammer Federation’s development will lose out to the Great Lush Federation.","The Great Lush Federation was advantageous in terms of its geographical location and could carry out ocean trading.","However, the Iron Hammer Federation also had mining resources that even the Great Lush Federation and Divine Wood Federation combined could not match.","Luo Lan decided to hedge these mining resources and enable the Iron Hammer Federation to thrive as soon as possible.","They could slow down later on.","While Luo Lan was lost in her ambitions and mapping out the Iron Hammer Federation’s future, the usually quiet Liu Jie spoke up."]},{"number":2224,"title":"Chapter 2224 Genius’ Chance!","paragraphs":["2224 Genius’ Chance!","“The Lonely Night Hurricane Moths that were flying outside the imperial court have spotted Lin Yuan! He’s back!”","Liu Jie paused before he looked into Luo Lan’s eyes and said thoughtfully, “I had the army of insects patrol around the Freezing Hammer Tribe for the past two days and managed to catch almost 100 spies who were acting suspiciously. After being questioned, I discovered that most came from the eight major Black Gold tribes. A small portion are nomads who were trying to sneak into the Freezing Hammer Tribe.”","Liu Jie’s words caused Luo Lan to narrow her eyes.","This was the first time that Liu Jie saw such an overpowering, lethal aura from Luo Lan.","Liu Jie was a native of the Radiance Hundred and had been a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence even before he met Lin Yuan. After he met Lin Yuan, he became the disciple of the Chief of the Spirit Guards, Night Leaning Moon.","After receiving an education in the Radiance Federation, Liu Jie had a fair amount of knowledge about the Startling Lines Continent’s three federations.","After the recent training on the Startling Lines Continent, Liu Jie noticed that the low-rank spirit qi professionals in the three federations lived pathetic lives.","If spirit qi professionals lived such lives, the regular people did not even need to be mentioned.","Liu Jie hoped that these circumstances could change.","After taking control of it, Lin Yuan did not immediately destroy and rampage the Startling Lines Continent. Instead, he helped the three federations develop in their own ways.","Liu Jie hoped that he could see a calm Startling Lines Continent in the future.","In order to achieve this goal, Luo Lan needed to steel her heart when it was necessary. Otherwise, the underground movement in the federations would hamper the speed of the developments.","Although Lin Yuan could help Luo Lan this time, he could not help her every time.","It was likely that Luo Lan’s recent change in mentality was related to the guidance she had received from Su Yiren these past two days.","Ever since Liu Jie joined the Astronomical Parliament, he saw the Astronomical Parliament as a long-term investment.","Lin Yuan selflessly provided for the other members of the Astronomical Parliament. It went without saying that the other members of the Astronomical Parliament also needed to repay him.","Liu Jie had not been able to set his mind at ease when it came to Luo Lan.","It would be much better to promote one of the Black Gold tribes rather than have the soft-hearted Luo Lan control the Iron Hammer Federation.","But this change in Luo Lan led Liu Jie to dismiss this idea.","On the way back, Lin Yuan thought about how he should communicate with Luo Lan.","It could be said that out of the three federations on the Startling Lines Continent, the Iron Hammer Federation had the most issues.","The structure and environment of the entire Iron Hammer Federation were changing. This would definitely be difficult for many tribes to accept.","Since it would be troublesome to talk about each matter individually, Lin Yuan summoned Genius the instant he stepped into the imperial court’s hall.","Genius meowed and affectionately nudged Lin Yuan’s neck with its face.","Its long tails wrapped around Lin Yuan, so it looked like eight shining ribbons were behind him.","Genius had been continuously strengthening itself, and even its bloodline had transformed multiple times.","However, no matter how much it changed, it would never stop cuddling and being affectionate with Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan had already used his spiritual energy to inform Genius about the discovery of the Wisdom Heart Gem.","Genius had been stocking up on energy all this time.","Now that it had the Wisdom Heart Gem, Genius decided to push itself and gain the chance to become a Class 5 Creation Master before it reached Myth Breed.","Although the chances were very slim, if it succeeded, it would also be able to transform when it evolved to Myth Breed.","At that time, it would definitely be able to cross the level of beginner Class 5 Creation Master. At the very least, it would be able to become stronger than Di Wanmi and Yi Huailu.","After Lin Yuan met up with Luo Lan, he did not wait for her to ask and instructed Genius to use Connected Tails to connect him to Luo Lan.","As Genius’ contractor, Lin Yuan could transfer all the information he wanted Luo Lan to know to her.","After Luo Lan received the information from Lin Yuan’s mind, her jaw dropped, and she stood rooted to the ground.","Lin Yuan knew how difficult it would be to digest such information. Thus, regardless of her expression, he would not be surprised.","The changes to the Iron Hammer Federation were too startling.","If there was ever a day that someone told Lin Yuan that the Radiance Federation had been reduced to a land of lava, he would be able to empathize with how Luo Lan was feeling now.","Luo Lan had also seen her fair share of major events and knew that the Iron Hammer Federation was about to transform. Thus, she forcefully calmed herself down and only allowed her eyes to remain as wide as saucers to indicate that she had not yet digested the astonishing news.","Lin Yuan silently waited for Luo Lan to recover from her shock before he went on to say, “Luo Lan, Yiren must have told you about the situation in the Great Lush Federation. With your previous mindset and character, I decided to allow you to try and walk down your own path.","“But now, reality has proved that your path isn’t feasible. I intend to use the same method on you as I did on Jin Qianxun and take full control of the Iron Hammer Federation. What do you think of this?”","Luo Lan nodded seriously. “Young Master, I will do everything as you say!”","Luo Lan had already made a decision. Thus, she did not feel burdened by what Lin Yuan said at all.","Although the Iron Hammer Federation’s climate was going to change to become like that of the Divine Wood Federation, where there would be no winter season, it would still take some time for the cold temperature to recede.","But the snow and ice covering the Iron Hammer Federation were already visibly melting.","With Luo Lan’s discerning gaze, she immediately realized that a canal was about to be constructed.","The canal’s construction would touch the lives of all the citizens in the Iron Hammer Federation.","Luo Lan needed to seize the opportunity and call all the tribes to help with the canal’s construction.","There were many rivers in the Iron Hammer Federation.","Although the currents of the main rivers were very strong, making them very dangerous, the resources in the rivers could be gathered once the snow melted. All of the tribes would be willing to take the risk for the sake of the massive potential rewards.","While Luo Lan’s mind was flying at top speed, Su Yiren said in a gentle voice, “Lin Yuan has agreed to let me stay and accompany you for some time. With all these massive changes, you’ll have a much easier time with my help. Why don’t I help to train your six female attendants? Once they’ve been trained, they can help you deliver your imperial commands and handle tasks that don’t require you to be personally present. This will save a lot of your time.”"]},{"number":2225,"title":"Chapter 2225 A Class 5 Creation Master Can Be Used in Such a Way?","paragraphs":["2225 A Class 5 Creation Master Can Be Used in Such a Way?","A thought suddenly struck Su Yiren, and she said to Luo Lan honestly, “With the Black Gold tribes’ support, the female attendants must be somewhat arrogant. They can’t be truly humble in front of you.","“But once you’ve taken control of the Black Gold and Platinum tribes, the six female attendants will be fully tamed by you because they would know that their true dependent source of support would not come from their families but from you!","“In order for their families to rise in importance and gain more resources, they would do their best to gain favor with you regardless of whether they are being sincere or for the sake of their families.”","The environment in the Seven States of Darkness was not much better than that of the Iron Hammer Federation.","Su Yiren, who had been born with a golden spoon, knew better than Luo Lan how to play with people’s hearts.","This was why Su Yiren had become certain that Sha Sha, Ni Xing, and the other attendants were all scheming.","Luo Lan looked at Su Yiren gratefully.","If Lin Yuan were not here and Luo Lan was too embarrassed to show her emotions in front of him, she would have wrapped Su Yiren in a big hug.","With Su Yiren’s help, it would be much easier for Luo Lan to carry out tasks, and Lin Yuan would not need to be overly worried about the Iron Hammer Federation’s changes.","But there were still things that Luo Lan needed to do for herself.","“Luo Lan, you don’t have to be too worried about altering the lakes. I have sent for Weng Queji and Yi Huailu through the Thoughts Letter Paper so they can discuss the project with you and Su Yiren. Di Wanmi will be here too. The best way to alter the rivers will be to use the strength of specialized feys. All you need to do is organize the tribe members after the discussions have concluded.”","In the past, Lin Yuan was used to doing everything himself. But now, there was clearly no need for him to do so.","As his enterprise grew, there were more areas that Lin Yuan needed to worry about and put effort into. Rather than wasting his mental effort on trivial matters, it would be better to tap into the capabilities of his faction.","The three Class 5 Creation Masters were more than sufficient to come up with a plan to address this issue.","There were no points of doubt about this matter to start with.","Yi Huailu had only recently become a Class 5 Creation Master and was new at many tasks. Thus, Lin Yuan also hoped this project would build the relationship between Yi Huailu and Weng Queji and enable Yi Huailu to grow rapidly.","Lin Yuan could help Yi Huailu to cleanse his body of impurities and heal his injuries but could not be of any help to Yi Huailu when it came to developing himself as a Class 5 Creation Master.","Lin Yuan’s simple words had the effect of a gigantic tsunami in the hearts of Su Yiren and Luo Lan, who had their fair share of experiences.","What? There were going to be three people to discuss the altering of the Iron Hammer Federation’s rivers with them. Since when did they gain the right to have a conversation with three Class 5 Creation Masters?","There had never been any Class 5 Creation Masters in the Iron Hammer Federation and only one in the Seven States of Darkness.","Lin Yuan had casually assigned three Class 5 Creation Masters to fix one of the Iron Hammer Federation’s biggest issues.","He already had enough foundational power to match the top three federations of the main world.","Luo Lan knew that with the three Class 5 Creation Masters, she could sit back and delegate manpower.","After talking about the issue of altering the Iron Hammer Federation’s rivers, Lin Yuan said to Luo Lan seriously, “Four months later, I will start providing you with 1,500 plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline monthly until you possess a total of 12,000 plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline. You can use them as you see fit to bolster the Iron Hammer Federation’s power and reputation.”","For the past three days, she had been thinking about how she should properly use those plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline.","Luo Lan was very careful with her planning for the plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline that came from Lin Yuan.","But she never expected that the quantity would amount to 12,000.","12,000 of them was an unbelievable concept!","It was unlikely that the Divine Wood Federation possessed more than 12,000 plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline in the past. If they did, the bandit groups from the Iron Hammer Federation would have stolen most of them.","Shock and happiness caused Luo Lan to tremble uncontrollably.","With such a large number of plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline, she could easily nurture a group of dedicated subordinates. She would need ten years or more to use up all of them!","The Iron Hammer Federation would then produce a group of young experts who had contracted plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline.","Lin Yuan’s promise of resources would give the Iron Hammer Federation a chance to rise and prosper in the main world.","Luo Lan placed her left hand on her shoulder and knelt to Lin Yuan. Touching one’s shoulder was the most respectful action a girl from the tribes could perform.","Luo Lan had only ever performed this for her father.","But Luo Lan felt that this was the only action she could perform to express her thoughts.","After saying what needed to be said, Lin Yuan intended to retreat to the backseat and leave all the tasks in the Iron Hammer Federation to Luo Lan and Su Yiren.","With Eternal Weapon One by Luo Lan’s side, the imperial meeting would be settled even without Lin Yuan’s interference.","Lin Yuan was already done investigating the secret of Snow Celestial Mountain. Now that it had become his friend, there was no longer any need for him to remain in the Iron Hammer Federation.","Lin Yuan had not had the chance to ask Celestial Sight what its special ability was.","The Spirit Lock spatial zone was very beneficial for faeries, and Begin Lady was proof. Lin Yuan also intended to take Celestial Sight to the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","On the way back, Celestial Sight had sworn its loyalty to Lin Yuan after just three statements from Begin Lady.","Lin Yuan was slightly surprised that Begin Lady would make this request to Celestial Sight. But after training for so long, Lin Yuan had no objection to creating a bond with other lifeforms.","Lin Yuan did not know that Begin Lady had consumed Bai Dong and Su Jian’s souls. With those human thoughts in its soul, Begin Lady could think from a human standpoint in any matter.","Since Celestial Sight had not evolved into an intermediate faerie and set its spirit fire alight, it did not need to hibernate in order to stabilize itself. All it needed was to stay with Lin Yuan.","This was essentially giving Begin Lady time off so it could focus on hibernating and stabilizing itself.","After all, Begin Lady could be awoken from its hibernation. It could be awakened if he really ended up encountering a problem that Celestial Sight could not solve!"]},{"number":2226,"title":"Chapter 2226 200,000,000 for You!","paragraphs":["2226 200,000,000 for You!","Lin Yuan, who had been ready to lead Liu Jie to bid goodbye to Su Yiren and Luo Lan, suddenly thought of something and said to Luo Lan and Su Yiren in a low voice, “Ta Lei has been in Thick Soil City. With help from the 1 billion tribe members, the construction of Thick Soil City has been completed. The Land Imps are just tying up some of the loose ends.","“Thick Soil City can easily fit more than 500,000,000 residents, each of whom can have their own house. These 500 million people will just be the start. The population of Thick Soil City can go up to 1.5 billion.”","While he spoke, Lin Yuan internally gasped in amazement.","If a city like Thick Soil City existed in his previous life, it would be able to contain almost 1/4r of the global population.","But this capacity size would only be able to contain 1/10 of the population in the Startling Lines Continent at best.","Furthermore, the Startling Lines Continent was just an average-sized continent in the main world.","When comparing the two settings, this world was much too enormous.","But in this much-too-enormous world, another even larger space was waiting for him to explore.","This thought set off Lin Yuan’s zealousness. He felt a similar passion, hope, and excitement when he first went to the Royal Capital and yearned to go off to explore the other federations.","“I intend on positioning Thick Soil City as the core of the Startling Lines Continent and the hub where the three federations will gather and cross paths. Among the 500,000,000 spots for residents, I am leaving 200,000,000 spots for the Iron Hammer Federation, while the Divine Wood Federation and Great Lush Federation will receive 150,000,000 spots each.","“Once you’ve got the Iron Hammer Federation fully under control, you can decide who are the citizens who will get to fill up the 200,000,000 spots. You are more familiar with Ta Lei than Yi Huailong and Jin Qianxun. You can let Ta Lei know if there are any issues.”","Luo Lan was stunned when she heard what Lin Yuan said, but she quickly realized the intention behind his arrangement.","Lin Yuan wanted to break down the walls separating the three federations of the Startling Lines Continent and breed unity between them. Could it be that he wanted to create the fourth major federation in this world?","With Weng Queji, Yi Huailu, and Di Wanmi’s help, the Startling Lines Continent indeed had enough Class 5 Creation Masters to make them worthy of such a future.","But if this was truly Lin Yuan’s plan, it meant that Thick Soil City was going to become the Royal Capital of that enormous federation and that she would no longer share equal status with Yi Huailong and Jin Qianxun. Instead, the three of them would become rivals.","But Lin Yuan clearly favored her in this competition. Otherwise, he would not have allocated 200,000,000 spots for her.","This was because she was a member of the Astronomical Parliament, thus making her closer to Lin Yuan than Yi Huailong and Jin Qianxun were.","She might not feel this way if Lin Yuan had not told her this information in advance, but since he had, she was going to seize this opportunity properly no matter what.","Luo Lan immediately started drawing out plans in her mind.","She knew that she was going to be swamped for the next year.","When Lin Yuan saw Luo Lan’s expression, he knew she understood his intention. Thus, he smiled silently and returned to the underground palace with Liu Jie in tow.","If Lin Yuan wanted to head to the marsh world, he needed to have a foothold in the main world.","This was because, in the underground palace, he would immediately become aware once anything happened in the Startling Lines Continent.","Secondly, the Space Tunnel conveniently linked the underground palace to the Radiance Federation.","But more importantly, Lin Yuan intended to spend the next few months observing Silver Corona.","As a carcinoma fey that transformed into a fairy, Silver Corona was no different from Liu Jie’s Ice Bite and Fat Dimension.","Lin Yuan and Liu Jie had just spent some time and effort opening more dimensional rifts that would help speed up the growth of Silver Corona’s power.","Lin Yuan decided to let Silver Corona be anchored in the Startling Lines Continent. Silver Corona’s sea of flowers could cover the entire Startling Lines Continent’s territory if possible.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower had been a carcinoma fey without any rational or logical thinking.","But now that Silver Corona had gained intelligence, it could eat only the alien beasts that emerged from the dimensional rifts and use the sea of flowers to protect all the lifeforms on the Startling Lines Continent.","The sea of flowers would be like a decoration that had suddenly grown out and did not come with any combat abilities.","The Startling Lines Continent was like a piece of driftwood in the sea.","If Silver Corona’s sea of flowers could truly cover the entire Startling Lines Continent, the sea of flowers would extend to the four corners of the federation and become like kelp that adjusted the direction in which the Startling Lines Continent floated.","Silver Corona’s original body was an aquatic plant-type carcinoma fey. It was more suited to living in the sea than on land.","This was just an idea that Lin Yuan had. Silver Corona’s power needed sufficient time to reach a certain level before such a situation could even become possible.","Luo Lan and Su Yiren were very sad to see Lin Yuan leave. He had left in such a rush that he did not even stay for the banquet.","But both of them quickly set aside their sadness and threw themselves into their work.","Both women were workaholics by nature.","They intended to overhaul the structure of the Iron Hammer Federation, and Su Yiren also wanted to help Luo Lan steal some of the limelight and influence from Thick Soil City.","Su Yiren was very busy.","Luo Lan made a silent pledge that after things settled on this end, she would help this good friend of hers snatch the Dark Continent back from Tower Canon and bring glory back to the Seven States of Darkness!","Luo Lan knew that she would need to be able to tap into all of the resources on the Startling Lines Continent if she wanted to be of help to Su Yiren.","To do this, she could not just wait around for Lin Yuan to reach out helping hands. She needed to fight with her own will.","Although Lin Yuan was biased toward her, he was also a fair and just person.","If she fell behind Jin Qianxun and Yi Huailong, he would swap her out with someone more capable.","...","A full month had passed since Lin Yuan and Liu Jie had left the underground palace.","Lin Yuan first went to Clean Brahma City before rushing to the Freezing Hammer Tribe. He had spent almost ten days traveling.","Once he was back at the underground palace, he noticed that the hardworking Hu Quan had led the team of Spirit Craftsmen in finishing off the final touches of the underground palace.","Currently, Hu Quan was delegating the Spirit Craftsmen to set up the garden under the light of the Sunlight King Lotuses."]},{"number":2227,"title":"Chapter 2227 Aren’t You Worried That Your Body Won’t Be Able to Keep Up With All the Hard Work?","paragraphs":["2227 Aren’t You Worried That Your Body Won’t Be Able to Keep Up With All the Hard Work?","The underground palace spanned 4,000 square meters, and the space had been carefully divided. When the width of the walls was included, the structure took up more than 30,000 square meters.","The surfaces of these 30,000 square meters were covered with hand-carved depictions by the Spirit Craftsmen.","Even before the work was done, it made for a breathtaking sight.","Now, the underground palace could only be described as dazzling.","Hu Quan was fully focused on the Spirit Craftsmen side of things.","After learning that Sun Ningxiang and Condense Fairy Orchard had joined Sky City, Hu Quan asked Lin Yuan to contact Sun Ningxiang twice.","It was not that Hu Quan wanted to become closer to Sun Ningxiang but that he wanted to obtain some rare plants from Condense Fairy Orchard that could be used to beautify the environment.","Flowers like the Gem Bell Orchid changed colors under sunlight. The flower cores were similar to gems and seemed to be full of fire.","There was a special charm when the Gem Bell Orchid climbed up the jade-textured pillars with carvings all over them.","Lin Yuan raised an eyebrow.","Hu Quan’s eye for beauty had improved significantly since joining Sky City.","During this time, he had the opportunity to come into contact with many rare spiritual ingredients that he had never had the chance to interact with before.","A Spirit Craftsman like him needed to gain more experience in order to broaden his horizons and expand his design perception.","After Liu Jie saw this, he could not help but recognize that Hu Quan’s abilities had broken through past Class 5 Spirit Craftsman.","Now, the underground palace could stand toe to toe with Night Leaning Moon’s Midnight Palace.","But it went without saying that the underground palace was a far cry from being as mechanically integrated as the Midnight Palace.","When Hu Quan spotted Lin Yuan, a smile spread across his face as he walked over to greet them.","At first, Lin Yuan thought that with Hu Quan’s character, he would first praise his achievements and express how satisfied he was.","But instead, the first thing that Hu Quan did was sigh before he lamented, “Lin Yuan, I wish that I had broken through earlier. At my current level, I see that my previous designs were all trash. But the structure has already been built, and I cannot change them. Once they’re changed, all of the previous base structures will have to be removed. So, I had no choice but to continue building on top of the original foundation. Because of this, I can’t help but have a few regrets about this piece.","“Lin Yuan, you mentioned to me previously that you want to build a true Sky City. How much longer before I’ll get to show off what I’m really capable of?”","Lin Yuan could not help but blink a few times when he heard what Hu Quan said.","This was partially because Lin Yuan knew Hu Quan’s principles and never-ending passion as a Spirit Craftsman. It was truly Sky City’s privilege to have such a responsible and dedicated Spirit Craftsman.","But on the other hand, Lin Yuan was also wondering how Hu Quan managed to work so hard. Was he not afraid of his body failing to keep up with all that hard work? He was already raring to dive into another giant project after he had just completed a six-month-long project.","While Hu Quan was willing to add value to Sky City, Lin Yuan could not bear to use Hu Quan like a machine.","“Uncle Hu, it will take at least a month before we begin building the true Sky City. You should use this time to rest more!”","Hu Quan hurriedly waved his hands and said, “Lin Yuan, you don’t know what makes me happy! After I was done drawing up the design for the underground palace. I realized that my Spirit Craftsman skills have improved significantly. I am obsessed with and going crazy over this improvement!","“Since another month is needed before the construction of the true Sky City can begin, why don’t you take me with you to the marsh world? I wonder if those brats have improved after half a year there.","“As their teacher, I should be properly guiding them. I can also take the time to draw out a plan for the territory in the marsh zone or at least come up with a blueprint! This way, even without me there, my disciples won’t end up building something completely devoid of beauty.”","At that point, Hu Quan paused as though he was going through his memories before he said, “Among my disciples who went to the marsh world, the one in charge is called Liu... Liu something. Has he been doing a good job?”","Lin Yuan knew that Hu Quan had been laser-focused on the construction of the underground palace for a very long time and had set everything else aside.","But it had to be said that Liu Tong’s presence in Hu Quan’s mind was tiny!","Frankly, Liu Tong and Hu Quan were cut from the same cloth when it came to their work ethic. Those two were equally voracious about work. There were even days when Liu Tong worked longer hours than Hu Quan did, although this was also due to the fact that he had contracted the Vitality Sloth.","Normally, a large project was undertaken by a few leading Spirit Craftsmen who would delegate most of the tasks to the construction team. There were very few cases where the Spirit Craftsmen involved themselves in the building process.","Thus, having 400 to 500 Class 2 and above Spirit Craftsmen working in the marsh world was considered a luxury.","If Sky City was not sponsoring all of these Spirit Craftsmen and they were hired from the Spirit Craftsman Association instead, it would cost over 500,000 Radiance dollars per month, and that was if so many could even be hired.","How could Lin Yuan not be satisfied with a territory built by such a team of Spirit Craftsmen?","Lin Yuan had always known that Liu Tong was hardworking and diligent. He had not become stained by arrogance or complacency at all after obtaining a Bronze/Legend fey.","Even Wen Yu, who rarely had a compliment for anyone, had spoken well of him to Lin Yuan more than once.","The only reason Hu Quan was unable to remember Liu Tong’s name was that Liu Tong’s presence in Hu Quan’s mind was much too weak.","Lin Yuan did not mind helping Liu Tong increase his occupancy in Hu Quan’s mind.","“I am very happy with Liu Tong! He can handle all tasks in the marsh world on his own. But while Liu Tong and the rest have the strength, they don’t have the strong Spirit Craftsmen capabilities that you have.","“If you’re willing to draw out a plan for the territory in the marsh world, Liu Tong and the rest will definitely be able to follow it to improve the territory even further.”","Lin Yuan did not forget to feed Hu Quan’s ego while he was praising Liu Tong.","Hu Quan looked surprised when he heard what Lin Yuan said. He had not expected someone as unimportant as Liu Tong to catch so much of Lin Yuan’s attention.","For Lin Yuan to praise Liu Tong to such a degree, it had to mean that Liu Tong had some potential."]},{"number":2228,"title":"Chapter 2228 Liu Jie’s Brocade Box!","paragraphs":["2228 Liu Jie’s Brocade Box!","Hu Quan started the engine of his brain and started to think.","In order to become a high-class Spirit Craftsman, Hu Quan’s memory had to be very good.","However, he had not spent too much time thinking about Liu Tong.","Now that he was focusing his mind on Liu Tong, many scraps of memory related to Liu Tong surfaced in Hu Quan’s mind.","His mind was led to a man who was not considered tall and was almost 35 years old, on the cusp of middle age.","!!","Liu Tong was not the kind to stand out in a crowd. Even if he did something worth remembering, he could still be easily forgotten.","It could be said that his external qualities left a lot to be desired.","But Liu Tong had indeed managed to distinguish himself to Hu Quan, to the point that he had been willing to observe and use him more than he did the others before he left for the marsh world.","Hu Quan rarely acknowledged another Spirit Craftsman.","The reason for acknowledging Liu Tong was not that Liu Tong had tried his best to gain Hu Quan’s favor but because he indeed possessed impressive Spirit Craftsman capabilities.","Although Liu Tong’s talent did not put him in the top 10 amongst the members of the Heavenly Craft Pavilion, there was no question that he was part of the top 50.","But the real reason for Hu Quan’s approval of Liu Tong was how hard he improved his Spirit Craftsmen skills.","It was inevitable that some would take their foot off the gas pedal slightly after receiving a task. This was because collaborative work did not show the differing amounts of contributions by those involved.","Furthermore, Hu Quan had never kept a close eye on this, leading the Spirit Craftsmen to believe that he did not care.","But the truth was not that Hu Quan did not care.","He felt that having sufficient spiritual ingredients was a blessing when it came to Spirit Craftsman tasks. After all, Spirit Craftsmen rarely had the opportunity to possess sufficient spiritual ingredients to sharpen their own skills.","With such benefits in front of them, those who did not seize the opportunity were morons.","Reality had proved that there were many morons.","Hu Quan did not notice that the Spirit Craftsmen were hardworking, but he could not ignore consistent work.","Since Lin Yuan had also praised Liu Tong, Hu Quan decided to provide Liu Tong with special guidance and officially begin nurturing him as a legitimate disciple.","Hu Quan barked out a few laughs.","“My present designs are much better than they were a few months ago. I don’t think I’ll improve again anytime soon. Lin Yuan, don’t worry. I will definitely draw up a proper base design for your territory in the marsh world!”","“Lin Yuan, I remember you saying that the ground in the marsh world is very soft and loose. Even if you try to suck out the moisture in the marsh world, the situation doesn’t improve by much. It will be difficult to build anything overly large on the base unless you mix in a large amount of sand and metal fragments into the ground.","“Rather than creating a territory on such ground, why don’t you nurture a few Island Whales and build your territory on them? This way, you’ll have the freedom to move your territory instead of it being fixed in one spot.”","Lin Yuan shook his head gently at what Hu Quan said.","He had already thought about this matter earlier on.","Although the moisture level in the marsh world was more than 60%, it was still different from the sea environment of the main world.","The water in the marsh world appeared clear, but once there was any movement of life in the water, the silt would be disrupted, and the water would turn black.","The Island Whales could breathe through their skin and blowhole.","While the Island Whales were swimming, the mud would seep into their blowholes and skin.","This might be fine for a short while, but the Island Whales’ health would definitely be affected in the long run.","But it could not be denied that Lin Yuan was very interested in mobile territory.","But finding a dimensional lifeform that could replace the Island Whales and carry the territory would be far from easy.","Klein Hub’s entrance had a size limitation.","The entrance’s size had not increased even after Morbius raised its grade.","Lin Yuan could move the Floating Island Whale to the marsh world through Klein Hub before it evolved to Myth Breed and truly grew into its real size, but once it reached more than 40,000 meters, it would be impossible to do so.","The Bug-Consuming Thearch Emperor Lizards had been able to pass through the entrance because they could change into human form.","But since Universe was meant to carry Sky City, it could not change into human form. Once it did, nothing would hold up Sky City, and it would plummet from the sky.","Unless he managed to find a Class 6 dimensional rift that linked the main world to the marsh world, Universe would end up stuck in the marsh world forever.","If he had to choose between the main world and the marsh world, Lin Yuan was leaning toward having Universe stay in the main world.","But he did feel regret over not being able to create a mobile territory in the marsh world.","Lin Yuan chatted with Hu Quan for a while, and after intense pleading from Hu Quan, Lin Yuan agreed to send him to the marsh world in advance.","Hu Quan wanted to go and take a look at the marsh world’s environment in advance so he could come up with a list of resources that were lacking and send people to gather them.","The marsh world’s materials had been prepared long ago. For this reason, the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s store of resources had shrunk by 2/3.","Hu Quan didn’t really need the list and did not feel that anything was missing. He was just finding an excuse for Lin Yuan to allow him to enter the marsh world as soon as possible.","Lin Yuan was worried that Hu Quan would over-exhaust himself and have insufficient rest, but he could not force Hu Quan after such insistent pleading.","Hu Quan had contracted the Vitality Sloth. With its effects, Hu Quan could work day and night without sleep and still have more energy than someone who had not contracted the Vitality Sloth. There would not be any health issues in the near future.","But if Hu Quan wanted to push himself this hard for the long term, Lin Yuan would force him to rest.","After sending Hu Quan to the marsh world, Lin Yuan returned to the underground palace and prepared to take a shower.","He had traveled along the dusty roads to the Freezing Hammer Tribe.","Although Lin Yuan had cleansed his body of impurities—his body was now unsullied—he was still uncomfortable after a prolonged period of not bathing.","At that moment, Lin Yuan saw Liu Jie walking into his room with a serious expression and holding a small brocade box.","Instantly, Lin Yuan was able to guess what was inside that brocade box that Liu Jie was holding!"]},{"number":2229,"title":"Chapter 2229 Celestial Sight’s Bloodline!","paragraphs":["2229 Celestial Sight’s Bloodline!","After Liu Jie walked over to Lin Yuan, he silently handed over the brocade box. He rarely put on such a tough stance in front of Lin Yuan.","“Lin Yuan, I have possessed the Sky Awakening Crystal for some time. With its help, Halberd Corner, Ice Bite, and Fat Dimension have all successfully evolved into fairies. I need to pause for a while to digest this increase in power.","“You told me to use it first, but I’m done with it now. You don’t have any more reason to turn me down! I know that both the Floating Island Whale and the Acid Corrosion Queen Bee need the Sky Awakening Crystal to comprehend Willpower Runes.”","Lin Yuan looked into Liu Jie’s sincere eyes. Unlike last time, he did not turn down Liu Jie’s kind gesture.","He smiled and opened the brocade box as he said, “Big Brother Liu, I will use the Sky Awakening Crystal for a month. The Acid Corrosion Queen Bee is in great condition. With help from the Sky Awakening Crystal, it will likely be able to comprehend a Willpower Rune.","“I will return the Sky Awakening Crystal to you in a month. After a month’s break, I’m sure you will have picked out more insect-species carcinoma feys to combine with the Firefly Demon Fetuses!”","After Lin Yuan accepted the Sky Awakening Crystal, Liu Jie smiled and left the room to return to his own room, where he could begin stabilizing his current power.","Next, he would lead the army of insects to help Silver Corona increase the class of its current batch of dimensional rifts and speed up the growth of the sea of bone lotus flowers.","Ever since the Insect Queen became good friends with Silver Corona, the latter often invited Elegance to the sea of bone lotus flowers to play.","Ever since Elegance gained its third pair of wings, it was no longer jittery around Silver Corona.","Liu Jie really liked Elegance being on good terms with Lin Yuan’s feys.","After Lin Yuan accepted the Sky Awakening Crystal, he immediately hung it up in the Spirit Lock spatial zone where all of the feys that needed it could benefit from its effects.","Although many of the feys had yet to reach Diamond X/Legend, the Sky Awakening Crystal could still raise their ability to comprehend Willpower Runes from nature. This was the reason the Sky Awakening Crystal was on the list of precious treasures.","Lin Yuan took a thorough shower after setting up the Sky Awakening Crystal.","Begin Lady and Celestial Sight had been looking around the underground palace that Hu Quan had decorated.","As faeries, they were naturally drawn to beautiful things.","Additionally, with Su Jian and Bai Dong’s experience, they had never had the chance to lay their eyes on such exquisite adornments. As such, Begin Lady was floored.","Celestial Sight felt more curious.","It had only just entered the human world and was no different from a blank canvas.","After eating the delicious human food that Lin Yuan had given it on the journey back, Celestial Sight became even more interested and excited about this world.","Begin Lady had been in the same situation as Celestial Sight in the past.","Endless Summer and the Mother of Bloodbath were also the same when they had just transformed into human form.","But this state would slowly recede with time.","Lin Yuan had already decided to bring Celestial Sight into the Spirit Lock spatial zone, and it had already sworn its loyalty to him. Thus, there was no reason for him to hide anything from it.","Begin Lady had already spent considerable time in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. The Spirit Lock spatial zone was an unimaginably attractive temptation to it.","It did not take long for Celestial Sight’s expression to prove Begin Lady’s prediction.","Celestial Sight was stunned from the moment it entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone. But soon, it started to gobble up all the pure spirit qi it could access.","As Celestial Sight absorbed the pure spirit qi, its root power subconsciously materialized and rose around it.","At that moment, the Source Sand transformed into a pool of quicksand that swirled next to Celestial Sight.","Lin Yuan could tell that the Source Sand sensed Celestial Sight’s root power being tempered and was very happy. It was as though the Source Sand itself was increasing its power.","He thought, It looks like the Source Sand can benefit significantly by staying by Celestial Sight’s side.","Lin Yuan was about to speak with Celestial Sight about this when he saw Celestial Sight recover from its state of shock and gently pick up the Source Sand. It then said with slight surprise, “This is such pure mutated earth-elemental energy!","“As a faerie, my original body is a type of the most elite elemental energy. This mutated earth-elemental energy stands to benefit significantly if it remains by my side. It might even gain a hint of ice-type.”","After what Celestial Sight said, there was no longer any need for Lin Yuan to bring it up.","But Lin Yuan had caught one point: Celestial Sight saying that faeries were made of the most elite elemental energy.","The Source Sand had indeed mutated from an earth-element lifeform.","Did this mean that the fate of elemental source-type lifeforms was eventually to become faeries?","Lin Yuan was not sure if Begin Lady or Celestial Sight had the answer to this question.","But since the matter concerned his fey, he still asked them, “Is it possible for the Source Sand to eventually transform into a faerie?”","He thought that they would hesitate. But instead, both of them nodded confidently.","“Mutated elements might be different from regular elements, but they are still elements. It’s definitely possible for them to become faeries. However, transforming into a faerie will be much more challenging for a single element.”","After hearing Begin Lady and Celestial Sight’s resolute answers, Lin Yuan felt that he had just learned a secret that had never been revealed in the main world.","If elemental source-type lifeforms could eventually become faeries, that meant that they had much more potential than regular source-type lifeforms.","Elemental source-type lifeforms were formed from the corpses of Favored Believers and Believers from the marsh world.","During the Banquet of Everything, Lin Yuan intended to investigate further to see which dimensional lifeforms transformed into elemental source-type lifeforms after death. This would allow him to gain useful insight.","Begin Lady thought that Celestial Sight would take the initiative to tell Lin Yuan what abilities its bloodline had. Yet it had not uttered a word about it throughout the entire journey.","Begin Lady suddenly realized that Celestial Sight had been a far cry from what it currently was when it first encountered Lin Yuan.","It was possible that it had learned what abilities its bloodline had but did not realize how important a faerie’s bloodline abilities were.","“Celestial Sight, my bloodline can infect feys and increase their potential. Is there anything special about your bloodline?”"]},{"number":2230,"title":"Chapter 2230 The Radiance Federation’s Reward!","paragraphs":["2230 The Radiance Federation’s Reward!","When Celestial Sight heard what Begin Lady said, it stopped for a moment to think before it said thoughtfully, “My bloodline power can’t affect lifeforms or benefit their bloodlines. But it does have special effects.”","While it spoke, Celestial Sight looked at the unused Day and Night Spirit Silver planks on Lin Yuan’s worktable. It reached out its hand and used its control of earth elements to produce an attractive force that pulled the Day and Night Spirit Silver into its hand.","Next, it put on a show of its bloodline’s manipulation of metal spiritual ingredients for Lin Yuan and Begin Lady.","Begin Lady’s bloodline was fresh and clear and seemed to be able to nourish all the lifeforms in the world.","Any lifeform that had been nourished would instinctively think of it as its mother. This was why Begin Lady was called the Gaea Begin River.","On the other hand, Celestial Sight’s bloodline was thick and tough. It encapsulated sharpness and iciness.","After such an obviously special bloodline power was injected into the Day and Night Spirit Silver, the surface of the Day and Night Spirit Silver was covered with a radiant metal sheen.","Lin Yuan instinctively used True Data and discovered that the Day and Night Spirit Silver had changed fundamentally after being nourished by Celestial Sight’s bloodline.","Celestial Sight’s bloodline power seemed to have gifted the Day and Night Spirit Silver with life while raising its original metal attributes.","The Day and Night Spirit Silver was still a Gold metal spiritual ingredient, but after its metal attribute was raised, its effects increased by at least five times and boosted it to Platinum grade.","It seemed that Celestial Sight’s bloodline power could improve metal spiritual ingredients.","Celestial Sight handed the Day and Night Spirit Silver that it had strengthened with its bloodline power to Lin Yuan and said, “This is my first time using my bloodline power to strengthen metals. I haven’t really looked into its full functions. But the higher the grade of the metal spiritual ingredient, the less I will be able to boost it.”","Celestial Sight sounded slightly sad when it said that.","Celestial Sight felt that its bloodline power was very weak compared to Begin Lady’s bloodline power of raising the potential of lifeforms.","But Begin Lady was an intermediate faerie. Thus, Celestial Sight felt that it did not have the right to compare itself to Begin Lady in the first place.","However, Celestial Sight did not know that Lin Yuan and Begin Lady were stunned upon learning about its bloodline power.","Begin Lady had consumed Su Jian and Bai Dong’s souls. Thus, it deeply understood the world of spirit qi professionals. It immediately saw the wide range of possibilities for Celestial Sight’s bloodline power.","Its own bloodline power could only bless spirit qi professionals by increasing their power.","But Celestial Sight could not only increase the power of spirit qi professionals but could also bless the lives of the spirit qi professionals.","Many metal spiritual ingredients were considered inferior because their metal attributes were not sought after. But once their metal attributes were improved, they could be used in more ways.","Currently, the cheapest metal spiritual ingredient commonly used by Creation Masters was the Spirit Settling Silver.","The containers made from Spirit Settling Silver could fuse and stabilize spiritual ingredients.","If the Spirit Settling Silver’s metal attributes were improved by at least five times, it would be the equivalent of raising a low-class Creation Master’s class by half a class.","Although the effects would not be as obvious on Class 4 and above Creation Masters, there would still be benefits. It would help them speed up their rate of spirit fluid concoction.","Time was money for high-class Creation Masters.","If a large batch of Spirit Settling Silver from the Radiance Federation had its metal attributes improved, the Creation Master resources of the Radiance Federation would be improved by at least 1/5.","Creation Master resources were the foundation of a federation.","This meant that Celestial Sight’s bloodline power to improve a metal spiritual ingredient’s metal attribute would be able to transform a top federation.","Celestial Sight’s bloodline power could not only evolve one type of metal spiritual ingredient.","Lin Yuan forcefully suppressed his excitement and asked Celestial Sight, “How many metal spiritual ingredients can you improve each day with your bloodline power without harming yourself?”","Lin Yuan had come from two worlds. His previous world had been technologically advanced. As such, he knew more about what improving metal attributes could do for the world.","Whether or not there were more faeries in the main world, all of them would have different bloodline powers.","It could be said that Celestial Sight’s bloodline power of improving the metal attributes of metal spiritual ingredients was now a specialty that only Lin Yuan possessed.","Celestial Sight looked around the Spirit Lock spatial zone that was chock full of spirit qi and said reservedly, “In the outside world, I will be able to improve around eight cubic meters of a similar metal without hurting myself. But in this place, with such an astonishing concentration of spirit qi, I will be able to improve 30 cubic meters with no issues. But I can’t say for absolute certainty, as I’ve only been here for less than a day. As such, this is just the safest estimate.”","Lin Yuan balled his fists in excitement. 30 cubic meters was just the safest estimate. It would surely increase if the metal in question was the Spirit Settling Silver!","Furthermore, the measurement was in size and not weight.","One cubic meter of Spirit Settling Silver could be made into 5,000 containers after it was stretched and manipulated.","The Spirit Settling Silver was very hard and flexible. Using it to make containers was just a very short extension of what it was capable of.","With the amount of metal spiritual ingredients Celestial Sight could produce in one day, at least 200,000 Spirit Settling Silver containers could be produced. This was enough to meet the needs of a large federation.","After all, the containers could be used repeatedly. They only had to be changed after they had been used to contain high-grade spirit fluids for fear that the medicinal properties would clash.","There were a limited number of Creation Masters, even in a large federation like the Radiance Federation.","Because of Di Wanmi and Whale Ocean Commerce’s plan, the Radiance Federation’s stock of Creation Masters had reduced significantly.","Four Beasts Territory, a rising top faction with the Creation Master role, had even been eliminated.","It could be said that the Radiance Federation’s arsenal of Creation Master resources was even weaker than that of the Freedom and Azure Federations.","Lin Yuan intended to give the Spirit Settling Silver, which had its metal attributes improved by Celestial Sight, to the Moon Empress so she could distribute them to the other Creation Masters of the Radiance Federation."]},{"number":2231,"title":"Chapter 2231 Strict and Do-Over!","paragraphs":["2231 Strict and Do-Over!","Di Wanmi had killed over 30,000 low-class Creation Masters and 40 high-class Creation Masters in her bid to become a Class 5 Creation Master,","Eventually, Night Leaning Moon killed her.","The only person who had benefited from that tragedy was Lin Yuan, gaining a Class 5 Creation Master puppet through Red Thorn’s ability.","However, even the influx of Spirit Settling Silver would not be enough to compensate for the Radiance Federation’s losses. After all, no matter how precious the materials used to make the containers were, they could not be compared with Creation Masters themselves.","But the containers could act as a warm bed that nourished and energized the Creation Masters’ overall strength.","Lin Yuan had more than his fair share of the Spirit Settling Silver. Heavy Mountain had just cleared out a large Spirit Settling Silver mine.","Lin Yuan handed a Diamond fey storage box full of Spirit Settling Silver to Celestial Sight.","“Celestial Sight, you will help me by using your bloodline power to improve these metal spiritual ingredients to the extent that your body isn’t affected! The place you’re in is called the Spirit Lock spatial zone. You can absorb as much of the pure spirit qi in here as you need to nourish yourself. I will be able to provide you with sufficient earth-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls to help you increase your power.”","Celestial Sight was not opposed to using its bloodline power to help Lin Yuan improve his spiritual ingredients. After all, it did not cause it any harm to do so.","Even if it did cause it harm, Celestial Sight was still willing to use its bloodline power to help Lin Yuan as a means of repaying him.","But the fact of the matter was that helping Lin Yuan in this way would not do it any harm. Instead, it would even receive more benefits from him.","Celestial Sight had learned what heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls were from the conversations between Begin Lady and Lin Yuan.","Treasures like this that contained pure earth-elemental energy would help it to accumulate energy quickly and withstand the Heaven’s Trial’s cleansing.","The Spirit Lock spatial zone was a place of blessing that would benefit it.","If it could be nourished with the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, Celestial Sight felt that it would soon be able to evolve into an intermediate faerie.","Celestial Sight solemnly received the Diamond fey storage box from Lin Yuan and said, “Lin Yuan, I will do my best every day to use my bloodline power to nurture the metal spiritual ingredients. Senior Begin Lady needs to hibernate, but I don’t. I will only need to spend six hours in the Spirit Lock spatial zone each day absorbing spirit qi. I can stay with you for the remaining 18 hours, during which I’ll absorb spirit qi and protect you.”","Celestial Sight excitedly added, “By staying with you, I’ll be able to learn more about human society.”","Lin Yuan nodded.","It would be enough to have a lower faerie like Celestial Sight, which had awakened its birth horoscope, by his side.","Begin Lady had been the one protecting and helping him deal with issues. It was time for it to properly hibernate and borrow the special effects of the Element Well and mouths of spirit springs to secure its current level.","Lin Yuan intended to have Celestial Sight focus on accumulating for a month before he handed 10,000 cubic meters of the Spirit Settling Silver that had been strengthened by Celestial Sight to the Moon Empress.","The delivery of 10,000 cubic meters of Spirit Settling Silver would make the trip worth it for Lin Yuan.","Having recently become a Class 6 Creation Master, the Moon Empress was busy creating a Secure Federation Treasure for the mirror city in the abyssal world.","It was said that this Secure Federation Treasure could ensure the survival of all the low-rank spirit qi professionals in the abyssal world, so they would not end up dying from dehydration and heat stroke after training for a few hours.","Lin Yuan could not help with this task. He also did not want to disturb the Moon Empress just because he had returned to the Radiance Federation.","After settling Celestial Sight and Begin Lady, Lin Yuan and Liu Jie went to the marsh world.","Before he entered the marsh world, Lin Yuan told Celestial Sight that after it was done with its six hours of absorbing spirit qi each day, it could pass through Klein Hub into the marsh world to meet up with him.","After entering the marsh world, Lin Yuan and Liu Jie saw that Hu Quan had gathered up the 300 Spirit Craftsmen and was reprimanding them fiercely.","Liu Tong was standing next to Hu Quan with Hu Quan’s blueprint in his hands.","This was enough to see that Hu Quan was giving Liu Tong special guidance.","“It’s good that you can handle hardship. But you aren’t detailed enough. How much attention and diligence are paid to a building is a separate matter from being able to handle hardship. Even if you work for 24 hours each day and your work doesn’t meet the standards or lacks beauty, it will all be useless!","“I just asked Liu Tong to give me a summary. Every building was built by Class 2 and 3 Spirit Craftsmen. The Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen were the leaders, while the Class 2 Spirit Craftsmen assisted them. With such a group, each building should meet the standards of Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen. Yet, the result is only 70% of that standard!","“I’m sure you know who were the ones in charge of that lacking 30%! Go and re-do all of it! During the reconstruction, the cost of the materials and losses incurred will come out of your pay and welfare!","“It has been a long time since I last taught all of you a lesson. This time, I need you to know that always endeavoring to do better is the basic principle that all Spirit Craftsmen should follow!”","Hu Quan was always very strict when it came to the Spirit Craftsmen.","But as a result of what he said, many of the Spirit Craftsmen would end up losing their income for a long time.","After all, the materials used in the construction were all of superior quality.","A reconstruction would damage a significant portion of the materials.","But none of the Spirit Craftsmen dared to look the slightest bit upset with Hu Quan, nor did any of them feel unhappy with him in the first place.","These Spirit Craftsmen who had rushed to finish the job and had not met the expected standard hung their heads in shame.","Lin Yuan looked at Hu Quan’s stern expression and thought, Hu Quan did end up finding many issues that are difficult for Wen Yu to spot as someone who isn’t part of this field.","Hu Quan spoke very harshly to these Spirit Craftsmen, but the punishments were insignificant to Lin Yuan.","Nonetheless, he did not speak up on behalf of these Spirit Craftsmen who had failed to meet the standard. This indicated that he agreed with Hu Quan.","He could not help but give Hu Quan a mental thumbs-up."]},{"number":2232,"title":"Chapter 2232 Big Surprise!","paragraphs":["2232 Big Surprise!","Lin Yuan was always gentle and generous with his subordinates. But this did not mean that he had not learned how to be a proper superior after all his growth.","If Lin Yuan spoke on their behalf now, it would result in the Spirit Craftsmen who had erred becoming grateful to him. But it would also put those who had tried their best on the spot. They might even end up giving up on trying their best and thinking that all they needed to do was be able to handle hardship.","This would spell trouble for their career as Spirit Craftsmen.","But while it was true that the Spirit Craftsmen had made mistakes, they also had to be recognized for the effort they had put in.","Since Lin Yuan had encountered Hu Quan teaching the Spirit Craftsmen a lesson, he took two steps forward to Hu Quan and said to the Spirit Craftsmen, “Uncle Hu expects so much from you because it will benefit your futures significantly. I have noticed your effort and will be giving Liu Tong a batch of Bronze/Epic feys.","“All of you left your families to come into the marsh world. You can contract the Bronze/Epic feys yourselves or leave them to your descendants. Both are good options. The Spirit Craftsmen who are part of the reconstruction will be able to claim their share from Liu Tong once the reconstruction is done and is confirmed to meet the standards.”","Five months had passed since Lin Yuan had last given out welfare to the Spirit Craftsmen.","This round of welfare was completely the same as the previous one.","The Spirit Craftsmen could never have imagined they’d gain two Bronze/Epic feys in the span of six months and even be able to leave them to their descendants.","If Hu Quan was not there, the Spirit Craftsmen would have started excitingly hopping around.","Hu Quan turned to look at Lin Yuan, and a look of admiration and a smile of gladness appeared on his face.","When Hu Quan first entered the Return from Faraway Mansion, Lin Yuan still had not grown by much.","Thus, Hu Quan saw Lin Yuan very differently from how Master Hong Shen and the rest did.","Although Hu Quan had sworn his loyalty to Sky City, a part of him still saw Lin Yuan as a junior.","What Lin Yuan just said not only appeased the crowd but also supported the lesson that Hu Quan was trying to teach.","But Lin Yuan’s subversive method was much more effective compared to Hu Quan’s fierceness.","The Spirit Craftsmen who were part of the reconstruction would only be able to receive the Bronze/Epic feys one or two weeks later than the other Spirit Craftsmen did. This would definitely teach them a lesson.","When Hu Quan looked at Lin Yuan, Liu Tong did the same.","Liu Tong’s gaze was full of gratitude.","Hu Quan had always been the straightforward type.","When he arrived in the marsh world, he immediately sought out Liu Tong and told him about Lin Yuan’s praise of him.","At that moment, Liu Tong knew why Hu Quan, who was always aloof toward him, had abruptly changed his attitude and was even willing to accept him as a disciple.","Now that he was the official disciple of a Class 5 Spirit Craftsman, his own Spirit Craftsman level would soon be able to exceed that of other Spirit Craftsmen.","Hu Quan’s special treatment of Liu Tong cemented his status. The few Spirit Craftsmen who were always indignant of him were finally tamed.","Lin Yuan was the biggest benefactor he had encountered on his journey from a nameless Spirit Craftsman to who he was today.","Now that the scoldings were done, Hu Quan kept Liu Tong with him while he waved to the other Spirit Craftsmen to gesture to them to get to work.","Hu Quan led Liu Tong as they started discussing the territory’s plans and design with Lin Yuan.","Hu Quan had revised the plan numerous times due to the ground condition in the marsh world. He eventually decided to add some unconventionally intelligent elements to secure the structure.","At that moment, Lin Yuan suddenly sensed the ground starting to quake in the distance.","He was familiar with such quakes and knew that they had to come from Rising Lizard running toward him.","Lin Yuan looked suspicious.","He had told Rising Lizard, Wendy, and White Pavilion that he would often come to the marsh world.","Why did Rising Lizard not rush over when it sensed his appearance but was only running over now?","Rising Lizard could not speak to him.","This situation had to mean that Rising Lizard needed to see him about a matter.","Hu Quan was frightened by the trembling ground.","But when he saw Lin Yuan’s nonchalance, Hu Quan kept a lid on his fright. If the disciple he had just accepted sensed his fear, all of his pride and authority would vanish.","Liu Tong had seen Rising Lizard running more than once. He was already used to these quakes.","Slowly, Lin Yuan could see the terrifying image of Rising Lizard running at full speed with Wendy and White Pavilion on its back.","After he obtained a large number of Drugged Snake Eagle hearts, Wendy’s power swiftly increased.","If Rising Lizard and Wendy started fighting, it might not be able to beat Wendy. After all, regular Apostles would not be able to handle Wendy’s petrification ability and terrible venom.","Suddenly, Lin Yuan’s gaze landed on Rising Lizard’s head, where he saw a turtle in its mouth.","Lin Yuan could not help but be curious about why there was a turtle in Rising Lizard’s mouth.","Rising Lizard had become accustomed to eating the Medusa Giant Lizards, and its palate was now very selective. Rising Lizard was even starting to lose interest in the Marsh Crocodiles, much less the turtle-species dimensional lifeforms that tasted far worse.","Since Rising Lizard did not have the turtle-species dimensional lifeform in its mouth to eat it, it was likely that Rising Lizard was coming to see him because of the turtle-species dimensional lifeform.","Lin Yuan instinctively used True Data to check on the turtle-species dimensional lifeform out of curiosity. What he saw immediately caused his excitement to flare up.","At that moment, Lin Yuan was just as excited as when he found out about Celestial Sight’s bloodline ability.","He turned and said to Hu Quan, “Uncle Hu, I think you should change our design for the base. We won’t need to build the territory on the ground. Rising Lizard, Wendy, and White Pavilion have brought me a large surprise!”","Hu Quan did not have True Data, nor was he a Class 5 Creation Master. He could not see the truth just from Rising Lizard holding the turtle-species dimensional lifeform in its mouth."]},{"number":2233,"title":"Chapter 2233 Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle!","paragraphs":["2233 Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle!","But Hu Quan knew that since Lin Yuan had said that, it had to be right.","Since there was no need to build a base on the marsh world’s loose ground, there was no longer any need to discuss the current design.","As a Spirit Craftsman, Hu Quan was very enthusiastic when it came to drawing up designs.","Lin Yuan’s eyes had been fixed on the turtle-species dimensional lifeform in Rising Lizard’s mouth.","Although the turtle-species dimensional lifeform was only Class 1, it definitely had the talent to become an Apostle. Lin Yuan was even willing to provide resources to nurture it into a Dictator.","[Alien Beast Name]: Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle","[Lifeform State]: Dimensional lifeform","[Alien Beast Class]: Class 1","Natural Skill:","[Mutated Shell]: Every time the effects of a special earth element are absorbed, the shell will take control of the effects and absorb them to expand the size of the shell. This will make the body stronger.","Lin Yuan had been developing in the marsh world for more than six months. During this time, he had gained a deep understanding of the lifeforms in the marsh world.","After Lin Yuan sent the Spirit Craftsmen into the marsh world to begin building the territory, he had asked Hu Quan to gather a few Fey Observers who could draw up a record of the discovered marsh dimensional lifeforms.","Lin Yuan had arranged for Feng Shuang, a Class 4 Creation Master, to lead the team of Fey Observers.","The records of the lifeforms in the marsh world had already filled up eight thick books. This was the precious knowledge that Lin Yuan had collected in his explorations of the marsh world.","If the books were given to any faction trying to explore the marsh world, they would help them avoid many potholes.","There were a total of two turtle-species dimensional lifeforms in the records. One was the Marsh Soil Scary Turtle, while the other was the Rock Plank Pavilion Turtle.","The Marsh Soil Scary Turtle searched for marsh soil continuously and stored ιτ in its stomach.","This was so they could digest the marsh soil to increase their power. The marsh soil was also used to attract females.","The Marsh Soil Scary Turtle did not have a yearly breeding period like other turtle-species dimensional lifeforms did.","When the Marsh Soil Scary Turtles went into breeding frenzies, they were always in the midst of combat.","This unique way of attracting mates meant that the Marsh Soil Scary Turtles that could not produce high-grade marsh soil would not be able to pass on their bloodlines.","If the Marsh Soil Scary Turtle could not find high-grade marsh soil to attract females within five years, it might even become a struggle to obtain low-grade marsh soil that was used to maintain its survival.","From the appearance of the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle in Rising Lizard’s mouth, Lin Yuan could be sure that the Rock Plank Pavilion Turtle was the victim.","Lin Yuan had a deeper impression of the Rock Plank Pavilion Turtle than the Marsh Soil Scary Turtle.","The Rock Plank Pavilion Turtle absorbed earth-elemental energy while it was growing. The earth-elemental energy would be compressed and applied to its shell.","There appeared to be a pavilion on the Rock Plank Pavilion Turtle’s back. In actuality, it was a rock pile that had stacked up over time.","The Rock Plank Pavilion Turtle did not have any combat abilities, and its only means of defense was its shell. It consumed nutritious marsh soil that contained organic matter from decayed lifeforms. It truly had no bone to pick with anything in the world.","The Rock Plank Pavilion Turtle was a large turtle-species dimensional lifeform but could retreat its head, four limbs, and tail into its shell just like smaller turtle-species dimensional lifeforms could.","This saved the Rock Plank Pavilion Turtle from extinction in the marsh world.","With this thought, Lin Yuan cursed to himself.","It was difficult to tell if the Rock Plank Pavilion Turtle had been willing to participate in the copulation that resulted in the birth of the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle.","If the Rock Plank Pavilion Turtle retreated its head, tail, and limbs into its shell, there was no way the Marsh Soil Scary Turtle could have forced it.","Since the Rock Plank Pavilion Turtle could absorb earth-elemental energy to create rocks, Lin Yuan had considered nurturing one so he could stand on one while it was in the water.","Because of the special abilities of Klein Hub, Lin Yuan could not move its position easily. This was why he had thought long and hard before deciding where the base would be built.","Even the places in the marsh world where mud gathered were actually just floating on the seemingly endless marsh.","If something could prop up the territory from underneath, Klein Hub would be unaffected, and the territory would also become mobile.","For this, Lin Yuan had intentionally nurtured 10 of the Rock Plank Pavilion Turtles.","But while he was nurturing them, Lin Yuan realized that they only grew to 20 meters wide at most. There was no way they would be able to hold up the entire territory.","As such, Lin Yuan gave up on that idea.","But now, the appearance of the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle allowed Lin Yuan to see new possibilities.","With the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle’s Mutated Shell skill, every special earth-elemental effect it absorbed would expand its shell and strengthen it.","Lin Yuan might be troubled to find sufficient earth elements with special effects before entering the marsh world. But now that he was in the marsh world, each type of strange low-grade marsh soil contained a different earth-elemental effect.","Lin Yuan had already collected more than thousands of types of low-grade marsh soil without even asking the Medusa Snake Demons to search for them.","Lin Yuan only had a few tens of the Medusa Snake Demons under him. Only half of them went out at a time to gather marsh soil and dimensional lifeforms that would be useful for the territory’s development.","Furthermore, it was almost time for the Banquet of Everything, where Lin Yuan could trade the Storing Ability White Peaches and Deposit Ability Litchi Branches to any Apostle in attendance for the marsh soil, which were considered common goods.","Lin Yuan felt that with the craving that Apostles had for source-type power, there should be none who would turn him down.","As such, it would not be difficult for Lin Yuan to enable the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle to grow larger.","As for the earth-elemental energy that the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle would need after obtaining the earth-elemental effects, Lin Yuan had more than enough of it.","With just this natural skill, the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle had already met Lin Yuan’s expectations.","Once it became an Apostle, it would gain another natural skill that might even boost its current one or bring Lin Yuan a new surprise."]},{"number":2234,"title":"Chapter 2234 Totem of a Cross on the Shield","paragraphs":["2234 Totem of a Cross on the Shield","Rising Lizard had reached Lin Yuan at that point.","The Marsh Ground Sphagna covered the entirety of Lin Yuan’s territory and controlled the water content of the ground. Because of this, even a large creature like Rising Lizard running on the ground would not cause it to sink into the mud.","When Rising Lizard came up to Lin Yuan, it lowered its head and spat out the four-meter-wide Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle in front of Lin Yuan.","At that moment, the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle’s head, tail, and four limbs had all retracted into its shell.","Out of terror, the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle still dared not extend any of its retracted body parts when it was placed on the ground.","Its fright was completely understandable, given that it was a recently born dimensional lifeform that had been picked up and carried around in the mouth of the enormous Rising Lizard.","After Rising Lizard stopped, Wendy settled into Lin Yuan’s arms while White Pavilion wrapped its large tail around Lin Yuan’s leg.","With admiration, Wendy looked at Lin Yuan and said demurely, “Dad, haven’t you been wanting a turtle that can grow into a large fellow? I think this fellow has a lot of potential and will be easy to sustain.","“White Pavilion, Rising Lizard, and I discovered it together! We didn’t make any decisions on our own. This fellow’s bloodline is very special! If you don’t want it, one of the three of us will turn it into a Favored Believer.”","While it spoke, Wendy looked at Rising Lizard.","Because of its natural skill, the carnivorous plants it accepted as its Favored Believers would all benefit. On the other hand, White Pavilion was more suited to accepting the Marsh Crocodiles as its Favored Believers. Only Rising Lizard did not have a specific type of dimensional lifeform it could benefit from.","Besides contracting the Medusa Snake Demons, Rising Lizard could also form a contract with the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle.","Normally, Apostles competed with each other.","Although Lin Yuan had turned Wendy, Rising Lizard, and White Pavilion into Apostles, there was no competition between them at all. Instead, their relationship was more of a partnership.","Lin Yuan hurriedly shook his head when he heard what Wendy said.","Rather than the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle becoming one of the Apostles’ Favored Believers, Lin Yuan would prefer to nurture it into another Apostle.","A dimensional lifeform could improve much more by becoming an Apostle than the Favored Believer of an Apostle.","Furthermore, the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle was only a Class 1 dimensional lifeform. It would only cost Lin Yuan 100 units of source-type power to nurture it into an Apostle.","Although the description of the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle in True Data met Lin Yuan’s expectations, it still needed to be practically tested.","Lin Yuan gently pointed at the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle, and an intense amber light lit up on the tip of his finger.","In the midst of its obliviously comfortable state, its body started to grow, and cracks rippled all over its shell.","Before the cracked shell pieces fell off, the new shell grew out and shattered the original pieces.","This process was repeated almost 100 times in the span of half an hour.","During this time, the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle grew from its original four meters to almost 70 meters.","The thickness of its shell moved from 20 to 30 centimeters to almost two meters. This was much thicker than the shells of other turtle-species feys of the same size.","Besides the thickness of the shell, Lin Yuan was more excited about the fact that the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle’s four limbs had grown to the size of enormous tree trunks. It would take about six people stretching out their arms to wrap fully around one of its legs.","The bottom of its legs did not have the usual feet that turtles had but fleshy webbed pads that contained bones that were even thicker than those of a human’s body. The pad spanned over ten square meters.","Its wide webbed feet and short tail would allow it to move very quickly in water.","Lin Yuan’s biggest hope for the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle was that its shell and body would become sufficiently strong.","The Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle had perfectly accomplished this.","A shield-shaped totem appeared below its jaw. There was a cross emblazoned on it.","After this totem appeared, Lin Yuan knew that the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle had fully transformed into an Apostle.","Wendy gasped in Lin Yuan’s arms.","Wendy and Rising Lizard were already used to Lin Yuan transforming other dimensional lifeforms into Apostles because they had both personally witnessed him doing so.","White Pavilion, the last Apostle that Lin Yuan had transformed, was the only one who was curious about what happened.","But curiosity was all it felt. It did not find it hard to believe at all.","Wendy, Rising Lizard, and White Pavilion all saw Lin Yuan as a Dictator.","Wendy had gasped because it was shocked by the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle’s size.","From its size, it was so obvious that it had grown from a Class 1 dimensional lifeform to an Apostle!","After hearing Wendy gasp, Lin Yuan nodded in disbelief. The Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle had also grown beyond his expectations.","Lin Yuan excitedly checked on the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle again.","[Alien Beast Name]: Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle","[Lifeform State]: Apostle","[Alien Beast Class]: Class 1","[Power of Faith]: Extremely weak","[Apostle Totem]: Cross Shield Totem","Natural Skill:","[Mutated Shell]: Every time the effects of a special earth element are absorbed, the shell will take control of the effects and absorb them to expand the size of the shell. This will make the body stronger. Each time it receives offerings from believers, it can choose to expand its body or strengthen itself.","[Expansion Division]: Once the body expands to a certain extent, it can choose to differentiate one or multiple external bodies. The body can only grow as a result of the main body’s strengthening. It cannot be improved on its own. The differentiated bodies will possess equal strength and defensive abilities as the main body.","Faith Ability:","[Believer Change]: A portion of the energy in the totem is injected into a believer to change its life attitude from dimensional lifeform to Favored Believer.","After seeing how the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle’s natural skill Mutated Shell changed and its new natural skill, Lin Yuan took a deep breath.","He knew that the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle, which he had come to possess by chance, was going to help him establish his strategic plans for the marsh world.","From now on, Lin Yuan was not going to be restricted by geography in the marsh world and could fly as freely as a bird."]},{"number":2235,"title":"Chapter 2235 Increased Size!","paragraphs":["2235 Increased Size!","Lin Yuan did not need to be afraid that the development of the territory would stagnate after the resources around the territory were used up.","Any terrestrial territory’s development was restricted by the resources in its surroundings.","The 36 major cities in the Radiance Federation all took advantage of the resources around them as well as their surroundings.","This was why the disappearance of the lava zone resulted in the entire Bronze Furnace City’s development and finances taking a hit.","If the lava zone’s energy core did not need to be absorbed in order to revive Jade Sundial, which resulted in the disappearance of the lava zone, Lin Yuan would not have invested so many resources into Bronze Furnace City to help its development get back on track.","Ever since he picked this spot in the marsh world to set up his territory, Lin Yuan had been careful about the resources he gathered from the territory. This was so he could ensure sustainability. Because of this, Lin Yuan accumulated resources very slowly.","But now that the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle had appeared, Lin Yuan would no longer need to worry about sustainability and could rapidly gather resources from the marsh world.","As the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle moved around, it could gather resources from all over the marsh world to strengthen itself.","The Freedom Federation’s mirror cities in the marsh world could not accomplish this.","Lin Yuan was already very satisfied with the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle before it became an Apostle.","Now that it had become an Apostle, its original natural skill, Mutated Shell, had changed. It could now also evolve itself using the offerings from its believers and decide whether it wanted to expand its shell or strengthen its body to enable itself to carry even greater weight.","This would allow Lin Yuan to adjust the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle’s development direction. He would not have to be worried about the territory being too heavy for the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle to carry or too large for earth-elemental effects from the marsh soil to be unable to reach the entire territory.","After the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle became an Apostle, the improvement in Mutated Shell essentially strengthened its fundamental ability.","As for its new natural skill, Expansion Division, it allowed the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle to change from a singular body to a team it could control. This team would operate under one will and be controlled to do the same actions.","This would allow Lin Yuan to keep the gardens and territories with special effects separate but still by the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle’s side. He would not have to worry about organization.","Lin Yuan lifted his hand and touched the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle’s exposed, thick skin.","At that moment, the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle opened its eyes and met Lin Yuan’s gaze.","The Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle had become a large stone, but it was small compared to Rising Lizard.","The trauma of being in Rising Lizard’s mouth had not disappeared just because its life rank had been raised.","The Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle admired Lin Yuan while ducking behind him in fear, so he was sandwiched between it and the Rising Lizard.","Lin Yuan smiled at this.","The Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle was afraid of Rising Lizard now, but once it grew and gained intelligence, it would eventually come to thank Rising Lizard, Wendy, and White Pavilion.","The Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle had to thank them for discovering and giving it this opportunity. Otherwise, with Lin Yuan lacking the spare energy to invest in the marsh world, there was no way he could have crossed paths with the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle.","It was clearly recently born and had struggled after being separated from its parents.","With the hardness of the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle’s shell as a Class 1 dimensional lifeform, it would not be able to fend off Class 4 and above Marsh Crocodiles even if it retreated into its shell.","Lin Yuan gently told the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtle, “You have transformed into an Apostle. You will definitely become a stand-out figure in the marsh world. I shall call you Lift Marsh! I hope you will eventually be able to lift up the entire marsh world on your back one day!”","Lift Marsh did not seem to fully understand what Lin Yuan said. But it seemed to get the gist.","The admiration it felt for Lin Yuan led Lift Marsh to cherish the name that Lin Yuan had given it.","Lift Marsh shook its shell and let out two grunts that resembled those of a bull. This whistle-link roar meant that Lift Marsh could rapidly circulate its bloodline at any time.","When its bloodline was rapidly circulated, the pressure in its bloodstream could even break iron boards that were half a finger thick.","Lin Yuan had showered affection on Wendy, Rising Lizard, and White Pavilion, so they did not find anything strange about what he said.","But what Lin Yuan said to Lift Marsh caused the Medusa Snake Demons working nearby to turn green with envy.","Half an hour ago, Lift Marsh had less value than dirt. But now, it had joined the upper echelons.","Lin Yuan’s ability to turn a regular dimensional lifeform into an Apostle deepened the respect and fear that the Medusa Snake Demons felt for him.","Wendy was just as powerful as Rising Lizard but still had the heart of a child. It had only been born slightly longer than a year ago.","Wendy was actually the Snake Change Medusa. It changed back into its snake form and slithered onto Lift Marsh’s expansive back before it changed back into human form.","After sitting on Lift Marsh’s back for a while, Wendy said happily, “Although there are many horns on Lift Marsh’s back, it is very smooth and comfortable to sit on! From now on, I can sit on Lift Marsh’s back and won’t have to sit on Rising Lizard anymore!”","White Pavilion swished its tail.","Rising Lizard sadly swung its heads as its countenance seemed to deflate.","Rising Lizard was a ferocious beast that relied on close combat, and every part of its body was a powerful weapon. Its skin was no exception.","One would only feel slightly prickly when their skin was touched along the grain. But if they touched against the grain, one would feel like they were being sliced by sharp razors that could easily cleave off more flesh over five centimeters thick.","Because of this, Wendy and White Pavilion always had to be exceptionally cautious when they rode on Rising Lizard’s body. But no matter how careful they were, they had been accidentally cut more than once.","After Lift Marsh became familiar with Rising Lizard, White Pavilion, and Wendy, Lin Yuan took out a ball of low-grade marsh soil.","The moment Lin Yuan took out the green and shiny ball of marsh soil, Lift Marsh’s gaze was immediately attracted to it. From then on, it was difficult for Lift Marsh to tear its gaze away."]},{"number":2236,"title":"Chapter 2236 This Name Sure is Accurate!","paragraphs":["2236 This Name Sure is Accurate!","Luckily, Lin Yuan was holding the marsh soil. Otherwise, Lift Marsh would not have been able to resist lunging forward to grab it.","Lift Marsh had just absorbed 100 units of pure source-type power and evolved into an Apostle.","It had used up a lot of nutrients and energy during the evolution and was currently in a drained state.","When Lin Yuan saw Lift Marsh’s look of yearning, he immediately tossed the marsh soil over.","Lift Marsh agilely caught it with its head before swallowing it.","Next, Lin Yuan did not skimp out on the earth-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","It benefited both feys and dimensional lifeforms that needed earth-elemental energy to absorb pure earth-elemental energy.","Lift Marsh swallowed two of the earth-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls as though they were jelly beans, and its body soon started to expand as its shell began to molt.","Since the shell was only molting once this time, the entire process was completed in just three minutes.","Lift Marsh had clearly grown by two meters.","Lin Yuan continued to feed Lift Marsh more low-grade marsh soil.","He noticed that each time it ate one ball of low-grade marsh soil and two earth-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, its body would grow by two meters in diameter.","This meant that if Lin Yuan fed Lift Marsh all the low-grade marsh soil he had, it would grow into a giant beast that had a diameter of almost 20 kilometers. This was almost as large as an Island Whale.","There were so many types of low-grade marsh soil in the marsh world that the number could be said to be infinite. The different bacteria in different environments produced marsh soil with different effects.","These innumerable types of low-grade marsh soil were already enough to turn Lift Marsh into a giant creature that had a diameter of 10 kilometers.","Lift Marsh would grow even larger when it went on to eat more mid-grade and high-grade marsh soil.","With this thought, Lin Yuan fed Lift Marsh a ball of mid-grade marsh soil and a ball of high-grade marsh soil. The mid-grade marsh soil caused Lift Marsh’s shell to molt five times and its diameter to grow by 10 meters. The high-grade marsh soil caused Lift Marsh’s shell to molt 30 times and its diameter to grow by 60 meters.","The expansion of Lift Marsh exceeded Lin Yuan’s expectations.","He pursed his lips. He had indeed named Lift Marsh accurately!","Once Lift Marsh reached a diameter of 30 kilometers, it would be able to lift up Lin Yuan’s territory in the marsh world. Once its diameter reached 100 kilometers, it would be able to meet Lin Yuan’s needs for a long time.","From then on, Lin Yuan could use Lift Marsh’s Expansion Division to produce more bodies. Once the bodies reached a certain size, they would be able to hold up the gardens and other additional areas.","This thought filled Lin Yuan with motivation. He decided to feed all of the marsh soil besides that in the ground to Lift Marsh to expand it to the greatest extent.","Since Lin Yuan had not been focused on the marsh world, he had not decided on a direction for the marsh world’s development.","But now, he had made a decision for the direction of the marsh world’s short-term development. This direction of development was to obtain as many types of marsh soil as possible.","Once the Banquet of Everything ended, Lin Yuan’s trades with the Apostles from Marsh East Circle would make it easy to increase Lift Marsh’s diameter to more than 10 kilometers.","Now that he had ascertained Lift Marsh’s abilities, he smiled and said to the shocked Hu Quan next to him, “Uncle Hu, try to continue drawing up a design for the territory based on the state of the current ground. However, the territory will eventually be shifted onto Lift Marsh’s back, so there needs to be iron boards built into the structure. Plant the Gold-Wrapping Vines that can bind the iron boards together. They will extend their vines deep into the ground and hold the iron structures together to form a secure base.”","Hu Quan only regained his senses a moment later. He sighed and said, “Lin Yuan, I’m always refreshing my knowledge by being with you. I will redo the design for the territory based on your suggestions and submit a completed plan to you in five days.”","Hu Quan did not know about the Gold-Wrapping Vine and its effects. It did not exist in the Radiance Federation and was only native to the Great Lush Federation.","Hu Quan did not ask Lin Yuan where he could obtain so many iron boards to cover the enormous territory.","But since Lin Yuan had brought up this plan, he would definitely prepare the necessary resources and spiritual ingredients. This was how much Hu Quan trusted Lin Yuan and his affirmation of Lin Yuan’s abilities.","When Hu Quan led Liu Tong away to begin brainstorming over the designs, Wen Yu rushed over.","Lin Yuan had informed Wen Yu before he passed through Klein Hub to enter the marsh world.","Lin Yuan did not have much time to spend in his territory. The journey to the Marsh East Circle to attend the Banquet of Everything was long, and he needed to leave now.","Before the Banquet of Everything started, many Apostles arrived in advance to begin selling their resources. Lin Yuan did not want to waste this chance.","As such, he decided to seek out White Speak as soon as possible so they could rush to the Marsh East Circle together.","Liu Jie and Wen Yu were humans, not dimensional lifeforms, and they were also incapable of disguising themselves. Thus, Lin Yuan did not intend to take them with him to the Marsh East Circle.","When Lin Yuan fully unleashed his Dictator disguise, he could fool even a large group of Apostles. However, he did not know if he could pull the wool over the eyes of Dictators.","Wen Yu and Lin Yuan had been communicating through the Thoughts Letter Paper. As such, she did not have much that she needed to report to him.","Lin Yuan had instructed Wen Yu to take note of the Storing Ability White Peaches and Deposit Ability Litchi Branches.","A week ago, the Storing Ability White Peaches and Deposit Ability Litchi Branches that had been watered with Grade 4 spirit fluids had ripened, and Sun Ningxiang had sent professionals to harvest them.","All of the harvested Storing Ability White Peaches and Deposit Ability Litchi Branches were in the Diamond fey storage box that Wen Yu was holding.","Wen Yu handed the Diamond fey storage box to Lin Yuan and said with a smile, “Young Master, I have harvested all of the Storing Ability White Peaches and Deposit Ability Litchi Branches. However, the quality isn’t too good.”","Wen Yu paused before she spoke again."]},{"number":2237,"title":"Chapter 2237 New Golden Throne!","paragraphs":["2237 New Golden Throne!","“The 50 Storing Ability White Peach Trees only produced 600 kg of the Storing Ability White Peaches. The 100 Deposit Ability Litchi Branch Trees only produced 1.8 tons of the Deposit Ability Litchi Branches.”","While she spoke, Wen Yu’s expression became more suspicious.","She was a Class 3 Creation Master. Before she met Lin Yuan, she had been an attendant at the Radiant Moon Palace. When she joined Lin Yuan, she started out as his assistant in Creation Master matters. Thus, she had a clear understanding of feys.","Moreover, her knowledge was not lacking in comparison to a Class 4 Creation Master. She also had a general idea of the effects of Grade 4 spirit fluids.","Normally, 50 of the Storing Ability White Peach Trees should produce 750 kg of fruits. After being watered with Grade 4 spirit fluids, they should produce more than 1.5 tons of fruits.","The production rate of the Deposit Ability Litchi Branch was even more astonishing.","Yet, 100 of the Deposit Ability Litchi Branch Trees had only produced 1.8 tons of fruits. It was more than half less than Wen Yu’s estimation of 4 tons of fruits.","Wen Yu was not the only doubtful one. Sun Ningxiang was very confused as well.","Wen Yu had reported the situation to Lin Yuan before the Storing Ability White Peach and Deposit Ability Litchi Branch trees had produced fruits. She only relaxed after Lin Yuan said that this situation was normal.","Lin Yuan coughed when he heard what Wen Yu said.","The Storing Ability White Peaches and Deposit Ability Litchi Branches would soon steal the spotlight of the Banquet of Everything and allow Lin Yuan to buy up all the resources in the Marsh East Circle.","Shadow was the first high-class dimensional lifeform that Lin Yuan interacted with. But it had not reached Apostle then.","Thus, Lin Yuan could not use Shadow to judge how attractive source-type power was to Apostles.","Then, he met White Speak.","From White Speak’s reactions to source-type power, Lin Yuan knew that Apostles craved for source-type power more than regular dimensional lifeforms did.","White Speak was not considered a weak Apostle.","There was no way that a below-average Apostle could crave source-type power more strongly than an upper Apostle did. This was because the stronger the Apostle, the stronger its desire to break through.","If Lin Yuan did not have many Storing Ability White Peaches and Deposit Ability Litchi Branches, which could increase source-type power, it might not cause much of a stir among the Apostles.","But Lin Yuan had a combined almost 2.5 tons of the Storing Ability White Peaches and Deposit Ability Litchi Branches. He definitely had massive stock that might even enable Dictators to break through.","With Celestial Sight and Begin Lady around, Lin Yuan did not feel any pressure about his journey to the Marsh East Circle and Banquet of Everything.","However, he did not intend to let Celestial Sight and Begin Lady show themselves unless it was absolutely necessary.","As a fake Dictator, Lin Yuan needed to have a true Apostle by his side in order not to raise suspicion.","Nonetheless, White Speak’s presence was enough to help Lin Yuan evade many roadblocks.","“Wen Yu, the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meetings will stop for some time. If there are any issues, I will inform all of you through the Thoughts Letter Paper.”","The Astronomical Parliament’s members could carry on as per usual with the Thoughts Letter Papers in their possessions.","But Lin Yuan was going to take a long trip and could not take Wen Yu back to the main world through Klein Hub.","In the marsh world, sacred source lifeforms could not link up with the stars and use the power of the stars to pull Bei Xu and the rest into the secret space among the constellations.","Luckily, Lin Yuan had set up a very solid foundation for the Astronomical Parliament’s members.","Even if he had to be absent for a month or two, there would be no issues cropping up that they could not handle.","“Young Master, don’t worry and leave things here to me. With Big Brother Liu here, things will become much easier for me. Besides Ningxiang, there isn’t really anyone else I can trust. During the next Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting, the Astronomical Parliament’s Stars will have increased, and it will be able to pull another two people into the parliamentary meetings!”","Lin Yuan pondered momentarily before saying, “Only three of the 12 golden thrones have been filled. The next Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting will only be held a month later. Send an announcement to them through the Thoughts Letter Paper later. The members of the Astronomical Parliament with the biggest improvements will eventually be able to fill up the spots on the golden thrones.”","Wen Yu was slightly stunned before she immediately understood what Lin Yuan was getting at.","The members of the Astronomical Parliament were getting along too well! They were almost getting too comfortable.","This situation would be very helpful for the development of the Astronomical Parliament’s members.","No matter how united a faction was, the members were still competitors.","Lin Yuan wanted to rile up the competitive spirit among the members of the Astronomical Parliament.","Lin Yuan’s judging standards were also very fair. It was based on which member of the Astronomical Parliament improved the most.","This method of competing would cause the members who came from outstanding backgrounds to lose their advantages. After all, with their backgrounds, their starting points were naturally ahead of others.","No matter how much they improved or achieved, the benefits of their background would be subtracted.","Without this mode of competition, Yin Lin would definitely end up sitting on the fourth golden throne.","With this method, all of them stood an equal chance of vying for a seat on the golden throne. The members would have to change and improve on their own during Lin Yuan’s absence. This would determine who ended up occupying the golden thrones.","Wen Yu could imagine how excited all of the members of the Astronomical Parliament would be after they received the news through the Thoughts Letter Paper.","Ever since Liu Jie took the Virgo throne, Yin Lin, Su Yiren, Bei Xu, and even Bu Po started thirsting for the remaining nine golden thrones.","Wen Yu was certain that during Lin Yuan’s absence, the members of the Astronomical Parliament would definitely make large waves.","But the Astronomical Parliament had been silently developing for almost eight months. It was time for this secret organization to shake up the main world.","By the time Lin Yuan and Wen Yu were done speaking, White Speak had organized the items and brought them over to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan was currently east of the East Vast Large Lake, a relatively small part of the Marsh East Circle.","Lin Yuan’s attendance at the Banquet of Everything was definitely considered a long journey.","White Speak had been to the Marsh East Circle before, but it had only recently evolved into an Apostle back then and had not caught any eyes. It had had no right to enter the residence of the Marsh East Palace."]},{"number":2238,"title":"Chapter 2238 Polar Sea Large Lake","paragraphs":["2238 Polar Sea Large Lake","But as things changed over time, looking back, White Speak’s mindset had changed significantly.","White Speak’s power had increased, especially when Lin Yuan used faith power to boost it.","White Speak knew that as long as Lin Yuan was willing to bless it with faith power, it could surpass all those with the level of Apostle.","Secondly, White Speak had changed its perception of its identity.","Previously, it had been a wandering Apostle and did not have a strong faction that supported it.","But now, it had the support of Lin Yuan, a Dictator. It had even received Lin Yuan’s dictator’s prize. Apostles that had received their Dictator’s dictator’s prize had a higher status than other Apostles.","The change in its identity caused White Speak to even lose respect for those ancient fossils in Marsh East Circle. They had reached the peak of Apostle but were unable to break through. Thus, they did not deserve to be discussed alongside Lin Yuan.","“Lord Dictator, I will use my source sacred body later. You can ride on my back as we rush there! Our time is a bit tight. This is the only way to ensure that you’ll be able to make it to participate in the advance trading that takes place before the Banquet of Everything.”","White Speak hung its head low. It felt that it had been inappropriate.","How did it dare to ask Lin Yuan to ride on its back? Would Lin Yuan think that it had been rude? But it was true that this was the only way to help Lin Yuan achieve his goal.","White Speak believed that someone like Lin Yuan did not need to participate in the advance trading held by those old Apostles in the Palace of Everything.","But it did not take long for White Speak to come up with a reasonable explanation for itself. It guessed that Lin Yuan had only recently transformed into a Dictator from the Turning Wheel Realm. He must have changed a portion of his memory when his life rank was transformed. This was why he was curious about the items that were being traded and wanted to join in.","If Lin Yuan knew what White Speak was thinking, he would immediately think that White Speak could fill the gaps on its own!","There was heavy responsibility that came with managing a household. As the leader of Sky City, Lin Yuan was in charge of all of its costs.","The territory in the marsh world needed to be built, and the same went for the territory that was to be built atop Universe.","Apart from these, Lin Yuan’s most pressing matter at the moment was to nurture Lift Marsh.","He had a great need for sacred source lifeforms, source-type items, and marsh soil of various grades.","There was no way that something as inferior as marsh soil would appear at the Banquet of Everything. But it had to be available in piles at the advance trading event.","Lin Yuan wanted to obtain more of the resources needed to evolve Lift Marsh at this trading event.","“Thank you for your hard work, White Speak!”","While Lin Yuan spoke, he generously lifted his hand and transferred 1,000 units of source-type power into White Speak’s body.","The 1,000 units of source-type power flowed throughout White Speak’s body, filling it with a sense of bliss.","White Speak knew that this was a casual reward from Lin Yuan. It felt way too good to be by the side of such a generous Dictator!","It thought back to how difficult of a life it had led in the past, and this intensified its gratitude and respect for Lin Yuan.","White Speak immediately activated its source sacred body. In this state, it was almost three meters tall.","Lin Yuan could ride on White Speak without ease. Once he climbed aboard White Speak, he waved at Liu Jie and Wen Yu as he said, “White Speak, let’s go! You can absorb the source-type power along the journey. If you finish absorbing the source-type power during the journey, I will provide you with more.”","Lin Yuan’s words caused White Speak to stomp happily on the ground.","White Speak felt that it was difficult to obtain pure source-type energy, but it did not mean much to Lin Yuan.","With the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, Lin Yuan could produce hundreds of units each day.","Only one source-type crystal was needed to produce one unit of pure source-type power.","At first, his use of source-type power was rather heavy. He had used all of it to improve the quality of laws.","But after it became easy for him to obtain source-type crystals, he started to accumulate source-type power.","Presently, he had accumulated more than 200,000 units of source-type power.","He would not feel the sting even if he gave White Speak 10,000 units of it, much less 1,000 units. After all, White Speak was one of the Apostles under him, making it part of his power.","...","A shining palace made of dark blue gems was deep in the sea. The walls were smattered with textures that seemed to reflect frigid hardness. The layers of reflected light resulted in the palace emanating a sense of boundlessness.","If the feng shui masters from Lin Yuan’s previous life came to this place, they would immediately notice that it was a place where darkness gathered and was extremely malevolent. No matter how long a person lived there, they would eventually be crushed by the overwhelming evil.","But this was just how the place was seen in the eyes of outsiders. But this place was sacred to the Apostles from the Polar Sea Large Lake.","That was because there was an Apostle by the name of Return to Ruins who lived there.","Many Apostles in their source sacred body state kneeling outside the palace. One of them had already been kneeling for 20 full years but had not had the opportunity to meet with Dictator Return to Ruins once.","Since it had not even had the chance to meet Dictator Return to Ruins, it went without saying that it had not received the dictator’s prize either.","Suddenly, the doors of the radiant palace swung open, and two Apostles wearing dark blue clothes walked out holding a book.","After sharing a look, they picked four Apostles from those who were kneeling.","The chosen Apostles could not contain their expressions of excitement, while those who had not been picked immediately started glaring at the four Apostles with envy.","They knew that these chosen Apostles were about to be blessed with Dictator Return to Ruins’ teachings. Once they left, they would boast to every other Apostle they came across about how they had once received Dictator Return to Ruins’ guidance.","At that time, even the Apostles, who were more powerful than them, would have to pay them some level of respect.","Furthermore, besides respect, they could also increase their power with the guidance they received from Dictator Return to Ruins. This evolution method was much more effective than aimlessly searching around on their own."]},{"number":2239,"title":"Chapter 2239 Where Did You Hide?","paragraphs":["2239 Where Did You Hide?","After a few hours passed, the four lucky chosen Apostles walked out of the palace with ecstatic expressions.","The Apostles kneeling outside changed their attitudes toward the four Apostles.","The Polar Sea Large Lake was expansive and chock full of resources. The Apostles within the Polar Sea Large Lake were split into two groups.","The first group was made up of those who had been taught by Dictator Return to Ruins. The other group was made up of those who did not have the right to meet with Dictator Return to Ruins.","The Apostles Dictator Return to Ruins had taught occupied the upper echelons of the Polar Sea Large Lake, only seconded by the Apostles who had received Dictator Return to Ruins’s dictator’s prizes.","This separation of lifeforms in the Polar Sea Large Lake caused the Apostles to take on the habit of paying their respects to Dictator Return to Ruins.","This culture had persisted for a long time.","It was difficult to track Apostles who were thousands to tens of thousands of years old. This was why newly evolved Apostles all rushed to kneel outside of Dictator Return to Ruins’ palace.","Habits would slowly turn into common practices that slowly changed into laws.","Without Dictator Return to Ruins’ guidance and protection, there was no way they would be able to make a name for themselves in the Polar Sea Large Lake.","Even if they decided not to stay in the Polar Sea Large Lake and went into other lakes to develop, they could still accomplish many things by taking advantage of Dictator Return to Ruins’ name.","Within the castle made of dark blue gems, a man with inky black hair that hung down to his neck was looking down at his fingers.","His aura was elegant, but his eyes were full of gleaming sharpness. This was enough to know that he was not as refined as his countenance made him seem.","Flecks of navy blue in the strands of his hair intertwined with the dark blue light dancing on his fingertips.","The dark blue light on his fingers rose and formed various shapes in the air. The constantly changing shapes indicated that the man was not at peace.","“The light green moon has already risen and fallen 6,000 times. How long it has been! Ever since becoming a Dictator, this is the closest that my faith power has come to reaching the Turning Wheel Realm. I heard that Dictator Everything has already stepped into the Turning Wheel Realm. I should take a look during the Banquet of Everything!”","While he was mumbling, he shook his hair as though he had come to a decision.","His gaze sharpened in an instant. He chuckled bitterly and continued murmuring, “Oh, Everything! You’ve hidden yourself ever since you stepped into the Turning Wheel Realm! I’m so curious to know where you’ve hidden.","“This Banquet of Everything should have been canceled, but you’re still holding it as per usual. This means that the Banquet of Everything will help you enter the Turning Wheel Realm! If that’s the case, you should be making an appearance at the Banquet of Everything or at least stick your head out from wherever you’ve been hiding!","“I didn’t dare to touch you before you stepped into the Turning Wheel Realm, but now that you have, you won’t be able to return to your prime before at least a few centuries have passed. So you can’t blame me for having an eye on you.”","There were two handsome androgynous figures next to this man. Both of them had respect written all over their faces.","Dictator Return to Ruins’ power had reached another level in the past few years.","During this process, Dictator Return to Ruins had not only gained benefits for himself but had also selected a few outstanding Apostles and kept them by his side to increase the overall power of the Return to Ruins Palace.","Return to Ruins was strict with its subordinates, but he knew when to be kind.","The entire Polar Sea Large Lake was permeated with Dictator Return to Ruins’ wills.","But none of this was what Dictator Return to Ruins wanted. What he wanted was to enter the Turning Wheel Realm.","Pinnacle Apostles looked forward to transforming into Dictators as much as Dictators yearned to enter the Turning Wheel Realm.","Although they would have to start over once they entered the Turning Wheel Realm, any lifeform that wanted to perfect itself would want to break past its limits.","Dictator Return to Ruins not only yearned to raise his life rank, but the strong subordinates he had nurtured were also the reason that he did not need to be afraid of starting over once he entered the Turning Wheel Realm.","Dictator Everything had been managing the Palace of Everything for tens of thousands of years. He was considered a veteran Dictator.","It was the strength of the Palace of Everything that made Dictator Everything release the news that it had entered the Turning Wheel Realm.","But no matter how strong the Palace of Everything was, there was no second Dictator.","Thus, if Return to Ruins was bent on conquering the Palace of Everything, there was no way they could fight back.","The Apostles that Return to Ruins had been nurturing for thousands of years were all pinnacle Apostles.","Nonetheless, there was still no second Dictator in the Polar Sea Large Lake.","This showed how venerated and rare Dictators were in the dimensional worlds.","This was also why the Polar Sea Large Lake had been so calm for thousands of years.","In order for an Apostle to transform into a Dictator, the most basic condition was to ensure that their faith was not tied to anyone else.","The master and servant bond in the marsh world was made of faith power. Thus, Dictators could only stand at the top and not be subservient to anyone.","Once an Apostle successfully evolved into a Dictator, it had to become domineering, even if their previous demeanor as an Apostle had been respectful and amiable. This was the fate of Dictators.","Return to Ruins had also changed his attitude when he became a Dictator.","However, it was smart enough to choose to flee. Otherwise, he would already be dead by now, and others would have collected and toyed with his source totem.","Return to Ruins had experience being hunted. He had also killed other Dictators before he arrived at the Polar Sea Large Lake.","The source totem left behind after an Apostle died was useless to Dictators, but the source totem left after a Dictator died could be turned into weapons by other Dictators.","Even with the advantage and having used all of his capabilities, Return to Ruins still suffered heavy injuries when he killed a Dictator.","This was why Return to Ruins Palace had chosen to retreat to the Polar Sea Large Lake to recuperate and build the Return to Ruins Palace.","The chances were very slim for one Dictator to be able to kill another Dictator.","In the marsh world, Dictators were no different from kings.","If a fight truly broke out, it would be difficult for one party to keep another from fleeing if they wanted to.","Thus, despite Dictator Everything being a veteran Dictator, Return to Ruins did not believe that Dictator Everything possessed any source totems left over from dead Dictators."]},{"number":2240,"title":"Chapter 2240 Dictator Everything Has Disappeared!","paragraphs":["2240 Dictator Everything Has Disappeared!","The source totems that Return to Ruins possessed were very suitable for it. This was why he had the courage to cause trouble for Dictator Everything in a bid to break through.","“Ring Silver and Ring Gold, release the news that from tomorrow onward, I will no longer be allowing any Apostles to enter the palace. I will head to Marsh East Circle to attend the Banquet of Everything.”","Dictators did whatever they wanted, and there was no need to make things clear to those Apostles.","Return to Ruins gave such an instruction because he wanted the news to get out that he was attending the Banquet of Everything.","The news of a Dictator attending another Dictator’s banquet would become the talking point of all the lifeforms in the marsh world.","It was likely that many Apostles who had not intended to attend the Banquet of Everything would change their minds in the hopes of attaining an opportunity.","Even some Apostles from the Polar Sea Large Lake would head to Marsh East Circle to participate in the Banquet of Everything to stay close to Return to Ruins.","However, Return to Ruins did not intend for the news to reach these people. The only one he wanted to hear about the news was Dictator Everything.","The Dictators in the marsh world usually never cross paths. But once any one of them made a move, the others would have to react.","If Dictator Everything did not hesitate to show itself after learning that Return to Ruins was heading to the Banquet of Everything, Dictator Everything could openly ask for help. He could even negotiate an exchange to pay Dictator Everything for the aid.","But if Dictator Everything continued to hide, it would send a valuable signal.","If a Dictator was confident of being able to take on another Dictator, they would not give up their pride.","Once Dictator Everything showed a hint of weakness, Dictator Return to Ruins would do whatever it took to hunt Dictator Everything down. He would then use his secret weapons and the source totem left behind by that veteran Dictator he had killed to take down Dictator Everything.","Even if he did not manage to find a way to enter the Turning Wheel Realm through Dictator Everything, the source totem left behind by Dictator Everything who had entered the Turning Wheel Realm would ensure that his efforts did not go to waste.","Dictator Return to Ruins preferred to walk in the light rather than the shadows. One could hide in the shadows but not in the light.","When they heard what their Dictator said, the two Apostles called Ring Silver and Ring Gold blinked their multicolored eyes and said respectfully, “Lord Dictator, we will send out the message. Who are you planning on taking with you to the Marsh East Circle?”","After asking the question, Ring Silver and Ring Gold looked rather anxious. It was as though they were afraid that Dictator Return to Ruins would name someone besides them.","Dictator Return to Ruins looked up at the dark green blurry images on the ceiling before saying decidedly, “All 80 teams and troops under the Return to Ruins Palace will follow me in secret. As for the Apostles who have been kneeling outside, there isn’t a need to try and stop those who want to follow.”","The hopefulness and anxiousness in Ring Silver and Ring Gold’s eyes immediately changed into excited enthusiasm.","They finally had the chance to be used by Dictator Return to Ruins. Their Dictator was about to begin a magnificent battle.","Many years had passed since the last magnificent battle between the factions of Dictators.","Each battle ended in great tragedy and was accompanied by rivers of blood and corpses.","But after the battle, the winning side would take over the fruits of victory and thus become much stronger than they used to be.","All of the lifeforms in the marsh world were born into struggle and fighting. They were only able to lead peaceful lives once they became Apostles.","Every dimensional lifeform had an intense yearning for combat.","With how much Ring Silver and Ring Gold worshiped Dictator Return to Ruins, there was no way they would even entertain the thought of Dictator Return to Ruins losing.","Dictator Return to Ruins’ order to send out the announcement was using them to begin preparing for the battle.","Ring Silver and Ring Gold were very competent. They quickly got a handle on their emotions and announced exactly what Dictator Return to Ruins had said.","After Ring Silver and Ring Gold left, Dictator Return to Ruins extracted the blurry, dark green image from the ceiling.","Once the green image left the ceiling, it immediately turned into nine-colored lights.","Even Dictator Return to Ruins could not see the blurry green figure’s real appearance past the nine-colored lights.","But Dictator Return to Ruins was well aware of how deadly the item hidden within the nine-colored ball of light was. In the past, he had almost died at its hands.","But after his victory, he turned the green figure into his weapon.","Dictator Return to Ruins slowly adjusted his simple but still presentable clothing. This movement resembled that of a gentleman.","After adjusting his clothes, Dictator Return to Ruins Palace strode out of the palace he had not left for the past 6,000 years.","The instant that he stepped out of the palace, Dictator Return to Ruins Palace looked up at the sky.","In an instant, blue flames appeared that seemed to lock up the entire world.","The pressurizing and terrifying blue flames seemed to destroy anything they touched and reduced them to nothing.","...","Dictator Everything’s reputation might not have spread throughout the entire marsh world, but lifeforms of a certain level in Marsh East Circle had all heard of her.","The Palace of Everything only hosted the Banquet of Everything once every century. It had long become the main event of the Marsh East Circle.","The Banquet of Everything was held in a different location each time, and there were currently an untold number of Apostles who were rushing to this year’s location.","But no one knew that the elites of the Palace of Everything, which had always been considered powerful beings shrouded in mystery, were currently in a state of bewilderment. This was because 80 years ago, Dictator Everything disappeared, and there had been no trace of her since.","The Banquet of Everything was being held as per schedule this year because the Palace of Everything’s elites wanted to keep up appearances. They did not want the others to start to panic and make decisions on their own.","Three girls with light purple hair were sitting in front of a large vine table with many rainbow masses. They distractedly played with these rainbow masses.","A moment later, the girl, who was clearly younger, could not help but say, “First Sister, Second Sister, Lordess Everything was clearly fine at first after stepping into the Turning Wheel Realm. But she suddenly disappeared, and not even we can catch any wind of her news. Do you think something has happened to Lordess Everything...”"]},{"number":2241,"title":"Chapter 2241 Hope It Isn’t You!","paragraphs":["2241 Hope It Isn’t You!","The girl was clearly not done speaking, but a sharp hiss cut her off.","“Third Sister, don’t say such inauspicious things! What could happen to Lordess Everything? Lordess Everything clearly prepared well before she entered the Turning Wheel Realm. It’s likely that Lordess Everything feels unsafe staying in the Palace of Everything! Something must have happened in the Palace of Everything that we don’t know about.”","After being rebuked, the young girl pouted sadly.","The girl who had not spoken narrowed her eyes but soon relaxed and said, “First Sister, Third Sister has secretly cried under her blankets untold times ever since Lordess Everything disappeared. She’s just worried about Lordess Everything! When Lordess Everything was still around, Third Sister was her favorite.”","The oldest girl did not say anything else, while the youngest girl looked gratefully at her Second Sister.","The second oldest girl smiled gently. At that moment, the two other girls heard the oldest girl say sternly, “Second Born and Third Born, go with me to the Marsh East Circle to socialize with the people coming to the Marsh East Palace.","“Under no circumstances can the news of Lordess Everything’s disappearance get out! Otherwise, chaos will definitely follow! Ever since Lordess Everything entered the Turning Wheel Realm, many things have happened to the Palace of Everything. I’m sure there are things you can understand without me having to say them!”","Third Born hurriedly nodded.","The three of them did not have the capability or means to search for Lordess Everything.","If Lordess Everything truly hid after sensing something was wrong, they would go against Lordess Everything’s plans if they sought her out.","As such, the only thing they could do was focus on making the Banquet of Everything a success and make sure that they did not cause the Palace of Everything’s reputation to take a hit during Lordess Everything’s absence.","Second Born gently played with the hairs hanging over her forehead. Her eyes were slightly narrowed as though she was thinking about something.","Although she was going two things at once, she still agreed to what First Born said and left to head to the Marsh East Palace.","There had never been any Dictators in the Marsh East Circle. Thus, the Marsh East Palace had no right to put on airs in front of the Palace of Everything.","Instead of saying that Second Born and Third Born were heading to the Marsh East Palace to communicate with the veteran Apostles, it was more accurate to say that they were going to give out orders.","None of the veteran Apostles in the Marsh East Palace would dare to go against an order from the Palace of Everything.","Thus, Third Born did not see this task as overly difficult. Most of her thoughts still had to do with Dictator Everything’s disappearance.","After Second Born and Third Born left, First Born looked in the direction they had walked off in and remained lost in her thoughts for some time.","Eventually, she lowered her gaze and murmured, “I have looked through the entire Palace of Everything. I can’t be the one threatening Lordess Everything. I have absolute loyalty and faith in Lordess Everything. The only two I haven’t checked are Second Born and Third Born. I really hope it isn’t one of those two. Or perhaps both of you are involved!”","While she spoke, a sharp glint flashed across her eyes.","Whether it was Second Born and Third Born or Lin Yuan and White Speak, both groups encountered numerous Apostles on the way to the Marsh East Palace.","Usually, it was rare to see so many Apostles so close to Marsh East Palace.","The East Vast Large Lake was expansive, but this was only from the perspective of dimensional lifeforms. To Apostles, it did not take much time to traverse the entire East Vast Large Lake.","It was just like how White Speak had called out Dark Scorpion so easily.","All the Apostles in the East Vast Large Lake had heard of each other.","White Speak had also made a big name for itself in the East Vast Large Lake.","There were many Apostles who knew White Speak who immediately tried to hide or greet it after they crossed paths.","When these Apostles saw a young man sitting astride White Speak, they could not help but look surprised.","Lin Yuan did not have a hint of the dimensional lifeform aura.","When Lin Yuan did not activate his faith power, the other Apostles could not sense the presence of faith power from him.","Some Apostles knew that White Speak had an offspring to whom it had passed its bloodline. But it was clear that the person on White Speak’s back did not share its bloodline.","But after making their greetings, the Apostles did not ask any further questions.","The best way to survive in the marsh world was to ask as few questions as possible.","The Apostle in human form on White Speak’s back might be something that was going to be traded at the Banquet of Everything!","White Speak did not know what these other Apostles were thinking. But if White Speak knew that they saw Lin Yuan as something it was going to sell, it would immediately try to kill them. Those Apostles were insulting the object of its faith and worship.","After the other Apostles left, Lin Yuan smiled and said, “White Speak, you are pretty well-known in the East Vast Large Lake!”","White Speak did not feel proud when it heard what Lin Yuan said. It also did not try to show off in front of him. In a relaxed and sincere voice, it said, “Lord Dictator, this is the East Vast Large Lake. There are at least tens of districts like the East Vast Large Lake in the Marsh East Circle.","“The East Vast Large Lake is considered to be of average power. Once we’re out of the Marsh East Circle, there won’t be any more of these events! If anyone tries to target us along the way or has any evil intentions, please bless me with power!”","Lin Yuan nodded gently.","When White Speak saw this, it looked happily expectant.","White Speak really liked it when Lin Yuan boosted it with faith power. Whenever he did so, White Speak could take control of a higher level of power.","The feeling of such incredible power allowed White Speak to see the direction in which it needed to improve.","As they encountered more and more Apostles, Lin Yuan no longer needed to inject pure source-type power into White Speak.","Lin Yuan did not intend to hide his ‘Dictator’ identity, but he also did not want to be the center of so much attention."]},{"number":2242,"title":"Chapter 2242 Lord Dictator, Sorry to Startle You!","paragraphs":["2242 Lord Dictator, Sorry to Startle You!","If any Apostles really developed evil intentions toward them, Lin Yuan would not mind showing what he was capable of.","White Speak had been flying at full speed. While it flew, the enormous image of a white crocodile more than 3,000 meters long trailed behind it and swallowed the clouds.","White Speak released its aura in such a way to recover its energy naturally. This attracted the attention of many Apostles.","Since it had already flown out of the East Vast Large Lake, it was not acquainted with the Apostles it encountered now.","There were a few Apostles who believed that they were stronger than White Speak and had thoughts of targeting it.","If not for the aura behind it and its outlandish way of rushing, none of the Apostles would act on such thoughts.","All of them were at least slightly in a rush. But this was a special time. It seemed inappropriate to rush so conspicuously when the Banquet of Everything was almost upon them!","White Speak had released its aura and made it clear that its faith power had not reached pinnacle Apostle. An Apostle of such level had no right to be acting so inappropriately.","Soon, trouble arrived.","While White Speak was flying, many black and brown spike-covered roots emerged from the lake not far ahead. Many of the spikes were hooked at the end and would rip apart whatever they sunk into.","There were a large number of lifeforms living in the marshes.","The black and brown roots appeared too abruptly. When they emerged, they ended up catching several of the Marsh Crocodiles.","After more roots appeared, the Marsh Crocodiles were ripped to shreds and fell back into the roiling black marsh below without even kicking up the slightest of water sprays.","The black and brown roots were clearly emanating faith power that was even more concentrated than the one that White Speak was releasing. This indicated that the owner of the black and brown spiked roots was more powerful than White Speak.","When the Apostles who had unsavory designs saw that someone had taken the initiative to attack White Speak, they all looked smug.","Serves you right for being so arrogant! Even high-level Apostles like us have to make sure we walk carefully within the lines. Now that Sucking Spike has appeared, this Marsh Crocodile that was lucky enough to become an Apostle will soon be sucked dry and be reduced to nothing more than Sucking Spike’s meal.","Sucking Spike was a relatively famous Apostle in Marsh East Circle but its reputation was stained with unsavoryness.","When Sucking Spike’s faith power reached average, it started attacking other Apostles. At least 50 Apostles had already died at its hands.","Sucking Spike was going to be selling a considerable number of source totems during the trading event.","Source totems were only produced after Apostles with faith power of a certain level died. Thus, the source of the source totems in Sucking Spike’s possession did not have to be explicitly stated.","But soon, the Apostles watching from the sidelines noticed that something was wrong.","Why was this Apostle so calm in the face of such a strong enemy’s attack? It even looked hopeful. What was going on? Could this Apostle with average faith power be an idiot?","A figure that was not considered tall but was very burly appeared in front of the black and brown roots. This figure was clad in a strange brown chain link armor.","The chain links were extremely peculiar. They appeared to come from different high-class dimensional lifeforms.","The figure had a malicious and playful expression. It looked at White Speak and Lin Yuan as though they were two fluffy bread with creamy fillings.","“Hehehe! After all my years in the Marsh East Circle, I rarely see such an impudent brat like you! Do you know where my armor came from?”","With a violent and amused expression,, this Apostle did not wait for White Speak and Lin Yuan to respond before it continued, “This armor is called the Hundred Apostle Armor. It’s my work of art! Each chain link comes from a different Apostle. It will be completed after another six pieces are added! You should feel very privileged to become part of the Hundred Apostle Armor!”","White Speak had never left the East Vast Large Lake. Thus, it had never heard of Sucking Spike and its horrible reputation.","Sucking Spike’s words caused fury to erupt within White Speak.","It would not be this angry if Sucking Spike’s words were directed at it. Sucking Spike was much stronger than it was and had every right to see it as lowly prey.","But in front of Lin Yuan, Sucking Spike was worth less than a speck of dirt!","Sucking Spike’s words were enormously disrespectful to Lin Yuan.","Just as White Speak was about to bite back with a response and launch a counterattack, Lin Yuan’s clear voice said, “Impudent? I think you’re the one who’s being rude.”","Lin Yuan’s words caused Sucking Spike’s ferocious expression to falter. Just as it was about to teach a lesson to this lifeform that did not even have a hint of the aura of power, it sensed an unbelievably concentrated stream of faith power materialize in front of it.","This faith power was so concentrated that Sucking Spike could not trace its source. Sucking Spike could not imagine how many lifeforms were contributing to it to make it so pure and boundless.","Once Sucking Spike investigated it more thoroughly, its expression became even more bemused.","This was because the source of this unimaginably thick faith power was the young man who previously did not even have a hint of the aura of power.","When the faith power entered White Speak’s body, it quickly gained the power of pinnacle Apostle.","White Speak did not hold back after gaining this power and immediately shot down toward Sucking Spike.","The fact that Sucking Spike could carve out a reputation for itself and kill almost 100 Apostles meant that it possessed power beyond that of others.","But after being boosted by Lin Yuan, White Speak’s power had already barely surpassed that of the Apostle level. As such, there was now a large gap between it and Sucking Spike.","After mercilessly killing Sucking Spike, White Speak collected everything from Sucking Spike’s body that had value.","When White Speak made its move, four pairs of large black wings appeared behind Lin Yuan.","White Speak held the resources it had collected from Sucking Spike and knelt respectfully in front of Lin Yuan as it said with reverence, “Lord Dictator, sorry to startle you!”"]},{"number":2243,"title":"Chapter 2243 He is a Dictator!","paragraphs":["2243 He is a Dictator!","Everything had happened in the span of an instant. The twists and turns frightened those watching, and their eyes almost fell out of their sockets.","At first, their disbelief was due to the sudden increase in White Speak’s power. It had even become powerful enough to kill Sucking Spike with its bloody reputation.","Lin Yuan’s astonishing methods that radiated concentrated faith power went beyond the Apostles’ comprehension.","Before any of the Apostles had time to make any guesses, what White Speak said revealed Lin Yuan’s identity.","Dictator! The young man with four pairs of black wings was a Dictator!","Even the most suspicious Apostles stopped questioning White Speak’s authenticity.","Dictators had a known status and significance in the marsh world. No Apostles dared to joke around with this title.","The faith power that Lin Yuan released had a concentration that none of the other Apostles thought was possible. Only Dictators could explain such methods.","As for Lin Yuan’s form being different from what Apostles were familiar with, this abnormality was soon forgotten.","The four pairs of wings behind Lin Yuan were made of the Day and Night Spirit Silver.","Lin Yuan had a deeper meaning for revealing the four pairs of wings.","Firstly, he wanted to see how deep of an understanding Apostles had of Dictators.","The Day and Night Spirit Silver did not exist in the marsh world.","Lin Yuan was revealing himself with something that did not exist in the marsh world. If he attracted suspicion from the other Apostles, he would have to hide his true identity more carefully, especially when he participated in the Banquet of Everything.","Secondly, Lin Yuan wanted to know if the Apostles in the marsh world could recognize the Day and Night Spirit Silver or metals.","It was not just Day and Night Spirit Silver that did not exist in the marsh world, but other metals did not exist either.","If an Apostle recognized the Day and Night Spirit Silver, it would mean that it had interacted with humans before.","Currently, the only place where there was a confirmed opening of a Class 6 marsh dimensional rift was in the Freedom Federation.","Lin Yuan was the Moon Empress’ disciple and a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence. Thus, he always thought of the Radiance Federation’s best interests. This meant that he was enemies with the Freedom Federation. This relationship applied not just in the main world but the marsh world as well.","Thus, Lin Yuan really wanted to find where the Freedom Federation was located in the marsh world.","From the information that the Goddess of Mercy had provided, the Freedom Federation had changed the direction of their development from the main world to the marsh world.","This development direction and plan were uncannily similar to that of the Radiance Federation.","Since the Class 6 marsh dimensional rift had opened in the Freedom Federation earlier than when the Class 6 abyss dimensional rift opened in the Radiance Federation, the Freedom Federation had been able to invest much more resources.","If Lin Yuan threw a wrench into the Freedom Federation’s development in the marsh world, he would definitely be able to cause the Freedom Federation some level of pain.","But after his test, Lin Yuan saw that none of the Apostles were suspicious about his four pairs of black wings. Apparently, these Apostles had never interacted with humans before.","There was no way that the Freedom Federation could hide its development in the marsh world.","Thus, Lin Yuan could deduce that the Class 6 marsh dimensional rift that linked to the Freedom Federation was not in this area.","Moreover, the Apostles did not have an accurate understanding of Dictators. This meant that Lin Yuan could continue doing what he was doing to keep up his facade of being a Dictator.","Lin Yuan was very interested in what the dead Apostle that had tried to stop them had left. However, what caught his attention was not the Hundred Apostle Armor that Sucking Spike had prided itself on but the marsh soil and source totems that Sucking Spike had collected.","Source totems were the treasures that Apostles traded with each other. It was a good that could be considered hard currency.","This showed how entrenched bloodshed was in the lives of the lifeforms in the marsh world.","But this also made it easier for Lin Yuan to collect source totems from other Apostles because any Apostles could carry such precious tradable items.","If source totems were considered a hard currency, marsh soil was common goods traded between Apostles.","Lin Yuan had discovered a large amount of the marsh soil amongst the items that Sucking Spike had left behind. There were only four to five units of low-grade marsh soil but more than 4,000 units of mid-grade marsh soil.","It seemed that the more powerful the Apostle, the more it preferred to collect marsh soil of a higher grade that it would use for trading.","Sucking Spike had almost 500 units of high-grade marsh soil.","Sucking Spike had possessed more than ten times the amount of high-grade marsh soil that Lin Yuan had accumulated.","Finding high-grade marsh soil was difficult, especially in a set territory.","Besides trading, Sucking Spike had to have traveled far and wide to collect and kill others in order to obtain so much high-grade marsh soil.","Sucking Spike had even managed to obtain four balls of top-grade marsh soil.","The amount of resources that Sucking Spike had provided Lin Yuan with were enough to increase Lift Marsh’s diameter by 40,000 meters.","With the marsh soil that Lin Yuan had on hand, it was enough to raise up the entire territory where Klein Hub existed.","Lin Yuan had already reached the goal of his trip before he had even reached the Palace of Everything.","Lin Yuan had never fed top-grade marsh soil to Lift Marsh.","However, Lin Yuan did not intend to feed top-grade marsh soil to Lift Marsh. Although Lift Marsh could gain some earth-elemental attributes after absorbing the top-grade marsh soil, the effects would not compare to that of the top-grade marsh soil itself.","Top-grade marsh soil was a true treasure and could not be wasted or casually used. The best way to use an item was to make sure it was used to its greatest value.","Lin Yuan intended to use the top-grade marsh soil as part of the fertilizer on Universe’s back.","This would make it easier for Lin Yuan to nurture various plant-type feys on Universe’s back. No matter how fragile and expensive the plant-type fey, it would have no issues growing on Universe’s back with the top-grade marsh soil, as well as the water-elemental energy that would be present.","Besides the marsh soil, there were also 26 balls of rainbow light. This meant that Lin Yuan now had 26 more sacred source lifeforms to distribute amongst the members of Sky City, and Sky City’s issue of sacred source lifeform scarcity had been solved.","This made Lin Yuan very happy.","With a wave of his hand, he stored the items in the spatial ring.","At the same time, he removed Dark Blue’s boosting ability. It was actually not a good decision to cause White Speak’s power to drop back down at such a time."]},{"number":2244,"title":"Chapter 2244 Gains and Gifts","paragraphs":["2244 Gains and Gifts","Some of the Apostles who were watching Lin Yuan were weaker than White Speak. If they tried to attack White Speak and Lin Yuan, he would not have time to inject faith power into White Speak’s body and then wait for White Speak to react.","But Lin Yuan had his reason for doing so.","Firstly, Celestial Sight had already turned into a beautiful button and sat right next to the Source Sand’s amber button on Lin Yuan’s clothes. If there was any danger, Celestial Sight would react immediately. Then, White Speak would not need to protect Lin Yuan.","Secondly, Lin Yuan had already confirmed that the Apostles in the marsh world were not fully familiar with Dictators.","He wanted to test to see how the Apostles would react when they were in the presence of a Dictator.","Although Lin Yuan had established his own territory in the marsh world that he had been developing for the past few months, he was only just starting to focus on the marsh world.","Hence, he still did not have a clear idea of the ways and laws of the marsh world.","The information he could obtain from White Speak was limited as it had been a wandering Apostle. There were many things that he needed to check for himself.","Before White Speak climbed to its feet, numerous Apostles fell to their knees tremblingly in front of Lin Yuan. A thread of faith power extended slightly from each of them toward him.","Lin Yuan had learned from speaking with White Speak that Apostles would offer up their own faith power to Dictators when they wanted to become recognized by a Dictator or join a certain Dictator’s camp.","Faith power was precious energy to Apostles.","When they offered up faith power to Dictators, they hoped that the Dictators would accept it and return the favor with gifts.","The gifts from Dictators always consisted of pure source-type power. Apostles could not obtain such pure source-type power on their own.","The Apostles kneeling in front of Lin Yuan were all nervous. They had no idea how he was going to react.","Lin Yuan had already seen how White Speak and Shadow reacted toward Dictators.","Both of them were no different from obedient puppies, genuinely respectful and faithful. They were like humans who were gazing at God.","When humans saw God, they would not question anything. All they would do was enter a natural state of worship.","The actions of these Dictators further confirmed the positions that Dictators held in the marsh world.","It was said that with more knowledge, one would be more aware of how to act.","White Speak had never even left the East Vast Large Lake and was considered insignificant among all the Apostles.","Without Lin Yuan, there was no way that White Speak could attend the Banquet of Everything. It did not have the power to enter the Marsh East Circle.","All of the Apostles there had more experience and power than White Speak.","Lin Yuan was in great need of faith power because he needed to use a large amount of faith power in order to develop the divine kingdom in the shrine in his soul.","It would take 20% of the faith power that Lin Yuan currently possessed in order to change the environment comfort level of the divine kingdom.","He would need much more faith power in order to fully develop his divine kingdom.","Luckily, once a lifeform became faithful to him and became his Apostle, it would start to continuously provide him with faith power.","If these Apostles were able to provide him with a large amount of faith power, it would definitely be substantially beneficial for the development of his divine kingdom.","With this thought, Lin Yuan did not hesitate to accept the glowing threads of faith power.","Next, he tried to use his own faith power to guide the faith power from the Apostles into his body.","Since these Apostles were being sincere, Lin Yuan did not meet with any obstacles and had an easy time accepting their faith power into his body.","The Apostles’ faith power was similar in purity and only differed in quantity.","The Apostles’ faith power easily fused with Lin Yuan’s body and was directed to the divine kingdom.","The faith power flowed like water into the fountain of faith on the altar. As a result, the jets of water spraying out from the fountain became stronger and taller.","Lin Yuan did not hold back in the face of such a valuable opportunity and drained all the faith power that he could from these Apostles.","Once dimensional lifeforms became Apostles, their lifespans became extremely long. The fruits of their long-time accumulation allowed Lin Yuan to gain plenty.","Just from the faith power of the six Apostles in front of him, the amount of faith power in the fountain of faith doubled.","This allowed Lin Yuan to discover a new, more efficient way to collect faith power.","Since he had gained, he needed to give a gift in return.","The Apostles had been willing to offer him faith power without fear of their totems being sucked dry and suffering any negative effects.","Lin Yuan needed to provide them with an equally valuable gift. Otherwise, no other Apostles in the world would be willing to provide him with faith power in the future.","Without Apostles offering him faith power, there was no way a fake Dictator like him could rapidly develop his divine kingdom.","However, he was not sure how large the reward should be. This was because he did not know how much faith power was worth in terms of source-type power in the eyes of Apostles.","Lin Yuan looked at White Speak. He hoped that White Speak could understand his intentions through this look.","White Speak immediately understood what he meant.","White Speak did not know that Lin Yuan’s look was a questioning one. It assumed that Lin Yuan was unwilling to continue speaking with these inferior Apostles and wanted it to be his mouthpiece.","Thus, White Speak said haughtily, “It is your honor to be able to provide my Dictator with faith power. You should be grateful if my Dictator is willing to provide you with even 10 units of pure source-type power.”","Although White Speak had misunderstood what Lin Yuan meant, it still gave him the answer he sought.","Lin Yuan looked at White Speak with admiration as surprise surfaced within him.","Although Lin Yuan knew that pure source-type power could transform a dimensional lifeform into an Apostle and had made several Apostles of his own, he had not expected pure source-type power to be so precious in the marsh world."]},{"number":2245,"title":"Chapter 2245 This Dictator is Rather Arrogant!","paragraphs":["2245 This Dictator is Rather Arrogant!","Lin Yuan was aware of how much faith power he had taken from the Apostles. Yet, that sea of faith power was only worth ten units of source-type power!","Lin Yuan looked at the six Apostles kneeling in front of him.","After hearing what White Speak said, the six Apostles looked hopeful. None of them exhibited any negative emotions. This meant that White Speak’s offer was agreeable to them.","It was true.","The gifts that Dictators gave Apostles were similar to the tips that wealthy patrons left servers at restaurants. The more tips they gave, the better of an impression they would leave. If they left a small tip, they would come off as stingy.","Since White Speak was aware of this, it had promised slightly more.","The Apostles would be happy if Lin Yuan gave them 8 units of source-type power.","At this time, Lin Yuan saw one of the Apostles kneeling at the back, looking up at him warily. When it noticed his gaze, it immediately dropped its head in fright.","It asked softly and timidly, “Lord Dictator, my name is Twin Feathers. I am very grateful that you’re willing to accept my lowly faith power. I hope I can have the chance to follow you in the future.”","The female Apostle named Twin Feathers spoke steadily, but its body was trembling slightly.","An Apostle making such a request could definitely be described as an overstep.","The reason for Twin Feathers making this request was White Speak.","Twin Feathers felt that it was stronger than White Speak. It was an Apostle who evolved from the Medusa Snake Demon. Thus, it definitely had more talent than an Apostle evolved from the Marsh Crocodile.","If there was even such an Apostle by this Dictator’s side, there was nothing for it to fear.","All the Apostles kneeling shared Twin Feathers’ thoughts, but none dared to voice them.","Twin Feathers had essentially helped to ask on behalf of itself and the others.","The other Apostles straightened their postures after hearing what Twin Feathers asked.","Once the Dictator accepted Twin Feathers, there was a high chance that they would be accepted too. After all, the Dictator had accepted Twin Feathers’ offering of faith power and theirs.","Lin Yuan surveyed Twin Feathers.","To the other Apostles, Lin Yuan’s gaze was one of amusement. But in actuality, it was one of excitement.","Lin Yuan did not have many powerful subordinates in the marsh world. Once he had these Apostles following him, he would not only be able to collect faith power from them from now on, but they would also help to protect his territory and aid in the development of the territory.","Lin Yuan would definitely be accepting these Apostles into his camp. He would have wanted to do so even if Twin Feathers had not requested so.","But in order to keep up pretenses that he was a Dictator, he had to be casual when he accepted their loyalties, as though he was performing an insignificant task.","Lin Yuan now had a deeper understanding of Dictators.","It was so easy for a fake Dictator like him to accept Apostles, much less real Dictators. Thus, every authentic Dictator had to have a large army of Apostles.","It was inevitable that Lin Yuan would cross paths with Dictators while developing in the marsh world.","This experience informed him of how astonishing was the power that Dictators possessed.","Twin Feathers had been waiting for Lin Yuan to respond and had even forgotten to breathe during that time.","When Lin Yuan still had not replied, even after a few moments passed, Twin Feathers’ heart sank.","At that moment, Lin Yuan nonchalantly reached out and pointed at Twin Feathers.","Six beams of amber light shot into the bodies of Twin Feathers and the other Apostles.","Source-type power was not valuable to Lin Yuan, but he did not give too much to the Apostles.","Since White Speak had said that 10 units of pure source-type power would be enough, this was how much Lin Yuan provided to each of the Apostles.","As for Twin Feathers, who had been the first to express its wish to join him, Lin Yuan gifted it with another 10 units of source-type power.","This demonstrated his generosity and was also a signal to the other Apostles that if they offered him faith power and joined him, there would be benefits in store for them.","Lin Yuan’s casual provision of rewards caused the other Apostles who were watching to become so jealous that they almost dashed over to him and offered their faith power just like the first six Apostles had done.","He had just provided 70 whole units of pure source-type power!","It was rumored that other Dictators only gifted their Apostles with 1 unit of source-type power at a time. They would never give this much.","Since the watching Apostles had never felt how pure the source-type power that came from other Dictators was, they had no basis of comparison for the source-type power that Lin Yuan had given Twin Feathers and the rest.","But as the direct recipients, Twin Feathers and the other Apostles were in a state of inexplicable comfort.","After repeated experiments, Lin Yuan noticed that pure source-type power was just like pure spirit qi to feys.","Pure source-type power did not help to evolve Apostles but helped them to improve their bodies and bloodlines. This increased the potential of the Apostles.","Pure source-type power could even heal hidden injuries that the Apostles could not address on their own.","The petrification gland on the back of Twin Feathers’ head had been attacked and injured in the past.","The Medusa Snake Demon’s petrification ability was linked to its petrification gland, and it was an ability that was unique to the Medusa Snake Demon species.","The hidden injury to its petrification gland had greatly reduced Twin Feathers’ strength.","Twin Feathers could now clearly sense that its petrification gland was being recovered.","After using up 5 units of source-type power, its petrification gland had not only recovered but was even slightly better than it had been before.","Twin Feathers was aware that it had received 10 more units of source-type power than the other Apostles did. This discovery thrilled Twin Feathers."]},{"number":2246,"title":"Chapter 2246 Small Source Fruit!","paragraphs":["2246 Small Source Fruit!","This not only showed Lin Yuan’s attitude toward his followers but also exemplified that this attitude of his was praiseworthy.","Rather than being excited over the gift and higher benefits, Twin Feathers was more confused and shocked.","It was not loyal to any Dictator but had a good friend in the group of the Medusa Snake Demons that it moved around with that had caught the attention of a Dictator after it became an Apostle.","Its friend’s petrification gland had also been injured, but not as seriously as its own. Yet, its petrification gland had not recovered after its Dictator gifted it source-type power.","Although this did not prevent it from using the ability, there were still limitations to the effects.","Could it be that this Dictator possessed source-type power that was purer than that of other Dictators?","It was rumored that there was a level above the Dictator level, the Turning Wheel Realm Dictator.","It was said that Turning Wheel Realm Dictators could unleash their source sacred bodies to the greatest extent. The source sacred bodies would present as a completely different form than their original dimensional lifeform form.","Was this Dictator in front of them an example of a sacred source body being unleashed to its greatest extent?","This Dictator now had four pairs of black wings flapping behind him, but there had been nothing on his back when he first appeared riding on the back of that Apostle.","With this thought, Twin Feathers, which was usually calm and had been given the nickname Cold-faced Snake Concubine, almost let out an excited shriek.","Not only did I become loyal to a Dictator, but this Dictator might have even entered the Turning Wheel Realm! I am so lucky!","The other five Apostles who received the source-type power were not weaker than Twin Feathers.","The Apostles who could make a name for themselves in the Marsh East Circle and were able to attend the Banquet of Everything had to have sufficient experience and an accumulation of resources.","Thus, these Apostles all had the same guess as Twin Feathers.","After the Apostles kneeling on the ground were done absorbing the source-type power, they stood up and bowed to Lin Yuan before dutifully moving behind him.","With this group of Apostles setting the example, the other Apostles in the area who had not yet offered their faith power to any Dictators all gathered to kneel in front of Lin Yuan in hopes of receiving gifts from him as well.","Compared to the faith power they were offering, the pure source-type power that only Dictators could offer was much more valuable.","It had not taken long for the Apostles to absorb the source-type power that Lin Yuan had given them, but it took some time for Lin Yuan to drain the faith power they offered.","It had taken almost nine hours to draw faith power from Twin Feathers and the other five Apostles.","Lin Yuan was in a rush to head to Marsh East Palace and could not stand there accepting the loyalty of all these Apostles.","Lin Yuan did not know how quickly he could absorb the faith power from other Apostles.","If he pushed his spiritual energy and soul power to the limit, he could only absorb the faith power from eight Apostles at most.","Nonetheless, he could not turn away these Apostles who wanted to follow him. He felt that he needed to give them some bait.","Once the Apostles took a bite of the Deposit Ability Litchi Branches and felt their effects, they would definitely be willing to do free advertising for him.","Lin Yuan had not expected to obtain a group of Apostle followers before he arrived at the Banquet of Everything.","But the situation gave him a feeling that Dictators would be in attendance at the Banquet of Everything.","The Apostles who had not become loyal to any Dictators yet would choose among the Dictators who were in attendance.","The best way to convince the Apostles to choose him was to be domineering and outlandish.","Although Lin Yuan was not such a person by nature, he had no problem acting like one.","He waved at Twin Feathers, whose gaze was full of curiosity and respectful fear but dared not look at him directly.","Next, he took out a wooden chest with beautiful flowers carved all over it. Hu Quan had made these wooden chests in his spare time.","The wooden chest was made of Spring Phoebe Zhennan, which had strong preservation abilities. Thus, Lin Yuan used these wooden chests as freshness cabinets.","Twin Feathers hurriedly received the beautiful wooden chest Lin Yuan held out toward it but dared not open the box. Instead, it silently waited for Lin Yuan’s next instruction.","It was careful and thought lowly of itself. White Speak, who had been with Lin Yuan for some time, was very satisfied with Twin Feathers’ attitude.","Lin Yuan looked at the 12 Apostles who were kneeling at him and said, “I cannot accept your faith power now. But you can follow me for now and let me see how much potential you have before I make any more decisions.”","After Lin Yuan said that he had no intention of accepting these Apostles’ faith power, all of the Apostles’ expressions deflated.","But what he said next immediately caused them to brighten up again.","The venerated Dictator in front of them told them to follow him for now. This meant that they still had a chance to join him as long as they performed well!","Before the Apostles could respond, Lin Yuan went on to say, “Twin Feathers, hand out a small source fruit to each of the Apostles.”","Twin Feathers curiously opened the wooden box to take a look at what the small source fruits were. It had never heard of such a thing before.","The 12 kneeling Apostles had not expected Lin Yuan to be willing to give them gifts despite not having accepted their loyalty. This meant that this Dictator had a very good personality.","They were also glad that they had not gotten ahead of themselves. Otherwise, they might have said something that offended this Dictator.","After opening the wooden chest, Twin Feathers saw a chain of red fruits within.","Each fruit was even larger than one of its eyes. The surface of the fruits was scaly.","Only a few plant-type feys in the marsh world could bear fruits, and none of the regular dimensional lifeforms had the right to eat them.","But once they reached Apostle, obtaining such fruits would not be difficult.","However, Twin Feathers had never encountered such fruits as what it saw in the wooden box."]},{"number":2247,"title":"Chapter 2247 Ten Thousand Source!","paragraphs":["2247 Ten Thousand Source!","Twin Feathers did not think that Lin Yuan would give these fruits to the other Apostles just because they had special flavors. Such a gift was slightly pointless.","However, Lin Yuan had to be doing so because the fruits had special effects.","Twin Feathers walked to the front of the group of kneeling Apostles and plucked a red fruit from the box.","The moment its finger touched the fruit, it sensed the pure source-type power within.","However, the amount of source-type power within the fruits was very little. Ten fruits contained the equivalent of 1 unit of source-type power.","Nonetheless, it was still a huge reward to these Apostles.","The Apostles who Lin Yuan had not picked had also received a fruit that would still significantly aid their improvement in the future.","When Twin Feathers was done handing out all the Deposit Ability Litchi Branches to the Apostles, these Apostles realized how generous he was.","The generosity of this Dictator toward inferior beings like them showed how powerful and wealthy he was.","None of the Apostles would be unwilling to be loyal to a generous, powerful, and wealthy Dictator like this. More importantly, this Dictator appeared to be very gentle, which meant that there was less risk associated with being around him.","The most important law in the marsh world was survival. The second law was that staying by the side of those in high positions came with risks.","There were many dimensional lifeforms that had been accepted by Apostles as Favored Believers who ended up killed because they had committed errors. There were also many cases of Apostles being killed by Dictators.","Hence, the safest option and best way to ensure their lifespans were prolonged were to become loyal to a gentle Dictator.","“I’m heading to the Marsh East Palace to participate in the Banquet of Everything. You don’t need to follow me. You can stay here to absorb the source-type power within the small source fruits. You can come and join me at the Marsh East Palace when I need you.”","Lin Yuan did not need too many Apostles to be by his side in order to attract attention at the Banquet of Everything.","Moreover, if they stayed with him, they would not have the opportunity to spread the word about the small source fruits and help him to attract a large sum through advertising.","Lin Yuan did not forget about his goal of going to the Marsh East Circle.","With his status as a Dictator, he could have Apostles following him at any time. After he gifted them the Deposit Ability Litchi Branches that contained source-type power, he could not drive them away even if he wanted to.","But if he missed the Banquet of Everything, obtaining such an enormous amount of resources would be difficult.","Lin Yuan was well aware of what was important and what was not.","After Twin Feathers was done distributing the small source fruits, it saw that the wooden chest was still half full. It could not help but gulp.","No matter how brave Twin Feathers was, it would never dare to touch something that Lin Yuan had not given it.","In the marsh world, names were given by the masses after one made a name for oneself. Many Apostles prided themselves on the names that they had carved out.","White Speak had never left the East Vast Large Lake. As such, it had not had the chance to carve a name for itself.","Twin Feathers had been called Cold-faced Snake Concubine, which was considered a name.","Dictators often called each other by these names. It was enough for the followers of Dictators to know them by these names.","In a way, knowing a Dictator’s name meant sharing in its glory.","White Speak had never interacted with Dictators in the past, so it was unaware of this.","But there was no question that Twin Feathers knew much more about the rules and customs than White Speak did.","Twin Feathers’ words caused Lin Yuan to be slightly shocked.","Name? He had never given himself any names or titles. But since Twin Feathers had asked, it meant that a name was an icon of one’s status. If he did not give one, it would be difficult to come up with a reason for the abnormality.","Thus, Lin Yuan had no choice but to come up with a name on the spot.","After thinking for a moment, Lin Yuan said, “Ten Thousand Source.”","He had chosen this name because Ten Thousand Source Hall had fronted Whale Ocean Commerce. The goal of Ten Thousand Source Hall had been to collect source-type items, which was exactly what Lin Yuan was trying to do now in the marsh world.","However, Lin Yuan had a preference for sacred source lifeforms over source-type lifeforms.","This was how he came up with the name ‘Ten Thousand Source’.","Lin Yuan had no idea that this name shocked the surrounding Apostles to the point that their chins almost hit the ground.","No Apostles or Dictators would dare to include the word ‘source’ in their name in the marsh world.","Including that word was seen as scorning other lifeforms of the same life rank. This would undoubtedly result in backlash from the other lifeforms.","As such, there were rarely any Apostles who had such a word in their name.","It was said that Marsh East Circle was considered on the smaller side of the six major circles.","There were only a total of six Dictators from Marsh Abyss, which was the center of the six major circles, who had the word ‘source’ in their names.","Could it be that this Dictator was one of the six?","But it would be too strange if that were the case. Why would a bigshot from Marsh Abyss come to Marsh East Circle to participate in a trading event held by a veteran Dictator?","Dictator Everything had a reputation for being reckoned with in Marsh East Circle, but the Palace of Everything did not have much hold in Marsh Abyss.","Lin Yuan had no idea that a name he had come up with off the top of his head would result in so much confusion and speculation. He also had no clue that this name might cause him trouble in the future.","After giving his name, Lin Yuan said to Twin Feathers and the other five Apostles, “The six of you don’t have to follow me either. From now on, begin collecting marsh soil for me. After the Banquet of Everything ends, I will distribute the remaining small source fruits in the box according to how much marsh soil each of you collects.”","If Lin Yuan wanted to make himself seem mysterious and untouchable, he should not be giving the Apostles such an easy task. But when practicality was compared with benefits, maintaining a high and mighty image was clearly not as important as benefits.","It was enough for these Apostles to see him as a Dictator.","It was always power and resources that propped a person up.","Lin Yuan had witnessed how eager the Apostles had been to receive the Deposit Ability Litchi Branches. The six Apostles would do their best to collect as much marsh soil as possible before the Banquet of Everything ended to obtain more small source fruits."]},{"number":2248,"title":"Chapter 2248 It is Never Wise to Burn Bridges!","paragraphs":["2248 It is Never Wise to Burn Bridges!","The six Apostles were going to be fighting intensely for some over the distribution of the small source fruits.","Lin Yuan was not opposed to competition among the Apostles under him. In fact, he hoped that they would work as hard as possible. An environment of friendly competition allowed everyone involved to progress.","Frankly, Twin Feathers and the other five Apostles had been confused when they first heard the task.","Marsh soil was the most common good in the marsh world, and collecting them from the natural environment was easy.","They could not believe that a task from a Dictator involved collecting something like marsh soil. It seemed degrading!","!!","But after Lin Yuan mentioned the reward, all of them immediately changed their minds.","The value of one small source fruit could not be compared with even an infinite number of marsh soil.","It was likely that this Dictator Ten Thousand Source aimed to test all of their abilities, thereby deciding which one he would rely more on in the future.","This was the only reason to explain why such a being of as high status as a Dictator would ask them to collect marsh soil.","There were at least 40 small source fruits left in the box. This meant that each of them could obtain at least seven of them.","If they performed well, they might even be able to obtain more than ten, which made up to 1 unit of source-type power.","Twin Feathers and the rest had all felt how beneficial the pure source-type power was. Thus, all of them felt a fiery competitiveness erupt within them.","Previously, Twin Feathers had been the one to speak to Lin Yuan first.","From their interaction, Zhen Venom observed that Lin Yuan was not opposed to his subordinates speaking up.","In order to leave an impression on him, Zhen Venom spoke up before Twin Feathers could get a word out. “Lord Dictator, don’t worry! Even without the small source fruits, I will definitely do my best to collect as much marsh soil for you!”","Twin Feathers glared at Zhen Venom and began to see it as its biggest competitor.","At the same time, it sneered to itself about how shameless Zhen Venom was.","Twin Feathers was certain that Zhen Venom was not immune to the temptation of the small source fruits.","Saying such a thing was such an obvious attempt at currying favor with Lin Yuan!","It was not just the other four Apostles who had dedicated their loyalties to Lin Yuan, who shared Twin Feathers’ thoughts. The other 26 Apostles had also received the small source fruits and absorbed the source-type power within.","Lin Yuan already sensed the air of competition rising from the six Apostles next to him. He did not mind adding a little more fuel to the flames.","“I’ll remember you, Zhen Venom.”","After saying that, Lin Yuan flapped his wings and flew up to land on White Speak’s back before they rushed off in the direction of Marsh East Palace.","When Lin Yuan left, there were 32 Apostles still kneeling respectfully on the ground. They only rose to their feet a full 30 seconds after Lin Yuan left.","Zhen Venom’s words immediately resulted in a significant uproar.","Twin Feathers thought, I can’t believe Zhen Venom beat me to the punch. I was just about to say something like that too.","Twin Feathers could tell that many of the 26 Apostles who were not its direct competitors looked persuaded by what Zhen Venom said.","Twin Feathers did not intend to be gracious to Zhen Venom. Since they were competitors, everything was within regulation as long as it did not attack Zhen Venom directly.","Just as a few of the Apostles were about to agree with what Zhen Venom said, Twin Feathers took a step forward and said with a smile, “It so happens that I think the same way. I was the one who distributed the small source fruits. Did you digest them well? Dictator Ten Thousand Source favors me exceptionally. I am sure I will be able to bring you more benefits in the future than Zhen Venom will.”","Twin Feathers’ words caused the Apostles’ hearts to swing over from Zhen Venom to its side.","Although all of them were newly acquainted with Dictator Ten Thousand Source, it was true that Twin Feathers was the one who had interacted the most with Dictator Ten Thousand Source. Thus, it made sense for Dictator Ten Thousand Source to have the deepest impression of Twin Feathers.","Although Lin Yuan had said before he left that he would remember Zhen Venom, a female Apostle had to be more memorable to a male Dictator than a male Apostle would.","At first, Zhen Venom had intended to compete fairly with Twin Feathers.","I can make Lord Dictator just as happy as you can. But I was the one who came up with this idea, yet you’re trying to steal my chances at victory!","Zhen Venom had evolved from the Drugged Snake Eagle.","The Drugged Snake Eagle poisoned many of its own kind before it poisoned others. Many of the Drugged Snake Eagles died from their own poison. Thus, the Drugged Snake Eagles were used to being poisoned by those around them, and Zhen Venom was no exception.","Zhen Venom huffed angrily and said, “Twin Feathers, it is never wise to burn bridges! Since you want to compete with me in such a way, I shall swear here and now that if you 26 Apostles give me all of the marsh soil that you have on hand, I will only keep six of the small source fruits for myself and distribute the rest equally to the rest of you. I don’t think any of the other five Apostles present will be as generous as me.”","Zhen Venom’s words caused the other 26 Apostles to swing back to its side.","Twin Feathers was silent for a moment after hearing what Zhen Venom said.","There were slightly more than 40 small source fruits, meaning each of them could obtain seven at least.","Zhen Venom had purposely stated a smaller-than-equal amount to turn the tide.","Only someone with the blackest of hearts could think of such a plan to harm others, even at the expense of their own advantage.","If it could not come in first, it could come in second, at least. It was likely that second place would still allow it to gain at least six small source fruits. There was no need for it to be as mad as Zhen Venom.","Unless it could promise to give more small source fruits, there was no way that the other Apostles would come to its side.","After understanding this, Twin Feathers immediately flew off.","The most important thing it needed to do now was to collect marsh soil. It did not intend on staying here and wasting time.","If Lin Yuan could see what was happening, the sight would definitely bring a smile to his face.","He had expected the Apostles to react in such a way."]},{"number":2249,"title":"Chapter 2249 Six Major Marsh Circles and Marsh Abyss!","paragraphs":["2249 Six Major Marsh Circles and Marsh Abyss!","If Lin Yuan did not want to use this chance to test the abilities of these six Apostles, he could have gathered all of the marsh soil that was present before he left.","Lin Yuan was not only going to reward the winners of this competition with small source fruits but also intended to select an assistant for White Speak. It would help White Speak in managing all the Apostles who became loyal to him.","During the journey, White Speak did not stop speaking with Lin Yuan and also found out about his plan.","But there was something that White Speak did not understand.","“Lord Dictator, there are clearly a total of 32 Apostles who want to become loyal to you. Why did you only pick the first six? Why not give a chance to the other Apostles who came later?”","Lin Yuan sighed to himself.","White Speak was strong and brave but lacked intelligence. There were many things that it needed to learn in the future. Regardless of who won, White Speak would need to learn from it for some time.","White Speak was not dim. As long as it had enough time, it would definitely be able to improve at breakneck speed. Lin Yuan was confident in White Speak when it came to this.","“White Speak, those six Apostles were the first to decide to follow me. This means that they have better judgment than the other 26 Apostles. The ability to make judgments at key moments is much more important than other abilities.”","After hearing what Lin Yuan said, White Speak carefully pondered over his words and logged them in its heart.","It seemed as though it was having a breezy time by Lin Yuan’s side, but it was a constant bundle of nerves easily affected by anything and everything that happened.","When Lin Yuan’s faith power did not boost it, it was one of the weakest of the 32 Apostles.","If Lin Yuan could use his faith power to boost it, he could just as well do the same to the other Apostles.","If it could not prove its value, it would eventually be left in the dust by these stronger Apostles and tossed aside by Lin Yuan.","The only thing that calmed it down was the thought that it had spent enough time by Lin Yuan’s side and played an important role.","As time passed, White Speak came to learn that Lin Yuan prioritized relationships.","Furthermore, White Speak had another thing going for it, which was that Lin Yuan had already provided it with more than 5,000 units of pure source-type power.","These 5,000 units of pure source-type power had already changed its roots. There was no question that it would be able to become a Dictator.","This was an advantage that the other Apostles did not have.","White Speak did not believe that Lin Yuan would choose another Apostle into who he would inject so much source-type power.","If Lin Yuan intended to nurture others, he would not have invested so much into nurturing it.","White Speak had long been certain that Lin Yuan was a Turning Wheel Realm Dictator.","White Speak had learned from Prayer Glow that the root power of Dictators was also source power.","This meant that Lin Yuan was essentially nursing it with his own life power.","With this thought, White Speak calmed down fully and made a silent decision.","Since Lin Yuan had placed so much hope in it, there was no way that it was going to let him down. Even if the other Dictators temporarily held it down, it would eventually turn the tables.","The Polar Sea Large Lake was within the Marsh West Circle.","The six marsh circles were close by and almost equidistant to Marsh Abyss.","The Marsh East Circle and Marsh West Circle took up a large portion of the marsh world.","Dictator Return to Ruins was only a small step away from becoming a Turning Wheel Realm Dictator.","Due to his special totem, the other Dictators who were as close to becoming Turning Wheel Realm Dictators dared not make an enemy of Dictator Return to Ruins. It was more than capable of killing them.","Any Dictator that had killed other Dictators would immediately shoot to fame.","It was easy for Dictators to injure enemies, but killing was another matter.","Dictator Return to Ruins had always maintained a low profile, and all the factions were guessing that it was because he had already entered the Turning Wheel Realm and would move the Return to Ruins Palace to Marsh Abyss once he rose up again.","But none of them had expected Dictator Everything Return to Ruins to declare that he was going to the Marsh East Circle to participate in the Banquet of Everything held by the Palace of Everything.","Marsh East Circle was considered one of the weakest regions among the six major circles. The Marsh East Palace did not even have a Dictator.","But 1,300 years ago, Marsh East Circle had been the strongest of all the six major circles, and there had been three Dictators in Marsh East Palace.","The three Dictators often bullied the Dictators from the other marsh circles. They were so arrogant that all of them had the word ‘source’ in their names.","If the three Dictators were not on such good terms and would even protect each other during battles, they would have been surrounded and taken down by other Dictators.","However, Turning Wheel Realm Dictators had to enter a period of weakness after their evolution. This was an obstacle that Dictators needed to cross no matter what in order to continue growing.","The three Dictators from Marsh East Palace had fallen out while they were fighting to enter the Turning Wheel Realm first.","Ever since then, the three of them stopped trusting each other.","Eventually, all three Dictators chose to hide away on their own to enter the Turning Wheel Realm.","There were many Dictators who were waiting to get their revenge on them.","The six marsh circles were all linked to Marsh Abyss and had intricate ties with each other.","The three Dictators had been so lawless in the other marsh circles that they even ended up offending a Dictator from Marsh Abyss who had been the first to enter the Turning Wheel Realm.","As a result, the three Dictators were killed, leaving the Marsh East Circle to fall to ruin for 1,300 years since.","This was the reason fights among Dictators had decreased since then.","Dictators now preferred to form friendly ties rather than fight with each other over resources. This was so they would have rocks to lean on for support when they entered the Turning Wheel Realm.","The other five marsh circles were all aware of this fight. However, almost no one in Marsh East Circle knew about it because those from the other five marsh circles had eliminated everyone who had been present during the incident.","After the incident, very few Dictators visited the Marsh East Circle again.","The news of Dictator Return to Ruins heading to Marsh East Circle to attend the Banquet of Everything had caught the attention of many.","There was a mysterious legend in the Marsh East Circle which said a treasure was hidden there. It was why three Dictators of similar power had been produced at once."]},{"number":2250,"title":"Chapter 2250 Gathering of Dictators!","paragraphs":["2250 Gathering of Dictators!","The other Dictators did not believe that Dictator Return to Ruins was heading to the Banquet of Everything for his original purpose. He had to have discovered something in Marsh East Circle to lead him to make such a big move.","As a result, many Dictators turned their attention to Marsh East Circle and decided to use the Banquet of Everything as well to go and take a look.","The five marsh circles were promptly stirred up into a huge wave of commotion.","Lin Yuan, who was rushing to the Banquet of Everything to gather resources, was completely oblivious to this.","Since Marsh Abyss was the core of the marsh world, it was extremely expansive.","The Apostles and Dictators from the six major marsh circles all assumed that everything was calm in Marsh Abyss. This was because news from Marsh Abyss rarely got out.","But it was only when these Apostles and Dictators from the six major marsh circles arrived at Marsh Abyss that they realized that fights were abound in the marsh world.","The only ones who survived in Marsh Abyss were those who were powerful enough to remain standing and those who piggybacked on these lifeforms.","Apart from these cases, accidents could happen at any moment in Marsh Abyss.","A figure dripping with black fluids was sitting within a palace that was next to the Palace of Everything.","The black fluids moved, writhed, and screeched as though they were the souls of the damned.","Occasionally, flecks of crimson light peeked through the fluids and turned into dark red worms that climbed up the body of this figure.","A flirtatious peal of laughter drifted out from the figure cloaked in black fluids.","“Hehe! Here I was trying to find an excuse to attend the Banquet of Everything to see if my sister can be harvested now that she has entered the Turning Wheel Realm.","“Lord Eternal Source doesn’t permit veteran Dictators from laying a hand on Dictators who have only just freshly entered the Turning Wheel Realm. Many sinners have been killed for this. Those sinners’ source tattoos are still hanging in Eternal Source Palace.","“I’m really afraid too! But as long as I stay under the radar and in a sterile place like Marsh East Circle, Lord Eternal Source shouldn’t be keeping that close of a watch.","“It’s almost time for Return to Ruins to enter the Turning Wheel Realm too. Return to Ruins won’t be acting so outlandish if he’s trying to enter the Turning Wheel Realm. It seems like he has encountered some troubles while trying to break through. With Return to Ruins’ brains and personality, he must be trying to solve his issues by setting his eye on Everything, who has only just entered the Turning Wheel Realm.","“I have been keeping my eye out for Return to Ruins for a very long time. I should be able to collect a double harvest this time. I am part of Lordess Evil Source’s camp. As long as I share some of the offerings with Lordess Evil Source, I’m sure she will be willing to protect me even if word gets out!”","The female figure disappeared from the black and red hall. This disappearance went unnoticed by all, even the eight Apostles standing outside the hall.","...","Lin Yuan accepted far more than 20 followers while he was on White Speak’s back and dashing through the marsh world.","Besides these followers, more than 100 Apostles had received the Deposit Ability Litchi Branches from him.","This allowed him to accumulate many more times the amount of power than he had in the past six months of his marsh world territory’s development.","His identity as a Dictator gave him an additional level of protection and authority in the marsh world.","This allowed Lin Yuan to realize that if he ever discovered the Freedom Federation’s territory in the marsh world, he could even use his identity as a Dictator to decimate the Freedom Federation’s territory without doing any of the work himself.","Although White Speak had come to understand many things, it felt increasing pressure with every follower that Lin Yuan gained. The pressure caused White Speak to feel an explainable inferiority.","Lin Yuan picked up on White Speak’s feelings easily.","He did not want White Speak to continue being weighed down by that pressure. Instead, he injected another 500 units of pure source-type power into White Speak’s body while he said, “White Speak, you have already been with me for some time. I intend to have you lead the Apostles who are following me.”","White Speak relaxed when it heard this. It was very touched when it sensed the 500 units flowing into its body.","With Lin Yuan’s promise, it would occupy a high position in the future. It did not have to be threatened by these Apostles and could even manage them as its subordinates.","But as touched as it was, White Speak did not respond to Lin Yuan immediately. Instead, it pondered for a moment before saying solemnly, “Lord Dictator, I don’t think I’m capable of taking up this task. I—”","Lin Yuan cut off White Speak before it finished speaking.","Lin Yuan was very happy to hear White Speak say this at such a time. It showed that it was a rational and responsible lifeform. He was not wrong for selecting and relying on it.","“White Speak, it’s true that you aren’t strong enough now. But you are smart enough and can learn anything quickly. This is your advantage! You’ll eventually be up to the job as long as you can use this advantage. I look forward to seeing the day when you grow to that point. Before that happens, I’ll arrange for two capable assistants for you. They will not only be your assistants, but you’ll also be able to learn from them for a long time.”","Lin Yuan spoke casually, but White Speak heard words that were full of hope of affection.","Since Lin Yuan had already said this, there was no way that White Speak would continue turning him down.","White Speak took a deep breath before saying seriously, “Lord Lin Yuan, don’t worry. I will definitely try to meet your goal as soon as possible and do a good job of managing them!”","White Speak had changed the way that it addressed Lin Yuan. Lin Yuan was well aware of what this change signified. It signified that they were now closer than they had been, that there was companionship between them besides just respect and worship.","This was the relationship that Lin Yuan hoped to have with White Speak.","When Lin Yuan arrived at Marsh East Palace, the name Dictator Ten Thousand Source and the mystical effects of the small source fruits had spread throughout the entire Marsh East Circle and even slightly beyond.","At that moment, all the veteran Apostles in Marsh East Palace were gazing at two purple-haired girls courteously and warmly."]},{"number":2251,"title":"Chapter 2251 Does Marsh East Palace Have the Right to Refuse?","paragraphs":["2251 Does Marsh East Palace Have the Right to Refuse?","The two purple-haired girls were pretty with lithe bodies. They were pleasant and elegant and gave off an air of opulent eliteness.","This aura was always associated with Second Born and Third Born, who were part of Dictator Everything’s camp.","Second Born and Third Born were wearing clothes made of precious materials that the Hundred Apostles Armor that Sucking Spike had created could not compare with them.","But it was also due to Second Born and Third Born’s species.","The Rosemary Purple Marten was one of the rare animal-type dimensional lifeforms in the marsh world. There were very few of them, and they were at least hundreds of times rarer than the Medusa Snake Demon.","The Snake Change Medusa represented the average population size of a regular species.","Second Born and Third Born were definitely not part of a regular species. In fact, they were the Rosemary Jade Martens, which were a rare breed of Rosemary Purple Marten.","Otherwise, they would never have caught the eye of Dictator Everything and nurtured them as her representatives.","Third Born had been worried about Dictator Everything all this time. But at the same time, she continued to remind herself that the Banquet of Everything was sure to go smoothly and would not stain the reputation of the Palace of Everything during Dictator Everything’s absence.","Because of these thoughts, Third Born appeared stubborn and tough in front of the veteran Apostles so that none of them had the chance to negotiate.","Second Born regarded all of this coldly from the side. But at the same time, her brow was slightly raised as though it was thinking about something.","If Third Born could see Second Born now, she would immediately realize that Second Born was trying to plot something.","Second Born appeared composed but had far more thoughts than others. There were times where even Third Born could not guess what was going through Second Born’s head.","The veteran Apostles in Marsh East Palace were currently looking at each other. A moment later, East Glow, who managed affairs in Marsh East Palace, said, “It is Marsh East Palace’s honor to be able to hold the Banquet of Everything. However, displaying trading items in the space between the main hall to the sacrificial lane is prohibited. That is the line we can’t cross! I’m sure the main palaces of the other marsh circles have the same rule!”","East Glow was filled with anxiousness when it said this.","The main palaces of other marsh circles had Dictators present to support them. Thus enabling them to have the authority to speak.","However, there were only Apostles and no Dictators in Marsh East Palace. Apostles were no different from insects in the eyes of Dictators.","Marsh East Palace did not have any standing to negotiate.","But since it had assumed this position, East Glow had no choice but to consider the pride of the entire Marsh East Circle. This was why it had said what it said.","After hearing what East Glow said, Third Born narrowed her charming eyes before her hand landed on the table in front of her and spoke as though she had been preparing for some time, “The central palaces of other marsh circles might have the right to say no, but does the Marsh East Palace have this right?”","Third Born’s words immediately tensed the atmosphere within the hall.","Star Splendor, known as the most beautiful Apostle in Marsh East Circle, was currently trying to lower its presence to appear as feeble as possible. Its beautiful face lost all of its usual confidence and high spirits.","Second Born turned to East Glow and said solemnly, “The Palace of Everything is willing to leave the Marsh East Palace with its pride, but the Marsh East Palace might do the same for us. Otherwise, we won’t be able to help it if Lordess Everything becomes angered!","“In the past, the Palace of Everything held the Banquets of Everything with the palaces from the other marsh circles. We will hold it on our own and make all the decisions this time. Do you have any thoughts on this?”","Second Born’s words caused the tense atmosphere to shift. As a result, East Glow and the rest were no longer as resistant.","Now that access to the area between the main hall and the sacrificial lane had been granted, the pride of the Marsh East Palace had been preserved.","It did not matter to Marsh East Palace whether the Palace of Everything held the Banquet of Everything on their own. In fact, this arrangement would save Marsh East Palace from providing helpers.","Although this would cause Marsh East Palace to lose some authority, the Palace of Everything had already compromised. It was only right that they took a step back too.","“Fine! We will do as the Palace of Everything says! You will be solely in charge of the Banquet of Everything!”","Second Born’s lips curved up slightly as though happy after achieving her goal.","Next to Second Born, Third Born was bewildered.","It would have been fine if First Born had been the one to say that, but it was strange that the words had come out from Second Born’s mouth instead.","Second Born had only ever been focused on increasing her own power. How could she be bothered to involve herself with such matters? Furthermore, why did she want sole control of the Banquet of Everything all at once?","The support from the Marsh East Palace had always been of great help to the Banquet of Everything.","The Banquet of Everything was just one of the many banquets held in the marsh world. A large amount of manpower was needed to carry out security, auctioning, and trades.","If there were any issues, it was not just the Banquet of Everything that would be affected. The Palace of Everything’s reputation would be blemished as well.","First Born could indeed find enough manpower to carry out all the tasks associated with the Banquet of Everything. However, with every extra person, there was added protection against risk.","There was no need to take the managing rights from the Marsh East Palace!","Furthermore, Dictator Everything was always gentle and unbothered by such trivial matters.","Dictator Everything would not be bothered in the slightest, even if the Palace of Everything requested to have full control but was turned down by the Marsh East Palace.","Second Born had spoken of Dictator Everything.","Since when did Second Born start to bring up Dictator Everything’s name in order to accomplish tasks?","Bringing up Dictator Everything’s name to lend power to her words and put pressure on others was very disrespectful to Dictator Everything.","Third Born decided to have a good talk with Second Born once the Banquet of Everything was over. If First Born found out about this, Second Born would surely be punished!","A thought immediately struck East Glow, and it hurriedly spoke."]},{"number":2252,"title":"Chapter 2252 Second Sister’s Strange Behavior!","paragraphs":["2252 Second Sister’s Strange Behavior!","“The Marsh East Palace is showing our sincerity by handing over sole control of the Banquet of Everything to you. But if any accidents happen and any bloodshed occurs, the Marsh East Palace will step in immediately to take back control!”","East Glow looked resolute and serious when it spoke.","It had been unwilling to open up the space between the main hall and the sacrificial lane because it wanted to preserve the pride of the entire Marsh East Circle. For this reason, it would even be willing to go up against the Palace of Everything.","The reason behind these words was the same.","It was unlikely that the Banquet of Everything’s attendees would find out that the decision-making power had been transferred solely to the Palace of Everything. But once there was bloodshed at the Banquet of Everything, the Palace of Everything would handle the matter without consulting the Marsh East Palace.","This would cause the Marsh East Palace to immediately become the laughingstock of the entire Marsh East Circle.","The Marsh East Circle was already considered weak among the six major marsh circles.","That said, the Apostles from the other marsh circles might still attend the Banquet of Everything because of the Banquet of Everything’s reputation.","Once the Marsh East Palace failed to maintain its pride, the news would definitely travel throughout the six major marsh circles. This was the last thing that East Glow wanted to see as the Marsh East Palace’s overseer.","East Glow had been very worried when it added this condition because it did not want to have any further conflict with the Palace of Everything.","Compared to the strong-headed and almost domineering girl, this girl who looked amicable but was frowning slightly was clearly not easy to deal with.","After Second Born heard what East Glow said, she looked at East Glow for a moment, causing all the hair to stand up on East Glow’s skin.","Second Born’s lips curved slightly in a mysterious smile.","“Of course! As the owner, you can step in anytime if there is any bloodshed. I only hope that you’ll be brave enough to do so!”","Second Born spoke neither too slowly nor quickly.","If one did not read too much into her words, they would give a sense of gentleness.","But when the veteran Apostles from Marsh East Palace heard this, they immediately picked up on the mocking and derision buried in each word.","When East Glow and the other Apostles still had not replied even after a few moments had passed, Second Born stood up and said, “Third Born, let’s go and help with the setting up. If we wait for First Sister for every issue, there won’t be enough time!”","Third Born stood up and looked at Second Born with a stunned gaze before she followed Second Born to the area where the Banquet of Everything was going to be held.","Second Born noticed Third Born’s gaze and returned it with a sharp look.","Second Born’s expression did not flinch as she asked, “Third Born, why are you looking at me this way? It’s almost like this is the first time we’re meeting!”","Third Born stretched contentedly. “Second Sister, you aren’t acting like usual. I thought I would have to handle the interaction with Marsh East Palace and set up on my own. But you’re here to help, so I can quickly skive off!”","After hearing Third Born’s reply, Second Born’s sharp gaze softened.","“Third Born, since you want to skive off, you can leave all of the setting up to me. You can handle the organization of the guest name list. It’s time for you to increase your power!”","Second Born pondered over what Third Born said before a confused expression spread across her face.","Since when was the peak of Apostle the end of the line?","She was in charge of organizing the labor for the Banquet of Everything. As long as she inserted some of its own people, she would have eyes looking out throughout the entire Banquet of Everything. This way, she would know the instant that that person appeared.","While she was thinking, Second Born looked at her hands.","From the moment that she started walking down that path and made that decision, she had decided to go for broke. Even if she had to break ties with her two sisters or if they ended up standing in her way, Second Born would not hesitate to spill their blood over her hands.","All of the roiling darkness was hidden under the facade of peaceful prosperity.","In just 45 hours, Second Born drew up the proposal for the labor organization of the Banquet of Everything.","Normally, even if the Marsh East Palace had given full control of the Banquet of Everything to the Palace of Everything, this proposal should still be handed to East Glow, who oversaw the Marsh East Palace. This was the most basic courtesy.","However, Second Born did not intend to do so.","Second Born and Third Born had come to have a discussion and only brought a small team with them.","Most of the Palace of Everything’s army was with First Born. Yet, Second Born’s plan included most of the troops.","Second Born thought, First Sister, you are indeed smart. You must have detected something! I hope you can turn a blind eye. Otherwise, you can’t blame me for ignoring all our years of sisterhood!","As Second Born looked at the name list with a million thoughts flying through her head, she suddenly heard Third Born’s hurried steps by the door.","As lively as Third Born was, she was always serious when she carried out her tasks. She would never be in such a panic unless something big had happened.","Second Born straightened her body and readied herself to hear what Third Born had to say.","Soon, the door of the room was pushed open. After Third Born stepped in, but before she even closed the door, she said loudly, “Second Sister, I heard that a Dictator has appeared in Marsh East Circle who is rushing to the Banquet of Everything! Will things change with a Dictator attending the Banquet of Everything?”","Third Born assumed that Second Born would become just as panicked as she was when she heard the news.","Yet, Second Born appeared composed and collected, as though she was completely unaffected by the news.","Second Born had already guessed that a Dictator would be coming to attend the Banquet of Everything. In the past years’ Banquets of Everything, there had been the occasional attendance by Dictators.","If she was still an Apostle now, she would definitely be in hysterics over Dictator Everything’s disappearance.","Apostles did not have the right to speak to Dictators. However, she had already crossed that boundary.","Since she was a Dictator as well, Second Born did not think that the Dictators who came to attend the Banquet of Everything would take the risk of starting a fight with her.","Dictator Everything had hidden herself away because Second Born had become a Dictator.","Second Born did not care how many Dictators came as long as her goal was unaffected."]},{"number":2253,"title":"Chapter 2253 Take Over Marsh East Palace?","paragraphs":["2253 Take Over Marsh East Palace?","At that moment, Third Born continued to speak frantically. “Second Sister, that Dictator is called Ten Thousand Source!”","Second Born’s heart skipped a beat, and her blood pressure shot up. She could hear her heart pounding in her head as she thought, What? Ten Thousand Source! Its name has the word ‘source’ in it!","Second Born had been completely composed a moment ago. But after hearing the name Ten Thousand Source, Second Born completely lost her cool.","For a Dictator to be alive after including the word ‘source’ in its name, it meant that this Dictator had to be stronger than others and might have even passed the feeble period after entering the Turning Wheel Realm.","Regular Dictators would not be able to stand up to such a Dictator.","This Dictator was highly likely to ruin her plan or even rob her of her rewards.","Would this Dictator come to kill her and turn her into a collectible source totem?","Second Born had not had an easy time reaching where she currently was. She did not want all of her effort to culminate in her becoming a toy of others.","As such, Second Born decided to hide during the duration of the Banquet of Everything. She would not act even if Dictator Everything turned up.","With that thought, Second Born tore the name list and said, “Third Sister, with a Dictator with the word ‘source’ in its name attending the Banquet of Everything, there is sure to be trouble! I don’t have much experience organizing labor, so I think it’s best to leave this task to First Sister! Let’s bring it up once First Sister arrives so she can make a decision! I will take this time to go into seclusion to increase my power!”","At that moment, Third Born felt as though she finally understood Second Born.","She had been confused through Second Born’s entire interaction with the Apostles from the Marsh East Palace.","Although Third Born was not skilled at hiding her emotions, she was not simple-minded either.","After being an Apostle for thousands of years, even the purest jade would eventually become stained.","Third Born never turned her scheming mind onto her sisters because they were the closest lifeforms to her.","But ever since the first time she sensed that something was off with Second Born, Third Born had been looking for abnormalities.","Third Born had clearly heard Second Born refer to Dictator Ten Thousand Source as ‘he’.","In the marsh world, due to differences in life ranks, the way that lifeforms of different life ranks addressed each other was also different.","Using gender pronouns did not only refer to gender. Only lifeforms of the same life rank could use them with each other.","It was strange for Second Born to address a Dictator in such a way, regardless of whether the Dictator had the word ‘source’ in its name!","Third Born forcefully suppressed her feelings of perplexity.","“Second Sister, this is a serious matter! The attendance of this Dictator could likely attract attendance by more Dictators! I’ll go and let First Sister know now. You stay here and hold down the fort!”","But now, Second Born’s mind was fully focused on the Dictator called ‘Ten Thousand Source’. Hence, she did not detect that Third Born’s attitude toward her had changed.","Second Born casually replied, “Go and inform First Sister! Nothing will go wrong with me here! You can take all the subordinates and be careful on the way.”","Third Born was shocked when she heard what Second Born said, as she could tell that Second Born was showing concern for her.","But eventually, Third Born still decided to disregard this sentimental moment and tell First Born about Second Born’s peculiarness.","Affection could never beat out faith in the marsh world.","This was the law that had ruled over the world for billions of years, and the entire system of this world was built around this law.","In actuality, Second Born wanted Third Born to go to First Born.","Second Born had long been prepared for First Born to suspect her.","After Third Born passed on the message that Second Born was leaving the final decision of the labor organization to First Born, the latter should set a significant portion of her suspicions to rest.","However, Second Born did not expect that Third Born would pick up her careless address of a Dictator.","Third Born and Second Born both lived in the Marsh East Circle but were not considered bigshots in the Marsh East Circle. The real bigshots were the Apostles who had presided over Marsh East Palace for a long time.","The veteran Apostles from Marsh East Palace had split opinions about the Dictator who was coming.","Some of them hoped that given the Marsh East Circle’s current lack of Dictators, this Dictator of unknown origin would choose to stay in Marsh East Palace. Otherwise, the Marsh East Circle would only deteriorate even more with the continued absence of a Dictator.","The other group of Apostles did not agree with this idea. Although there were no Dictators in Marsh East Circle now, it enabled these veteran Dictators to gain extremely strong speaking authority. If a real Dictator took over Marsh East Palace, their positions would change from decision-makers to followers or even servants.","These Apostles had long lost their edge after being corrupted by greed over time. Now, they were like elderly lions who only wanted to spend their days taking advantage of their positions.","While the veteran Apostles were arguing vehemently, Star Splendor said in almost a giggly voice, “I don’t think we should be talking about whether this Dictator should be allowed to take over Marsh East Palace, but how we can dissuade this Dictator if it does decide to do so!”","Star Splendor’s words caused the fighting to halt, and the entire scene fell silent.","Who could dissuade a Dictator with the word ‘source’ in its name if it wanted to take over Marsh East Palace? This feat was so impossible that it was almost laughable.","Star Splendor’s words made this clear to the Apostles who had been fighting. They suddenly felt as though they were as helpless as ants trying to fight an elephant."]},{"number":2254,"title":"Chapter 2254 Dictator Ten Thousand Source Has Arrived!","paragraphs":["2254 Dictator Ten Thousand Source Has Arrived!","This topic was brought up by East Glow. Since East Glow was the current decision-maker of the Marsh East Palace, the pressure and responsibility on its shoulders were almost suffocating.","During the interaction with the Palace of Everything, everyone retracted their necks and darted around the topic. However, East Glow had no choice but to stick its neck out and interact with the Palace of Everything.","As time passed, East Glow came to understand the importance of power.","At first, East Glow was not the type to chase power. But now, it had started chasing power as its top priority.","Even its admiration for Star Splendor came after its yearning for power had been quelled.","In order to quickly increase one’s power, especially during this period of stagnation, the best way was to select and become loyal to an Apostle.","East Glow thought that its suggestion would provide a way out for its companions.","Yet, after it made this suggestion, it received a lot of pushback. Only a minority of Apostles agreed with it.","It was no wonder that the Marsh East Circle was going downhill.","With these Apostles who did not want to progress and were happy to continue basking in their power, the Marsh East Circle had no future in sight.","East Glow suddenly felt a wave of exhaustion, and it no longer wanted to continue fighting with its colleagues.","East Glow said, “If we can’t come to an agreement, I will request to become this Dictator’s follower. I will follow if this Dictator chooses to leave the Marsh East Circle.”","East Glow’s expression turned serious as it looked at Star Splendor and said, “Star Splendor, there is no Apostle in the Marsh East Circle who can best you in looks. Your looks are a part of your capabilities. But such a capability is nothing more than an adornment. It can’t become your rock to rely on.","“I have been courting you for more than 800 years partly because of your looks and aura but also because of the talent I see in you. With your talent, you are the most likely among us to break through to become a Dictator. So I hope you will have a good think about whether you want to continue staying here to enjoy the rest of the fading prosperity or go back to basics to carve out a new path!”","After it was done speaking, East Glow did not wait for Star Splendor’s reaction but left the meeting hall immediately.","It left the interior of the palace to go and take a look at the carnivorous plants being nurtured outside. Each of these carnivorous plants produced fruits of different types. They were tasted, and East Glow often plucked one or two to taste after a meeting.","East Glow’s gaze fell on the carnivorous plants again. But instead of plucking the fruits, East Glow thought, The small source fruits given by Dictator Ten Thousand Source contain pure source-type power. My talent is limited. I will only be able to take a step further if I use pure source-type power to change my talent.","East Glow was unsure if it would be able to become Dictator Ten Thousand Source’s follower. But even if Dictator Ten Thousand Source did not acknowledge it, it hoped that it could do all it could to trade for a few small source berries.","Before East Glow entered Marsh East Palace, it had traveled through the other five major marsh circles, as well as Marsh Abyss. However, it had never heard of any fruit that could increase source-type power.","East Glow was not strong, but this did not prevent it from gaining more knowledge.","Not even in Marsh Abyss had East Glow heard of any fruit that could increase source-type power after being consumed.","The news of Dictator Ten Thousand Source’s small source fruits would definitely spread rapidly throughout the six major marsh circles until word finally got to Marsh Abyss.","Lin Yuan knew that after nurturing the Deposit Ability Litchi Branches and calling them small source fruit when he distributed them, word about them would soon spread far and wide.","But he did not expect that the pure source-type power in the marsh world came solely from Dictators and that it was also extremely precious to Dictators.","There had never been any fruits in the marsh world that provided pure source-type power after they were eaten.","The small source fruits crushed the system of the marsh world and even challenged the authority of all the Dictators.","Unlike in the human world, there were no special messaging methods in the marsh world. Thus, news of Lin Yuan’s name being Dictator Ten Thousand Source and the small source berries traveled very slowly. Until now, word had not gotten past the Marsh East Circle.","But there was still some time before the Banquet of Everything began, and the Banquet of Everything lasted for a full two weeks.","That period of time was long enough for the news of Dictator Ten Thousand Source and the small source fruits to reach Marsh Abyss.","It could be said that Lin Yuan’s actions had started a storm in the marsh world after its extended period of peace.","Regardless of whether it was the name that Lin Yuan had come up with, the Deposit Ability Litchi Branches known as small source fruits, or the Storing Ability White Peaches, which were about to be known as the big source fruit, all of them would kick up astonishing waves that drew powerful Apostles to the Marsh East Palace.","The powerful Dictators would find it worth it to make the trip, whether it was to cause trouble for Lin Yuan or to obtain the small source fruits by trading with him.","Lin Yuan was not intentionally hiding his identity.","There was no need to pretend to be an Apostle to carry out trading.","If he appeared too weak while possessing a treasure like the small source fruits, he would come up against some trouble while he was trading.","Thus, when he arrived at the entrance of Marsh East Palace and faced the guard Apostles, he decided to announce his fake identity.","Lin Yuan turned and shot a look at White Speak. There was no need for Lin Yuan to speak directly to these Apostles outside of Marsh East Palace.","White Speak said loudly and arrogantly, “Who is currently in charge of Marsh East Palace? Dictator Ten Thousand Source is here. Why are there no greeters or ushers?”","The Apostles looked displeased when they heard the first half of what White Speak said.","An Apostle with just higher average faith power dared to speak so haughtily at the entrance of Marsh East Palace? It dared to ask for the current overseer of the Marsh East Palace?","Although there were no Dictators in the Marsh East Palace, all of the veteran Apostles who were present had reached the peak of Apostle.","Before the guards could form their frowns fully, the latter part of what White Speak said caused the guards’ eyes to widen until they were as large as saucers."]},{"number":2255,"title":"Chapter 2255 Second Born’s Test!","paragraphs":["2255 Second Born’s Test!","News of Dictator Ten Thousand Source and the small source fruits had already reached Marsh East Palace. The Apostles guarding the entrance had also heard of them.","Marsh East Palace needed to put on their warmest and humblest attitudes when facing any Dictator, much less one with the word ‘source’ in its name.","As the head of Marsh East Palace, East Glow still made the final calls in Marsh East Palace despite having butted heads with the other veteran Apostles. After all, it was the strongest Apostle.","East Glow had been thinking of how it could become acquainted with Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","East Glow did not know when Dictator Ten Thousand Source would turn up or what it would look like. It was unquestionably disrespectful to seek a Dictator out.","East Glow had considered all the possibilities and arranged for one of his close subordinates to stand guard by the entrance of Marsh East Palace. This was so it would immediately be alerted once Dictator Return to Ruins arrived at Marsh East Palace.","There were many veteran Apostles in Marsh East Palace with similar power levels.","It was not easy to manage them. Almost all of the Apostles in Marsh East Palace had Dictators to whom they were loyal. Thus, there were many different camps formed among these Apostles, and they often clashed against each other when they worked together.","When the subordinate that East Glow positioned by the entrance came to its senses, it hurriedly bowed and said, “Greetings, Dictator Ten Thousand Source! The current decision-maker in Marsh East Palace is Lord East Glow. I will go and inform Lord East Glow now. Before that, please come with me to the main area of Marsh East Palace, where you’ll be able to rest.”","Once this Apostle was done speaking, the other Apostles guarding the entrance had also recovered from their shock, and the gears were quickly turning in their head.","They looked at Lin Yuan with respect, curiosity, and slight wariness.","Lifeforms of the same life rank in the marsh world could become loyal to each other.","Faith power was unidirectional and binding. Once one party formed a contract with another through faith power, the contract could not be dissolved by one party.","Thus, although there was a Dictator in front of them, the Apostles could not ask to follow Lin Yuan. They had to continue being loyal to the Dictators they had committed to.","There were many veteran Apostles in the Marsh East Palace who did not want Lin Yuan to take over. Thus, several of the Apostles standing guard did not put on friendly attitudes toward him but only maintained the most basic respect.","At the same time, they intended to quickly send word to their Dictators once East Glow’s subordinate had led Lin Yuan to the rest area.","White Speak was very happy with what East Glow’s subordinate said and nodded with a smile as it said, “Then let’s go! Tell that East Glow to come and see my Dictator!”","White Speak’s words were haughty and rude. Yet, East Glow’s subordinate found no issues with what White Speak said and saw it as acceptable.","Lin Yuan knew just how big the gaps between lifeforms of different life ranks were.","Thus, he not only did not rebuke White Speak for being so arrogant but was even glad that White Speak was aware of this relationship between lifeforms of different life ranks. If Lin Yuan was courteous to everyone, his facade as a Dictator might fail and lead to suspicion.","When East Glow’s Apostle led Lin Yuan to the main hall, all of the guards vanished from the entrance of Marsh East Palace as they had all left to report to their own Dictators.","Lin Yuan strolled relaxedly through Marsh East Palace.","Many flowering carnivorous plants were planted within Marsh East Palace, each beautiful exterior hiding a greedy stomach. With the sheer number of flowers, not even 10,000 Marsh Crocodiles would be enough to feed all of the carnivorous plants.","Carnivorous plants had much bigger appetites than animal-type dimensional lifeforms.","The carnivorous plants were all planted in marsh soil, and there were at least 300,000 of each grade of marsh soil.","It was impossible for Marsh East Palace to use all of the marsh soil they had in these plants.","Lin Yuan could be certain that Marsh East Palace was overflowing with marsh soil.","After realizing this, Lin Yuan no longer needed to worry about whether Lift Marsh would be able to hold up his ever-expanding territory after it had absorbed sufficient marsh soil. Instead, he had to think about how he should use the additional islands that grew out from Lift Marsh’s main body to their greatest advantage.","East Glow’s subordinate was currently leading the way, and it dared not utter a word to Lin Yuan for fear of saying something that rubbed him the wrong way. Such a thing could end up affecting its master.","East Glow wanted to follow Lin Yuan and East Glow’s subordinate was definitely aware of this. It hoped that it would be able to turn this wish into reality.","It could not change the fact that it was East Glow’s follower. But if East Glow became Dictator Ten Thousand Source’s follower, by transferrence, it would also be following Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","It was not always a good decision to follow a Dictator, but it was definitely the best choice if one wanted to transform and become stronger.","East Glow’s subordinate knew why the veteran Apostles were unwilling to follow Dictator Ten Thousand Source and were against Dictator Ten Thousand Source taking over Marsh East Palace. Nonetheless, East Glow’s subordinate scorned such behavior.","Once a lifeform stopped yearning to improve and transform, its soul would begin to rot. As it continued to live, it would be nothing more than a walking corpse controlled by desires. As other lifeforms continued to grow stronger, those who remained in the same spot would only end up destroyed.","At that moment, East Glow’s subordinate suddenly realized that the purple-haired Apostle from the Palace of Everything named Second Born was walking toward them.","Second Born’s gaze had passed over it and landed on Dictator Ten Thousand Source. It was a very disrespectful gaze, but East Glow’s subordinate chose not to speak.","Its master wanted to curry favor with Lin Yuan to follow him.","Nonetheless, it had no right to offend someone from the Palace of Everything because the Palace of Everything had a Dictator.","White Speak was just about to comment on Second Born’s rude gaze when it was stopped by Lin Yuan’s raised hand.","This was because Lin Yuan noticed that he could not see this girl’s data using True Data."]},{"number":2256,"title":"Chapter 2256 Samsara Realm?","paragraphs":["2256 Samsara Realm?","This situation meant that this girl’s power had already reached Eternal.","Lin Yuan found out from his conversations with White Speak that the limit of Apostles was about the equivalent to pinnacle Immortal.","When Lin Yuan used his faith power to boost White Speak to Eternal, it exceeded the level of Apostles.","This purple-haired girl’s background could not be seen in True Data, meaning her power had exceeded the level of Apostles, and she was a true Dictator.","This is the first time that Lin Yuan was looking at a living and breathing Dictator. He appeared calm but was actually gripped with nervousness.","Lin Yuan wanted to test to see if this real Dictator could see through him as a fake Dictator.","If this girl could see the truth, it meant that he would only be able to pull the wool over the eyes of Apostles and not Dictators from now on. But if he managed to keep the lie going, he could truly do whatever he wanted and blend into the marsh world.","No matter how strong his identity as a human, it would never compare to what he could achieve as a Dictator.","This was why Lin Yuan told White Speak not to speak.","White Speak would definitely speak without any thought to respect because it wanted to protect him.","Lin Yuan was not afraid of this purple-haired girl, but he also did not want to clash with her.","He was not acquainted with East Glow, but from how East Glow’s subordinate acted, it was clear that this girl was not East Glow.","Since East Glow was Marsh East Palace’s decision-maker, it was the strongest presence in Marsh East Palace.","There was a high chance that this girl came from the Palace of Everything.","Once conflict arose between Lin Yuan and the purple-haired girl, the Banquet of Everything would not be able to continue progressing normally regardless of whether they defeated or killed each other. This would ruin Lin Yuan’s plan.","However, Lin Yuan was curious.","Was Dictator Everything not a veteran Dictator? Why did this girl only seem to be around Sovereign XII/Immortal I? This level of power meant that the girl had only recently become a Dictator. There was no way that she was Dictator Everything.","While Lin Yuan was thinking, Second Born did not hesitate to expose her aura of a Dictator to sense Lin Yuan’s power.","But eventually, she came up empty. She did not have the slightest idea of how strong he was.","Or, he might be a sham who did not have a shred of power. But this situation was impossible.","Second Born could not sense Dictator Everything’s aura either, as Dictator Everything had set up that blockage against her.","This Dictator, with the appearance of a young man, had the aura of clouds shrouded in fog.","Both of them had different auras but had the same effect.","This Dictator called Ten Thousand Source had to have entered the Turning Wheel Realm or perhaps even reached a higher level.","Second Born had only just promoted its life rank.","Since reaching Dictator, she had not tried to sense the aura of a Turning Wheel Realm Dictator. But was she really unable to pick up even a trace?","Could it be that this Dictator’s power had truly surpassed the Turning Wheel Realm and reached the Samsara Realm?","It was said that once one entered the Samsara Realm, one was no longer afflicted by death. One would also be able to awaken a power beyond faith power and source power.","Before Dictator Everything entered the Turning Wheel Realm, she had expressed more than once that she wanted to enter the Turning Wheel Realm.","With this thought, Second Born inhaled sharply.","This smiling young man in front of her could very well be a Dictator who had entered the Samsara Realm.","Dictators who had entered the Samsara Realm were all considered eminent beings in Marsh Abyss.","Second Born had felt slightly indignant when she first heard the name “Ten Thousand Source”. She thought that another arrogant fellow had appeared in the Marsh East Realm.","But after estimating Lin Yuan’s power, Second Born no longer thought that way.","After entering the Samsara Realm, one had the right to add ‘source’ to one’s name.","Second Born wanted to meet with Lin Yuan so she could assess him.","After her check, Second Born was well and truly shocked by Lin Yuan.","No matter how many plans she had, she no longer dared to put them into action.","Second Born bowed to Lin Yuan just like she used to do for Dictators when she had been an Apostle before hurrying back to where she resided.","Second Born’s actions took East Glow’s subordinate slightly aback.","Second Born followed Dictator Everything and was Dictator Everything’s close subordinate. She was even closer to Dictator Everything than it was to East Glow.","An Apostle who had become loyal to a Dictator did not need to bow to another Dictator as it would weaken the authority of its own Dictator.","It was likely that Second Born did so because she had heard of Dictator Ten Thousand Source’s name and wanted to assess if Dictator Ten Thousand Source was stronger than Dictator Everything.","With this thought, East Glow’s subordinate became excited. Only a powerful Dictator like this was worth following.","Lin Yuan raised an eyebrow in the direction that Second Born had left.","He had never met a Dictator from the Turning Wheel Realm, but he guessed that a Turning Wheel Realm Dictator was similar to experts who had awakened their birth horoscopes and were walking down heaven’s path.","Lin Yuan needed to find a way to get to know a veteran Dictator and ask about whether there were levels above Turning Wheel Realm.","If that purple-haired girl had not only recently become a Dictator and did not know much, Lin Yuan would not have minded inviting her to have a drink with him.","Along the way here, Lin Yuan had sensed multiple auras trying to check on him.","None of them had been obvious or managed to reach him, but White Speak could not help but huff angrily when it sensed them and released its own thick aura.","All of the auras were stronger than White Speak’s own, but they became wary and fearful once they sensed White Speak’s aura. They hurriedly dodged before they stopped their investigative efforts.","After being led to the main palace to the seat where East Glow usually sat, Lin Yuan sat down unceremoniously.","East Glow’s subordinate served up a platter of fruits and various wines before it rushed off to report to East Glow.","East Glow was now the last person in the entire Marsh East Palace who knew of Ten Thousand Source’s arrival, but it did not feel unhappy in the slightest."]},{"number":2257,"title":"Chapter 2257 Are You Seducing Me?","paragraphs":["2257 Are You Seducing Me?","It even generously provided its subordinate with a large pile of rewards.","It did not matter who heard first. What was important was leaving the best impression on Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","There were many veteran Apostles in the Marsh East Palace who did not want Dictator Ten Thousand Source to take over Marsh East Palace. Thus, East Glow did not have many obstacles to take down.","Even if there were obstacles in its way, it would be able to bulldoze through them as the decision-maker in Marsh East Palace.","East Glow hurriedly rushed toward the main palace.","When it arrived at the main hall’s entrance, East Glow saw four attendants who were usually with Star Splendor standing there.","This meant that Star Splendor, who did not support Dictator Ten Thousand Source’s takeover of Marsh East Palace, had gone to see Dictator Ten Thousand Source first.","This discovery caused East Glow to furrow its brow.","East Glow had been courting Star Splendor and was enraptured by Star Splendor’s looks.","Once one’s looks reached a peak, one would be able to captivate others even if they were lacking in other areas.","East Glow did not feel this way before it met Star Splendor.","If not because of East Glow, there was no way that Star Splendor would have been able to enter Marsh East Palace, given its powers 800 years ago.","After being given resources from Marsh East Palace, Star Splendor was now an Apostle with below strong faith power.","In spite of Star Splendor’s current strength, East Glow continued to supply it with resources.","The issue of inviting Dictator Ten Thousand Source into Marsh East Palace was the first time that East Glow and Star Splendor were on opposite sides.","This allowed East Glow to understand that with Star Splendor’s personality and plans, there was no way that it could continue to remain by its side for long.","But why had Star Splendor come to meet with Dictator Ten Thousand Source?","It had brought Star Splendor into the Marsh East Palace because it had been enthralled by Star Splendor and because Star Splendor had spent a significant amount of effort currying favor and even seducing it.","Star Splendor was not strong but was skilled at using its looks as weapons.","Thus, after some rumination, East Glow understood why Star Splendor had beaten everyone else to the punch and rushed there to meet Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","It could be that Star Splendor was never against Dictator Ten Thousand Source entering Marsh East Palace but hoped to create conflict so the other veteran Apostles would not come to meet with Dictator Ten Thousand Source. This way, it would have a higher chance of being accepted to join Dictator Ten Thousand Source’s camp.","This fit with Star Splendor’s style.","Dictators were not the final destination of power that dimensional lifeforms could attain. They were also doing all they could to find ways to increase their power, just like Apostles did.","How could such an expert fall to a pretty face?","It would not have wanted to give up everything for Star Splendor’s sake if it had not entered a period of ease and comfort.","East Glow shot a look at a few of the subordinates behind it, and they immediately locked the entrance to the main hall.","East Glow was still the overseer of Marsh East Palace.","The veteran Apostles would not dare to protest even if they came to the main hall to greet Dictator Ten Thousand Source but found themselves stopped.","East Glow still possessed such authority.","East Glow was in no rush to enter the main hall but intended to allow Star Splendor to stay a little longer in the main hall.","This was so Star Splendor could find out how big of a mistake it was making by seducing a Dictator.","It also gave East Glow a chance to test Dictator Ten Thousand Source’s personality and find out whether it would be worth it to become loyal to Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","As an Apostle, it could not opt out once it had become loyal to a Dictator.","It would be better to continue on its own rather than commit to a Dictator who could not even hold out against temptation.","Star Splendor’s heart sank, and its expression slowly turned awkward.","Star Splendor had always used its beauty to obtain resources. But in the face of this Dictator with the appearance of a young man, the looks it had always been proud of had become useless!","Lin Yuan was holding the Storing Ability White Peach that contained source-type power. Its juices were sweet and refreshing, much tastier than a peach.","Lin Yuan chomped down on the Storing Ability White Peach as he examined the kneeling Star Splendor.","At first, Lin Yuan had not thought much about Star Splendor coming to see him. He just assumed Marsh East Palace had sent an Apostle to come and greet him.","He did not care if this Apostle was East Glow.","A faction without a Dictator and only made up of veteran Apostles could never be united.","But slowly, Lin Yuan realized that Star Splendor was not talking about what mattered, and he realized that Star Splendor had to be scheming something.","Lin Yuan was slightly frustrated but continued to smile.","He did not expect to be seduced in a place like the marsh world where dangers were abound and all lifeforms abided by the law of the jungle.","He would not have taken out the Storing Ability White Peach to eat if he knew.","The Storing Ability White Peaches were about the size of two fists, and one was at least 500 grams.","Lin Yuan originally wanted to use the Storing Ability White Peach to attract the attention of the veteran Apostles from Marsh East Palace so that he had something he could use to leverage a trade.","But Star Splendor’s mind was not on the right track and was not focused on the Storing Ability White Peach at all.","After eating one and a half of the Storing Ability White Peaches, Lin Yuan could not go on.","If Star Splendor did not leave soon, his stomach would explode from eating all of the Storing Ability White Peaches.","Lin Yuan discourteously tossed the remaining half of the Storing Ability White Peach onto the table.","The marsh world was warm and humid. Thus, the environment was filled with various types of bacteria. All of the bacteria could quickly decompose living creatures.","This was why the bodies of anything that died in the marsh world decomposed completely within half a day.","The remaining half of the Storing Ability White Peach would be covered with bacteria and rot within half an hour.","There was no way that Lin Yuan could digest the Storing Ability White Peaches in his body during that time.","Thus, Lin Yuan decided to give up on the remaining half of the Storing Ability White Peach.","Star Splendor had caused Lin Yuan to overeat to the point of nausea, and he still had not been able to accomplish his goal. Thus, he became increasingly upset with Star Splendor.","When Star Splendor entered, Lin Yuan had indeed felt that it had exceptional looks.","However, its looks could not compare to Su Yiren’s.","After spending time with Su Yiren, Lin Yuan was no longer overly affected by beauty."]},{"number":2258,"title":"Chapter 2258 Looks Above Star Splendor!","paragraphs":["2258 Looks Above Star Splendor!","In terms of aura, the Moon Empress, Night Leaning Moon, Purple Love, and the Goddess of Mercy all had their own style with varying degrees of suaveness and elegance.","Lin Yuan often interacted with such people and had long developed a high standard and defense against beauty.","In terms of power, Star Splendor was many levels weaker than the Moon Empress, Night Leaning Moon, the Goddess of Mercy, and Purple Love. There was less than no competition.","Thus, Lin Yuan was only momentarily stunned by Star Splendor’s looks and did not react in any other way.","Star Splendor noticed this. Thus, everything it did next was on the fly.","Lin Yuan did not want to waste time with Star Splendor and said, “Beauty is never reliable. White Speak, take her away!”","White Speak made a noise of acknowledgment before it fixed its cold gaze on Star Splendor and pointed toward the door.","If not for Lin Yuan’s instruction, White Speak would have been too lazy to even lead the way for Star Splendor.","Before he met Lin Yuan, White Speak would have been taken in by Star Splendor’s looks.","Star Splendor had come in first in the Marsh East Circle’s annual beauty pageant. It was indisputably the most beautiful being in Marsh East Circle.","There were many Apostles who yearned for nothing more than to be close to beauties,","However, White Speak had seen Lin Yuan in his dictator’s body form.","At that time, it had been floored by Lin Yuan’s dictator’s body. Star Splendor could not compare to that feeling.","If White Speak did not know that Lin Yuan was a Dictator and the Marsh East Circle’s pageant was below him, White Speak would have told him about it.","If Lin Yuan competed in his dictator’s body form, he would definitely sweep up all the votes even if Star Splendor had bribed all of the voters.","Star Splendor was miserably led out of the main hall by White Speak.","Lin Yuan’s last words reverberated in Star Splendor’s head as it left.","The Dictator seated on the main seat in the form of a young man had said it so casually, but it had sliced through Star Splendor’s pride.","Over the years, Star Splendor often made use of its looks in Marsh East Palace to obtain benefits. It had even used the leverage to kill off female Apostles who it saw as threats.","But now, she could compete neither in terms of power nor looks.","Despite being humiliated, all it could do was endure. It was even silently grateful that Dictator Ten Thousand Source had not punished it for its seduction attempt.","After leading Star Splendor to the entrance of the main palace, White Speak immediately spotted another Apostle nearby.","White Speak nodded at East Glow and coldly told Star Splendor, “Remember what my Lord Dictator said! Beauty is never reliable. My Dictator doesn’t blame you, but that doesn’t mean you didn’t do anything wrong. Don’t ever appear in front of him again! Or else you’ll have to face the consequences yourself!”","White Speak walked into the main hall, and East Glow hurriedly followed behind it.","Star Splendor expected to see East Glow at the entrance of the main hall, but it had not anticipated that White Speak would say such a thing before East Glow.","Star Splendor’s eyes searched East Glow’s face to assess how it felt about it.","Star Splendor thought that it would be able to see worry or pity on East Glow’s face.","Yet, East Glow did not even meet its gaze and maintained an expression of apathy.","Thus, Star Splendor shifted all of the unhappiness, resentment, and deep-set terror that it had accumulated against Lin Yuan onto East Glow.","However, had no idea that its place in East Glow’s heart had fallen far from its original position.","East Glow had made many guesses.","After hearing what White Speak said, East Glow immediately understood why Star Splendor had come to see Dictator Ten Thousand Source first.","In spite of all the guesses, East Glow did not feel good now that its guess had been confirmed.","But East Glow rationally knew that it was time to let go of Star Splendor.","Rather than pursuing Star Splendor without any conclusion in sight, White Speak telling Star Splendor not to appear in front of Dictator Ten Thousand Source anymore ended any lingering reluctance that existed.","If it wanted to join Dictator Ten Thousand Source from now on, it had to stop associating with Star Splendor.","After understanding this, East Glow felt much more relaxed.","As someone who prioritized beauty, the most difficult part was making the move to sever all ties.","When East Glow followed White Speak in, Lin Yuan, who was already filled with Storing Ability White Peaches to the point of bursting, took out another Storing Ability White Peach.","In the eyes of others, Lin Yuan was an inscrutable Dictator, but in actuality, he was just a litchi branch and peach seller.","He needed to use the Storing Ability White Peach to attract the attention of East Glow, Marsh East Palace’s decision-maker.","East Glow’s gaze fell on Lin Yuan. When it saw Lin Yuan, East Glow let out a gasp of wonderment.","Someone who truly prioritized beauty did not distinguish between gender.","Lin Yuan’s looks were already outstanding. After multiple cleansings and consuming the Earth Center Fine Milk, Lin Yuan and the Moon Empress already had equal standing when it came to looks and aura.","Even if Lin Yuan did not use his dictator’s body, his appearance and aura were still more excellent than that of Star Splendor.","An Apostle looking directly at a Dictator was considered an overstep.","East Glow forcefully tore its eyes away from Lin Yuan.","But immediately after shifting its gaze down, East Glow’s eyes landed on the Storing Ability White Peach that Lin Yuan was holding as well as the half-eaten Storing Ability White Peach on the table.","The Storing Ability White Peach contained much more source-type power than the Deposit Ability Litchi Branch.","Thus, East Glow did not need to touch the Storing Ability White Peach itself to feel just how pure the source-type power within was.","It would be fine if Lin Yuan was only holding one of the Storing Ability White Peaches.","News had already spread about Dictator Ten Thousand Source being in possession of the small source fruits that contained pure source-type power.","This peach was clearly not the rumored red small source fruit."]},{"number":2259,"title":"Chapter 2259 Tossed it Halfway?","paragraphs":["2259 Tossed it Halfway?","However, East Glow thought about it and realized it was conceivable that Dictator Ten Thousand Source might possess other similar fruits to the small source fruits.","But what was the half-eaten fruit thrown onto the table?","A layer of bacteria was already covering the fruit that was in the middle of decomposing the fruit.","After being decomposed by the bacteria, the pure source-type power within the fruit would be absorbed by the bacteria.","The Dictator in front of him was indifferent to this. Such behavior was too wasteful!","Not even Dictators should be wasting such pure source-type power!","Just as East Glow’s brain shut down, a clear voice said in its ear, “What? Are you interested in the big source fruit I ate partially?”","East Glow immediately reacted as Ten Thousand Source was speaking to it. It nodded sincerely and did not intend to hide anything from the Dictator it wanted to follow.","Lin Yuan was very satisfied with East Glow’s honesty. He could only negotiate prices with it when it showed that it was sincere.","To these Apostles, the Storing Ability White Peaches, known as small source fruits, and the Deposit Ability Litchi Branches,, known as big source fruits, were treasures they could never obtain on their own.","However, these fruits they saw as treasures were easily obtained by Lin Yuan from his territory.","As long as Lin Yuan was willing to provide the army of Hundred Questions Beasts with Creation Master resources, he would be able to obtain one batch every three months.","Thus, Lin Yuan was very indifferent to the Storing Ability White Peaches and Deposit Ability Litchi Branches.","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan did not intend to allow the Storing Ability White Peaches and Deposit Ability Litchi Branches to leave his control. Even after trading, he wanted to control the sold Deposit Ability Litchi Branches and Storing Ability White Peaches.","The best way would be to accept the Apostles who had obtained the Storing Ability White Peaches and Deposit Ability Litchi Branches. This would be a win-win situation for Lin Yuan.","It would not be difficult for Lin Yuan to achieve this with his status as a Dictator.","Lin Yuan looked at East Glow and said with pretentious allurement, “Neither the small or big fruits are precious to me. I can have as many of them as I want. However, I don’t like helping Apostles who are not under my camp, not even if the Apostle offers an astronomical price!”","Lin Yuan’s words were music to East Glow’s ears.","It had been thinking about what it should say to Dictator Ten Thousand Source to be accepted into his camp.","But now that Dictator Ten Thousand Source had spoken, it could use the segue to make its stance clear and declare its loyalty.","With this thought, East Glow bowed seriously to Lin Yuan and said, “Dictator Ten Thousand Source, I might be the decision-maker in Marsh East Palace but rather than this position, I would rather serve you! Are you willing to give me the chance to do so?”","Lin Yuan was silent for a moment.","Lin Yuan did not expect an Apostle with such authority would be willing to become loyal to him so easily.","Although Lin Yuan had decided that he would accept East Glow, he needed to maintain the demeanor of a Dictator.","As an act, Lin Yuan was momentarily silent.","But this action caused East Glow’s heart to rise into its throat.","More time passed, and Lin Yuan still had not replied.","All he did was toss the big source fruit to East Glow.","East Glow touched the big source fruit and was so excited that it almost jumped up from the ground.","But it did not allow the excitement to get to its head and humbly extended a tendril of its faith power toward Lin Yuan.","This was not the first time that Lin Yuan was experiencing this situation. He knew that East Glow wanted him to extract the faith power.","There was no way that Lin Yuan would hold himself back from such an opportunity.","Lin Yuan released his pillar of glowing faith power and started wildly extracting East Glow’s faith power.","Lin Yuan was in great need of faith power.","Although absorbing a large amount of faith power would affect East Glow, Lin Yuan still absorbed as much of it as he could.","Lin Yuan had a way of making up for this.","Source-type power was much more important to Apostles than faith power was.","Lin Yuan would compensate East Glow after he was done extracting its faith power.","East Glow was the first veteran Apostle in Marsh East Palace who became loyal to him. It was also the strongest expert in Marsh East Palace.","The better treatment that East Glow received from Lin Yuan, the better impression that Lin Yuan would make as news of him spread.","Lin Yuan knew that there had to be some Apostles in Marsh East Palace who did not welcome him.","Rather than becoming the follower of a Dictator, it was much better to continue enjoying their authority in Marsh East Palace.","Lin Yuan would not absorb the faith power of the Apostles, who did not welcome him and rejected him.","But it would be best if these Apostles left him alone. Otherwise, he would not mind collecting more source totems, which were also uncontracted sacred source lifeforms, to strengthen himself in the marsh world.","East Glow possessed much more faith power than Twin Feathers, Zhen Venom, and the other Apostles who had become loyal to him.","East Glow had to be the most powerful Apostle in the entire Marsh East Circle to become Marsh East Palace’s overseer.","Lin Yuan was no longer clueless about the exchange rate between faith power and source-type power.","According to the rate, if the faith power Twin Feathers provided had been worth 10 units of source-type power, it meant that the faith power that East Glow provided was worth 40 units of source-type power.","East Glow sensed that all of the faith power in its source totem had been drained. This feeling of being completely stripped and drained was foreign to it.","But it also filled East Glow with hope.","Given how generous Dictator Ten Thousand Source was, it would definitely make up for all the source power that it had given.","East Glow was stuck at pinnacle Apostle and could not advance further. It could not progress even if it accepted more believers and collected more faith power. This was a matter of its talent having reached its limit.","Its talent needed to transform for it to be able to inch toward Dictator.","This was East Glow’s goal of becoming Lin Yuan’s follower.","Nonetheless, it was still very serious about being Lin Yuan’s follower!"]},{"number":2260,"title":"Chapter 2260 Trouble Brews at the Banquet of Everything!","paragraphs":["2260 Trouble Brews at the Banquet of Everything!","After East Glow said that it wanted to follow Lin Yuan, the latter immediately tossed it the big source fruit.","The big source fruit contained about half a unit of source-type power.","This generous gift proved once again to East Glow how wealthy Dictator Ten Thousand Source was.","East Glow was more powerful than Twin Feathers. Hence, it knew that the most common good being traded among Dictators in Marsh Abyss was source-type power. The level of goods that source-type power could trade for was beyond the knowledge of Apostles.","Lin Yuan had spent almost a day extracting the faith power from East Glow’s source totem.","After earning faith power from this method, Lin Yuan realized that enabling the divine kingdom to develop quickly would not be impossible.","After Lin Yuan was done absorbing East Glow’s faith power, it looked weak and feeble.","Lin Yuan raised his finger and walked up to East Glow, gently pressing his finger on its forehead.","Soon, East Glow felt pure source-type power flowing into its body.","The source-type power was like keys unlocking all the locks in East Glow’s body, even nurturing its roots.","East Glow felt extremely excited when it sensed this. It knew that it would be able to make a charge toward Dictator once it filled up its source totem with faith power again.","Although it had reached pinnacle Apostle and was the most powerful being in the Marsh East Circle, East Glow still felt that it had been a long way from Dictator.","But after following Lin Yuan, the road to Dictator had opened up in front of it.","East Glow knelt and started to kowtow to Lin Yuan.","Its attitude toward Lin Yuan had not changed just because its life rank had increased.","After kowtowing a few times, East Glow realized with a shock that it had previously received pure source-type power.","It had encountered it by chance and traded for it with a large amount of resources. East Glow had always seen that event as a life-changing opportunity.","But that unit of source-type power was many levels from being as pure as the source-type power that came from Lin Yuan.","This discovery caused East Glow to further elevate Lin Yuan’s position in its heart.","A Dictator who was able to give such pure source-type power to his followers had to have crossed the Turning Wheel Realm at the very least.","A Dictator like this had to have his own territory in Marsh Abyss.","Furthermore, Lin Yuan had the word ‘source’ in his name.","There was a high possibility that Lin Yuan was a bigshot from Marsh Abyss, who East Glow had never heard of.","The more East Glow thought about it, the more it felt that it had hit the jackpot.","Most importantly, this Dictator it had chosen to become loyal to had exceptionally good looks.","As someone who prioritized beauty, East Glow felt blessed to be able to serve such a Dictator.","Lin Yuan injected 50 whole units of source-type power into East Glow’s body.","Lin Yuan wanted to come off as generous but could not go overboard. From East Glow’s perspective, every ten additional units of source-type power was a huge reward.","Big changes occurred in Marsh East Palace during the day that Lin Yuan extracted East Glow’s faith power.","Firstly, the Apostles who did not welcome Lin Yuan became filled with suspicion.","This was the first time East Glow met this Dictator, yet they were spending so much together. There could only be two possibilities for such a situation.","The first possibility was that East Glow had angered Dictator Ten Thousand Source and ended up killed.","The other possibility was that Dictator Ten Thousand Source had accepted East Glow as his follower.","Regardless of which possibility was the truth, they caused the veteran Apostles in Marsh East Palace to be shaken to the core.","After Third Born returned to the Palace of Everything and reported what had happened to First Born, the latter immediately led a team from the Palace of Everything to Marsh East Palace.","At first, First Born had been focused on the mole.","But now that it was confirmed that a Dictator was attending the Banquet of Everything, significant changes would definitely occur to the Banquet of Everything.","Without Dictator Everything in the Palace of Everything, the Palace of Everything had become a dried-up well and could not afford to handle any strong waves, much less a Dictator with the word ‘source’ in his name.","This Dictator even possessed the small source fruits which contained pure source-type power. A figure like this would undoubtedly attract more Dictators to the Marsh East Palace to attend the Banquet of Everything.","A Banquet of Everything that previously was only going to have Apostles in attendance was about to become the battleground for Dictators.","Just like how the Palace of Everything had forcefully taken the rights to manage the Banquet of Everything from the Marsh East Palace, the Dictators who arrived would definitely end up making up the rules as they pleased.","After hearing Third Born’s description of Dictator Ten Thousand Source, there was a high chance that even Dictator Everything was not on his level.","This thought filled First Born with a deep sense of helplessness.","Nonetheless, the Banquet of Everything had to go on as usual. Thus, First Born zeroed all of her thoughts on the setting up and organization of the Banquet of Everything.","She also started to become wary and guarded against Second Born.","Her helplessness and anxiousness would become the best shields.","When Third Born mentioned that Second Born had addressed Dictator Ten Thousand Source with a gender pronoun, First Born became certain that there was something off about Second Born.","Given Second Born’s careful character, she would never make such a simple error, even in a state of panic.","Dimensional lifeforms often kicked up a significant fuss when they evolved into Apostles but always evolved into Dictators silently.","It was not impossible that Second Born had silently broken through to Dictator.","However, there was something that First Born did not understand.","If Second Born had truly become a Dictator Everything, shouldn’t Lordess Everything be more relaxed? Why did she view Second Born as a threat?","First Born had some uncertainties. Was it that Lordess Everything had become distrusting of Second Born, or had Second Born truly schemed against Lordess Everything?","From Second Born’s previous treatment of Lordess Everything, First Born always felt that Second Born’s loyalty and admiration had been genuine.","The pressure and messy thoughts gave First Born a headache.","Because of Lin Yuan’s arrival, violent undercurrents had formed under the seemingly calm Banquet of Everything. There were only going to be even more ferocious storms in the Banquet of Everything’s future."]},{"number":2261,"title":"Chapter 2261 Beginning of the Divine Kingdom’s Transformation!","paragraphs":["2261 Beginning of the Divine Kingdom’s Transformation!","Lin Yuan was done absorbing the faith power as well as providing East Glow with source-type power.","Now, East Glow was one of his subordinates, and he did not wait before giving East Glow an order, “I want you to carry out a task while I’m attending the Banquet of Everything.”","East Glow’s expression turned serious.","Issuing it a task immediately after it became his follower meant that Lin Yuan wanted to test its capabilities.","It needed to do its best to complete this task from Lin Yuan and become Lin Yuan’s close subordinate.","East Glow had immediately assessed and knew what White Speak was capable of.","The White Evil Marsh Crocodile was a rare type of Marsh Crocodile, but it was not considered impressive when all the mutated types of the marsh world were considered.","East Glow’s true form was the Wilted Bone Marrow Wood. It was mutated from the carnivorous plant, the Wilted Bone Tough Wood, and comparable to the Rosemary Jade Martens from the Palace of Everything.","White Speak could not compete with it either in terms of power or talent.","Yet, White Speak had managed to become a close subordinate of a powerful Dictator who had at least reached the Turning Wheel Realm.","This Dictator had even been willing to make physical contact by riding on White Speak’s back. This meant that this Dictator was not averse to emotional ties.","East Glow liked people who saw emotional ties as important. Its efforts would never be in vain when it was loyal to and carried out tasks for such people.","“Lord Ten Thousand Source, feel free to give me any instructions! There is little that I can’t accomplish in the Marsh East Circle.”","East Glow had intentionally touted its own capabilities but not overly conspicuously.","This was because, as capable as it was within the Marsh East Circle, it was nothing more than an ant in front of a Dictator.","Moreover, doing so would likely tick off White Speak.","White Speak was Lin Yuan’s close subordinate, and East Glow needed to do its best to curry favor with White Speak as soon as possible.","Even after a prolonged period as the Marsh East Palace’s overseer, East Glow had not forgotten about social ties.","East Glow’s words pleased Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan was in urgent need of both marsh soil and uncontracted sacred source lifeforms.","Lin Yuan nodded at East Glow and gave it a task that it would never dream of ever receiving. “Go and collect as much marsh soil and as many source totems as you can. After the Banquet of Everything ends, I will repay you with small source fruits and big source fruits.”","Lin Yuan waved at East Glow, indicating that it could leave now.","When East Glow left, it could not help but ponder over the meaning of the task that it has been given.","However, it could not puzzle out an answer.","Marsh soil was the most basic currency in the marsh world. Dimensional lifeforms like the Medusa Snake Demons often traded with marsh soil. They were also traded among low-class Apostles.","But high-class Apostles preferred to trade source totems.","It was understandable for a Dictator whose power had at least reached the Turning Wheel Realm to want source totems. But why did he want lowly marsh soil?","East Glow cursed to itself about how it could not understand how Dictators were thinking while it came up with what it felt was the most likely possibility.","It had to be that Lin Yuan wanted to make good use of it in the future and was using this task to give it an opportunity to trade low-grade marsh soil for high-grade resources. It was both a test of its abilities and an opportunity to reward it.","This was the only conceivable possibility.","Lin Yuan looked in the direction that East Glow had left in and wondered if his task had been too direct.","It was not his style to give such a direct order, but there was no question that it would be better for someone like East Glow, who resided in Marsh East Palace and had the position and status to back it up to collect source totems, as opposed to him ostentatiously trading the big source fruits and small source fruits left, right, and center at the Banquet of Everything.","East Glow would do its best to gather as much marsh soil and as many source totems as possible to earn the small and big source fruits. Since this task concerned the benefits it would receive, Lin Yuan did not have to worry about keeping a close watch over it.","With East Glow doing its best to collect the marsh soil and source totems, Lin Yuan could fully let go of the reins during the Banquet of Everything and did not have to worry about buying marsh soil and source totems.","Lin Yuan could use the small source fruits and big source fruits to trade for truly high-grade resources. This would not only benefit Lin Yuan’s plan but would also allow him to rub elbows with powerful Dictators.","Rather than fighting on his own in the marsh world, establishing good ties with some Dictators could allow him to gain their help when he needed them.","Lin Yuan’s network of information in the marsh world was far too short.","The Dictators who had been growing for a long time in the marsh world would allow Lin Yuan to gain more information and connections.","With the big and small fruits in his hands, he could be certain that there was nothing he could not trade for.","While Lin Yuan was hesitating about whether he should go out for a walk and browse, a strange feeling appeared in Lin Yuan’s head.","It was as though someone was praying by his ear.","Lin Yuan circulated his soul power and listened in, only to hear Truth praying within his soul, “My most beloved, noble, and all-knowing god! Your lowly servant Truth has already improved your divine kingdom’s comfort level from Wasteland to Barren. May I ask if I should activate the blood you left behind to begin the life derivation of the divine kingdom?”","Lin Yuan was both excited and curious about the changes to the divine kingdom.","Lin Yuan had never interacted with the divine kingdom.","There was no question that the divine kingdom was a power that could only be unlocked after an extremely high-level breakthrough.","Lin Yuan was lucky to have it.","In his past life, Lin Yuan had been interested in biology.","Now that his divine kingdom’s environment level had been raised from Wasteland to Barren, he would be able to witness the true beginning of life once he used his blood to begin the derivation of life in the divine kingdom.","After triggering life, it would spread, change, and move in different directions.","The thought filled Lin Yuan with a mystical feeling.","He did not choose to give an order to Truth through his soul power. Instead, he willed himself onto the altar in the divine kingdom and gazed across the divine kingdom, whose environment level had been changed from Wasteland to Barren."]},{"number":2262,"title":"Chapter 2262 Intermediate Holy Spirit","paragraphs":["2262 Intermediate Holy Spirit","There were no visible differences to the divine kingdom, whose environment level had changed from a Wasteland to Barren.","However, a few small changes were enough to maintain the derivation of life.","Lin Yuan had spoken with Truth and learned that once the derivation of life began in the divine kingdom and the life cycle was formed, the traces left would raise the environment comfort level.","The derivation of life in the divine kingdom was a huge matter to Lin Yuan.","He solemnly nodded at Truth and said, “Truth, use the blood I left behind to begin the derivation of life in the divine kingdom!”","Truth was exhilarated.","Holy spirits also had different grades. Truth was only a beginner holy spirit.","A holy spirit could only evolve when it was rewarded by the ruler of the divine kingdom.","Each time the holy spirits helped the rulers to manage and develop the divine kingdom, they would be able to receive rewards.","When Truth helped Lin Yuan improve the divine kingdom’s environment comfort level from Wasteland to Barren, it had significantly improved as well.","Its body had become more solidified.","Lin Yuan had also noticed this.","Lin Yuan’s new instruction to Truth would allow the latter to improve again.","Currently, it was the only holy spirit in the divine kingdom.","But as the divine kingdom’s development progressed, the number of holy spirits in the divine kingdom would increase.","At that time, it would have to face competition from rivals.","It needed to develop more quickly to ensure that these future rivals did not beat it. That way, no matter how many holy spirits appeared in the divine kingdom, Lin Yuan would still think of it first when he had tasks to give out.","Truth’s sense of urgency caused it to become motivated and diligent even without any rivals by its side.","Lin Yuan’s blood was red, fresh, and vibrant.","The blood nourished the fountain of faith in the divine kingdom and caused the blood to be stained gold.","Truth bent over and ushered Lin Yuan’s blood out of the fountain of faith.","It knelt on the ground as though it was receiving a sacred being as Lin Yuan’s blood spread over the water in the divine kingdom.","Lin Yuan’s blood quickly flowed to every corner of the water.","An epoch of life beginning with Lin Yuan’s blood was unleashed.","Once Truth was done, it returned to Lin Yuan’s side and, as per its duty, asked Lin Yuan, “The speed of derivation can be sped up by spending faith power. When the derivation of life is about to come to a stop, the faith power can also become a guide to the right path.”","Lin Yuan had confirmed through True Data that the derivation of life in the divine kingdom had to reach around 10% before a role could be set for the divine kingdom.","It took such a long time just to change the divine kingdom’s environment comfort level. Thus, the divine kingdom’s derivation would not progress too quickly either.","If this were in the past when Lin Yuan could not obtain faith power from Apostles, he would not choose to spend the faith power even if he could obtain faith power at a decent rate.","But now, Lin Yuan had found a quick and reliable way to obtain faith power.","Given such a circumstance, time was more precious than faith power.","Lin Yuan was not only interested in the faith power being able to improve the divine kingdom but also the faith power’s ability to fix and progress the derivation.","Before Lin Yuan transmigrated, he had a great interest in biology.","The derivation of Earth had also gone through several overhauls.","For example, the Ordovician mass extinction assimilated the oceans and created the first batch of vertebrates. The Late Devonian extinction and Permian-Triassic extinctions caused the lifeforms to derivate and separate further until only the lifeforms that were most suited for survival had the strongest adaptive abilities and could coexist the best with other existing lifeforms.","The Carnian pluvial episode brought with it more than 2,000,000 years of storms and created the legend of the dinosaur era. As a result, dinosaurs were positioned as kings and species of unprecedented strength.","A descent would follow every peak. Eventually, the Cretaceous-Paleogene extinction event ended the era of the dinosaurs.","After observing the changes in eras and derivations that came with them, one might say that without them, the environment of the entire Earth might have collapsed long ago and failed to continue to progress smoothly.","Due to his understanding of biology, Lin Yuan knew that it was absolutely necessary to use his faith power to derivate and fine-tune life. It was a task that was worth him taking seriously.","As such, Lin Yuan said to Truth seriously, “For now, I will replenish the faith power in the fountain of faith. You can use all of the faith power in the fountain of faith to speed up the derivation of the divine kingdom and modify the derivation. How much more faith power do you need in order to transform into an intermediate holy spirit?”","Truth sensed Lin Yuan’s generosity and did an estimation based on the current strength of the faith power in the fountain of faith before it said honestly, “I would like to become an intermediate holy spirit. To do so, I will need around another two units of faith power after using up the faith power in the fountain of faith.","“After becoming an intermediate holy spirit, I will be able to achieve an appropriate role once the divine kingdom’s role is confirmed. With a role, I will be able to speed up the derivation of life in the divine kingdom. From then on, when you interact with other rulers of divine kingdoms, I will be able to act as your envoy and receive and greet guests.”","After hearing what Truth said, Lin Yuan nodded.","He always knew that the creation of the divine kingdom in the shrine was largely related to the spirit fire.","Begin Lady had set its spirit fire alight but had not activated a divine kingdom.","Thus, the appearance of the divine kingdom was related to a level above spirit fire. It was very likely that the next level above for experts who had set their spirit fires alight was to activate their divine kingdoms.","Other divine kingdoms were floating around within the gray fog of the divine kingdom. As long as Lin Yuan continued to develop the divine kingdom, he would have plenty of opportunities to interact with other divine kingdoms.","Lin Yuan would be able to set a role for the divine kingdom once the derivation reached 10%.","Once the divine kingdom had a role, the advantage of intermediate holy spirits over beginner holy spirits would become evident.","Only intermediate holy spirits could interact and socialize. Thus, it was necessary to evolve Truth to an intermediate holy spirit as soon as possible.","“Truth, after you use up all of the faith power within the fountain of faith, how many more units of faith power will be needed to increase the divine kingdom’s level of derivation to 10%, with the fountain of faith’s contents being used as a measure of equivalence?”"]},{"number":2263,"title":"Chapter 2263 The Swallowed Dark Gold Snake Scale!","paragraphs":["2263 The Swallowed Dark Gold Snake Scale!","Truth was momentarily at a loss about how to respond.","It was the servant of the ruler of the divine kingdom and was only in charge of carrying out tasks. It did not have the right to analyze the divine kingdom’s circumstances.","It was not until Lin Yuan asked that Truth did a detailed analysis of the divine kingdom for the first time.","Once it was done, it did not respond with certainty. “I can’t confirm how many rounds of derivation modification will take place if everything goes smoothly. At least 20 equivalent units of faith power will be needed to raise the derivation level to 10%. If things don’t go well, 50 equivalent units of faith power might even be needed.”","Truth’s response allowed Lin Yuan to understand just how much faith power was needed to modify the derivation of lifeforms.","Nonetheless, he needed to pay the price. Otherwise, the derivation of the divine kingdom might halt and start over.","This would be a waste of time and cause all of the previously invested faith power to go to waste.","However, Lin Yuan was not daunted by having to spend such a large amount of faith power.","Now that he could obtain faith power from Apostles, it would not be difficult for him to obtain 50 times the faith power that was contained in the fountain of faith.","He thought, It looks like I need to amp up my attraction of Apostles in the marsh world.","Lin Yuan had thought about nurturing more holy spirits. But to do so, he needed to kill experts who had awakened their birth horoscopes so the fountain of faith could nurture the birth horoscopes to birth new holy spirits.","Every expert in the main world who had awakened their birth horoscope had uncomparable status. There was no way that Lin Yuan could kill them with ease.","Experts who had awakened their birth horoscopes would definitely cause a war to break out.","Thus, Lin Yuan decided that he would stick with just nurturing one holy spirit for now. Since the holy spirit was the gateway to interacting with other divine kingdoms, it would be better to nurture Truth to intermediate holy spirit, then advanced holy spirit.","With that thought, Lin Yuan went on to ask Truth, “How much faith power, when measured using the fountain of faith, is needed to evolve you directly to an advanced holy spirit?”","Truth was stunned for a moment before it immediately guessed Lin Yuan’s intention.","Truth made a hand gesture of praying before it bowed and said in a voice of admiration and respect as though it was chanting, “Around 30 units of faith power will be needed for me to transform into an advanced holy spirit when measured against the amount of faith power currently in the fountain of faith.","“In that case, there is a high chance that I will be able to become an advanced holy spirit before you set a role in the divine kingdom. After becoming an advanced holy spirit, I will not only gain a role but will also become a holy general who can teach and provide intelligence to the lifeforms derived in the divine kingdom. At that time, I’ll be able to secure your faith in the divine kingdom! The divine kingdom will also be able to provide you with faith power to top up the fountain of faith.”","When he heard what Truth said, Lin Yuan was excited but also rolled his eyes.","Can’t you be optimistic?","You said that if everything went well, 20 units of faith power would be able to allow the divine kingdom’s derivation level to reach 10% and gain a role.","Rather than nurturing it into an advanced holy spirit, Lin Yuan preferred for his divine kingdom’s development to go more smoothly.","He had not expected that once Truth evolved to an advanced holy spirit and the divine kingdom’s development reached a certain level, the divine kingdom would be able to provide Lin Yuan with faith power as well.","Even if the divine kingdom could not provide him with enough faith power to satisfy the divine kingdom’s development, the divine kingdom would no longer be a bottomless well but be able to sustain the most basic extent of its development.","If ever the day came that Lin Yuan could no longer obtain faith power from the outside world, the divine kingdom could provide itself with enough faith power to be self-sustaining. This would ensure that the divine kingdom would not be destroyed.","Lin Yuan said to Truth seriously, “If so, try your best to become an advanced holy spirit before the divine kingdom is given a role!”","Truth had started guessing Lin Yuan’s intentions while he had been asking it questions.","When it heard the promise from Lin Yuan, Truth became so excited that its body started to tremble.","Once nurtured into an advanced holy spirit, Truth would never infuriate Lin Yuan as long as no abnormal incidents occurred. Its position in the divine kingdom would be more secure than ever, and it would not have to be worried about being out-competed by any new holy spirits.","A large amount of time and resources were needed to nurture a holy spirit.","Although organizing the divine kingdom was not the only way for a holy spirit to increase its power, it was the fastest way.","After Truth gratefully thanked Lin Yuan for his blessing, it went back to keeping a close watch on the derivation of life in the divine kingdom.","After Lin Yuan assessed the situation in the divine kingdom and came up with a plan, he left his divine kingdom.","It would take time for the derivation of life to take place in the divine kingdom. Lin Yuan might be able to see life in this currently lifeless divine kingdom the next time he visited the divine kingdom.","Since Lin Yuan had already handed over the job of collecting marsh soil and source totems to East Glow, he decided to stay in Marsh East Palace.","This was so he could maintain his demeanor of a Dictator and because he decided to feed the four dark gold snake scales he obtained from Celestial Sight’s Heaven’s Trial to Green Vine’s vine that had already absorbed one dark gold snake scale so he could see how it would change.","Morbius had spent a large amount of root power to obtain the four dark gold snake scales and had only woken up yesterday.","Morbius rarely said anything was precious or special. But after receiving the four dark gold snake scales, Morbius clearly said that special changes would take place once the five scales were combined.","If Morbius had not suggested Lin Yuan wait until its root power was recovered to a certain level before having Green Vine consume the four dark gold snake scales in case of any unforeseen issues, Lin Yuan would have already lost his patience and fed the four dark gold snake scales to Green Vine. There was no way that he would wait until now to act.","Although Green Vine was only Creation Breed, it had consumed one of the dark gold snake scales and could already control the flames that burned on the snake scale."]},{"number":2264,"title":"Chapter 2264 The Perfect Touch Wisteria’s Transformation!","paragraphs":["2264 The Perfect Touch Wisteria’s Transformation!","It struck fear in even experts like Begin Lady, who had set its spirit fire alight.","Once Green Vine consumed the other four dark gold snake scales, Lin Yuan would essentially gain an expert who had set its spirit fire alight.","After Lin Yuan entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone, he noticed Green Vine in human form playing tag with Gray, the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope, Brocade Zither (Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl), and the other feys that Lin Yuan was nurturing.","Chimey had been afraid of Green Vine because it had consumed the dark gold snake scale. But now that it had Lin Yuan’s aura hanging around it, Chimey was no longer afraid.","However, Chimey was currently busy with increasing its power and stayed in its nest in the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree all day, absorbing the energy from the strange flames.","Lin Yuan had left Genius in the marsh world.","Now that the army of Hundred Questions Beasts had expanded by another 300 Hundred Questions Beasts, even having the fat ginger shouldering the load for Genius still required Genius to teach the 300 entrants.","After all, the other Hundred Questions Beasts did not have Connected Tails and could not share knowledge like Genius could.","Green Vine had the appearance of a beautiful cold lady but was actually very lively and pure-minded.","Thus, Gray, who was not afraid of Green Vine, became its best playmate.","Green Vine could already manipulate its body form. Thus, even when it changed back into its original form in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, it would not be overly large and take up too much space.","Green Vine was very aware of what benefited it and what did not. Thus, it badly yearned for the four dark gold snake scales that Lin Yuan had placed on his worktable in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","But without Lin Yuan’s permission, despite Green Vine clearly being able to sense the benefits that the four dark gold snake scales could bring it, it would not touch them.","Lin Yuan watched Gray in cloud form playing with Green Vine and suddenly felt that he needed to have Green Vine by his side when he traveled through the marsh world.","Firstly, Green Vine was an icon of his power, and secondly, Green Vine’s mentality needed to mature.","With this thought, Lin Yuan waved at Green Vine.","When Green Vine saw Lin Yuan calling it, it skipped over to Lin Yuan and said in a tone that resembled that of a rapper, “Yo! Yuan! Did you miss me? I want to go out and play! I don’t want to stay in the Spirit Lock spatial zone forever!”","When he heard Green Vine’s strange voice, Lin Yuan felt that he needed to tell it to speak as little as possible in the outside world.","But after some more thought, Lin Yuan decided against this.","Although Green Vine had reached Creation Breed, it was not just a fey that Lin Yuan had contracted and nurtured. He also saw it as one of his children.","It was not right for a parent to suppress a child’s natural personality.","Lin Yuan decided to allow Green Vine to be itself freely.","Green Vine was already filled with joy when it heard Lin Yuan say that he was going to let it out to play. It did not expect that there would even be another blessing that followed.","Lin Yuan had truly left the dark gold snake scale to it!","With this thought, Green Vine first rushed over to give Lin Yuan a hug.","Green Vine was almost two meters tall.","Although it looked more human-like now that it had changed into human form, it was still much taller than regular humans.","The two-meter-tall Green Vine’s height only elevated its queenly aura. It also added charm to Green Vine’s figure.","The difference of 20 centimeters in their heights caused Lin Yuan’s face to be completely covered when Green Vine hugged him.","Green Vine did not feel any strangeness about its actions.","It only released Lin Yuan after hugging him for 20 seconds.","Lin Yuan’s thoughts had never veered off course, but that did not mean he was unaware.","In his previous life, he had been chased by girls. But in this second life, this was the first time that he was experiencing such a thing.","Lin Yuan coughed forcefully, saying, “Change back into your original form! Let me know if there are any issues while you’re absorbing the four snake scales! Don’t force yourself!”","With Green Vine’s big personality, it completely had not noticed that Lin Yuan’s face had turned slightly red.","Green Vine changed back into its fey form without much thought.","It morphed itself smaller than its true size. Nonetheless, it was filled with strength, especially the vine that had absorbed the dark gold snake scale.","The vine resembling a snake had already slithered to the worktable where the four dark gold snake scales were laid out.","Lin Yuan thought that Green Vine would carefully absorb items of such level one by one.","Yet, Green Vine used Swallow Same Source to pull all of the four scales into the vine and absorbed them at once.","Although Green Vine’s personality was unusual, it was not stupid.","All feys had the basic instinct to avoid harm.","Since Green Vine had chosen to swallow the four snake scales simultaneously, it must have done an assessment and decided that doing so at once would not cause it any harm.","When Green Vine pulled the four dark gold snake scales into its vine, the fire burning on Green Vine started burning even more intensely.","While the flames burned, each ember turned into the shape of a snake. The thousands of burning snakes intertwined, creating a terrifying scene.","Green Vine’s vine, which used to be covered with scales, became more lifelike as the burning snakes continued to dance.","The tightly stacked scales gently bloomed and slowly turned a royal dark gold, and a lifelike snake pattern appeared on the tip of each scale.","Lin Yuan observed and confirmed that the structure of the snake scales was still woody fibers.","Every wooden fiber was similar to the five dark gold snake scales.","Besides the change in Green Vine’s vine’s surface, a bigger change took place to its anterior."]},{"number":2265,"title":"Chapter 2265 Tongue Formed From Snake Scales!","paragraphs":["2265 Tongue Formed From Snake Scales!","At first, the anterior of Green Vine’s vine formed a triangular shape. However, it had now transformed into a lifelike snake head, complete with a prominent bump. Upon closer inspection, one could see a golden horn protruding from the skin.","Lin Yuan thought, Perhaps, the horn might grow longer if I obtain more of the dark gold snake scales and feed them to this vine.","Just as Lin Yuan thought that Green Vine’s changes due to the absorption of the four dark gold snake scales were coming to an end, Green Vine started to shake violently as though something was trying to break out from within it.","Lin Yuan immediately became anxious.","It was only because he was able to sense through their spiritual connection that Green Vine was fine and that Green Vine still appeared to be perfectly happy that some of Lin Yuan’s worry was alleviated.","Suddenly, the sound of gold and stone grinding against each other was let out from the mouth of the snake head on the vine’s anterior.","Soon, Lin Yuan saw the five snake scales join together to become a tongue that stuck out from the snake head’s mouth.","The swaying snake tongue was burning with fervent flames, and the dark gold flames were so intense that they turned a pure black.","The black flames were full of the aura of annihilation.","When the tongue composed of the five dark gold snake scales flicked out of Green Vine’s anterior, Green Vine’s shaking became less intense, and its evolution approached its end.","Green Vine used Swallow Same Source to consume the four dark gold snake scales and had undergone another monumental change.","Green Vine maintained its original appearance when it only absorbed one dark gold snake scale.","But now, its vine looked no different from a real snake.","Green Vine could comfortably spit out the five dark gold snake scales.","After the five dark gold snake scales caused Green Vine to transform, they became its strongest weapons.","Lin Yuan casually fed 100 spirit qi crystals to Green Vine to help it to replenish the spiritual power it had used up when it was absorbing the four dark gold snake scales.","When Green Vine changed into human form, Lin Yuan realized with a shock that the exterior of Green Vine in human form had changed drastically.","Green Vine’s entire aura had changed from that of a charming lady to that of a pure and beautiful queen.","Every one of its smiles was filled with evil, seductiveness, and scorn. With this appearance, Green Vine was even more terrifying.","As it followed Lin Yuan around in the outside world, its present but also absent aura of annihilation would be enough to strike terror in a powerful Dictator.","Through his interaction with East Glow, Lin Yuan guessed that there would be other Dictators attending the Banquet of Everything.","Lin Yuan did not just release the news of the small source fruits to attract Apostles but also tempt Dictators.","Rather than trying to obtain deals from Apostles, Lin Yuan would definitely be able to obtain more from Dictators.","In the past, Lin Yuan had no idea how he would maintain his facade as a Dictator in front of other Dictators. But now, a way had opened up for him.","...","There were many veteran Apostles from Marsh East Palace who had asked to see Lin Yuan in the past few days.","Regardless of how these veteran Apostles felt about Lin Yuan, and no matter how much they did not welcome him to remain in Marsh East Palace for long, they still needed to put on the appropriate attitude.","If an Apostle was rude to a Dictator, it would have no choice but to die there and then. In the marsh world, Dictators did not need any reason to take the lives of Apostles.","But after accepting East Glow as a follower, Lin Yuan refused to see the other Apostles from Marsh East Palace.","East Glow ran to where Lin Yuan resided thrice a day. The veteran Apostles were strong-headed and argumentative when they faced Second Born and Third Born as they had been unwilling to give access to the space between the main hall and sacrificial lane to hold the Banquet of Everything.","But when a Dictator decided to reside there, all of them had shut their mouths and dared not protest in the slightest.","Dictator Ten Thousand Source had already moved in. There was no way that they could chase out a Dictator for the sake of their pride. Apart from them, not even the entire Marsh East Circle had the pride to compete with a Dictator.","East Glow’s main reason for coming to see Lin Yuan was to report news and provide information, as well as receive the marsh soil and source totems that it had collected for him.","As the leader of the veteran Apostles from Marsh East Palace, East Glow wielded significant authority. All it needed to do was let the other veteran Apostles know, and it would be able to collect all of the marsh soil from the Marsh East Palace’s treasure vault.","The other veteran Apostles were all curious about this as they did not understand why East Glow needed such a large amount of marsh soil.","It not only needed high- and top-grade marsh soil but even low- and mid-grade marsh soil.","East Glow knew that pure source-type power was the most precious of all the resources it needed.","Since marsh soil and source totems would allow Lin Yuan to trade for pure source-type power, East Glow used all of the resources it had accumulated over the years to trade for all of the marsh soil that the other Apostles from Marsh East Palace had.","All of them had done as East Glow asked.","Although East Glow was already following Dictator Ten Thousand Source, the veteran Apostles would still be following East Glow’s lead in representing Marsh East Palace to interact with the Palace of Everything.","If East Glow decided to leave, the burden of the job would fall on their shoulders. Thus, the Apostles had all set their prices very low when they traded for resources with East Glow. East Glow did not take long to collect all of the marsh soil from these Apostles.","Alas, it was not as easy to collect source totems. East Glow could not trade for them from the other Apostles like he did with the marsh soil. It also could not take possession of all the source totems in the Marsh East Palace’s treasure vault.","The other Apostles could ignore resources of the marsh soil’s level, but it would definitely attract questions if it started gathering source totems.","As such, East Glow started to think.","All of a sudden, it came up with an idea.","When East Glow spoke with Lin Yuan, it noticed that Lin Yuan did not discriminate against having an old Apostle like it as a follower.","Not all of the veteran Apostles in Marsh East Palaces were complacent and rotting internally—a small portion of them was just like East Glow and wanted to follow Dictators."]},{"number":2266,"title":"Chapter 2266 Return to Ruins’ Goal!","paragraphs":["2266 Return to Ruins’ Goal!","There were also many who approached East Glow in the hopes of convincing it to link them up.","Benefits definitely needed to be offered in order to set up an intentional connection, especially when this matter involved or not they could become followers of a Dictator.","The Apostles had all made numerous promises to East Glow. They promised that if they could ever become Dictator Ten Thousand Source’s followers, they would definitely continue to respect East Glow and stand by it.","East Glow felt that these were acceptable.","It had already spent the majority of its resources buying up the marsh soil. Although the marsh soil was not expensive, and East Glow could easily trade for a large amount of them, it had gathered an overwhelming quantity.","East Glow felt that it could borrow resources from these Apostles who wanted to follow Lin Yuan to trade for as many source totems as possible.","Lin Yuan’s rewards consisted of small and big source fruits.","East Glow was unsure if it would allow resources like the big and small source fruits to reach unloyal Apostles. Thus, East Glow dared not make promises involving the big source fruits and small source fruits.","However, if these Apostles managed to become Lin Yuan’s followers, such decisions would be out of East Glow’s hands.","As such, East Glow could let the related information go out.","The veteran Apostles had lived for thousands of years and were all old foxes. Thus, they could understand East Glow’s intention to keep secrets.","Everything was going very smoothly.","For a brighter future, the veteran Apostles who had enjoyed comfort were willing to sacrifice everything they had.","East Glow not only traded for resources with these Apostles who wanted to follow Lin Yuan but had also held an internal meeting of Marsh East Palace.","East Glow led the meeting and exerted pressure on the other Apostles to successfully trade for all of the source totems in the treasure vaults for low prices.","East Glow did not hide what it was doing from Lin Yuan and revealed all of its recent achievements.","This was because it would be a very good way to show that it was competent.","Lin Yuan was very excited as he listened to East Glow’s reports and secretly gave East Glow a large reward.","However, his expression did not change as he continued to calmly listen to East Glow’s report on its achievements of late.","When East Glow finished speaking, it peeked up at Lin Yuan’s face.","At that moment, East Glow felt a warm strength flow into its body as its body rapidly came alive.","All of the hidden injuries in its body slowly started to heal, while this strength unlocked its body’s potential.","As a reward, Lin Yuan had gifted East Glow 100 units of pure source-type power.","This was to reward East Glow for the big help it had provided him but also because Lin Yuan intended to properly nurture East Glow.","East Glow was only one step away from reaching Dictator. Out of all of Lin Yuan’s followers, East Glow had the potential to become a Dictator the fastest.","If he could nurture a Dictator in the marsh world, many things would become much easier to manage.","Lin Yuan, although not a genuine Dictator himself, had the ability to convince dimensional lifeforms that he was one, thanks to Dark Blue.","With Dark Blue’s power, Lin Yuan could enhance the abilities of White Speak, and he could do the same for East Glow.","Once East Glow achieved the breakthrough to Dictator level and received the boost from Lin Yuan, he would become another formidable expert with Eternal power under Lin Yuan’s command.","Compared to the Eternal weapons that Red Thorn controlled through its Tongue of Relinquish, East Glow was a living and breathing expert who could accomplish many tasks with more convenience. Thus, it could better protect Lin Yuan’s territory.","“You’ve done well and met my expectations. This is my reward to you,” said Lin Yuan.","East Glow bowed to Lin Yuan to express its respect and gratitude as it began to carefully use the 100 units of source-type power to evolve itself.","In the past, White Speak would surely start to panic when it saw Lin Yuan paying so much attention to East Glow.","But after its long talk with Lin Yuan—when Lin Yuan told White Speak about his hopes for it—all of White Speak’s worries were set at ease.","No matter how strong East Glow was, it was still only White Speak’s assistant.","White Speak had never wanted to grow as badly as it did now.","In the past, White Speak only wanted to increase its power. But now, it also wanted to learn.","Once East Glow was done absorbing the pure source-type power, it remembered its main reason for coming and hurriedly said, “Lord Dictator, there is accurate information saying that Dictator Return to Ruins is headed for the Marsh East Circle to attend the Banquet of Everything.","“We’re not the ones who found out about this information. Many Apostles headed for the Marsh East Circle know about it. So, I think that Dictator Return to Ruins was the one who released the news of his attendance himself.”","Lin Yuan narrowed his eyes when he heard what East Glow said, and he balled up his fist.","White Speak had almost died at Prayer Glow’s hands. If Lin Yuan had not sent Begin Lady over in time, White Speak would have stopped breathing long ago.","It was likely that if that had happened, White Speak’s source totem would have been traded by Prayer Glow at the Banquet of Everything.","Prayer Glow had acted under Dictator Return to Ruins’ name. Hence, White Speak could not help but be affected by the mention of Dictator Return to Ruins’ name.","It went without saying that Lin Yuan was also aware of this. Hence, he not only had no positive feelings toward Dictator Return to Ruins, but he even labeled Dictator Return to Ruins as an enemy.","If a Dictator wanted to hide their tracks, there was no way that an Apostle would be able to find them. If a Dictator’s movements were known, it could only be because they had released the information themselves.","It was just like how Lin Yuan had done so much to get the word out about being a Dictator.","It was apparent that Dictator Return to Ruins was not coming to attend the Banquet of Everything just to trade for resources. He had to have another goal.","Although Lin Yuan had intentionally spread the word about the small and big source fruits, there was no way that the news would spread so quickly as to already have reached Dictator Return to Ruins, who was located in the Marsh West Circle.","Hence, there was no way that Dictator Return to Ruins was coming because of Lin Yuan.","There could only be one possible Dictator who attracted the attendance of another Dictator.","It seemed that Dictator Return to Ruins had set his sights on Dictator Everything."]},{"number":2267,"title":"Chapter 2267 Dictator Pregnant Poison","paragraphs":["2267 Dictator Pregnant Poison","Lin Yuan thought, I expected that the Banquet of Everything would not go smoothly, but I didn’t expect the storm to be stirred up by someone other than me.","Dictator Everything had to be hiding a special secret as well.","“I know. Alert me immediately if any Dictators appear before the Banquet of Everything begins.”","East Glow hurriedly nodded.","Frankly, it was rather nervous and anxious about the arrival of so many Dictators at Marsh East Palace.","Luckily, it had already become Lin Yuan’s follower. Thus, no matter what happened, it could fall back on Lin Yuan’s support and would not have to worry about handling everything on its own.","As the head Apostle of Marsh East Palace, it would have to receive all of these Dictators.","At that time, East Glow would definitely be able to obtain fresh information.","...","In a marsh that seemed to stretch on endlessly, a figure was floating amongst the black fluids.","This figure was holding an Apostle who had lost all aura of life.","The crimson light flashing amongst the black fluid turned into dark red worms that tunneled into the body of the dead Apostles, scooping the corpse out clean while extracting its memory.","A mocking peal of laughter echoed from the figure ensconced in a black fluid.","“The Marsh East Circle is becoming increasingly backward. I can’t believe the Apostles dared to call themselves kings of Marsh East Palace! It’s ludicrous! Hmm, it might not be a bad decision for me to stay in the Marsh East Circle. All those Apostles will have no choice but to listen to me or become my fertilizer!”","Suddenly, the figure enveloped in black fluid frowned. It was as though there was something of interest in this dead Apostle’s memories.","“Ten Thousand Source isn’t one of the seven from Marsh Abyss. Besides the fact that the word ‘source’ is included, it’s even the last word! This is clearly a provocation toward those seven figures!”","The figure was suspended in midair as though it was hesitating.","Since the figure had stopped abruptly, half of its body emerged from the black fluid.","The female body was dressed in a dark red lace dress which exuded seductive charm.","The black fluid hung off her long red hair. The mix of red and black made her hair appear even more beautiful.","The girl looked gentle and attractive, but the glint of light in her eyes and the angle of her upturned lips made it clear that she was a ruthless being who had no regard for life.","Using the word ‘source’ in a name was already very unusual. Any Apostle who had interacted with a Dictator before knew of this.","However, in order to show respect to the seven figures and separate themselves from them, the Dictators who included the word ‘source’ in their names all put the word ‘source’ at the front of their names. Examples included ‘Source Sea’ and ‘Source Bite’.","Thousands of years ago, even the Dictators who dared to add the word ‘source’ to their names would never be so audacious as to put the word at the back.","Just where did Dictator Ten Thousand Source come from? Was he tired of living?","Dictator Pregnant Poison had only caught one Apostle on her journey.","The Apostle had come from the direction of the Marsh East Circle. For news to have reached this Apostle, it meant that news of Dictator Ten Thousand Source arriving at the Banquet of Everything had already spread throughout the Marsh East Circle.","This matter would eventually reach the seven figures in Marsh Abyss.","Dictator Pregnant Poison could not be certain about anyone else, but Dictator Evil Source, to whom she was loyal, would definitely pursue this brazen fellow.","She was secretly heading to the Banquet of Everything because of Dictator Everything, who had just entered the Turning Wheel Realm.","She would immediately be dragged into the mess if she appeared at the Banquet of Everything. This would not be beneficial to her in the least.","Dictator Return to Ruins and Dictator Ten Thousand Source were so ostentatious.","With Dictator Everything added to the mix, one could only guess how many Dictators were going to be attracted to attend the Banquet of Everything.","With this thought, Dictator Pregnant Poison clenched her jaw.","“My sister, now that you’ve entered the Turning Wheel Realm, why don’t you be a good girl and let me harvest you? Why did you have to go and attract so many mad characters?","Although Pregnant Poison was hesitant, her body was honest.","This was because wealth could only be achieved through risk.","Furthermore, after extracting this Apostle’s memory, Pregnant Poison learned that Dictator Ten Thousand Source possessed a fruit called the small source fruit.","There could only be two possibilities for there being pure source-type power in the small source fruits.","The first possibility was that Dictator Ten Thousand Source’s true body was a carnivorous plant and produced the small source fruits himself.","But if that was the case, Dictator Ten Thousand Source would not have given the small source fruits to Apostles as rewards.","Dictator Pregnant Poison knew many Dictators who had transformed from carnivorous plants. All of them treasured their fruits greatly. This was the case even if their fruits did not come with any sought-after effects and only tasted pleasant.","The other and most likely possibility was that Dictator Ten Thousand Source possessed a special carnivorous plant that could produce the small source fruits. It even produced the fruits in a sufficient quantity that allowed Dictator Ten Thousand Source to give them away casually.","No Dictator would appear out of nowhere. This was because, during their growth, they would certainly catch the attention of many as well as gain many followers.","When it came to a Dictator like Dictator Ten Thousand Source, who had appeared out of nowhere, it was likely that he had seized an opportunity and had been holed up somewhere, increasing his power.","The small source fruits contained pure source-type power. After thousands of years, they were sure to cultivate a powerful Dictator.","With this thought, Dictator Pregnant Poison became even more filled with enthusiasm.","At that moment, her ideal prey was no longer Dictator Everything but the carnivorous plant that could produce the small source fruits!","Dictator Pregnant Poison was slightly hesitant about whether she should report to Dictator Evil Source about Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","If she did report the matter to Dictator Evil Source, she would be handsomely rewarded.","Dictator Evil Source was never stingy with subordinates who could bring profits.","Dictator Evil Source had entered the Samsara Realm. If he attended the Banquet of Everything, Pregnant Poison would have no hope of harvesting Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","She was a Dictator. Due to the special nature and uniqueness of Dictators, there was no way that Dictator Evil Source would ever truly trust her and see her as a close confidant.","Given the circumstances, it would be better to take the gamble of harvesting Dictator Ten Thousand Source rather than obtaining a reward from Dictator Evil Source."]},{"number":2268,"title":"Chapter 2268 Demon Desire, Tyrant Lizard, Treasure Seeker!","paragraphs":["2268 Demon Desire, Tyrant Lizard, Treasure Seeker!","Since Dictator Pregnant Poison was headed to the Banquet of Everything in secret, it would be best if she could remain in the shadows while Dictator Return to Ruins and Dictator Ten Thousand Source tore it up.","She had made Dictator Return to Ruins’ acquaintance in the past. He was dominant and courageous, killing other Dictators soon after becoming one himself.","From the moment she found out that Dictator Everything Return to Ruins was going to attend the Banquet of Everything, Dictator Pregnant Poison saw him as her rival for stealing away Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","If her rival started fighting with her target, many more opportunities would open up for her as she remained in the shadows.","For Dictator Ten Thousand Source to include the word ‘source’ in his name, he had to possess considerable power.","If Dictator Return to Ruins used the source totems of Dictators, he could definitely cause considerable harm to Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","Given her power, even if she had been injured by a pinnacle Turning Wheel Realm Dictator, she could inject her poison into them, and they would fall under her control.","Dictator Pregnant Poison had always been confident in her abilities. Hence, she decided that she would continue heading toward Marsh East Palace.","Suddenly, she sensed an aura in the distance and froze before retreating silently back into the marsh.","Waves gently rolled across the surface of the water and did not even catch the attention of the Marsh Crocodiles in the distance, which were tearing the corpse of their previous companion apart.","In the distance, figures appeared on a large boat made of bones.","There were four giants in the water, each with eight tentacles, who were pulling the giant boat made of bones through the water.","The top of the boat was crawling with purplish-brown moss.","There were a few male Apostles who were not covered with many clothes kneeling on the deck.","Occasionally, strange sounds could be heard from within the boat.","After the four giants pulled the boat away, the black fluid gathered once again in midair.","As the red light flashed, Dictator Pregnant Poison’s figure reappeared in the black fluid.","“Dictator Demon Desire, that despicable woman! She actually came all the way to the Marsh East Circle from the Marsh North Circle! She must either be here because of Dictator Everything or to find the rumored treasure in the Marsh East Circle.","“My lovely sister Dictator Everything, you’re usually so radiant. But now that you’ve entered the Turning Wheel Realm, things are going to turn tough! You might be able to hide from Dictator Return to Ruins and me, but you won’t be able to escape Dictator Demon Desire’s inspection.","“Dictator Demon Desire is riding on her Love Bone Spring Grace Boat and even brought her four pinnacle Marsh Lake Giant Octopi. She’s definitely planning on making big moves!","“Now that Dictator Demon Desire has shown herself, her two lovesick puppies, Dictator Tyrant Lizard and Treasure Seeker, won’t be far behind. It looks like the Banquet of Everything will be much more exciting than I envisioned.”","A scheming expression appeared on Dictator Pregnant Poison’s face.","Dictator Return to Ruins might not be able to pose a threat to Dictator Ten Thousand Source, but with Dictators Demon Desire, Treasure Seeker, and Tyrant Lizard joining the party, the four Dictators would certainly be able to cause significant trouble for Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","If the four Dictators joined forces but were still unable to give Dictator Ten Thousand Source a headache, it would be better for her to give up on targeting Dictator Ten Thousand Source as soon as possible!","It was rumored that Dictator Treasure Seeker had reached pinnacle Turning Wheel Realm 500 years ago and was only a step away from reaching the Samsara Realm.","Dictator Treasure Seeker had always been hard at work gathering treasures and possessed at least five Dictator source totems.","Even Lord Evil Source did not want to get into a conflict with someone of Dictator Treasure Seeker’s power unless it was absolutely necessary.","If Dictator Treasure Seeker’s power advanced just one more step further, his palace would soon pop up in the center of Marsh Abyss.","Nonetheless, Dictator Treasure Seeker still did not have the right to include the word ‘source’ at the back of its name.","She had noticed Dictator Demon Desire on her journey but had not heard any news before this that Dictator Demon Desire would be heading to Marsh East Palace to attend the Banquet of Everything.","One could only imagine how many Dictators were silently heading to Marsh East Palace, like Dictator Demon Desire.","Dictator Pregnant Poison felt that even if she did not manage to harvest Dictator Ten Thousand Source, she would at least be able to harvest other Dictators. As long as she could harvest other Dictators, this trip to Marsh East Palace would not be a wasted one.","After ensuring that Dictator Demon Desire’s Love Bone Spring Grace Boat was long gone, the black fluid continued speeding toward Marsh East Palace.","The Banquet of Everything was being prepared under the eyes of the masses.","only helped First Born occasionally.","21:07","At first, First Born had locked her suspicions onto Second Born.","Once First Born arrived at Marsh East Palace, she immediately put on the charisma of a leader and managed everything perfectly.","As more Dictators arrived, she needed to ensure that the preparations were grander and that nothing went wrong so as not to damage Lordess Everything’s reputation.","Second Born could tell that danger was present and that showing herself would not be wise. Thus, she pulled back all of her schemes and went back to spending her days in seclusion.","Second Born had acted the same way during previous events such as the Banquet of Everything. She only helped First Born occasionally.","At first, First Born had locked her suspicions onto Second Born.","But First Born could not detect anything about Second Born’s behavior. It was normal for Second Born to spend most of her time in seclusion.","Rather, it was Third Born who became strange of late and caused Second Born to become slightly guarded against her.","First Born sighed.","If Second Born truly caused Lordess Everything to feel endangered and pressed to hide, the three sisters could no longer continue remaining together in the future.","Third Born had always had the personality of a child.","After that incident, she should have matured.","Every person in the Palace of Everything was responsible and performed their necessary duties.","As troubled as Third Born was, she continued to help First Born.","As she looked at the Apostles who had recently joined the Palace of Everything, Third Born said solemnly, “None of you have previous experience putting on a Banquet of Everything. There are many things that I can’t trust you to do on your own.","“Luckily, we have enough manpower now. All of you can each shadow an experienced worker. Observe and ask as much as you can so that you’ll be able to provide real help during the next Banquet of Everything!”","Once she was done speaking, Third Born went back to supervising.","Third Born was less competent than First Born at everything else besides supervision. She would immediately notice if anyone made a mistake during the setup.","Third Born already spotted several errors and was anxious to start with.","Thus, all of it culminated in her losing her temper, and the Apostles from the Palace of Everything were all scared and breathless. All of them were terrified of Third Born spotting their mistakes.","After Third Born left, the Apostles who had recently joined the Palace of Everything or had only been here for a few decades could not help but grumble, “It’s not like setting up an event is difficult. What’s there that can’t be done by us? Why do we need to learn from experienced workers?”"]},{"number":2269,"title":"Chapter 2269 Dictator Everything Found!","paragraphs":["2269 Dictator Everything Found!","After the Apostle complained, it soon received chimes of agreement from the other Apostles.","“Exactly! If we’re allowed to help, the event’s setup would already be almost finished! Forget it. Let’s stop complaining. Let’s go and learn! If Sister Third Born finds out that we haven’t been learning, we’ll be scolded again! I’m sure no one really wants to be reprimanded by her!”","While the Apostles were complaining and interacting, a petite figure was watching all of this unfold from the sidelines.","This figure’s young face was also extremely dignified and composed.","If anyone saw this petite Apostle’s face at that moment, they would notice that her aura was even more impressive than that of Third Born.","The petite figure did not speak.","While the other Apostles left to seek out other Apostles from the Palace of Everything who had been part of the Palace of Everything for some time so they could learn from them, this figure silently blended into the crowd.","Lin Yuan had spent too much time in the main hall and wanted to go out for some air.","Lin Yuan could not walk around with Dictator Ten Thousand Source’s identity but could disguise himself with the Faceless Paper, so he appeared like any other Apostle.","As for his identity, he could as East Glow to casually set one up for him. An identity arranged by East Glow would give him the right to walk around freely, and he would have reasonable cause regardless of what he did.","White Speak wanted to follow Lin Yuan, but the latter declined. Since he could not walk around with his Dictator Ten Thousand Source identity, it would be better for White Speak to remain in Marsh East Palace.","The Faceless Paper could not change its wearer’s height.","He and the two-meter-tall White Speak would definitely attract attention as they walked about.","Lin Yuan decided not to browse the advance trading event that took place between the Apostles before the Banquet of Everything.","East Glow had already helped him to obtain all that he needed.","He was not interested in the spiritual ingredients that came from the bodies of dimensional lifeforms and Apostles.","Lin Yuan decided to go and take a look at how the preparations for the Banquet of Everything were coming along.","Although under Second Born’s request, the Palace of Everything had taken over the right to hold the Banquet of Everything from Marsh East Palace, First Born had still gone to see East Glow and asked for some manpower.","East Glow did not know why a faction with a Dictator at the helm was flip-flopping so much.","But since First Born had spoken, East Glow did not reject her.","Marsh East Palace did not have any Dictators, but there were plenty of regular Apostles.","In the past, East Glow would only have agreed in order to maintain a good relationship with the Palace of Everything.","But now, East Glow had agreed under the condition that First Born provided marsh soil.","First Born thought that East Glow had gone mad. After all, it was being called a king in a marsh circle without a Dictator. It was actually interested in something like marsh soil and looked extremely greedy for it as well!","The longer First Born looked, the more she felt that she was about to develop a sty.","East Glow sensed First Born’s attitude toward it but did not care in the slightest. It was doing so in order to accomplish the task Lin Yuan had given it.","The more marsh soil it collected, the more pure source-type power it would obtain.","What did others know?","Since Marsh East Palace had sent so many workers to help with the Banquet of Everything, Lin Yuan did not stand out at all when he was there.","With Begin Lady and Celestial Sight by his side, Lin Yuan did not have to worry about encountering any danger.","Lin Yuan casually used True Data to check on all the Apostles and dimensional lifeforms he encountered.","As the rows of data appeared in front of him, he made notes of each of the Apostles’ talents and skills.","Lin Yuan noticed that there were as many types of Apostles as there were feys.","Although there were differences between the faith power of the Apostles, the strong and weak could easily be discerned based on how their abilities countered each other.","As he walked around, Lin Yuan noticed that there was an Apostle following each of the Apostles who were setting up. The Apostle at the front would speak in a lofty manner while the one at the back would nod continuously. It was a very similar sight to the one from Lin Yuan’s previous life, where experienced employees would lead the rookies around.","It was clear that these Apostles were from the Palace of Everything.","Lin Yuan noticed that the Apostles from the Palace of Everything were much stronger than those from Marsh East Palace.","After all, one was a faction that had a Dictator. Thus, there was a difference between their capabilities.","Suddenly, Lin Yuan’s footsteps halted.","This was because he noticed that he drew a blank when he used True Data on the figure in front of him.","There could only be one possibility for such an occurrence: this person pretending to be an Apostles was actually a Dictator at least.","Lin Yuan’s lips curved into a small smile.","In one of its reports, East Glow had told Lin Yuan that Dictator Everything had entered the Turning Wheel Realm.","Dictator Everything had yet to show herself, and her three close subordinates were handling everything about the Banquet of Everything. Hence, there was a high chance that this news would turn out to be true.","There was no way that a regular Dictator would pretend to be an Apostle because it would have to devolve its life rank. In the eyes of the marsh world, this would be seen as degrading oneself.","The Dictator had to have a reason for doing so.","When he thought about Second Born, who had become a Dictator, a thought struck Lin Yuan.","Once a Dictator entered the Turning Wheel Realm, there would be a long period when they would be unable to protect themselves.","An Apostle would be willing to safeguard such a Dictator, but to other Dictators, a Dictator who had just entered the Turning Wheel Realm was like a cake that anyone could cut into. Thus, there was a high possibility that this petite Apostle was Dictator Everything.","It was said that Dictator Everything was female. It must be hard on Dictator Everything to pretend to be a male Apostle.","Lin Yuan was about to question this Apostle he suspected to be Dictator Everything and took a step forward towards the petite Apostle as he said, “Come and help me! We need another person’s help setting up here.”","The petite figure clearly froze when it heard what Lin Yuan said.","Soon, it cautiously raised its head and rested its gaze on Lin Yuan.","It quickly hid this act of cautiousness, but Lin Yuan still caught on to it."]},{"number":2270,"title":"Chapter 2270 True Appearance!","paragraphs":["2270 True Appearance!","There was much to do when it came to setting up the event, so it was common for the manpower to be shuffled around.","When the Apostle before the petite figure saw someone from Marsh East Palace coming over to ask for help, it said, “Cleansing Rain, go and help! I can teach you the rest when you get back.”","The Apostle named Cleansing Rain was about to come up with a reason to turn Lin Yuan down when it was trapped by that one statement and could no longer do anything to turn Lin Yuan down.","It said to Lin Yuan, “Let’s go. I still have things to learn here. I hope I can finish helping you as soon as possible!”","Lin Yuan smiled silently and turned to lead the way.","After walking for a few minutes, the petite figure noticed that there were fewer and fewer lifeforms around. They had slowly left the space where the Banquet of Everything was being set up.","The petite figure halted its steps.","Lin Yuan turned to see a hostile expression on the petite figure’s face and said with a smile, “Dictator Everything sure is interesting. To think that you even gave yourself the name Cleansing Rain!”","Lin Yuan could clearly see that this petite figure’s expression had changed significantly. It now looked like a cat whose fur was standing on end.","It was in a state of incredulity but also helplessness.","A Dictator who had just entered the Turning Wheel Realm was even weaker than a regular Apostle.","Dictator Everything dared not lay a hand on Lin Yuan.","This was because she knew that she would not be able to beat him and because doing so would definitely end up exposing her identity.","Once her identity was exposed, there was no way she would be able to escape Second Born’s evil intentions.","Moreover, this Apostle with average looks was strange as well. She could not look into his power at all!","Since he did not immediately attack her but exposed her identity instead, it meant that he did not want to take her life.","Dictator Everything could be certain that she could not sense even a trace of a killer’s aura from this person.","Thus, Dictator Everything had no choice but to silently admit to what Lin Yuan said.","“No matter how interesting I am, I’m still less spirited than you. A Dictator who has entered the Samsara Realm is actually pretending to be an Apostle and is involved in something as trivial as the Banquet of Everything. I’m sure you’re after more than just seeking me out! I heard that Dictator Ten Thousand Source arrived at the Marsh East Palace a few days ago. You must be him!”","When one was speaking to an intelligent person, there was no need to expend too much effort or words.","After Lin Yuan revealed Dictator Everything’s identity, the latter stopped trying to hide her identity. This was because it would be futile.","Dictator Everything had spoken calmly but was actually testing him as she could not sense even a hint of his aura.","As far as Dictator Everything could tell, Lin Yuan was a regular person.","Under such circumstances, Dictator Everything started to guess.","Lin Yuan had to be much more powerful than she was for her to be completely unable to sense his power.","Dictator Everything had only just entered the Turning Wheel Realm and had not expected Second Born to suddenly break through to Dictator.","There was a high possibility that Second Born, who had suddenly broken through to Dictator, would start to target Dictator Everything. This also went for Dictator Return to Ruins, who had yet to enter the Turning Wheel Realm.","But if her guess was right, standing before her was a Dictator who had entered the Samsara Realm.","This meant that she was clearly unworthy.","Only a Dictator who had entered the Samsara Realm would dare to call himself ‘Ten Thousand Source’.","Lin Yuan pointed forward. “Let’s go. Why don’t we go into the Marsh East Palace’s main hall to speak? You are a Dictator who has entered the Turning Wheel Realm. There’s no need to put on such a sorry display.”","Dictator Everything froze when she received Lin Yuan’s invitation but could read between the lines of what he said.","By saying that there was no need for her to put on such a sorry display, did that mean that he intended to help her?","If that were the case, there would be no need for her to continue hiding.","However, this was just her guess.","If Dictator Ten Thousand Source truly helped her and solved her issues, what could she give him in return?","What Lin Yuan needed the most now was information on Dictators.","East Glow mostly only knew information pertaining to Apostles. Thus, it could not provide Lin Yuan with too much information.","Lin Yuan had not approached Second Born because he felt that it would not know much more about Dictators than East Glow did having only recently become one.","Only a veteran Dictator like Dictator Everything could help him properly.","If Dictator Everything could truly help him, Lin Yuan did not mind giving her a leg up.","There was no way he would be able to develop in the marsh world on his own, so Dictator Everything would be a good choice of ally.","However, allies also needed to be ordered.","If Dictator Everything was intelligent, she would definitely know what to do.","From what Dictator Everything said, Lin Yuan found out for the first time that the level above Turning Wheel Realm was Samsara Realm.","Celestial Sight, who had unlocked its birth horoscope, had comparable power to a Turning Wheel Realm Dictator, while Begin Lady, who had set its spirit fire alight, was comparable to a Samsara Realm Dictator.","Thus, Lin Yuan did not feel guilty at all about being mistaken for a Samsara Realm Dictator.","Lin Yuan walked in front while Dictator Everything followed behind him.","While they were walking to the main hall, Dictator Everything tore apart her disguise.","A strange dark blue leather covering appeared in Dictator Everything’s hand.","She had long white hair with wisps of silver that cascaded down to her bare feet and was braided exquisitely. There were silver bells tied to the braid that rang softly as Dictator Everything walked.","Once they reached the main hall, there was no one from the Palace of Everything around so Dictator Everything no longer had anything to worry about.","When one faced a stronger Dictator with one’s true appearance, one would be able to express one’s respect for the stronger Dictator.","When Lin Yuan heard the twinkling bells, he turned to look at Dictator Everything.","The sight that greeted him was like a fresh sprout growing on an icy mountaintop. The refreshing and unique aura put Lin Yuan in a momentary trance.","This was not because Dictator Everything was more beautiful than the Moon Empress and the Goddess of Mercy but because he had never encountered a woman with an aura similar to that of Dictator Everything.","White Speak immediately walked up to Lin Yuan when it saw him enter. It went without saying that it also noticed Dictator Everything behind him.","White Speak had never seen Dictator Everything before, but it had heard of what Dictator Everything looked like.","Moreover, White Speak was unable to sense this girl’s aura. Thus, it quickly became certain of Dictator Everything’s identity.","White Speak did not look dazzled by Dictator Everything at all. This was because Dictator Everything’s looks could not match up to Lin Yuan in his merman form."]},{"number":2271,"title":"Chapter 2271 A Verbal Slip-Up Leads to Trouble!","paragraphs":["2271 A Verbal Slip-Up Leads to Trouble!","For some reason, White Speak had a strange hope—it hoped that many Dictators would come to attend the Banquet of Everything.","Lin Yuan could reveal his Dictator’s body and show the other Dictators what true beauty was.","If someone with Star Splendor’s appearance could be called the biggest beauty of the Marsh East Circle, Lin Yuan’s appearance would surely be reputed throughout Marsh Abyss.","Lin Yuan instructed White Speak, “Go and bring another bench into the main hall for Dictator Everything.”","White Speak hurriedly nodded.","Meanwhile, Dictator Everything said softly, “Call me Cleansing Rain. That’s the name my mother gave me when I was young. I’ve never revealed the name, so no one from the Palace of Everything knows about it.”","Lin Yuan had not expected Dictator Everything to use her real name to conceal her identity.","From what Dictator Everything said, Lin Yuan could tell that she was threatened by something in the Palace of Everything. Otherwise, she would not insist that no one from the Palace of Everything find out the truth.","The Palace of Everything was under Dictator Everything’s supervision, and it would be impossible for the entire Palace of Everything to rebel against her. Hence, there was a high chance that Dictator Everything had been forced to this place because of Second Born, who had become a Dictator.","To confirm this guess, Lin Yuan said, “You can call me Lin Yuan.”","Dictator Everything shook her head gently and said, “Lin Yuan might be your real name, but I would rather call you Ten Thousand Source. I applaud your courage to add the word ‘source’ into your name and to the back at that.”","Lin Yuan frowned slightly. He could tell that Dictator Everything was trying to get at something.","Could it be that the name he had come up with on the fly had a hidden meaning?","With that thought, Lin Yuan looked at Dictator Everything with an expression that made it clear that he needed an explanation from her.","Dictator Everything saw that Lin Yuan had turned austere and immediately thought back to what she had just said.","But even after a moment passed, Dictator Everything could not figure out which part of what she had said had been strange.","Could it be that by applauding Lin Yuan’s courage for including the word ‘source’ at the back of his name, Lin Yuan felt affronted and was now angry?","Dictator Everything’s expression immediately turned panicked.","Dictators took pride in their names and were willing to safeguard their names with their lives.","If Lin Yuan felt that she was trampling on his pride, she might instantly become his enemy.","Dictator Everything hurriedly explained, “I meant to say that it’s brave for you to be unafraid of the seven Dictators from Marsh Abyss! Once news of your name gets out, the seven Dictators from Marsh Abyss will definitely send someone to you. If my guess is right, it’ll either be Dictator Evil Source or Hornless Dragon Source.”","Lin Yuan suddenly realized that so much thought went into a Dictator’s name! Had he just fixed a ticking bomb to himself by calling himself ‘Ten Thousand Source!?","From the information he gained from East Glow, Lin Yuan knew Marsh Abyss’ position in the marsh world.","It was likely that Evil Source and Hornless Dragon Source, who Dictator Everything had mentioned, were two of the seven figures who East Glow had spoken of.","Lin Yuan would be rather troubled if he offended a Samsara Realm Dictator because of his name.","With Begin Lady around, Lin Yuan did not have to be afraid of either Dictator Evil Source or Dictator Hornless Dragon Source. But if both of them appeared together, the situation would turn sticky.","With a wave of his hand, Lin Yuan summoned Green Vine, who started to converse with Dictator Everything on Lin Yuan’s behalf.","Dictator Everything froze when she sensed Green Vine’s aura.","This cold and beautiful woman was clearly weak, so why did she have such a startling aura?","Dictator Everything was already planning on bootlicking Lin Yuan in the hopes that he would help her. Hence, she could only answer honestly to Green Vine’s superficial questions.","Lin Yuan found out a lot of information that had been previously unknown to him from the conversation between Dictator Everything and Green Vine.","It turned out that once an Apostle who followed a Dictator broke through to the Dictator level, they would definitely betray their Dictator. It was a path that almost all Dictators had to go down.","It was as though this was the world’s way of keeping down the number of Dictators in the world.","This would explain why Second Born had unsavory intentions for Dictator Everything.","White Speak broke out in a cold sweat when it heard the conversation between Dictator Everything and Green Vine and turned to look at Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan had been trying to nurture White Speak into a Dictator. Could it become a traitor to Lin Yuan after it became a Dictator?","White Speak could not believe that it would ever decide to do so. Yet, there was no way that Dictator Everything was lying.","White Speak was unsure how Lin Yuan would react once he learned of this piece of information.","East Glow, who was about to break through to Dictator, might be even more worried than White Speak.","Lin Yuan looked into the distance as he mulled over Dictator Everything’s words, but there was no worry in his eyes.","He only took in Apostles so he could accept their faith power.","However, Dictators also needed to lock their Apostles’ source totems after absorbing their faith power.","He was not a true Dictator and had different methods from regular Dictators.","After Lin Yuan saved Dictator Everything, he could clearly sense that a glowing dot that represented Dictator Everything’s faith power had appeared in the fountain of faith.","However, this dot of light was almost pathetically small.","This situation informed Lin Yuan that he could also receive faith power from Dictators. As such, he did not have to worry about East Glow and White Speak betraying him after they became Dictators.","Alas, he could only be certain once he had tested this out. Lin Yuan intended to find the time to do exactly that.","He decided to help East Glow to become a Dictator before the Banquet of Everything began so he could see if East Glow ended up straying.","What would happen when he boosted a Dictator with his faith power?","With that thought, Lin Yuan decided to do a test on Dictator Everything first.","He raised his hand, and five pillars of glowing light appeared behind him, enveloping him in faith power."]},{"number":2272,"title":"Chapter 2272 Dictator Everything Attacks!","paragraphs":["2272 Dictator Everything Attacks!","Although Lin Yuan had told Truth to use the faith power in the fountain of faith to speed up the derivation of the divine kingdom, the derivation of the divine kingdom still took time.","Truth did not start off by spending a large amount of faith power.","The pillars of faith power shot toward Dictator Everything.","In an instant, Dictator Everything and Lin Yuan were linked by faith power.","As the sea of faith power flowed into Dictator Everything, she felt all the power that had drained out from her when she entered the Turning Wheel Realm returning to her. In addition, the power continued to grow stronger.","Dictator Everything’s skirt billowed, and the bells tied to her hair twinkled as her hair danced in the breeze.","The eleven silver braids were woven out of white hair, and the bells struck against each other continuously.","Dictator Everything’s eyes became increasingly pure.","Slowly, the pupils disappeared from her eyes.","Lin Yuan thought that he would be able to inject all of his faith power into Dictator Everything, but it turned out that the body of a Turning Wheel Realm Dictator did not possess a high enough volume.","When Lin Yuan could no longer pump any more faith power into Dictator Everything’s body, Dictator Everything’s body emanated an aura that indicated she had broken through that limit.","Although he had not set his spirit fire alight, the sleeping Begin Lady had already confirmed with Lin Yuan that Dictator Everything had entered that level.","This meant that by using Faith Application, he had managed to enable Dictator Everything to gain the power of a Samsara Realm Dictator.","After performing this experiment, Lin Yuan did not give Dictator Everything the chance to savor the feeling before he retracted his faith power.","This caused Dictator Everything to plummet to the ground moments after its fingers brushed the clouds. It was once again so feeble that it could not even stand up against an Apostle.","After that experience, Dictator Everything started looking at Lin Yuan in a different light.","She no longer saw him as just a regular Samsara Realm Dictator. There was no way that a regular Samsara Realm Dictator could possess such power. Not even the seven figures from Marsh Abyss could accomplish such a feat.","Dictator Everything could be certain that what just happened was not a figment of her imagination but that she had truly possessed power beyond that of a Samsara Realm Dictator.","Such mighty methods went beyond the comprehension of even Dictator Everything with her long life.","Lin Yuan realized that after this experiment, the glowing dot in the fountain of faith that represented Dictator Everything’s faith power had become much stronger.","Since Dictator Everything was now his believer, there were some things that Lin Yuan no longer needed to discuss with her.","Lin Yuan said to White Speak, “Go and wait in the main hall. Without my permission, no one will be able to enter. You will be able to enjoy your share of the spotlight once the Banquet of Everything begins”.","He then said to Dictator Everything, “How can the Banquet of Everything take place without Dictator Everything? Since you said that an Apostles will betray their Dictator after becoming a Dictator themselves, I will provide you with power so that you can handle your household affairs as you see fit!”","Dictator Everything looked at Lin Yuan gratefully before she bowed deeply.","Lin Yuan’s words could only mean that he intended to help her.","If not for the fact that she had never heard of a level above the Samsara Realm, she would suspect that Lin Yuan had reached such a level!","With such a figure around supporting her, she would not have to be afraid despite being in such a weak state.","In order to receive such protection, she needed to offer something of her own. One had to give to receive.","After she bowed to Lin Yuan to express her gratitude, Dictator Everything said gratefully, “Lord Lin Yuan, you have saved my life from danger. I promise that once I’ve crossed this awkward period and regained my power, I will always stand on your side no matter what, even if you decide to make an enemy out of those figures from Marsh Abyss!”","Dictators from the marsh world always kept their promises.","Dictator Everything said what she said to express her thanks to Lin Yuan but also to give her assurance.","Lin Yuan looked at Dictator Everything and said, “Some promises need to be done and not said. I am very interested in your faith power.”","While he spoke, Lin Yuan injected 1,000 units of pure source-type power into Dictator Everything and looked down into her eyes.","The large amount of source-type power immediately caused Dictator Everything to feel her power being awakened.","As she sensed the purity of the source-type power, Dictator Everything became increasingly certain that Lin Yuan was no weaker than the seven figures from Marsh Abyss.","Dictator Everything had once received a reward from Dictator Mountain Ridge Source. The source-type power from Dictator Mountain Ridge Source had been much less pure than the source-type power from Lin Yuan.","Dictator Everything momentarily hesitated after she heard Lin Yuan’s request before she revealed the faith power from her source totem to Lin Yuan so that he could extract as much as he wanted.","Lin Yuan did not stand on ceremony. He needed an endless river of faith power in order to develop the divine kingdom.","In the past, Lin Yuan had only considered harvesting from Apostles. But now that he had the chance to harvest from a Dictator, he was not going to miss out on this opportunity.","The Apostles could not dream of comparing the faith power from Dictator Everything’s source totem.","East Glow’s faith power had been like a mountain stream, while Dictator Everything’s faith power was more like a raging river.","Lin Yuan used the glowing pillars of faith power to transport Dictator Everything’s faith power into the fountain of faith in the divine kingdom.","Just like with East Glow, Lin Yuan did not hold back at all with Dictator Everything’s faith power.","Dictator Everything’s face became increasingly pale as her faith power drained out from her, but she dared not do anything to stop Lin Yuan.","Dictator Everything’s faith power substantially added to the faith power in Lin Yuan’s fountain of faith.","According to the exchange rate between faith power and source-type power, Lin Yuan injected adequate source-type power into Dictator Everything’s body.","After receiving Lin Yuan’s pure source-type power twice, Dictator Everything did not bear any grudges toward him as she had not been disadvantaged by this trade of resources.","Rather, she seemed to have taken advantage of him instead."]},{"number":2273,"title":"Chapter 2273 What Kind of Situation is This?","paragraphs":["2273 What Kind of Situation is This?","Lin Yuan spent a full day draining the faith power from East Glow’s body and even longer draining the faith power from Dictator Everything’s body.","White Speak had been guarding the entrance relentlessly for the past few days.","Lin Yuan had ordered it not to let anyone in. Thus, it even blocked East Glow when it came to report to Lin Yuan.","East Glow was beside itself with anxiousness as the Banquet of Everything was going to begin tomorrow.","Dictator Return to Ruins had arrived at Marsh East Palace two days ago. He had asked to meet with Dictator Ten Thousand Source more than once and ordered East Glow to relay the message.","However, East Glow had not had the chance to speak with Lin Yuan, so it had no way of giving an answer to Dictator Return to Ruins.","Dictator Return to Ruins started acting like a bully from the moment he arrived.","None of his subordinates had shown the Palace of Everything any respect and almost prevented the Banquet of Everything from carrying on as usual.","It was only when Dictator Demon Desire arrived and struck fear into Dictator Return to Ruins that he settled down.","Although Dictator Demon Desire came from the Marsh North Circle and was not part of Marsh Abyss, her reputation was much more impressive than that of Dictator Return to Ruins.","Dictator Demon Desire had not entered the Turning Wheel Realm either.","Her reputation could suppress that of Dictator Return to Ruins Palace because Dictator Return to Ruins Palace had been holed up in the Return to Ruins Palace in the Polar Sea Large Lake. Although he left the Return to Ruins Palace occasionally, it had been centuries since he had last left the Polar Sea Large Lake.","Furthermore, Dictator Treasure Seeker and Tyrant Lizard were also unquestionably involved.","Dictator Demon Desire did whatever she pleased. One could only imagine how many male Dictators had lost their lives on the Love Bone Spring Grace Boat.","Dictator Return to Ruins never liked to associate with such female Dictators. But this did not mean that the other male Dictators were turned off by her.","Dictator Treasure Seeker and Tyrant Lizard were both Dictator Demon Desire’s loyal lapdogs.","Dictator Tyrant Lizard had reached advanced Turning Wheel Realm, while Dictator Treasure Seeker had reached pinnacle Turning Wheel Realm and also possessed a large number of treasures.","Dictator Return to Ruins had come to the Banquet of Everything because of Dictator Everything and not to cause trouble or get himself killed.","Given Dictator Tyrant Lizard and Treasure Seeker’s characters, they would still follow Dictator Demon Desire to the Banquet of Everything even if they had no interest in the Banquet of Everything themselves.","If he clashed against Dictator Demon Desire, both Dictator Tyrant Lizard and Treasure Seeker would not hesitate to offer up their source totems.","Thus, Return to Ruins immediately became quiet after Dictator Demon Desire arrived and decided to send people to secretly search for Dictator Everything instead","It went without saying that such behavior alerted First Born, Second Born, and Third Born.","First Born and Third Born were both extremely worried.","Before Dictator Everything entered the Turning Wheel Realm, there would have been no reason to be afraid of Dictator Return to Ruins.","Dictator Return to Ruins might have killed other Dictators, but so had Dictator Everything.","But Dictator Everything had entered the Turning Wheel Realm and was in a weak state. She would have no choice but to succumb to Dictator Return to Ruins if she was discovered.","Second Born resented Dictator Return to Ruins.","Dictator Return to Ruins’ actions formed a roadblock that prevented Second Born from attaining what she wanted.","But since she had no way of fighting Dictator Return to Ruins, Second Born changed her mindset.","Previously, she was focused on finding a way to obtain benefits from Dictator Everything.","But now, she just needed Dictator Everything to die. Once Dictator Everything was dead, the others would not be able to hold Second Born accountable for her betrayal.","Second Born decided not to attend the Banquet of Everything and leave everything to First Born and Third Born. She could hide her power from people who were weaker than her but could not hide from Dictators who were as or more powerful than her.","When she thought back to how Dictator Ten Thousand Source had looked at her, Second Born was certain that he had seen through her and recognized her true power.","If that was all there was to the situation, there would be no need for East Glow to be as anxious as it was.","However, Dictator Tyrant Lizard and Treasure Seeker turned up two days later.","Dictator Tyrant Lizard and Treasure Seeker did not get along, and their subordinates broke out into numerous fights that caused chaos to spread throughout Marsh East Palace.","However, Dictator Tyrant Lizard and Treasure Seeker were both focused on Dictator Demon Desire and did not restrain their subordinates.","The Dictator Frost Cold and Freezing Ember couple had arrived as well a few days ago.","Both of them were Dictator Hornless Dragon Source’s close subordinates. Their arrival was representative of Dictator Hornless Dragon Source’s will.","The matter now involved the seven figures from Marsh Abyss. All of them would become focused on the Marsh East Circle that did not even have a Dictator.","All of this was because of Lin Yuan.","When East Glow was so anxious that it did not know what to do with itself, a girl with white hair walked out of the main hall and said in a haughty voice, “Lord Ten Thousand Source wants to see you.”","East Glow immediately recognized this white-haired girl.","Dictator Everything’s appearance was well-known, and the Palace of Everything had also advertised Dictator Everything’s appearance before in the past. As a result, there were many Apostles and Dictators in the various marsh circles who could recognize Dictator Everything.","Before East Glow even had time to be shocked by Dictator Everything’s appearance, it was stunned by the way that Dictator Everything had addressed Lin Yuan.","A Dictator who had entered the Turning Wheel Realm had addressed Lin Yuan as ‘Lord’. What kind of situation was this?","Even if he was stronger than Dictator Everything, he was still on the same life rank as Dictator Everything. Thus, there was no reason for Dictator Everything to address him as ‘Lord’.","At that moment, East Glow thought of something.","Dictator Everything did not immediately return to the hall after East Glow entered. Instead, she surveyed the surroundings.","She no longer needed to hide and cower.","After she was done taking in the sights, she greeted White Speak solemnly.","Although White Speak was neither talented nor powerful, it was an important subordinate to Lin Yuan. Thus, Dictator Everything needed to establish good ties with it.","Given her relationship with Lin Yuan, she would have plenty of opportunities to interact with him in the future.","From the moment that East Glow spotted Lin Yuan, it started to give its report.","Lin Yuan raised an eyebrow as he listened to East Glow’s report.","It seemed that the Banquet of Everything had attracted six Dictators. Including the two Dictators from the Palace of Everything, there were eight Dictators present.","While there were people walking in the light, there had to also be some causing trouble in the shadows, just like Second Born.","The storm that was about to break out in the Banquet of Everything was going to be much larger than Lin Yuan expected.","The Banquet of Everything would begin tomorrow.","Lin Yuan turned and said to East Glow, “Although you’ve become my follower, you’re still in charge of Marsh East Palace. Given how helpless you are against the Dictators, I’m sure you don’t have the courage to interfere with the Apostles under these Dictators either.”"]},{"number":2274,"title":"Chapter 2274 No Respect!","paragraphs":["2274 No Respect!","Lin Yuan spoke the truth, but it still made East Glow uncomfortable.","However, there was nothing that East Glow could do. Even if it could defeat these Apostles, doing so would offend the Dictators who supported them. Thus, the loss it would suffer would outweigh the benefits.","Yet, it could not allow the Marsh East Palace’s pride to be trampled along with its own.","It was said that Star Splendor had become acquainted with Dictator Return to Ruins’ Apostle and had been recommended to Dictator Return to Ruins.","Meanwhile, East Glow followed Lin Yuan so it could attain a breakthrough and reach a brighter future.","It was clear that Star Splendor had not attached itself to Dictator Return to Ruins just to obtain such things.","After all, East Glow had chased Star Splendor for many years. Although it knew what kind of character Star Splendor had, East Glow still could not shake the bad taste in its mouth.","Lin Yuan’s words had hit a nerve. But since it was Lin Yuan who had spoken, East Glow still nodded seriously.","As Lin Yuan sensed the change in East Glow’s mood, he gently tapped the table twice as he said, “Since this is how things are, why don’t I help you to become a Dictator? Once you become a Dictator, none of the other Dictators will speak against you while you’re managing trivial matters as long as you act reasonably. You are my follower, They have to consider my pride.”","Lin Yuan’s decision for East Glow to break through to Dictator was not a last-minute one. He had only come to this decision after contemplating for some time.","Firstly, Lin Yuan wanted to test to see if East Glow would betray him once it became a Dictator. Secondly, the other Dictators were all keeping a close eye on him.","East Glow had been an Apostle when it entered. But when it left the hall, it would be a Dictator. Such an action would surely astonish the other Dictators.","One had to be strong in order to establish a network in society, so Lin Yuan needed to cultivate his image properly.","If someone still tried to cause trouble for him after he had cultivated his image, he would not mind gathering some Dictator source totems. It just so happened that it was time for him to contract his second sacred source lifeform.","East Glow was struck dumb when it heard what Lin Yuan said. It was so happy that it had no idea what to say.","This was a massive blessing!","Although it was a pinnacle Apostle and was only one step away from reaching Apostle, it was extremely difficult to take that step.","By being willing to help it, Lin Yuan would surely provide it with a sea of source-type power.","East Glow had already become Lin Yuan’s follower. Thus, it left everything to Lin Yuan to arrange.","It did not know how it should repay Lin Yuan.","But in order to become stronger, East Glow could not let go of such a chance.","“Lord, once I become a Dictator, I will do my best to carry out your orders!”","Lin Yuan did not respond.","East Glow’s loyalty would either persist after it became a Dictator because Lin Yuan was not a dimensional lifeform or would change its mind and betray him.","It was not up to a few promises from East Glow to determine which result would take place.","Lin Yuan did not believe such potentially empty promises either.","He had not used much source-type power recently, and the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had not slowed in its absorption of Law Source Crystals either. Thus, Lin Yuan possessed an ocean of source-type power.","Lin Yuan manipulated a large amount of source-type power into East Glow’s body.","The source-type power flashed and shone around Lin Yuan. For a moment, East Glow almost mistook Lin Yuan for a celestial being.","A river of source-type power gilded within East Glow and unlocked the padlocks within its body. As wave after wave passed, East Glow’s life rank was unbolted and promoted, turning it into a true Dictator.","There were no trumpets or fanfare when an Apostle evolved into a Dictator.","East Glow fully retracted its aura.","Its source totem was no longer fixed at one spot but spread throughout its entire body until it settled just below its skin.","When East Glow opened its eyes again, it could be addressed as Dictator East Glow.","East Glow did not appear overly excited or overwhelmed now that it had reached the level it had been dreaming of.","This was because none of it had come from its own hard work but had been a gift from Lin Yuan.","East Glow understood that there were times when a strong source of support was much more important than one’s own hard work.","But it went without saying that such an opportunity only came about after its previous hard work. If it had not been strong enough, it would never have been able to receive such a blessing from Lin Yuan.","Although it had become a Dictator, East Glow did not forget its promise to Lin Yuan.","East Glow started to kowtow to Lin Yuan just like the first time it had met him.","East Glow’s actions and the look in its eyes told Lin Yuan that he had made the right guess.","East Glow had not developed a traitorous bone after it became a Dictator. Instead, it was now going to be a source of Dictator-level power that Lin Yuan could wield.","“East Glow, go and handle the affairs of the Palace of Everything. If there are any issues, you can let White Speak know and discuss them together.”","From Lin Yuan’s words, East Glow could sense how much affection Lin Yuan had for White Speak.","East Glow was glad that it had not looked down on White Speak when they first met. Otherwise, even after becoming a Dictator, a few nasty comments from White Speak to Lin Yuan would cause Lin Yuan to turn against it.","East Glow remembered Dictator Everything who it saw by the entrance and asked, “Lord Ten Thousand Source, Dictator Everything—”","Before East Glow finished speaking, Lin Yuan said, “You don’t need to talk about Dictator Everything. She will make an entrance during the Banquet of Everything tomorrow.”","East Glow was about to leave the hall when it suddenly remembered Dictator Return to Ruins’ invitation for Lin Yuan and asked softly, “Lord Ten Thousand Source, Return to Ruins would like to see you before the Banquet of Everything begins. Are you interested in meeting him?”","When East Glow had been an Apostle, it had to address Return to Ruins as ‘Dictator Return to Ruins’ as a show of respect.","But now, East Glow had transformed into a Dictator and could address Dictator Return to Ruins by name.","Lin Yuan immediately turned the offer down by saying, “I don’t have any ties with Return to Ruins. There’s no need to see him.”","Although East Glow did not have much experience, it had confirmed when Lin Yuan injected almost 3,000 units of source-type power into its body to turn it into a Dictator that he had to have reached the Samsara Realm and was much more powerful than Dictator Return to Ruins.","There was no need for Lin Yuan to look out for Dictator Return to Ruins’ pride!"]},{"number":2275,"title":"Chapter 2275 Fool!","paragraphs":["2275 Fool!","A Samsara Realm Dictator was not a being you could meet with just because you wanted to.","After East Glow left the main hall, it sensed that there were dozens of eyes on it.","Not only did East Glow not try to hide its imposing manner, but it even revealed a small portion of its Dictator aura so the others around could sense it.","It did not take long for the eyes to shift away immediately after they sensed East Glow’s aura.","If they got on Dictator East Glow’s bad side by looking at it for too long, Dictator East Glow might end up attacking them.","How did East Glow go in as an Apostle and come out as a Dictator!?","None of them attributed the cause to East Glow. If East Glow had such capabilities, it would not have been stuck at pinnacle Apostle for thousands of years.","All of this had to be because of Dictator Ten Thousand Source!","Only pinnacle Apostles had been sent over to survey the situation, and all of them subconsciously came up with the same idea.","If Dictator Ten Thousand Source could help East Glow transform into a Dictator, he could help them too.","If they had not already become loyal to other Dictators, these pinnacle Apostles would have immediately dashed over to meet with Dictator Ten Thousand Source in the hopes of securing a brighter future for themselves.","Eventually, the Apostles who had come to gather information had no choice but to suppress any and all ideas that had sprouted in their minds before they returned to report to their Dictators.","It was likely that the Dictators they were loyal to would not be able to remain composed either after finding out that East Glow had transformed into a Dictator.","Usually, the Dictators who attended the Banquet of Everything in disguise did not bring Apostles with them.","The Apostles who had arrived at Marsh East Palace with a parade in tow all formed several ideas after learning of the news.","Ever since Dictator Treasure Seeker and Tyrant Lizard arrived, Dictator Demon Desire stored her Love Bone Spring Grace Boat away, and the Apostles on the boat, who were dressed revealingly, all ended up locked in the boat.","The two powerful lapdogs afforded Demon Desire a lot of conveniences.","Hence, Dictator Demon Desire did not mind taking these two lapdogs’ pride into consideration while they were by her side.","Both Dictator Tyrant Lizard and Treasure Seeker were focused on Dictator Demon Desire.","Star Splendor might be the most beautiful being in Marsh East Circle, but Dictator Demon Desire had already been crowned the unbeatable beauty of the Marsh West Circle when she had still been an Apostle. Thus, her pageant record was even more illustrious than that of Star Splendor.","Dictator Demon Desire had enraptured Dictator Tyrant Lizard and Treasure Seeker before she even became a Dictator.","After becoming a Dictator, her exquisite appearance and aura had risen to another level. Every knit of her brows and smile caused the other gender to lose their minds, or at least those who were interested in women.","Hence, despite knowing that her two lapdogs were obsessed with beauty, Dictator Demon Desire was not worried about Star Splendor stealing their attention.","Dictator Demon Desire did not see Star Splendor as an enemy.","Beauty was just a weapon in the arsenal of women.","Star Splendor’s power was much less powerful than Dictator Demon Desire, and her beauty was of a completely different style that posed no threat to her.","Dictator Demon Desire had wanted to give Star Splendor some advice before she left the Marsh East Circle but had not expected the nearsighted Star Splendor to end up joining Dictator Return to Ruins.","Although Dictator Demon Desire did not know Dictator Return to Ruins well, she had heard of the rumors surrounding him.","His sole focus was on increasing his power, and matters of the heart held no significance to him. What was the point of becoming loyal to someone like him?","If Star Splendor’s beauty was not enough to trigger interest, there was a high chance that it would end up being used by Dictator Return to Ruins as a tool to control other Dictators.","While Dictator Demon Desire chewed on a purple fruit that resembled grapes, Dictator Tyrant Lizard and Treasure Seeker peeled another two grapes and handed them to her.","Both of their eyes met, and an intangible brawl broke out. It was as though they were trying to compete to see whose grape Dictator Demon Desire would pick first.","Demon Desire was already used to such occurrences. She knew that she had to be fair.","Dictator Demon Desire received both grapes and popped them into her mouth with her slender ivory fingers before she returned the skins to Dictator Tyrant Lizard and Treasure Seeker.","Then, she went on to eat other fruits.","At that moment, a decently attractive female Apostle under Dictator Demon Desire walked hurriedly into the hall.","Dictator Demon Desire did not use to have female followers. She only chose to accept a few for Dictator Tyrant Lizard and Treasure Seeker’s sakes.","The female Apostles were only allowed to give reports to Demon Desire when Dictator Tyrant Lizard and Treasure Seeker were around.","It was not the first time this female Apostle did such a thing. It knew that Dictator Demon Desire would never try to hide information from Dictator Tyrant Lizard and Treasure Seeker.","The female Apostle hurriedly bowed and said, “Lord Dictator, you asked me to keep an eye on East Glow. East Glow indeed went to see Dictator Ten Thousand Source—”","Dictator Tyrant Lizard interrupted the female Apostle before it could finish its report. “Demon Desire, why are you interested in someone like Ten Thousand Source who thinks too much of himself? There is no way that Lord Carnage Source will let him off for having the audacity to give himself such a name before he attains any achievements.”","Dictator Treasure Seeker shot Dictator Tyrant Lizard a look of disdain and thought, Fool! If Ten Thousand Source is truly mad and reckless, we would have already gotten at least a glimpse of him in the time that we’ve been in Marsh East Palace.","For a Dictator who seemed to come from nowhere to give himself such a name, it meant that he had to have what it took to back such a name up.","If Tyrant Lizard was not Dictator Carnage Source’s follower, Treasure Seeker would not have been so patient with him for so long!","Tyrant Lizard acted without thought because he knew he had a source of support to rely on. This would eventually lead to his downfall.","The structure of Marsh Abyss was constantly shifting. Did he really think that the seven figures were completely devoid of fear and did not need to think before they acted?","The seven figures had deep grudges against each other and were constantly fighting over resources. If any one of them was injured, they would immediately become prey to the other six.","This was why the seven figures had chosen to recruit him without any forceful pressures.","This was before he had entered the Samsara Realm.","At that time, the seven figures had taken down the Dictators in the Marsh East Circle who had the word ‘source’ in their names because none of them had entered the Samsara Realm. The strongest of them had only been advanced Turning Wheel Realm.","There was no way that such figures could pose a threat to the seven figures.","Thus, once it was confirmed that Dictator Ten Thousand Source had reached the Samsara Realm, Dictator Carnage Source would never lay a hand on Dictator Ten Thousand Source, regardless of how he felt about Dictator Ten Thousand Source, for fear of costing him his profits."]},{"number":2276,"title":"Chapter 2276 Came Personally?","paragraphs":["2276 Came Personally?","Suppose Dictator Carnage Source knew that Dictator Ten Thousand Source was not a regular Samsara Realm Dictator. In that case, he might not take action even if Dictator Ten Thousand Source killed Dictator Tyrant Lizard.","The competition between Samsara Realm Dictators was just this realistic.","A slight change could lead to ripples of changes.","Dictators who could enter the Samsara Realm only differed in how their source totems countered each other. Who was truly worse than the other?","Dictator Tyrant Lizard’s words caused Dictator Demon Desire to frown.","She did not meet Dictator Tyrant Lizard’s eyes or responded to what he said. Instead, she turned to signal to the female Apostle to continue its report.","The female Apostle chose to disregard Dictator Tyrant Lizard’s pride as well. It was already aware of the fact that Dictator Tyrant Lizard was Dictator Demon Desire’s lapdog. Thus, its expression did not change as it went on to say, “East Glow was not with Dictator Ten Thousand Source in the hall for a long time, but when it came out, it was a Dictator.”","The female Apostle did not raise its head even after it was done with its report. But it could clearly tell that the auras of the three figures around it had changed significantly.","A moment later, Dictator Demon Desire revealed a half smile as she looked into Dictator Tyrant Lizard’s eyes and said, “We both saw East Glow when he came to greet us. How long do you think it would have taken East Glow to break through to Dictator on his own?”","Dictator Treasure Seeker was delighted when he saw the mocking way that Demon Desire was looking at Tyrant Lizard.","Hehe, it seems like there is really more to this Ten Thousand Source than what meets the eye. I can’t believe he’s capable of changing lives to such an extent!","There was no guarantee that the seven figures had such capabilities. Even if they did, they had never used them.","“I don’t have many words of praise for East Glow. He did accumulate a solid store of faith power, but his mental state was lacking. He would have needed to be tempered by a large amount of pure source-type power in order to evolve. Without external help and with sufficient resources, he would have needed at least another 800 years. If East Glow remained complacent in the Marsh East Palace, he might never have been able to become a Dictator.”","Dictator Treasure Seeker made pertinent points.","Dictator Tyrant Lizard had no way of rebuking Dictator Treasure Seeker.","However, it did not sit right with him that his old rival had gained the upper ground while they were in front of Dictator Demon Desire.","But despite Dictator Tyrant Lizard being unable to think of anything as a rebuttal, he would never dare to belittle Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","While Dictator Tyrant Lizard was left feeling awkward and miserable and Treasure Seeker was gleeful over his win, they had no idea that Dictator Demon Desire had formed a strong interest in Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","Meanwhile, Dictator Freezing Ember and Freezing Ember, who came from the Marsh North Circle, were feeling stern after listening to their subordinate’s report.","Dictator Frost Cold’s ice-blue cloak had snowflakes hanging off of it.","A beautiful and determined face topped the body that was over two meters tall. Although her face was wide and rugged, it had a heroic beauty.","Dictator Freezing Ember was taller than Dictator Frost Cold and wore dark blue armor with grayish-blue flaming ice patterns all over it.","His short dark blue hair had two streaks of blue that moved and danced. Each time the two streaks intercepted each other, icy flames shot out and enveloped Dictator Freezing Ember.","After Dictator Freezing Ember’s Apostle left, he said in an austere voice, “Wife, we must inform Lord Hornless Dragon Source about this! If Dictator Ten Thousand Source possesses such power, we have to make sure that we trade for the big and small source fruits!","“News also came that Dictator Mountain Ridge Source will be making a personal appearance at the Banquet of Everything. Once Dictator Mountain Ridge Source arrives, we won’t be able to obtain many benefits from the Banquet of Everything.”","Dictator Frost Cold sighed when she heard her husband’s suggestion.","“At first, I thought that this would be a very easy task. Who could have known that it would turn out to be so challenging? Dictator Ten Thousand Source must have entered the Samsara Realm to be able to evolve East Glow from Apostle to Dictator.","“Since this matter involves a Samsara Realm Dictator, we will have to inform Lord Hornless Dragon Source of this even if Dictator Mountain Ridge Source’s information doesn’t turn out to be reliable.","“Hehe, the thousands of Frost Cold Eyes I set up outside Marsh East Palace spotted Pregnant Poison. She might have spotted the Frost Cold Eyes, but thieves will always be thieves. She must be hiding somewhere, hoping to jump in and take advantage of whatever crisis ensues.","“Although Return to Ruins is out in the open, he must have the same goal as Pregnant Poison. Although Everything has visited Distant Mountain Ridge Palace before in the past, it’s unlikely that Dictator Mountain Ridge Source will be willing to see her subordinate falling to a scheme by Dictator Evil Source’s subordinate and a factionless Dictator.","“This Banquet of Everything will probably be even more exciting than the Divine Source Gathering that takes place once every century in Marsh Abyss!”","Dictator Freezing Ember nodded gently at what his wife said.","His wife was usually the decision-maker when they went out on missions for Lord Hornless Dragon Source. This time was no exception.","Although both of them had different personalities, they knew when they needed to be cautious and responsible.","Both of them decided to keep as low of a profile as possible at the Banquet of Everything and only make a decision when they received an order from Dictator Hornless Dragon Source.","There was even a chance that Dictator Hornless Dragon Source would make a personal trip after hearing the news!","Dictator Return to Ruins had been the last to receive the news.","He not only heard of how East Glow had evolved from an Apostle to a Dictator but also found out from his subordinate that Lin Yuan had turned down his invitation.","This caused Dictator Return to Ruins to feel humiliated and awkward. But there was nothing he could do.","After spending such a long time in the Polar Sea Large Lake educating Apostles who were seeking breakthroughs, Dictator Return to Ruins had become accustomed to being put on a pedestal. He rarely experienced what it was like to be slighted.","When a wealthy young master who had been lavished with affection since he was young arrived at an elite school and noticed that many students were better off than him, he would be sure to feel uncomfortable.","This was similar to how Dictator Return to Ruins felt now.","All these Dictators were stronger than him. He had to act and speak carefully in front of them to avoid trouble.","Dictator Return to Ruins had already regretted coming and trying to take advantage of the situation more than once.","When Star Splendor joined Dictator Return to Ruins, he learned that East Glow had been chasing it.","But Dictator Return to Ruins still decided to do so because he had not cared about East Glow.","But it had not been long since he accepted Star Splendor, and East Glow was now a Dictator.","Although East Glow was not as powerful as him, they now had the same life rank."]},{"number":2277,"title":"Chapter 2277 Invite the Wolf Pack","paragraphs":["2277 Invite the Wolf Pack","More importantly, East Glow must have caught Dictator Ten Thousand Source’s attention. This was the only reason to explain why Dictator Ten Thousand Source had spent such a large amount of pure source-type power to help East Glow to break through his life rank.","With this thought, Dictator Return to Ruins felt exceedingly conflicted and awkward.","He had not marked Star Splendor yet.","If he gave Star Splendor to East Glow now, the latter might forget about what he had done. But if he did this, he would become the laughingstock of all Dictators.","Dictator Return to Ruins dared not be angry at Dictator Ten Thousand Source over the rejection.","A Samsara Realm Dictator could even beat him up, and he would not utter a word of complaint. In fact, he would even put on a merry facade and make it seem as though the beating was a reward.","Dictator Return to Ruins no longer dared to hatch any schemes surrounding the Banquet of Everything. If there was truly anything he wanted to do, he would have to do them in secret.","...","The Banquet of Everything’s preparation was complete.","The Palace of Everything had never put on such a lavish event before.","A banquet that attracted so many Dictators should be regarded as a privilege. Yet the air permeating the Palace of Everything was extremely tense and suffocating.","A sheep could put on a banquet for a pack of wolves without worry as long as it had a tiger by its side. But without the tiger, the sheep would just end up as the wolf pack’s food.","Without Dictator Everything there it was not just First Born and Third Born who did not feel secure. Even Second Born felt extremely untethered.","After Second Born became a Dictator, she inserted many spies among the Palace of Everything’s newly recruited Apostles. All of them were loyal to Second Born and did their best for her sake.","First Born and Third Born did not know that an Apostle from Marsh East Palace had called away one of the Palace of Everything’s new Apostles, but Second Born was aware of that.","Second Born felt increasingly suspicious about this. It made more than one guess as to the reason.","Could the Apostle who had been called away be Dictator Everything, who had been in disguise and hiding?","There was nowhere that Dictator Everything could have gone after she entered the Turning Wheel Realm.","Although there were risks to hiding in the Palace of Everything, it was still much safer than fending for herself in the outside world where dangers were abound. Thus, after weighing each scenario, the only reasonable conclusion was that Dictator Everything had been hiding in the Palace of Everything.","Second Born had considered seeking East Glow to ask him about this matter.","Although East Glow did not technically rule over Marsh East Palace, he was in charge of most matters.","But Second Born did not do so because she was afraid that such an action would be too obvious.","But now that East Glow had become a Dictator, she had even less of a legitimate standing to ask him about this matter.","Now that East Glow’s life rank had risen, he would be able to tell with one look that Second Born had become a Dictator.","If the Apostle who had been called away was truly Dictator Everything in disguise, she must have already obtained Dictator Ten Thousand Source’s protection.","If that were the case, there was no way that a traitor like her would meet with a pleasant ending!","Second Born started to panic.","Meanwhile...","Lin Yuan was still oblivious to all that was happening outside.","After a good nap, he took a bath using the water that Dark Blue produced.","Dictators dressed extravagantly in the marsh world. They were not only rich but also prioritized their pride.","Regular resources were of no use to Dictators and could not be of much help. Hence, the Dictators added them to their outfits.","Just like powerful spirit qi professionals, Dictators had two types of outfits. One was for daily use, while the other was for formal events.","The daily outfits were for convenience and comfort, while the formal outfits were worn in meetings with other Dictators or during large-scale events.","Lin Yuan needed to follow such customs in order to keep up his facade of being a Dictator. Thus, he started to select his outfit after his bath.","The main world had many spiritual ingredients that could not be found in the marsh world. Such spiritual ingredients were more outstanding than those made from the bodies of dimensional lifeforms and could definitely stun the other Dictators.","With that thought, Lin Yuan picked a half armor made from the Blue Topaz that was only found in Class 5 subterranean dimensional rifts and was called the most beautiful blue-colored stone in the world. There was nothing blue in color that could compete.","The Blue Topaz contained a special magnetic field and was usually used to strengthen feys that could control attractive and repelling forces.","The Blue Topaz had two colors. One was lake blue, while the other was electric blue.","The profound and dazzling blue stones were adorned on the skin of the Eternal Breed Aurora Broken Night Fox.","The Aurora Broken Night Fox had thick fur that Wen Yu trimmed and used to line the inner side of the material to increase comfort.","The Aurora Broken Night Fox’s aura still clung to the skin and could easily be detected.","He matched the Blue Topaz half armor with a battle skirt similar to the ones ancient male soldiers wore. The battle skirt had pleats that resembled swords and was full of the tenacity and toughness of men.","The battle skirt also came from the Aurora Broken Night Fox.","There were many Wide Moon Brocades attached to the battle skirt.","The Wide Moon Brocade was an extremely elite product and was formed from the silk of the mutated Wide Moon Silkworm.","The value of the Wide Moon Brocade did not come from the material itself but from the workmanship. Only one length of the Wide Moon Brocade was woven by thousands of Class 3 and above Weavers once a year.","The marsh world did not have such a culturally-established foundational institution.","Lin Yuan did not have many eye-catching adornments on this half-armor and battle skirt, but it exuded extravagance.","Lin Yuan attached the Fish World Sea Trump Card to his waist and donned a pair of blue and white shoes. The pattern on the shoes resembled the Sentient Being Protective Dragon, with clear Blue Topazes adorning the front. Although the battle skirt concealed the shoes, they shimmered when he walked, their light blending seamlessly with the front illumination of the half armor.","Given the sturdiness of the materials used to make this outfit, it would not be damaged and would continue to drape around his body even if Lin Yuan changed into his merman form while dressed in it.","When Lin Yuan left the room, White Speak and Dictator Everything, who had been standing by the door, were both stupefied.","After a momentary trance, their gazes were filled with wonderment.","This especially applied to Dictator Everything.","Dictator Everything could not sense Lin Yuan’s aura, meaning that he did not like to remain in his Dictator’s body like other Dictators did.","Dictators who used their Dictator’s bodies always had much stronger auras and more dazzling beauty."]},{"number":2278,"title":"Chapter 2278 Dazzling Appearance!","paragraphs":["2278 Dazzling Appearance!","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan’s appearance and aura already far exceeded most of the Dictators who were using their Dictator’s bodies.","Dictator Everything dared not imagine how Lin Yuan would look when he actually used his Dictator’s body.","White Speak had seen Lin Yuan in his Dictator’s body state.","At that time, his Dictator’s body had only been covered by water.","It was likely that Lin Yuan would look even more breathtaking when he wore this outfit while in his Dictator’s body.","White Speak had interacted often with East Glow recently and knew that East Glow was an obedient servant.","East Glow was waiting right outside the hall.","It was likely that all thoughts of Star Splendor would be erased from East Glow’s mind once he laid eyes on Lin Yuan.","Indeed, when East Glow saw Lin Yuan, he reacted in exactly the same way that White Speak had guessed.","White Speak coughed to remind East Glow not to forget his manners.","East Glow hurriedly regained his senses and pulled his gaze away from Lin Yuan.","A true pursuer of beauty never discriminated between genders.","East Glow was knocked out by Lin Yuan’s appearance and aura but did not form any inappropriate thoughts.","East Glow was still only interested in female dimensional lifeforms.","But now that he had seen Lin Yuan, his taste had been elevated. It would probably be difficult for him to be satisfied with and settle down with another female dimensional lifeform in the future.","Even Dictator Everything’s looks were not enough to cause East Glow’s heart to skip a beat.","The Dictators who arrived at Marsh East Palace all observed the unspoken rule of avoiding each other.","But now that the Banquet of Everything was officially beginning, the Dictators were finally gathering together.","There were many trends during a meeting of Dictators due to the difference between their powers and backgrounds.","The stronger and higher status that a Dictator had, the later they would arrive.","East Glow only came to fetch Lin Yuan after he had settled all the other Dictators in their seats. Thus, Lin Yuan was the last to appear at the Banquet of Everything.","Lin Yuan exuded no aura as he walked right in front of the crowd.","Green Vine, with its aura of annihilation and its chilling beauty, trailed behind him by half a step.","Dictator Everything followed behind Green Vine.","White Speak and East Glow flanked Dictator Everything.","First Born and Third Born were delighted when they spotted Dictator Everything, but Second Born was gripped by fear.","All of the other Dictators’ eyes were fixed on Green Vine and Lin Yuan. Not even Dictator Return to Ruins was even sparing a glance at Dictator Everything, who he saw as his target.","The Dictators expected that they would not be able to catch even a hint of Lin Yuan’s aura as they had long started assuming that he was at a level above the Samsara Realm.","However, Green Vine’s aura was much too strange. The aura of annihilation almost seemed too elite!","Green Vine was not considered strong and had only reached around an Apostle’s level, but it was likely that this aura of annihilation had been gifted by Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","Dictator Ten Thousand Source was truly generous. He was willing to give all sorts of good things to his subordinates!","This was what most of the Dictators were thinking.","However, the Dictators who had experience interacting with the seven figures from Marsh Abyss felt extremely troubled.","Dictator Frost Cold and Freezing Ember shared a silent look. They could see in each other’s eyes what the other wanted to say.","The level of the annihilation aura emanating from the girl behind Dictator Ten Thousand Source was beyond even that of Dictator Hornless Dragon Source.","How was this possible!?","Dictator Tyrant Lizard had completely different thoughts from Dictator Freezing Ember and Frost Cold.","The first person to pull their eyes away from Green Vine was Dictator Treasure Seeker, who shifted his gaze onto Lin Yuan.","After looking at Lin Yuan for a moment, Dictator Treasure Seeker’s gaze swung between Lin Yuan and Dictator Demon Desire. After some internal turmoil, his gaze finally settled on Dictator Demon Desire’s face. It was as though he had just made a difficult choice.","Lin Yuan could not be bothered to guess what these Dictators were thinking.","He still possessed a large number of the Deposit Ability Litchi Branches and Storing Ability White Peaches. The next batch would be ripe soon as well.","Lin Yuan did not have much use for them and had decided that he would give them to the dimensional lifeforms who sided with him.","He needed to ensure that these Dictators sided with them when he processed the trades.","Given that Dictator Everything could supply him with a glowing dot of faith power, it meant that other Dictators could as well.","The other Dictators were in fear of Lin Yuan and had no idea that they all saw him as a fat sheep.","Dictator Everything’s gaze swept through the crowd and offered an empty smile at Second Born.","Second Born’s legs turned to jelly as she saw the endless innuendos in Dictator Everything’s eyes.","Both First Born and Third Born noticed this as well and looked at Second Born with pained expressions.","If Lin Yuan was not walking in front of Dictator Everything, Second Born would not have minded revealing her powers and killing Dictator Everything with one quick strike in front of all these Dictators.","But Second Born dared not do so now. All she did was silently wait for Dictator Everything, who had found herself a source of support, to deliver her sentence.","After Lin Yuan took his seat, Dictator Everything said softly to him, “Lord Ten Thousand Source, Second Born is very talented. You said that I can handle my subordinates how I see fit. She betrayed me because her Dictator consciousness had been awakened. This is a path that all Apostles who became Dictators have to go down. But this doesn’t mean that she can’t become loyal to other Dictators now.","“Dictator Tyrant Lizard is supported by Dictator Carnage Source while the Dictator couple, Frost Cold and Freezing Ember, are under Dictator Hornless Dragon Source’s wing.","“If Second Born did not coincidentally become a Dictator at the same time that I entered the Turning Wheel Realm, she would not have gone so far. Since she betrayed me, I definitely won’t be using her again in the future. Are you interested in taking her? If you are, you can accept her as your subordinate. I hope you will give her a chance to work for you.”","Dictator Everything thought that she hated Second Born with her entire being.","But when it really came time to sentence Second Born to death, Dictator Everything could not bring herself to do so. After all, she had raised Second Born.","Thus, Dictator Everything decided that she would create a chance for Second Born to continue living.","If Lin Yuan was unwilling to take Second Born, Dictator Everything would have no choice but to steel her heart against Second Born, who had betrayed her.","Lin Yuan did not try to understand Second Born’s circumstances, but he remembered what a sorry state Dictator Everything had been when they first met in the Palace of Everything that she had built from the ground up.","Second Born had managed to keep the fact that she had become a Dictator under wraps. This was enough to show how capable she was."]},{"number":2279,"title":"Chapter 2279: Do You Have an Explanation For This?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2279: Do You Have an Explanation For This?","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan’s gaze grazed Dictator Everything. When he saw that she was sincere, he said, “Since that’s the case, bring Second Born with you to come and see me after the Banquet of Everything ends. ‘","Dictator Everything’s words revealed her ability to see the bigger picture, which resonated with Lin Yuan. He had successfully gained the loyalty of this perceptive Dictator.","With that in mind, Lin Yuan made up his mind to reward Dictator Everything when she brought Second Born to meet him.","Since Dictator Everything had shown herself, it went without saying that First Born was no longer the representative of the Banquet of Everything.","First Born had stepped up to manage the situation when Dictator Everything disappeared as a show of loyalty.","But if First Born continued to assume the position even now that Dictator Everything was back, it would be seen as an arrogant insult.","First Born immediately came over to pay her respects to Dictator Everything.","Dictator Everything decided not to take over as host of the Banquet of Everything. Instead, she told First Born to continue acting as the host. She even praised First Born for doing a good job of managing the Palace of Everything in her absence.","Dictator Everything had already decided to cling to Lin Yuan. Otherwise, she would never have decided to give Second Born this chance, no matter how strong their emotional ties had been.","In Dictator Everything’s eyes, Second Born was nothing more than another tool she could leverage to get into Lin Yuan’s good books.","The Dictators abided by the law of the jungle, and their hearts were full of schemes.","After First Born received the order from Dictator Everything, she returned to the platform and began to speak.","Only the Apostles were paying close attention to what First Born was saying. Meanwhile, the Dictators’ eyes never even landed on First Born.","Many of them sent silent signals to Lin Yuan while he nodded in reply.","It would have been fine if Lin Yuan had not smiled. But his smile immediately caused Dictator Treasure Seeker to feel as though a giant headlight of charm had been turned on to full force and directed at him full force. The force of it even caused Dictator Demon Desire’s beauty to pale slightly in comparison.","Dictator Treasure Seeker could not help but feel conflicted. He was like a fan trying to decide between two celebrities to commit himself to.","Lin Yuan’s appearance was so astonishing and Green Vine’s aura was so mesmerizing that Dictator Freezing Ember, Cold Frost, and Tyrant Lizard, who had planned on investigating Lin Yuan, were momentarily at a loss about what to do next.","Nonetheless, Dictator Freezing Ember and Cold Frost had the support of Dictator Hornless Dragon Source, while Dictator Tyrant Lizard had the support of Dictator Carnage Source. Thus, none of them were afraid of Lin Yuan.","A strange state settled over the scene.","No conflicts broke out.","This caused Dictator Pregnant Poison to grind her teeth in frustration.","Dictator Everything was by Lin Yuan’s side.","It was evident that Dictator Return to Ruins had the same goal as her, but he was now putting on a coward’s show. Without chaos, she would not have any opportunities to insert herself!","Dictator Demon Desire was only one step away from reaching the Turning Wheel Realm.","Dictator Demon Desire and Return to Ruins were in similar situations. But with Dictator Treasure Seeker’s help, Dictator Demon Desire was only lacking in pure source-type power.","If left to her own devices, it would take Dictator Demon Desire at least 1, 500 years to gather the amount of pure source-type power she needed.","Source-type power was very important to Dictators.","Despite knowing of Dictator Treasure Seeker’s affection for her, she dared not ask him for source-type power.","Dictator “IVrant Lizard was impulsive and unreliable.","But in order to ensure that she still had a source of support to rely on after entering the Turning Wheel Realm, she could not allow Dictator Treasure Seeker to form feelings of resentment toward her.","Although Dictator Demon Desire made no move to reciprocate, reject, or take responsibility for Treasure Seeker and Tyrant Lizard, she had internally always leaned toward Dictator Treasure Seeker.","Dictator Demon Desire needed to obtain source fruits from Lin Yuan to shorten the time it took for her to enter the Turning Wheel Realm.","With the calmness of the scene, Dictator Demon Desire had no segue. Thus, she decided to have Dictator Tyrant Lizard open up the way for her.","Dictator Demon Desire was well aware of what she needed to do.","She gently nudged Dictator Tyrant Lizard’s muscular side with her arm and said softly, “Tyrant Lizard, I find myself being unable to tear my gaze from Dictator Ten Thousand Source! I really want to have dinner with him and chat about life on the Love Bone Spring Grace Boat!”","Dictator Demon Desire activated her source totem’s power while speaking to prevent Dictator Treasure Seeker from overhearing.","Dictator “IVrant Lizard did not have time to be happy over the fact that Dictator Demon Desire spoke to him when he felt a chill go up his spine due to the tone that Dictator Demon Desire had taken.","It went without saying that a lapdog could not vent its anger on the goddess it worshipped. Thus, Dictator Tyrant Lizard transferred all of his fury onto Lin","Yuan.","Normally, a Dictator would never forget their manners regardless of how furious they were.","But when Tyrant Lizard told Dictator Carnage Source about Dictator Ten Thousand Source, Dictator Carnage Source had instructed him to test Lin Yuan. Dictator “IVrant Lizard did not want to be the one with his head on the chopping block. He was terrified that he would end up being taken advantage of.","But Dictator Tyrant Lizard was so angry that he let his childish side take over this time, and he took a step forward and looked into Lin Yuan’s eyes as he said loudly, “Dictator Ten Thousand Source, do you know that your name is an offense to the seven figures from Marsh Abyss? Do you have any explanation for this?","“Many of us came for the small source fruits you possess. Otherwise, we would never attend such a trivial event like the Banquet of Everything. We have already fed your pride to such an extent. Don’t you think that you should offer some sort of gesture? ‘","Dictator Pregnant Poison silently praised Dictator Tyrant Lizard’s sudden attempt to stir up trouble. Good job, my rival!","Dictator Freezing Ember and Cold Frost shared a look and leaned back into their chairs as they waited to see how Lin Yuan reacted to Dictator Tyrant Lizard.","Dictator “IVrant Lizard had mentioned the seven figures. Lin Yuan’s attitude toward Tyrant Lizard would show everyone how much heat he was packing.","Dictator Treasure Seeker had no idea what Dictator Demon Desire had said to Dictator “IVrant Lizard, but he was certain that it was related to what Dictator Tyrant Lizard just did.","As enamored as Dictator Treasure Seeker was by Dictator Demon Desire’s appearance, he was no moron. He was well aware that Dictator Demon Desire had been using him and Tyrant Lizard and had struck an almost beautiful balance between them.","Dictator Treasure Seeker only cared about appearance. As long as she was the most beautiful one around, he did not care about anything else.","However, Dictator Tyrant Lizard felt genuine love for Demon Desire and was much more sincere than Treasure Seeker, who was solely concerned with appearance.","But it was clear that Dictator Demon Desire was taking advantage of Tyrant Lizard.","Dictator Treasure Seeker would not have cared before he encountered a face more beautiful than the one that Dictator Demon Desire possessed.","But now, one such face had appeared.","Thus, Dictator Demon Desire’s negative actions would be amplified in Dictator Treasure Seeker’s eyes.","At that moment, Dictator Treasure Seeker’s eyes were no longer on Dictator Demon Desire but fully directed at Lin Yuan.","Dictator Everything and Director East Glow were about to respond to what Dictator “IVrant Lizard said when White Speak took a step forward and spoke with firmness in spite of its obvious nervousness.."]},{"number":2280,"title":"Chapter 2280: Consequence of Recklessness!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2280: Consequence of Recklessness!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“If one of the seven figures with the word ‘source’ in their name decides to come and personally ask my Lord about his name, he might be willing to give them an answer. Are you asking because you can speak on behalf of those seven figures? Also, what gives you the right to speak to my Lord?","Dictator Everything and East Glow felt as though White Speak was extremely brave.","But White Speak’s actions had indeed preserved Lin Yuan’s pride.","If Lin Yuan had spoken to Dictator Tyrant Lizard himself, his authority would have been undermined.","A Samsara Realm Dictator should never speak to a Turning Wheel Realm Dictator under any circumstances.","It was not just Dictator Everything and East Glow who felt that White Speak was brave. Even the other Dictators and Apostles were looking at White Speak with astonishment.","An Apostle would have to be under immense pressure to speak to a Turning Wheel Realm Dictator in such a way, even if it had a source of support.","For an Apostle to have the audacity to speak to Dictator Tyrant Lizard in such a way, it caused the other Dictators to reaffirm their belief that Lin Yuan was extraordinary.","Dictator “I?rant Lizard had already been fuming. But now, he had just been insulted by a mere higher average Apostle. There was no way that Dictator Tyrant Lizard could take this lying down.","There was only one way that Dictator Tyrant Lizard could recover his pride: to strike and kill White Speak. Otherwise, no matter where he went, he would be seen as the Dictator who had been humiliated by an Apostle.","Dictator “I?rant Lizard felt that as long as he did not kill White Speak and only taught it a lesson, Lin Yuan would refrain from killing him on account of Dictator Carnage Source.","As such, Dictator Tyrant Lizard raised his hand, and two giant images of charging lizards shot toward White Speak.","There were many dimensional worlds related to lizards in the marsh world.","Dictator “I?rant Lizard’s original form was the Titan Demon Lizard. He was much larger than the Medusa Giant Lizards and was more skilled at close-quarter combat.","The two lizard images that Dictator “I?rant Lizard released were not imbued with too much power. Even if they made contact with White Speak, they would only end up taking half of its life.","The best way for Lin Yuan to demonstrate his formidability and stun all of the Dictators present was to make an example out of someone.","Since Dictator Tyrant Lizard had made the first move, Lin Yuan did not hold back either.","Although he had no use for Dictator source totems, he could give them to the others from Sky City.","When the two lizard images were closing in on White Speak, Lin Yuan slowly raised his hand, and a pink and gold stream of water shot out from the tip of his finger like a streak of lightning.","The stream water formed a perfect arc and caused the two lizard images to disappear, thereby nullifying Dictator Tyrant Lizard’s attack.","But the stream of water did not halt and shot toward Dictator “I?rant Lizard.","Begin Lady intentionally hid its aura when it attacked to prevent its aura from being exposed.","As a result, ‘IVrant Lizard and all of the Dictators present could not sense anything special about the pink and gold stream of water that had shot out from Lin Yuan’s finger.","Yet, the seemingly normal stream of pink and gold water had nullified Dictator Tyrant Lizard’s attack.","Dictator “I?rant Lizard dared not be complacent when he saw the stream of water moving toward him and activated his Dictator’s body.","But before Dictator ‘IVrant Lizard’s Dictator’s body could form fully, the pink and gold stream of water changed into a circle that trapped Dictator “IVrant","Lizard.","Soon, pink and gold flames lit up on the ring of water.","The pink and gold flames seemed capable of burning a hole in the sky. A terrifying power permeated the air, and the other Dictators almost let out squeaks of fear.","Dictator “I?rant Lizard’s wail of pain seemed to stoke the brilliant pink and gold flames. But the pink and gold flames soon entered Dictator Tyrant Lizard’s open mouth and tumbled down his throat, sealing all sound off.","The flames burned in the sky for less than a minute and were about to disappear when nine colors slowly enveloped a tooth-shaped spike.","The stream of pink and gold water that was devoid of aura returned to Dictator Ten Thousand Source’s hand.","With that, the advanced Turning Wheel Realm Dictator Tyrant Lizard’s life came to an end.","Lin Yuan was currently toying with Dictator Tyrant Lizard’s source totem in his hand. It was as though Dictator Tyrant Lizard had never existed in this world or attended the Banquet of Everything.","Dictator Demon Desire had intended to use Dictator Tyrant Lizard to open up the path. But she had not expected him to die before he achieved what she wanted.","Dictator Frost Cold and Freezing Ember were Dictator Hornless Dragon","Source’s close subordinates but rarely had the chance to meet him. Dictator Hornless Dragon Source could also kill Dictator “I?rant Lizard easily, but would it also have seemed so casual?","Lin Yuan toyed with Dictator Tyrant Lizard’s source totem for a while before he realized that there were nine colors to the light that enveloped it.","He could not help but think back to the color of the Grace Queen and Sword of Service’s source totems.","At that moment, Morbius’ voice sounded in Lin Yuan’s head. “When a Class 4 dimensional rift evolves into a Class 5 dimensional rift, there is a chance of a Dictator’s sacred source lifeform being discovered. The Grace Queen had indeed come from a Dictator’s source totem, while the Sword of Service had come from an Apostle’s source totem. If both sacred source lifeforms are equally matched, there would be no distinction of one being more superior than the other.’","Lin Yuan nodded to himself. Only a sacred source lifeform that came from a Dictator could have abilities as strong as the ones that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen possessed.","However, he did not know what level of Dictator the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had been.","If Lin Yuan ever had the opportunity to explore the water world dimensional world, he might be able to find a clue to the answer.","The Dictators present wanted to discuss the trading of the source fruits with Lin Yuan but did not know how to broach the subject.","Lin Yuan possessed a large number of the Storing Ability White Peaches and Deposit Ability Litchi Branches. He had intended to trade them for resources and faith power at the Banquet of Everything.","Since Dictator Tyrant Lizard had already broached the topic, Lin Yuan decided to continue with the topic even after Dictator Tyrant Lizard had died.","“All of you must be interested in the source fruits I possess. I only give the source fruits to my friends. I not only have small source fruits but big source fruits as well. ‘","While he spoke, Lin Yuan took out a wooden box that contained ten pairs of the Storing Ability White Peaches and Deposit Ability Litchi Branches.","Lin Yuan handed the wooden box to Dictator East Glow and said, “Go and give one small source fruit and large source fruit to each Dictator present so they can have a taste!”","East Glow hurriedly received the wooden box from Lin Yuan. Just as it was about to distribute the source fruits, a figure materialized out of black fluid in midair.","Flashes of red swimming around the black fluid outlined the shape of Dictator Pregnant Poison’s figure.."]},{"number":2281,"title":"Chapter 2281: Oh, It’s Time to Fight for Favor!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2281: Oh, It’s Time to Fight for Favor!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Dictator Pregnant Poison did not hesitate to take the seat that Dictator Tyrant Lizard had left open.","She looked at Lin Yuan and said sweetly, “I’m sure Lord Ten Thousand Source won’t mind sharing the big source fruits and small source fruits with me too!”","Dictator Pregnant Poison’s words caused the gazes of all the Dictators to turn strange, and the tension that formed after Dictator Ten Thousand Source killed Dictator “I?rant Lizard broke immediately.","Many Dictators there had interacted with Dictator Pregnant Poison in the past.","Dictator Pregnant Poison had the support of Dictator Evil Source and acted both without mercy or morality. There was a period in the past when she killed all the Apostles in her path.","If Dictator Evil Source had not saved her, she might have been killed by Dictator Eternal Source.","Her source totem’s ability allowed her to be skilled at hiding. If a pinnacle Turning Wheel Realm Dictator like Treasure Seeker tried to survey the surroundings without activating his source sacred body, he would not be able to detect her.","Dictator Pregnant Poison had to have a reason for hiding.","Her sudden appearance could only be because Dictator Ten Thousand Source had started giving out the small source fruits and big source fruits.","Her behavior was almost too shameless to stomach.","But with Dictator Evil Source’s support, her status was indeed higher than that of Dictator Tyrant Lizard.","Dictator Frost Cold and Freezing Ember pursed their lips.","They would never have the courage to appear just to ask for benefits if it were them.","Dictator Everything narrowed her eyes at Dictator Pregnant Poison.","Out of all the Dictators present, Dictator Everything and Pregnant Poison had interacted the most with each other. Dictator Everything had never managed to gain the upper hand in any of their clashes.","Dictator Everything could sense Dictator Pregnant Poison coveting her. But rather than coveting her, Dictator Pregnant Poison was more after her source totem.","Furthermore, Dictator Pregnant Poison did not try to hide how much she desired Dictator Everything’s source totem.","If Second Born had not suddenly become a Dictator, Dictator Everything would be the wariest of Dictator Pregnant Poison.","Because of her familiarity with Dictator Pregnant Poison, Dictator Everything knew that Dictator Pregnant Poison was always aware of boundaries.","Now that she had joined Lin Yuan, Dictator Pregnant Poison would no longer try to target her regardless of how much she desired her source totem.","While Dictator Everything was examining Dictator Pregnant Poison, the latter was doing the same to Dictator Everything.","Dictator Pregnant Poison had winked at Dictator Everything more than once.","Dictator Everything did not intend to tell Lin Yuan about her grudge against Dictator Pregnant Poison.","She was already blessed enough to have Lin Yuan’s protection.","Dictator Everything was well aware of her status.","If she told Lin Yuan about her grudge against Dictator Pregnant Poison and Lin Yuan stepped in to help her deal with her, he would definitely end up offending Dictator Evil Source, who supported Dictator Pregnant Poison.","Dictator Evil Source was always the most uninhibited and fearless of the seven figures. A creature who had changed from male to female, and switched between the two genders for some time before landing on one, did not act under any reasonable logic.","Even if Lin Yuan was not afraid of Dictator Evil Source, she would not have anything to repay him with. What she needed to do was to do her best to improve herself while she was under his protection until Dictator Pregnant Poison was no longer capable of touching even a hair on her body.","At that time, Dictator Pregnant Poison would no longer pose any threat.","Rather, it would be Dictator Pregnant Poison who would be worried about her.","Thus, when Dictator Pregnant Poison winked at her, Dictator Everything’s lips stretched into a cold smile.","Lin Yuan had been using True Data to check on his surroundings, so he had discovered Dictator Pregnant Poison’s presence long ago.","It was not just Morbius’ True Data but Begin Lady, who had set its spirit fire alight, could also see through Dictator Pregnant Poison’s disguise and locate her with ease.","Lin Yuan looked at Dictator Pregnant Poison and said, “If we’re friends, it goes without saying that you’ll be able to taste the small and big source fruits.”","It did not take long for East Glow to distribute the small and big fruits in the box.","After receiving thousands of units of source-type power from Lin Yuan, East Glow was not at all interested in the small and big source fruits.","While it was distributing the small and big source fruits, the other Dictators noticed East Glow’s attitude toward the big and small source fruits, causing them to feel a jumble of emotions.","All of these Dictators were well aware of East Glow’s capabilities. He was nothing more than a native of the Marsh East Circle. He had not been capable enough to become a Dictator and presided over Marsh East Palace with the power of a pinnacle Apostle.","If this were in the past, East Glow would have never acted in such a way toward the big and small source fruits.","East Glow had only changed after he met Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","In such a short period, Dictator Ten Thousand Source had not only increased East Glow’s power but also broadened his horizons.","It was much more difficult to broaden horizons than it was to increase one’s power.","There could only be two possibilities for such an occurrence.","The first was that Dictator Ten Thousand Source had a large quantity of the big and small source fruits.","The second possibility was that Dictator Ten Thousand Source was extremely generous and did not hesitate to give his subordinates source-type power.","But regardless of which reason it was, the Dictators and their Apostles were all extremely envious of East Glow.","Dictator Return to Ruins looked at the big and small source fruits in his hands and sensed the pure source-type power within before he looked at the image of East Glow’s back and fell deep into thought.","Ever since Dictator Return to Ruins became a Dictator, he had never considered ever becoming loyal to another Dictator.","All he ever thought about was breaking through to the Turning Wheel Realm, continuing to enjoy life as a king in the Polar Sea Large Lake, and basking in being worshiped by Apostles.","But now, his mind had changed.","If he, like East Glow, became loyal to Dictator Ten Thousand Source, could the latter help him to break through as well? Would he also be rewarded with a large number of source fruits?","When this thought popped into Dictator Return to Ruins’ mind, it took root.","As for Dictator Everything, Dictator Return to Ruins had long forgotten about her. He might even end up colleagues with her in the future. If that were the case, he would have to do his best to fight for favor with her!","The Dictators present examined the big and small source fruits in their hands.","When the red scaly skin of the small source fruits was peeled, sweet and juicy flesh was revealed underneath. There was a hint of sourness within the sweetness that caused anyone to salivate.","This fruit had much better flavor than most of the fruits that carnivorous plants produced.","When they saw that the small source fruits contained a large seed, all of the Dictators hurriedly stored the seeds away so they could try to grow the small source fruits themselves.","Lin Yuan saw what the Dictators were doing but did not intend to stop them.","The Storing Ability White Peaches and Deposit Ability Litchi Branches’ seeds would never sprout. They were usually only nurtured through separation. When their seeds were buried, the only result would be a pile of foul-smelling rotting soil.."]},{"number":2282,"title":"Chapter 2282: Are You Willing to Give Me a Chance?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2282: Are You Willing to Give Me a Chance?","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","After the Dictators were done eating the Deposit Ability Litchi Branches, they went on to taste the Storing Ability White Peaches.","The Dictators were much more careful when they ate the big source fruits as compared to when they ate the small source fruits.","At first, the Dictators were only in awe of the taste of the small source fruits. But it did not take long for them to realize what was impressive about the small source fruits.","The source-type power within the small source fruits was even purer than the source-type power within their bodies.","After sensing the benefits of such a small amount of pure source-type power, the Dictators felt a bliss that they had never experienced before in the past.","Dictator Frost Cold, Freezing Ember, and Pregnant Poison had all PEVElUJE? source-type power by Dictator Evil Source and Hornless Dragon Source in the past.","It was true that the source-type power from those two Dictators had been purer than the one in their bodies, but it was a way away from being as pure as the source-type power within the small source fruits.","This discovery put the three of them in a state of disbelief.","Dictator Freezing Ember and Frost Cold shared a look and saw fear in each other’s eyes.","The source-type power was so pure that it had the power of Dictators. Could it be that Dictator Ten Thousand Source was even stronger than Dictator Hornless Dragon Source, who they were loyal to?","Where had Dictator Ten Thousand Source come from?","Previously, they had taken an assessing attitude toward Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","Their attitudes toward Dictator Ten Thousand Source only changed when he killed Dictator Tyrant Lizard, and they acknowledged that he had the right to include the word ‘source’ in his name.","But the small source fruits allowed Dictator Freezing Ember and Frost Cold to gain a deeper understanding of Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","Both of them decided to taste the big source fruits carefully in order to confirm their guess.","Dictator Pregnant Poison always put herself first. An individual like this would be quick to switch sides if they ever decided to join a camp.","Dictator Pregnant Poison saw Dictator Evil Source as a stepping stone and often used his name to obtain benefits.","But now, Dictator Pregnant Poison regretted not waiting until she had the chance to become loyal to Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","Dictator Evil Source was not as generous as Dictator Ten Thousand Source, who casually gave out source-type power.","There was a big difference between an Apostle offering its faith to a Dictator compared to becoming loyal to a Dictator.","Once an Apostle became loyal to a Dictator, the Dictator would be able to get a sense of what the Dictator was thinking. If the Apostle formed any thoughts of betraying its Dictator, the Dictator would immediately become aware of it.","But there were no such concerns once it became a Dictator.","Dictator Evil Source had no clue that Dictator Pregnant Poison had just uttered words against him.","Dictator Frost Cold and Freezing Ember’s speculations were confirmed once they consumed the big source fruits.","Both of them were hesitant about telling Dictator Hornless Dragon Source about this news.","It would be fine if Dictator Hornless Dragon Source had sensed this for himself, but if the news came from both of them, they would be essentially saying that","Dictator Hornless Dragon Source was weaker than Dictator Ten Thousand","Source. This could very well earn them Dictator Hornless Dragon Source’s ire.","While the two of them were thinking, Dictator Treasure Seeker, who had silently finished eating the big and small source fruits, was now staring at Lin Yuan’s face instead of Pregnant Demon Desire.","All lapdogs had an affliction. When their two targets had similar levels of beauty, they would focus on the target with higher status.","Dictator Demon Desire had been feeling sullen over Dictator “IVrant Lizard’s death.","As one of her two biggest lapdogs, Dictator Tyrant Lizard might not be able to be of as much help as Dictator Treasure Seeker, but he still had his uses. Dictator Pregnant Poison had even arrived and taken Dictator Tyrant Lizard’s seat.","The poisonous vapors emanating from Dictator Pregnant Poison forced Dictator Demon Desire to hold her breath.","However, there was nothing that Dictator Demon Desire could say when Dictator Pregnant Poison had the support of Dictator Evil Source. All she could do was silently keep her guard up against and focus on Dictator Pregnant Poison.","She was terrified that Dictator Pregnant Poison would be mad enough to attack her. After all, she had done something similar numerous times in the past.","Dictator Pregnant Poison was the most unpopular Dictator in all the marsh circles.","She did not have any Apostles who were loyal to her. Only those of the same species as Dictator Pregnant Poison or those who had blood relations with her could stand to be with her for prolonged periods.","If any Apostle became loyal to Dictator Pregnant Poison, it would be no different from committing suicide.","Although Dictator Pregnant Poison had become much less wild after getting on Dictator Eternal Source’s wrong side, she still saw killing Apostles as her hobby.","Dictator Demon Desire did not notice that Dictator Treasure Seeker’s expression and eye line had changed. Otherwise, she would have definitely regretted coming to attend this nuisance of a Banquet of Everything.","If she had not insisted on coming, Dictator Treasure Seeker would not have come with her and had the chance to meet Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","Lin Yuan silently waited for all of the Dictators to finish eating the big and small source fruits. When the slowest Dictator, Dictator Return to Ruins, swallowed the last morsel of fruit, Lin Yuan declared loudly, “l want to build an alliance that I will head up. If you join my alliance, you will be able to trade with me for the big and small source fruits. All of you are Dictators and have met the standard to join my alliance. You can decide for yourselves if you want to join.”","Lin Yuan’s words had opened up the floor of discussion and placed the topic of the big and small source fruits at center stage.","All of the Dictators were already looking solemn as they were deep in thought. This included Dictator Freezing Ember, Frost Cold, and Pregnant Poison.","Dictator Return to Ruins did not just want to trade for the big and small source fruits. What he wanted was to cling to Lin Yuan.","If he joined the alliance, he would only be able to touch Lin Yuan. This would be a far cry from clinging to him.","Dictator Return to Ruins acted decisively.","When he decided that he wanted to target Dictator Everything, he immediately left to head to the Banquet of Everything.","Since he had decided to become loyal to Dictator Ten Thousand Source, Dictator Return to Ruins did not hesitate and stood up as he said, “Lord Ten Thousand Source, I am answering your call. Not only do I want to join your alliance, but I also want to stay by your side for the long run, just like East Glow and Everything. Are you willing to give me a chance?”","Dictator Return to Ruins spoke his mind without hesitation, not holding back any of his words. Accompanied by his subordinate Apostles, he made his intentions clear.","While it was typical for Apostles to feel humiliated when their own Dictator expressed such sentiments, Dictator Return to Ruins had a different objective in mind. He desired to pledge his loyalty to Dictator Ten Thousand Source, understanding that it would ultimately benefit the Apostles under his command.","The stronger Dictator Return to Ruins became, the more resources he would acquire, leading to greater rewards for his loyal Apostles.."]},{"number":2283,"title":"Chapter 2283: What a Horrible Woman!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2283: What a Horrible Woman!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","None of the other Dictators mocked Dictator Return to Ruins either.","Dictator Ten Thousand Source’s power had already been recognized, and all of the Dictators present agreed that he could stand toe to toe with the seven figures from Marsh Abyss. Thus, Dictator Return to Ruins was making a very smart choice for his future.","Dictator Return to Ruins came from an unorthodox path and did not have a source of support, nor was he as powerful as Dictator Freezing Ember, Cold Frost, and Pregnant Poison. Hence, none of them felt threatened by him in the least.","But if Dictator Ten Thousand Source accepted him, they could not continue acting so arrogantly in front of him.","When Lin Yuan heard what Dictator Return to Ruins said, he fixed his gaze squarely on him.","Dictator Everything had told Lin Yuan about Dictator Return to Ruins, so he knew that Dictator Return to Ruins was very strong. He had killed other Dictators not long after becoming a Dictator himself.","As such, it would be very worthwhile to nurture him.","However, Dictator Return to Ruins would have to demonstrate sufficient sincerity if he wanted to follow Lin Yuan.","“You’re welcome to become part of the alliance. But you will have to speak with me privately after the Banquet of Everything ends to discuss joining and becoming loyal to me.”","Dictator Return to Ruins’ biggest worry was that Dictator Ten Thousand Source would turn him down outright. Yet, Dictator Ten Thousand Source did not do so and even gave him a chance for a meeting. Clearly, he wanted to judge how sincere he was.","The last thing that Dictator Return to Ruins lacked was sincerity.","As long as Dictator Ten Thousand Source could help him to enter the Turning Wheel Realm, he would not mind offering up everything that he had.","After all, once he broke through, and after Dictator Ten Thousand Source protected him through the awlwvard phase of being powerless, he would be able to earn back everything with some effort.","Dictator Return to Ruins bowed to Lin Yuan before he took a seat.","Dictator Treasure Seeker did not understand why Dictator Ten Thousand Source would want to start an alliance.","Nonetheless, Dictator Treasure Seeker had already completely transferred how he felt about Dictator Demon Desire onto Lin Yuan.","According to the lapdog creed of self-improvement, Dictator Treasure Seeker needed to find a way to do something beneficial for Lin Yuan.","Dictator Treasure Seeker was always interested in treasures and said to Lin Yuan, “Most respected Lord Ten Thousand Source, do we need to offer anything in return in order to join the alliance and trade for the big and small source fruit? Can Dictators who are already loyal to the seven figures also join the alliance?”","Dictator Treasure Seeker was helping the other Dictators by asking for clarity so that Dictator Ten Thousand Source would explain further. Otherwise, there were some things that would be inappropriate for Dictator Frost Cold, Freezing Ember, and Pregnant Poison to say.","As for Dictator Demon Desire, it was likely that she was trying to come up with a way to use her looks to obtain benefits from Dictator Ten Thousand Source without paying anything in return!","What a horrible and shameless woman!","Lin Yuan looked at Dictator Treasure Seeker and noticed that he was looking at him with a strange gaze.","But it could not be denied that Lin Yuan had been waiting for someone to ask this exact question.","“You can join the alliance even if you have already pledged your loyalty to other Dictators. But whether your Dictator is willing to let you join is your personal Issue.","“After joining the alliance, you can choose to provide your own faith power or the faith power from the Apostles under you to trade for the big and small source fruits. You can reward your Apostles as you see fit.","“It goes without saying that I will lead an alliance I set up. You will need to listen to my orders when I give you tasks. I am confident that you will be satisfied with your remuneration.”","When Lin Yuan noticed that the level of the Dictator he was pretending to be had reached the Samsara Realm and was on the same level as the seven figures from Marsh Abyss, he could switch from trying to establish partnerships to ordering others to work under him.","Given his power and the effects of the small source fruits, Lin Yuan believed that none of the Dictators would refuse to join the alliance.","Lin Yuan’s words led Dictator Frost Cold and Freezing Ember to come to a decision. They were going to join Lin Yuan’s alliance.","Since they would not have to pledge their loyalties and only needed to carry out tasks, they would not need to change their current status of being loyal to Dictator Hornless Dragon Source.","It was unlikely that Dictator Hornless Dragon Source would come down on them for such a matter.","Dictator Frost Cold and Freezing Ember wanting to join the alliance annoyed Dictator Pregnant Poison.","Dictator Hornless Dragon Source might not care about his subordinates joining such an alliance that did not require its members to pledge their loyalties, but the Dictator Evil Source that Dictator Pregnant Poison knew and was loyal to would never agree to it.","Thus, she could not join the alliance and had lost the chance to trade for the big and small source fruits.","At that moment, the ever-self-centered Dictator Pregnant Poison hoped that Dictator Evil Source would drop dead.","It was an unbelievably good deal to be able to trade for big and small source fruits with their subordinate Apostles’ faith power. How was this any different from picking up source-type power from the ground?","Every Dictator was currently hatching their own scheme. The only person whose mind was blank was Second Born.","When she saw Dictator Everything by Dictator Ten Thousand Source’s side, Second Born was sure that she was done for. She had wanted to kill Dictator Everything, so there was no way the latter would let her off.","She was likely still alive because Dictator Everything did not want to prevent the Banquet of Everything from proceeding normally.","Second Born had thought about pleading to Dictator Ten Thousand Source for mercy and asking to join him as a way of surviving.","However, Second Born did not think that she would be able to offer more value than Dictator Everything, who had already entered the Turning Wheel Realm.","At that moment, an air of desolation had materialized in the air and seemed to turn the entire Marsh East Palace into an ancient battleground that was littered with corpses.","Many Apostles found it difficult to breathe because of this air of desolation. Only Dictators were able to stand it.","From the moment they sensed this aura, the Dictators who were aware immediately recognized it as coming from Dictator Carnage Source.","Dictator Carnage Source had been the source of support for Dictator Tyrant Lizard, who Dictator Ten Thousand Source had just killed.","Dictator Carnage Source had actually turned up personally!","Given the strength of Dictator Carnage Source’s legs, there was no way that he had rushed over only after hearing of Dictator Tyrant Lizard’s death. He must have already been in the Marsh East Circle.","When he heard about Dictator Ten Thousand Source from Tyrant Lizard, he had left to head to the Banquet of Everything.","Regardless of Dictator Carnage Source’s goal, Dictator Ten Thousand Source had essentially slighted Dictator Carnage Source by killing Dictator Tyrant","Lizard.","For the sake of his pride, Dictator Carnage Source had to come and confront Lin Yuan.","All of the Dictators and Apostles who were present became nervous.","If two Dictators from the Samsara Realm started fighting, the mountains would start to shake, and the tsunamis would rise.."]},{"number":2284,"title":"Chapter 2284: Setting Up and Using a Segue","paragraphs":["Chapter 2284: Setting Up and Using a Segue","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Fights between Samsara Realm Dictators might not result in death, and they would continue to avoid each other in the future, but they would instruct their subordinates to take over the fight to cause a war to break out.","Such a situation had happened in the past, and the biggest victim had been the entire Marsh East Circle.","It was always best to be prepared.","Was the Marsh East Circle going to have to suffer through another war?","The air of desolation formed a harrowing wail, and the figures of six Turning Wheel Realm Dictators appeared in midair.","The six Turning Wheel Realm Dictators positioned themselves facing each other in pairs, assuming a kneeling position on the ground, thus forming a makeshift throne.","Among them emerged a short-haired, muscular man who took his place on the throne. His distinct features included red eyes and gray hair.","He held a remarkable three-meter-long knife in his left hand that radiated a mesmerizing display of nine colors. The knife was undoubtedly a Dictator’s source totem, a testament to its origin from a Dictator who had successfully transcended the Turning Wheel Realm. The luminance of the light emitted by the knife further affirmed its prestigious lineage.","Dictator Carnage Source sensed Dictator Tyrant Lizard’s death and silently fixed his cold eyes onto Lin Yuan. It was as though he was waiting for Lin Yuan to offer an explanation.","Only Dictator Carnage Source’s close subordinates had the right to be by his side.","But at that moment, none of the Turning Wheel Realm Dictators dared to stick their necks out to say a word against Lin Yuan.","It was best for these Turning Wheel Realms to play it safe when they were in the presence of a Samsara Realm Dictator.","Given their understanding of Dictator Carnage Source, he was probably trying to pick up the pieces of his pride and would not genuinely try to attack Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","If he was injured, there was a high chance that the other six figures would take advantage of him.","The seven Dictators in Marsh Abyss who had the word ‘source’ at the back of their names might be allies at certain times, but they were also rivals.","After Dictator Carnage Source appeared, Lin Yuan found out about Dictator Carnage Source’s power through communicating with Begin Lady.","Dictator Carnage Source’s aura was even stronger than that of Begin Lady. This meant that Begin Lady would be at a disadvantage if it had to fight Dictator Carnage Source.","But this did not mean that there was no way of fighting.","If Green Vine interfered during a fight between Begin Lady and Dictator Carnage Source, the latter would definitely take a hit.","But this did not mean that Lin Yuan’s side would be able to escape unscathed. In fact, he might even end up paying a higher price than Dictator Carnage Source.","Lin Yuan looked calmly at Dictator Carnage Source, and his eyes showed no intention of dodging.","This stalemate allowed Dictator Carnage Source to understand Lin Yuan’s stance.","As a result, Dictator Carnage Source was rather awkward.","You were the one who killed a Dictator who was under me. How can you expect me to lower my head first? Ridiculous!","If Dictator Carnage Source could clearly sense Lin Yuan’s power, he would have pushed on with the stalemate.","But the key point was that Dictator Carnage Source could not sense Lin Yuan’s power.","Green Vine’s aura of annihilation frightened Dictator Carnage Source. He could be certain that this aura would definitely be able to harm him if it exploded. Thus, he decided to stop the stalemate.","In his long life, ever since calling himself Carnage Source, he had never been unable to sense the power of another being.","All Dictator Carnage Source could do was scoff before asking, “Ten Thousand Source, can I ask what Tyrant Lizard did to anger you that you had to kill him?”","Dictator Carnage Source’s words caused all of the Dictators present, including Dictator East Glow and Everything, to look shocked.","Firstly, Dictator Carnage Source had addressed Lin Yuan as ‘Ten Thousand Source’, meaning that he acknowledged this name. This meant that there would no longer be seven figures from Marsh Abyss, but eight!","Furthermore, Dictator Carnage Source’s cold and haughty tone was not due to him trying to put Dictator Ten Thousand Source at a spot but a segue that he had created for Dictator Ten Thousand Source to use.","Otherwise, there would be no need for Dictator Carnage Source to speak first and clash against Dictator Carnage Source’s aura. A more normal behavior would be to demand compensation from Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","Regardless of what Dictator Tyrant Lizard had done wrong, the fact remained that one of Dictator Carnage Source’s people had died while no one from Dictator Ten Thousand Source’s side had lost their lives.","Lin Yuan smiled faintly when he heard what Dictator Carnage Source said. This was a similar smile that he had put on when he faced Dictator Tyrant Lizard.","However, Lin Yuan had no intention of attacking Dictator Carnage Source.","What a joke. If they really started to fight, he would be the one suffering a bigger loss.","Lin Yuan was pretending to be a Dictator and was harvesting the resources he needed from the marsh world.","As such, it went without saying that he needed to take the segue that Dictator Carnage Source had created. Otherwise, if Dictator Carnage Source felt forced and ended up attacking him, he would have no choice but to give up on his act. “Your subordinate attacked my follower right in front of me. What would you have done if you were me?”","Lin Yuan’s words were reasonable.","Yet, when Dictator Carnage Source heard his words, his expression hardened.","Lin Yuan’s words seemed to be an explanation, but he was actually shirking responsibility and pushing the blame onto Dictator Carnage Source’s side.","This was not the behavior of one who was taking the segue.","I already set up the segue. Are you not going to take it? Do you think that you can do whatever you want with me?","Just as Dictator Carnage Source was about to speak, Lin Yuan went on to say, “l have established an alliance. Are you willing to join it? After joining the alliance, you will be given the right to share in the benefits and manage the alliance. I won’t restrain you in any way. ‘","If Lin Yuan was the king of the alliance, Lin Yuan’s words to Dictator Carnage Source were essentially offering Dictator Carnage Source the chance to be a king of equal status.","Dictator Carnage Source had appeared in time to hear Lin Yuan’s explanation of the alliance. Thus, he knew that this alliance could lead to him trading for the big and small source fruits.","Pure source-type power was also useful to Samsara Realm Dictators. This was why Samsara Realm Dictators were also unwilling to give away pure source-type power as rewards.","Lin Yuan’s words meant that Dictator Carnage Source would enjoy equal status with him and would also allow Dictator Carnage Source to fulfill his aim of coming.","Dictator Carnage Source happily accepted this means to an end.","A smile spread across Dictator Carnage Source’s cold and chiseled face.","He walked over to Lin Yuan and reached out his fist.","Bumping fists was a gesture of respect and agreement in the marsh world.","Lin Yuan gently bumped his fist against Dictator Carnage Source’s fist.","At that moment, the alliance that Lin Yuan had set up changed completely.","There had never been a faction in the marsh world that had two Samsara Realm Dictators.","Once news of this alliance leaked, an unimaginable number of Dictators would be clamoring to join.."]},{"number":2285,"title":"Chapter 2285 Gentle Pressure!","paragraphs":["2285 Gentle Pressure!","Lin Yuan had planned carefully before he decided to offer Dictator Carnage Source equal authority.","Firstly, Dictator Carnage Source had not caused trouble for him or tried to attack him. But this did not mean that the other six Samsara Realm Dictators from Marsh Abyss would act the same way.","If any of them ended up having an impulsive character and wanted to attack him, things would turn difficult for Lin Yuan.","If Dictator Carnage Source was linked to him, the other six Samsara Realm Dictators would hesitate before they made a move on him.","But all of the Dictators and Apostles who were part of this alliance needed to provide offerings.","Lin Yuan had more than enough big and small source fruits that he could use as rewards.","Dictator Carnage Source also needed appropriate rewards when giving out tasks.","Lin Yuan was offering pure source-type power.","If Dictator Carnage Source did not offer something that could rival pure source-type power, he would not be able to attract the attention of the other Dictators and Apostles.","Although Dictator Carnage Source shared the same status as Lin Yuan in this alliance, Lin Yuan was still the heart of the alliance.","Everyone, including Dictator Carnage Source, was only going to join the alliance because they were eyeing the big and small source fruits he possessed.","When Dictator Carnage Source bumped his fist against Lin Yuan, he had instinctively looked off into the horizon in the distance.","He could sense auras belonging to Dictator Evil Source, Hornless Dragon Source, and Mountain Ridge Source.","The three of them had clearly been waiting for him to try to kill Ten Thousand Source because of Dictator Tyrant Lizard in order to assess Lin Yuan’s power.","But none of them had expected him to agree to join Lin Yuan’s alliance.","The three of them could no longer remain there.","Dictator Carnage Source did not try to hide his gleeful expression.","Normally, even if a Dictator under him died, Dictator Carnage Source would never have appeared in front of a Samsara Realm Dictator whose powers were unknown.","After all, what did the death of a subordinate have to do with him? Once they died, they would be useless! He could just search for another subordinate to replace the dead one. Given his status, he did not have to worry about a lack of applicants.","But Dictator Carnage Source had appeared because Dictator Evil Source, Hornless Dragon Source, and Mountain Ridge Source had pressured him.","The seven figures from Marsh Abyss were balanced, but there were still some who were stronger than others.","Dictator Carnage Source was the weakest out of the seven.","He could only stand up to the other six because of the Samsara Realm source totem his mother had left to him.","But external power was just that. Thus, there were some areas in which Dictator Carnage Source felt pressured.","The pressure made Dictator Carnage Source extremely uncomfortable, but there was nothing he could do about it.","Since there was no way for him to gain the upper hand, being pliant could sometimes bring more benefits than insisting on a stalemate.","But now, he was linked to Lin Yuan. He might not be fully aware of Lin Yuan’s power, but it did not matter, even if Lin Yuan had similar power to him. His strength had already exceeded that of the other six figures, and he would no longer have to be pressured by them from now on.","In fact, he might be able to turn the tables and pressure the other six Dictators instead.","But before Dictator Carnage Source had time to be smug, small yellow almond flower petals drifted down from the sky.","The yellow almond flower petals made Marsh East Palace seem as though it was suddenly made of blooming almond flowers.","A branch that seemed to be as strong as a soaring dragon burst out from the ground.","The singular branch twisted toward the sky.","When yellow almond flower petals appeared on the branch, a girl with chestnut hair that was tied in a ring around her head and wearing a long yellow dress appeared on the branch.","She was holding the branch as though she was perched on a swing. Her bare feet occasionally peeked out from beneath her long dress.","At the instant that the girl appeared, Dictator Carnage Source’s expression turned stern.","Dictator Mountain Ridge Source had actually appeared!","At that moment, the level of the Banquet of Everything had been elevated to the point that it was now out of the league of regular Dictators.","Dictator Freezing Ember, Frost Cold, Pregnant Poison, and Return to Ruins all lowered their heads so they would not have to meet Dictator Carnage Source and Mountain Ridge Source’s eyes.","Dictator Return to Ruins was relieved that he quickly became loyal to Lin Yuan.","If he had hesitated and waited, he would have lost his chance when these two bigshots appeared. This was because, at this point, he no longer had the authority to speak.","Dictator Mountain Ridge Source first nodded at Lin Yuan.","Next, she turned to Dictator Carnage Source and nodded at him.","Dictator Mountain Ridge Source’s actions made it clear that she held Lin Yuan in higher regard.","Normally, Dictator Carnage Source would have immediately taken umbrage at what Dictator Mountain Ridge Source did.","But he no longer thought that way.","He was now part of Lin Yuan’s alliance. There was no reason for him to be calculative toward a member of the same alliance who could help to increase his power.","Dictator Mountain Ridge Source said to Dictator Everything gently, “Everything, I didn’t expect your life to take such a turn. To think that you are now by Ten Thousand Source’s side.”","Dictator Mountain Ridge Source had once helped Dictator Everything.","Thus, despite already being Lin Yuan’s follower, she bowed to Dictator Mountain Ridge Source.","“Thank you for remembering me! I also believe that I’ve been blessed!”","Dictator Everything had thought about seeking Dictator Mountain Ridge Source’s protection during her weak phase after she entered the Turning Wheel Realm.","But she eventually gave up on that idea because she had offered her loyalty to repay Dictator Mountain Ridge Source for her help, but the latter had not agreed. All she had said was that Dictator Everything needed to continue training.","At the time, Dictator Everything had not thought much about it.","But Second Born had suddenly become a Dictator and almost came after her life.","If she had not found a way to escape, she might have already become a source totem in Second Born’s possession.","While Dictator Everything had been hiding, she had completely given up on any thoughts of joining Dictator Mountain Ridge Source.","She was very grateful for Dictator Mountain Ridge Source’s help, but it had only been help. Lin Yuan was the one who had rescued her.","When Dictator Mountain Ridge Source heard what Dictator Everything said, she said regretfully, “I wanted to wait for you to train a bit more before I took you in. Who would have imagined that Ten Thousand Source would beat me to the punch? I am rather regretful about this!”","Dictator Everything would have been extremely touched if she had heard Dictator Mountain Ridge Source say that in the past.","But now, Dictator Everything did not feel touched in the slightest. Rather, she even felt slightly put off.","This was because Dictator Mountain Ridge Source’s words could have been interpreted as trying to poach Lin Yuan’s subordinate. This was a subversive way of putting pressure on Lin Yuan."]},{"number":2286,"title":"Chapter 2286 Rushing to Trade!","paragraphs":["2286 Rushing to Trade!","Lin Yuan was capable of boosting Dictator Everything to the level of Samsara Realm and could also provide her with a large amount of source-type power.","There was no way that Dictator Mountain Ridge Source could have offered her the same.","Dictator Everything was afraid Lin Yuan would give her away to connect with Dictator Mountain Ridge Source.","It was common in Marsh Abyss for Samsara Realm Dictators to give away the Dictators and Apostles who were under them as gifts.","Before Lin Yuan could speak, Dictator Everything hurriedly said, “Thank you for your kindness! I was lucky enough to be saved by Lord Ten Thousand Source. I am willing to serve him to the death!”","Dictator Mountain Ridge Source had been waiting for Dictator Everything’s reaction because she could use it to judge the level of resources that Dictator Ten Thousand Source possessed.","If Dictator Everything looked regretful after she expressed such a sentiment, it meant that Dictator Everything saw Dictator Ten Thousand Source as being inferior to her.","But now, Dictator Everything had expressed adamant loyalty toward Dictator Ten Thousand Source. This meant that she felt that being loyal to Dictator Ten Thousand Source would bring more benefits.","Dictator Mountain Ridge Source was slightly surprised by this, but it also led her to decide how to approach Dictator Ten Thousand Source.","Dictator Mountain Ridge Source was well aware of what was going through Carnage Source’s mind.","They were all old foxes, so what was the point of acting around each other?","Did Dictator Carnage Source think that his previous status was going to change now that he had joined Dictator Ten Thousand Source? How could things be so simple?","Dictator Hornless Dragon Source and Evil Source hid and watched everything unfold. But it was likely that they had similar thoughts to Carnage Source.","Dictator Mountain Ridge Source smiled and said, “Ten Thousand Source, I am very interested in your alliance. Will I have the chance to join?”","Lin Yuan was shocked when he heard this. He had not expected his suggestion to receive a response from the Marsh Abyss’ Samsara Realm Dictators so quickly.","The more Dictators and Apostles joined his alliance, the more reputable he would become and the wider the network he would gain.","Hence, there was no reason for Lin Yuan to reject her.","When it came to treatment, impartiality was sufficient.","Lin Yuan would treat Dictator Mountain Ridge Source the same way he treated Dictator Carnage Source.","“Since you’re interested in joining, I have no reason to say no. You have heard my promise to Carnage Source. I can make you the same promise. I hope that everyone can get along amicably!”","Dictator Mountain Ridge Source never expected that she would receive better treatment than Dictator Carnage Source. The intelligent knew to be impartial.","If one did not even know this, there was no way they could have grown to this extent in the marsh world.","But while she and Dictator Hornless Dragon Source would be willing to silently share equal status with Dictator Hornless Dragon Source, would Dictator Evil Source be willing to do so?","But before Dictator Mountain Ridge Source could respond to Lin Yuan, an elderly voice sounded out from nearby.","An elderly man with blue hair suddenly appeared riding on an ice-blue ball of flame. He was the picture of leisure.","Terrifying insects were crawling around within the blue ball of flame. But the flames made it difficult to see the insects clearly.","“I am willing to join your alliance. I can now provide you with the faith power of 500 pinnacle Apostles eight. How many big and small source fruits will you be willing to give me in exchange for this?”","Dictator Mountain Ridge Source had been annoyed about being interrupted by Dictator Hornless Dragon Source. But she also wanted to know the answer to Hornless Dragon Source’s question, so she forced down her bubbling feelings of protest.","Since it was a trade, both sides needed to benefit. If only one side benefited while the other took a loss, there was no way for the trade to proceed.","Lin Yuan already knew how much faith power was worth in exchange for source-type power.","Using East Glow as an example, Lin Yuan had rewarded him with 30 units of source-type power in exchange for draining all of his faith power. This would equate to 200 small source fruits or 20 big source fruits.","When the elderly man appeared, Dictator Frost Cold and Freezing Ember both gained the courage to raise their heads.","This meant that there was a very high chance that this elderly man was Dictator Hornless Dragon Source.","Dictator Hornless Dragon Source had offered the faith power from 500 pinnacle Apostles.","He could just use this example to do the calculation.","“For 500 pinnacle Apostles, I can give you 100,000 small source fruits and 10,000 big source fruits.”","While Lin Yuan was speaking, he gestured to East Glow, and the latter came over to hand one big and one small source fruit to Dictator Hornless Dragon Source.","Dictator Hornless Dragon Source did not try to be courteous and immediately swallowed both fruits with no thought of etiquette.","Dictator Hornless Dragon Source quickly digested the big and small source fruits. He could sense how pure the source-type power within the big and small source fruits was. Source-type power of such purity could bring him significant benefits!","Once a Dictator reached the Samsara Realm, it became difficult to continue advancing.","The reason was that source-type power was like logs. No matter how many logs were stacked together, their quality would not change unless they were affected by an external force.","Alas, no one in the marsh world had found a way to change the quality of the logs.","However, this extremely pure source-type power had allowed the logs to change slightly.","Dictator Hornless Dragon Source was confused by this change, but he could be certain that it was very beneficial.","Dictator Hornless Dragon Source had offered to trade for the small source fruits with the faith power from 500 pinnacle Apostles because he wanted to get a sense of how many big and small source fruits Dictator Ten Thousand Source had in inventory.","Although Dictator Hornless Dragon Source was one of the seven Samsara Realm Dictators from Marsh Abyss, it was difficult for him to gather 500 pinnacle Apostles and convince them to offer their faith power to him.","However, Dictator Hornless Dragon Source had not expected Lin Yuan to agree immediately.","This was 100,000 small source fruits and 10,000 big source fruits that they were talking about!","Did the big and small source fruits come in such a large supply?","Dictator Hornless Dragon Source saw the price that Lin Yuan offered as fair.","But due to the difference in level between source-type power and faith power, source-type power was more valuable than faith power. It was akin to comparing thousands of tons of bronze to a few tons of gold. They might have the same value, but most people knew that gold was better.","Thus, Dictator Hornless Dragon Source believed he had profited from this trade.","Although obtaining the faith power from these 500 pinnacle Apostles had been difficult, it was worth it as long as he could receive such remuneration."]},{"number":2287,"title":"Chapter 2287 Can You Cause Trouble Later?","paragraphs":["2287 Can You Cause Trouble Later?","Hence, Hornless Dragon Source immediately agreed.","“Deal!”","Those who traded first would be rewarded first. Lin Yuan might not have big and small source fruits left over for those who wanted to trade with him later.","Lin Yuan and Hornless Dragon Source both felt that they had profited from the deal.","Meanwhile, Mountain Ridge Source had gnashed her teeth tightly together.","Hornless Dragon Source, that old piece of scum! What an old fox! All he did was think of ways to profit!","Just as Carnage Source was about to speak, Mountain Ridge Source could no longer restrain herself and said, “I also want to use the faith power from 500 pinnacle Apostles to trade for a similar number of big and small source fruits as what you offered Hornless Dragon Source.”","Lin Yuan fell silent.","Lin Yuan’s silence caused Mountain Ridge Source’s heart to sink.","Could Hornless Dragon Source’s deal have cleared Ten Thousand Source out?","She would be taking a great loss if she missed out on all that pure source-type power!","During Lin Yuan’s silence, the sky filled with purple fog that rolled slowly.","Thousands of chillingly evil green eyes seem to appear within the fog.","Hornless Dragon Source knew that Evil Source could not hold back for much longer.","However, Lin Yuan had already agreed with his request, and his deal would definitely be completed!","Lin Yuan’s silence was indeed due to him calculating if he had enough big and small source fruits to finish the deal.","100,000 of the Deposit Ability Litchi Branches weighed around 2 tons, while 10,000 of the Storing Ability White Peaches weighed around 1.75 tons.","Just his deal with Dictator Hornless Dragon Source would cost Lin Yuan almost all of the Deposit Ability Litchi Branches and Storing Ability White Peaches that he had at hand.","Lin Yuan could not trade source-type power directly with a Samsara Realm Dictator.","He decided that when he returned, he would use source-type power to cultivate another batch of the Storing Ability White Peaches and Deposit Ability Litchi Branches so he could increase capacity.","Although Lin Yuan did not have sufficient Deposit Ability Litchi Branches and Storing Ability White Peaches on hand, he would be able to nurture more quickly after increasing capacity and being nurtured by the army of Hundred Questions Beasts and Sentient Being Protective Dragon.","Given Mountain Ridge Source’s urgency to trade with him, Lin Yuan believed that she would not mind waiting for a while.","Lin Yuan coughed before he said to Mountain Ridge Source, “I don’t mind trading, but you will need to wait for some time. I will let you know how long the wait will be at a later date.”","Mountain Ridge Source’s heart sank when she heard what Lin Yuan said.","She was not afraid to wait but that Lin Yuan would be unable to produce the big and small source fruits.","Every Dictator had an exceedingly long lifespan. Waiting was never an issue.","She had to line up after him since Hornless Dragon Source had taken the first slot. This meant that if the other five figures wanted to trade with Lin Yuan as well, they would have to line up behind her!","With that thought, Mountain Ridge Source felt slightly comforted.","Carnage Source was beside himself with anxiousness and the desire to speak. He had clearly been the first to make a move but had not been able to obtain any benefits.","Carnage Source had only just called out Ten Thousand Source’s name when a sharp yet also low voice exploded onto the scene.","A figure wrapped in a purple robe appeared in front of Carnage Source and effectively blocked him.","The wind blew down the hood of the robe, and a handsome yet alluringly beautiful face appeared in front of Carnage Source.","This face was currently looking at Carnage Source with amusement.","As a result, Carnage Source’s face fell.","Lin Yuan also saw a face under the hood. This face was rugged, tough, and had a goatee growing on it.","At that moment, a pair of long arms emerged from under the purple robe.","The hands pressed down on the head in the hood before turning the head 180 degrees, changing the orientation of the two faces.","Now, the rugged and tough side was facing Carnage Source, while the sinisterly handsome and beautiful side was facing Lin Yuan.","“Ten Thousand Source, what a nice-sounding name! Are you trying to be the Dictator over all the creatures of the world? Hehe!”","The first part was said in a wicked male voice while the laughter changed to that of a charming girl.","Lin Yuan did not find anything strange about this switch.","There were all types of talents with all types of characters in the Radiance Federation. All one needed to do was to stay true to one’s heart. It did not matter what kind of face one had as long as it allowed one to speak with ease.","Was it not tiring to switch in such a way?","Lin Yuan did not react to what Evil Source said because he knew that Evil Source definitely had more to say.","If all she wanted to say were such useless comments, it would have been better for her to continue hiding and watching.","Hornless Dragon Source and Mountain Ridge Source had both made deals with him.","Carnage Source had been the first Samsara Realm Dictator to join his alliance.","Although he had given himself the name Ten Thousand Source because he wanted to appeal to the ambitions of all Dictators so he could gain as much profit as he could, and even if Mountain Ridge Source, Hornless Dragon Source, and Carnage Source were unhappy with him, they would never turn on him.","When Lin Yuan did not reply, Dictator Evil Source started to giggle wickedly.","Evil Source’s voice made numerous Apostles dizzy, and their blood started to rush uncontrollably. It was as though there was a large invisible hand that was squeezing their hearts.","When they saw how Evil Source was acting, Mountain Ridge Source, Carnage Source, and Hornless Dragon Source all frowned as sour expressions spread across their faces.","Evil Source never acted in a logical manner. No one knew what she was going to do next!","Mountain Ridge Source and Hornless Dragon Source had already formed deals with Lin Yuan.","If Evil Source truly went into a fit of madness, it would not do the two of them good to stand by and watch. After all, Lin Yuan had not provided them with the goods yet!","If Hornless Dragon Source and Mountain Ridge Source only stood by and felt upset,","Carnage Source would feel strongly compelled to jump out and curse Evil Source’s ancestors!","Damn! Can you cause trouble later? Can you wait to do it after my deal with Ten Thousand Source is done? If you cause trouble now and cause Dictator Ten Thousand Source to be upset, he could say no when I request to trade with him! Damn it all!","If not because Evil Source had yet to attack Lin Yuan and was still in the midst of a fit of insanity, Carnage Source would have helped Lin Yuan to take on Evil Source despite being unwilling to involve himself in potential trouble.","Lin Yuan was now intertwined with his profits! This was also profits that Carnage Source could not give up on, no matter what!"]},{"number":2288,"title":"Chapter 2288 A Bet!","paragraphs":["2288 A Bet!","Lin Yuan had already heard from Dictator Everything that out of all of the seven Dictators in Marsh Abyss with the word ‘source’ in their names, Eternal Source found it the most difficult to deal with Evil Source’s eccentricities.","Lin Yuan had not had the chance to meet Eternal Source, but he had learned the difference between schizophrenia and perversion from Evil Source.","Lin Yuan looked at Evil Source calmly.","Regardless of what plans Evil Source had, all he had to do was handle them.","He had enough power to deal with the attacks from a Samsara Realm Dictator.","Moreover, Mountain Ridge Source, Hornless Dragon Source, and Carnage Source’s profits were involved with him. Thus, there was no way that they would remain idle if Evil Source attacked him. Even if they did not help him, they would make a statement at the very least.","The only person present who was on Evil Source’s side was Dictator Pregnant Poison, who was loyal to her.","But given that Dictator Pregnant Poison was a Turning Wheel Realm Dictator, there was no need for Lin Yuan to be concerned about her. Begin Lady could kill Dictator Tyrant Lizard in an instant, meaning that it could do the same to Dictator Pregnant Poison. It was clear from her aura that she was weaker than Dictator Tyrant Lizard.","If Dictator Pregnant Poison knew what Lin Yuan was thinking, she would definitely cry out that there was a misunderstanding.","The person present who was angrier with Evil Source was none other than Dictator Pregnant Poison.","She could not join Lin Yuan’s alliance because of Evil Source.","But since Lin Yuan needed faith power, there was a chance that she could seek him out privately to trade for source-type power.","But now that Evil Source had come to stir up trouble and she had promptly been tossed to Evil Source’s side, how could she still go and seek Lin Yuan out privately?","But although she was cursing Evil Source to herself, there was no way that Dictator Pregnant Poison would allow herself to show how she felt.","If Evil Source truly ended up attacking Lin Yuan, she would have no choice but to side with Evil Source.","If she did not react, not only would she not receive any protection from Lin Yuan, but Evil Source would also put an end to her traitorous life.","As Dictator Pregnant Poison became increasingly angry, she made a decision that she would eventually find a chance to get rid of this lunatic.","Evil Source’s laughter caused half of the Apostles present to fall to their knees. First Born and Third Born were among them.","Besides Apostles, there were also a large number of dimensional lifeforms and the Apostles’ believers and Favored Believers who were present in Marsh East Palace.","Given how many Apostles were wrecked by Evil Source’s laughter, one could only imagine how many believers and Favored Believers had rotted at the sound of her laughter.","Lin Yuan never showed mercy to his enemies, and there were times when his methods could be described as cruel. This was proof of his growth.","However, Lin Yuan would never harm the innocent.","Evil Source’s maniacal laughter had caused an unimaginable number of dimensional lifeforms to lose their lives.","This action was not wicked but downright evil.","After she was done laughing, Evil Source used her hands to turn her head again. It was as though her two-faced head was nothing more than an entertaining toy to her.","“Ten Thousand Source, your big and small source fruits must need time to ripen. They must come from a carnivorous plant that you’re nurturing. I am very interested in your carnivorous plant that can produce big and small source fruits. Why don’t you bet on it?”","Evil Source’s words caused the atmosphere to turn to ice.","Previously, Evil Source’s inappropriate action only showed how bizarre of a personality she had.","But her most recent words had infringed on Lin Yuan’s profits.","Hornless Dragon Source and Mountain Ridge Source had only traded for the big and small source fruits with Lin Yuan. However, Evil Source wanted to steal the source of the big and small source fruits.","This had undoubtedly resulted in a clash of formidability.","Lin Yuan had to rise to the challenge no matter what. Otherwise, he would come off as weak.","Mountain Ridge Source, Hornless Dragon Source, and Carnage Source were all waiting for Lin Yuan’s reaction.","Since Lin Yuan had what it took to clash against Evil Source, he did not need to be afraid of her. Thus, he looked at her with amusement and asked coldly, “It is true that a plant produces the big and small source fruits. But what can you offer to persuade me to make this bet? Unless you can offer at least 100 Dictator source totems, you won’t be able to match the value of a plant that can produce the big and small source fruits!”","At that moment, Lin Yuan did not know what kind of bet Evil Source would come up with.","But since she was the one who had suggested the bet, she would not be able to back out as long as he responded to it.","Lin Yuan was not sure if he would be able to win in a bet against Evil Source. But if he did win, there was no question that he would hit the jackpot.","Frankly, he wouldn’t mind even if he lost. At the very most, he would give some of the Storing Ability White Peach and Deposit Ability Litchi Branch’s sprouts to Evil Source.","The big and small source fruits were not special because of the Deposit Ability Litchi Branch and Storing Ability White Peach themselves but because Lin Yuan had cultivated them through pure source-type power.","All of the source-type power within the big and small source fruits came from Lin Yuan.","Once the sprouts that Lin Yuan had cultivated produced the big and small source fruits, they needed to be further nurtured with more pure source-type power. Otherwise, they would be no different from ordinary fruits.","If Evil Source could truly get her hands on the Deposit Ability Litchi Branch and Storing Ability White Peach’s sprouts that Lin Yuan had cultivated, there was no guarantee that she would be willing to spend a large amount of pure source-type power on them.","Thus, Lin Yuan would not be suffering any losses even if he did end up losing the bet.","Carnage Source, who had already made numerous unspeakable comments about Evil Source to himself, saw that Lin Yuan seemed to have no intention of backing down. Thus, he knew that Lin Yuan and Evil Source were definitely going through with the bet.","Evil Source had to possess a fair number of treasures. It was not impossible for her to be able to offer something of comparable value to the big and small source fruits.","But would Evil Source truly be willing to make the offer?","There was no telling how many big and small source fruit-producing carnivorous plants Lin Yuan had.","But they were part of his fundamental resources. He had to be severely impacted if he lost them!","Evil Source would be similarly affected if she lost such fundamental resources.","Since he was the first to join Lin Yuan’s alliance and also wanted to trade with him in the future, now was the time for him to make a gesture."]},{"number":2289,"title":"Chapter 2289 The Second Endless Gem!","paragraphs":["2289 The Second Endless Gem!","Thus, Carnage Source voiced his support for Lin Yuan, “Evil Source, if you want to win something, you’ll have to offer something of value! If you want to start a bet with Ten Thousand Source, Mountain Ridge Source, Hornless Dragon Source, and I will be willing witnesses!”","If Carnage Source voiced his support for Lin Yuan quickly, Lin Yuan would remember to thank him first.","However, Carnage Source dared not insult Evil Source too much. Hence, he included Mountain Ridge Source and Hornless Dragon Source when he sided with Lin Yuan.","Hornless Dragon Source and Mountain Ridge Source might not side with him, but they would not rebuke him on account of Lin Yuan’s pride.","Since he was making a choice that involved his profits, Carnage Source would not mind minimizing his losses while maximizing his profits.","Hornless Dragon Source and Mountain Ridge Source had essentially been coerced by Carnage Source to make a stand. However, they could not bring themselves to rebuke Carnage Source. All they could do was internally insult him while they said, “Since we’re here, we’re willing to be witnesses! We’ll also act as judges to assess if the betting stakes are fair.”","Lin Yuan and Evil Source’s lips curled upward when they heard what the three Dictators said.","Lin Yuan had smiled because the three Dictators had chosen to side with him against Evil Source, with whom they were more familiar.","With three Dictators with the word ‘source’ in their names helping him, Lin Yuan would not have to worry even if Evil Source ganged up with the other four figures from Marsh Abyss.","Moreover, it was unlikely that the other four Dictators would be equally as insane as Evil Source.","Lin Yuan was very curious about what Evil Source was going to offer to trade for a sprout that could produce big and small source fruits.","Evil Source had smiled because her fury had reached a peak, to the point that she almost lost control and lashed out.","But she managed to force this fury down in the nick of time.","Evil Source looked at Lin Yuan as though she was surveying him.","She was certain that this was the first time that Carnage Source, Mountain Ridge Source, and Hornless Dragon Source were meeting Lin Yuan. Yet, they had immediately inserted themselves into her path.","Evil Source thought, Let’s see if you can continue acting so arrogant when I obtain the carnivorous plant that can produce the big and small source fruits! At that time, Carnage Source, Hornless Dragon Source, and Mountain Ridge Source will trample over each other to side with me just like they are doing with Ten Thousand Source now.","But this did not mean that Evil Source believed that she was weaker than Lin Yuan.","Her hand suddenly flew toward her chest, and her five pale and slender fingers penetrated her chest. Yet, no blood appeared.","After fiddling for a while, she plucked a dark green gem from her chest.","“I will use this in the bet!”","Lin Yuan forced himself to remain composed when he saw what Evil Source had just taken out, but he could not do anything about his violently racing heart.","Morbius also started to turn warm on Lin Yuan’s wrist.","Lin Yuan did not have to communicate with Morbius to know that he was in the presence of the second Endless Gem from the marsh world.","The fact that the second Endless Gem had come from Evil Source proved that Lin Yuan’s guess had been right.","If he won the Endless Gem, he would be able to unlock another fey that had been spirit locked by Morbius and gain access to their full set of abilities.","Lin Yuan had unlocked the Jasmine Lily first.","If he won this Endless Gem, he would be able to unlock Green Vine and increase its power to the greatest extent.","Thus, it was absolutely necessary for him to win this bet against Evil Source!","However, Lin Yuan did not appear to be anxious.","This was because he did not know how valuable the Endless Gems were to Samsara Realm Dictators.","Moreover, he also wanted to judge the expressions of the other Dictators to discern if they also possessed Endless Gems.","Lin Yuan saw expressions of astonishment on Carnage Source, Mountain Ridge Source, and Hornless Dragon Source’s faces. The three of them looked surprised that Evil Source would offer something like that as a betting state.","A moment later, Mountain Ridge Source said in a dignified and gentle voice, “Evil Source, I hope you won’t regret using that as your betting stake! You refused to lend the stone to all six of us. But now, you’re willing to use it as a betting stake in a gamble with Ten Thousand Source!”","Mountain Ridge Source’s words informed Lin Yuan that the other six Dictators with the word ‘source’ in their names did not possess any Endless Gems.","At that moment, Morbius’ voice sounded in Lin Yuan’s ear. “Partner, this Endless Gem’s aura forms a closed loop with the aura of the first Endless Gem. I think there are only two Endless Gems in the marsh world!”","Lin Yuan pursed his lips when he heard what Morbius said.","Since that was the case, it was now even more necessary for him to get his hands on the Endless Gem!","He would not have to think about gathering any more of the Endless Gems while he was developing in the marsh world.","An emerald green ancient tree had grown on the Pure Land of Bliss the last time that Morbius absorbed the Endless Gem.","Who could say how the Pure Land of Bliss would change after absorbing this second Endless Gem?","Carnage Source sensed Evil Source’s anger, but he had already decided to side with Lin Yuan and had already put his money where his mouth was by forming a grudge between himself and Evil Source.","Given Evil Source’s petty and vengeful character, she would definitely seek revenge on Carnage Source.","Since he was already going to be targeted by Evil Source, he might as well go for broke and help Lin Yuan again.","He only hoped that doing so would cement his place in Lin Yuan’s mind.","“Evil Source, you were fortuitous to attain the gem. Indeed, it has impressive functions. But do you really think this gem is enough to trade for a carnivorous plant that can produce pure source-type power? I don’t think that your betting stake is of equal value. Mountain Ridge Source and Hornless Dragon Source, what do you think?”","Carnage Source was terrified that he would be left hanging after he helped Lin Yuan and positioned himself opposite Evil Source. Thus, he dragged in Mountain Ridge Source and Hornless Dragon Source again.","Even after being coerced by Carnage Source again, Mountain Ridge Source and Hornless Dragon Source still had no choice but to remain silent.","Although they had already made trade deals with Lin Yuan, they should not be taking a stand in such a situation.","But they had already taken a stand. Even if they did not see it through, they had already offended Evil Source.","Hence, Mountain Ridge Source and Hornless Dragon Source had no choice but to back up what Carnage Source said.","Because of this, a black and purple vein popped out on the hand that Evil Source used to turn her head.","In an instant, Evil Source’s hand became even larger than half of her body."]},{"number":2290,"title":"Chapter 2290 Green Field Secret Treasure, Volume 4, Sky High!","paragraphs":["2290 Green Field Secret Treasure, Volume 4, Sky High!","The purple and black fingernails on the fingers had a thick and creepy aura that would cause shivers to crawl up the spine of anyone in the vicinity.","Even Begin Lady, who was on Lin Yuan’s body, felt immense pressure.","But eventually, Evil Source regained her calmness and picked up a book.","When the book appeared, Lin Yuan was immediately reminded of the Secret of the Dead, Volume 5, Sinking Song that currently resided in his soul.","The Secret of the Dead, Volume 5, Sinking Song had already been cleansed and branded on the fountain of faith. It would not be long before he found out about its abilities.","Lin Yuan instinctively used True Data to check on the green book in Evil Source’s hand.","What he saw confirmed his conjecture—Green Field Secret Treasure, Volume 4, Sky High.","While Lin Yuan was checking on the green book, Evil Source opened the book.","In an instant, it was as though a seed was sprouting, and it did not take long before the entire sky was covered.","Lin Yuan was not amazed by this and calmly admired the changes.","But the other Dictators and Apostles sensed the power of their source totems weakening. Even Carnage Source, Mountain Ridge Source, and Hornless Dragon Source were affected.","Evil Source turned her gruff and tough face toward Lin Yuan as she said hoarsely, “Do you know why the seven of us are able to oversee Marsh Abyss? It’s because each of us possesses one of these books that have different abilities. I will add this book to the stakes, but you will also have to up your stakes. If you win, you can have this book. If you lose, I will pick three items from your possession!”","Evil Source’s words stunned Carnage Source, Mountain Ridge Source, and Hornless Dragon Source. Even Carnage Source, who wanted to leave a good impression on Lin Yuan, dared not utter a word.","By offering this book, Evil Source was essentially offering to hand her authority over to Lin Yuan.","A large reason the seven of them could stand toe-to-toe without any of them gaining the upper hand on each other was the different abilities that the seven books possessed.","At first, they all chalked it up to Evil Source’s habit of acting irrationally. But now, Evil Source had just offered all of her assets.","Lin Yuan could tell from their expressions that this book was the real deal. It was likely that it was part of the marsh world’s biggest secret.","He had discovered both the Secret of the Dead and Green Field Secret Treasure in the marsh world and also proved the existence of the deceased dimensional world.","Lin Yuan did not have to be concerned when his betting stake was only the Deposit Ability Litchi Branch and Storing Ability White Peach’s sprouts.","But now, Evil Source wanted to pick three of his possessions. This would unquestionably affect his foundations.","Lin Yuan had just as valuable possessions as the Green Field Secret Treasure, Volume 4, Sky High. The Secret of the Dead, Volume 5, Sinking Song was already enough to match the value.","Thus, Lin Yuan could not agree to this bet with Evil Source.","“I don’t possess anything as valuable as that book. So I can’t accept your request. But if I lose, you can have all of my big and small source fruit sprouts. I won’t hold anything back.”","When Lin Yuan spoke, he intentionally gnashed his teeth together and put on a pained expression.","Even now, Evil Source was the most interested in the carnivorous plant that could produce big and small source fruits. Thus, Lin Yuan could be certain that Evil Source would agree to his counteroffer.","Just as Evil Source looked persuaded and was about to agree, Lin Yuan added, “The stakes I added are about 100 times more valuable than the original stake. So, you will be at an advantage. As such, I will decide how the bet will proceed!”","Evil Source’s expression turned stern.","Offering all of the big and small source fruit-producing carnivorous plants showed that Lin Yuan was going all out.","People who went all the way out were usually hiding an unbelievable secret weapon.","This caused Evil Source to feel a pressure that she had not felt in a long time.","But she was the one who had suggested the bet. No matter how mad she was, she would never choose to back out at such a juncture.","“Fine, you can decide how the bet will go on! But we have to be competing based on power.”","Since all bridges were already burned, bringing out the real guns would be better!","This way, they would be able to figure out the extent of each other’s power and avoid future conflicts if necessary.","If they bet in any other way and one side was indignant about losing, it could trigger serious consequences.","Evil Source seemed to be giving Lin Yuan a way out, but it was also a way out for herself.","Now that Evil Source had agreed, Lin Yuan pointed at Everything.","“Everything has only just entered the Turning Wheel Realm and is not much stronger than a pinnacle Apostle. I will send her as my representative in the fight, and you can also pick a Dictator who has recently entered the Turning Wheel Realm. We will boost each of them, and whoever follower wins also wins the bet!”","Mountain Ridge Source, Hornless Dragon Source, and Carnage Source found Lin Yuan’s bet to be very refreshing. They had never heard of such a bet before.","But it was true that this method of betting could demonstrate a Dictator’s power.","This method of betting also enabled Lin Yuan and Evil Source to avoid fighting directly.","However, this method of betting was well suited to Evil Source’s source totem’s ability.","Just like how they had never heard of Ten Thousand Source in the past, it was likely that Ten Thousand Source was not familiar with Evil Source either.","Otherwise, he would never have suggested such a bet.","Pregnant Poison had already appeared next to Evil Source.","Regardless of how she felt, Pregnant Poison would have to act appropriately in a fight between Evil Source and Lin Yuan.","Pregnant Poison prayed that Evil Source would not pick her. She would not be willing to participate even if she was given the chance to enter the Samsara Realm.","However, her ability could counter Everything. It was unlikely that Evil Source would give up on the advantage and the opportunity to increase her power.","Once representing Evil Source in a fight against Lin Yuan, she would be well and truly on the opposite side from Lin Yuan.","But if she lost, Evil Source would not let her off either.","But it did not take long for Pregnant Poison to realize that she was worried over nothing because Evil Source ended up picking another Turning Wheel Realm Dictator.","This Dictator had only recently entered the Turning Wheel Realm and had about the same amount of power as Everything.","Pregnant Poison knew that this Dictator was always by Evil Source’s side but was not well aware of his background.","Despite only recently letting out a sigh of relief, Pregnant Poison got an increasingly stronger feeling that something was wrong.","She started to cry out angrily to herself, Tasteless! Why wasn’t I picked? Don’t you trust me? Let me see how you pick up the pieces after your loss!"]},{"number":2291,"title":"Chapter 2291 Defeated?","paragraphs":["2291 Defeated?","But as Pregnant Poison continued to insult Evil Source, she started to tremble in fright.","If the Dictator who Evil Source chose ended up losing, the entire marsh world would change, and she would be at the forefront of that change.","Pregnant Poison had only ever wanted peace. Otherwise, she would not have hidden in the shadows of the Banquet of Everything.","If Evil Source had picked her to be the representative, she would have been overcome with fear and embarrassed herself.","It would be fine if Evil Source was the one who had suggested how the gamble proceeded.","Although Evil Source was the one who suggested the bet, Lin Yuan was the one who decided how the gamble proceeded.","Lin Yuan would definitely suggest something that was advantageous to him.","Evil Source could not afford to lose and give up on her treasures. But the same went for Lin Yuan.","Evil Source and Lin Yuan were already in a full-fledged confrontation that had dragged in Mountain Ridge Source, Hornless Dragon Source, and Carnage Source. As such, all three of them were feeling the heat.","However, all three of them were much better at handling pressure than Pregnant Poison was.","Truthfully, the entire Marsh Abyss was centered around the seven figures, and there was no question that they were the Marsh Abyss’ core.","This seven-pronged system provided them with a substantial amount of profits. Any trouble that tipped the balance would be disadvantageous for them.","However, Lin Yuan had already agreed to the trade, and the three of them were extremely unwilling to let the trade slip away.","Thus, despite knowing that the fallout from this change would affect them, the three of them had no choice but to go along with what was happening.","Moreover, they were going to choose Lin Yuan when push came to shove.","At that moment, the three of them felt coerced by Lin Yuan.","Everything felt both nervous and excited.","This fight involved the top authority and power of the marsh world.","She was now Lin Yuan’s spear that had to cut down the obstacles in his way to clear the path. This was an unspeakable honor!","She had only entered the Turning Wheel Realm recently. When Lin Yuan’s power boosted her, she could even reach the Samsara Realm. Everything had never dared to dream of being boosted to such an extent.","Everything was well aware of how powerful Samsara Realm Dictators were. They possessed unlimited possibilities.","Yet, Everything did not believe that Evil Source would be able to boost a Turning Wheel Realm Dictator to Samsara Realm like Lin Yuan had done.","At the very least, she was certain that Mountain Ridge Source did not possess such power.","Although Evil Source possessed the Green Field Secret Treasure that represented untold authority in the marsh world while Lin Yuan possessed no such thing, Everything believed that her side would emerge victorious.","Thus, Everything maintained her composure as she advanced. She was even more confident than usual.","When the wind blew at her skirt, the bells adorning the ends of her long braids jingled.","The air was filled with a delightful melody as Everything activated her Dictator’s body. A long, satin-like tail emerged behind her, gracefully slicing through the air and leaving spatial ripples in its wake.","Around Everything’s wrists, five radiant silver satin strips materialized, resembling dancing ribbons of silver suspended in mid-air. The silver ribbons, adorned with tinkling silver bells, transformed into ten elegant tails, swaying in synchronized harmony.","Beneath Everything’s dress, a source totem illuminated her abdomen, emanating a powerful aura.","Although her power had dipped to the level of a pinnacle Apostle, Everything still possessed an all-encompassing formidability.","Lin Yuan already knew what ability Everything’s source totem had. It was called Acceptance.","She could use her body as a carrier and set a target to direct her source totem at. Both of them would then sustain the same amount of damage. She could redirect damage to the target and vice versa when she sustained damage.","When Everything was in battle, her source totem’s ability and regenerative power gave her great advantage over opponents of the same level.","The longer they fought, the bigger advantage she would enjoy. Even if she started off with the short end of the stick, she would eventually make a comeback as the battle progressed.","Her only downfall would be if her opponent had any special methods, such as venom.","Lin Yuan had considered this, but he had two Dictators in Everything and East Glow.","East Glow excelled in defense and was not suited for a one-on-one battle. Thus, Lin Yuan had no other choice.","Still, he believed that Evil Source would not pick a Turning Wheel Realm Dictator who could counter Everything.","He had picked his representative first. If Evil Source immediately tried to take him down, it would come across as her being afraid. After all, this bet was not about whose representative was stronger but about who could better boost their representative.","Evil Source possessed the Green Field Secret Treasure and was already inflated with arrogance.","There was no way that she would try too hard and come across as desperate in front of three Dictators who possessed the same amount of power she did.","Lin Yuan was right.","Even if Evil Source decided to give up on her pride and sent out a representative who could counter Everything, Lin Yuan would not be afraid.","Lin Yuan could only boost Everything to barely the level of Samsara Realm because her body could not handle any more. The issue was not with his lack of faith power. If he forcefully boosted her anymore, her body would explode, and she would die.","As such, there was no way that Evil Source would be able to do better than him when it came to boosting.","If Evil Source was truly able to boost a Dictator who had only just entered the Turning Wheel Realm to the Samsara Realm, she would have become the sole ruler of the marsh world long ago. There would be no need for her to share the authority with the other six Dictators with the word ‘source’ in their names.","Moreover, Everything had said that Evil Source was not the strongest of the seven Dictators with the word ‘source’ in their names. The strongest of them was Eternal Source, who had not appeared today.","As a spirit qi professional, Lin Yuan’s methods were foreign to the lifeforms from the marsh world. But he could use them nonetheless.","Hence, Lin Yuan was not just going to boost Everything’s power.","Evil Source saw the mixture of austerity and nervousness on her representative’s face. It was a far cry from Everything’s confident countenance.","It had not been long since Everything joined Lin Yuan. But Evil Source’s chosen representative had already been with her for more than 2,000 years, and it could be said that she had personally shaped her.","Given the circumstances, she would be defeated if they did end up competing.","That would not do!"]},{"number":2292,"title":"Chapter 2292 Elite Bloodline!","paragraphs":["2292 Elite Bloodline!","Evil Source let out a disdainful scoff. Standing next to her, Dictator Mite Thread, with her long black and purple hair, trembled involuntarily.","Having spent considerable time by Evil Source’s side, Dictator Mite Thread understood the true nature of her character. Surviving over 2,000 years in Evil Source’s presence wasn’t a result of Mite Thread’s exceptional abilities. Rather, it was her ability to decipher Evil Source’s temperament.","Numerous comrades had been eliminated in the past for inadvertently upsetting Evil Source in some way. If Mite Thread couldn’t quell Evil Source’s displeasure, her life would inevitably meet its end, even if she managed to defeat Everything. Evil Source wouldn’t spare a second thought about her accomplishment.","Since Mite Thread was aware of this, she knew that she had to square up to match Everything’s aura.","With this thought, Mite Thread immediately activated her dictator’s body.","Countless black and brown threads shot out from Mite Thread’s body. They did not need to be attached to any body and maintained rigidly in the air.","Small dark red spider-like insects started to crawl out from Mite Thread’s body and quickly covered the net of threads.","As the spider-like insects poured out, the net of threads soon became crowded. Once a certain number of spider-like insects had appeared, they spat out threads and left the main net, dangling off the main net with their singular threads.","The small dark red spider-like insects resembled the mites that Lin Yuan had seen in the skincare advertisements from his previous life.","Lin Yuan rarely felt goosebumps rise all over his body. He was not startled but repulsed.","As the dark red spider-like insects continued to pour out, Mite Thread’s body shrank and turned yellow until she looked like a skeleton wrapped in skin.","Mite Thread’s hands and legs assumed strange poses as she stood at the center of the large net, and a peculiar hissing sound could be heard coming from her mouth.","Carnage Source and Hornless Dragon Source exchanged glances, their eyes conveying unspoken thoughts and understanding.","Mountain Ridge Source, drawn to Everything’s exceptional beauty and elite lineage, had developed an interest in her. Mountain Ridge Source intended to have Everything serve as a female attendant, with little regard for her power and abilities.","On the other hand, Mite Thread, nurtured by Evil Source, always had to remain vigilant and on guard. While Evil Source was known for her eccentricity and penchant for pushing her subordinates into risky situations, she typically treated her favored subordinates well.","Among the Dictators, Mite Thread was recognized for her exceptional abilities and potential, placing her in a top-class position.","Although Mite Thread’s abilities could not counter Everything, she surpassed Everything in both abilities and potential.","However, Carnage Source and Hornless Dragon Source did not believe that Lin Yuan did not have stronger subordinates he could have chosen to represent him. They felt that he was being overconfident and underestimating his enemy.","Even if Lin Yuan was truly stronger than Evil Source, the latter possessed that book.","Mountain Ridge Source looked at Everything with pity as she had full knowledge of the extent of Everything’s power. Thus, she understood the circumstances better than Hornless Dragon Source and Carnage Source did.","Mite Thread’s ability was called Parasite Cycle. If the mites from Mite Thread’s body got on a target, they would immediately penetrate the skin and become a parasite.","Once the mites entered the target’s body, they would start to multiply and destroy the target from the inside.","The mites were very tiny.","The net of threads currently looked purple and black because it was not done growing. Once it was fully extended, the color would be stretched until it appeared transparent.","Setting aside the fact that the threads were very sharp and could slice or restrain a target, the mites could also move swiftly on the net.","Although Evil Source appeared to be deranged, she hated to lose.","Mountain Ridge Source did not believe that Everything had any chance of defeating Mite Thread unless Everything’s power could exceed that of Mite Thread when Lin Yuan boosted her.","But was this possible?","Mite Thread had already unleashed her power, and her aura was gradually pressing down on Everything.","Finally, a satisfied smile appeared on Evil Source’s face. “Ten Thousand Source, let’s do our best!”","Evil Source raised her left hand, made a spiritual gesture, and a ball of purple fog entered Mite Thread’s body.","Purple flames lit up all over Mite Thread’s web of threads.","The purple flames caused each of the mites to double in size. It was clear that they could do much more damage now.","Evil Source stopped what she was doing at this point as she waited to see how Lin Yuan would retaliate.","Evil Source was used to slowly revealing one’s attacks when she fought against the other six figures. They explored each other’s powers by slowly revealing their secret weapons.","This was why Evil Source did not instantly boost Mite Thread to the greatest extent.","But while Evil Source felt this way, the same could not be said for Lin Yuan because he did not have that many secret weapons that Evil Source could slowly explore.","Lin Yuan did not know whether the Dictators from Marsh Abyss had ever interacted with humans from the Freedom Federation. Hence, unless it was absolutely necessary, Lin Yuan did not want to use his spirit qi professional abilities.","Feys’ abilities contained clear signs of spirit qi fluctuations, which did not exist in the marsh world.","The Apostles might not notice this, but Carnage Source, Hornless Dragon Source, Mountain Ridge Source, and Evil Source had not moved their gaze away from him.","With this thought, Lin Yuan prepared to use one outstanding move to demonstrate his Dictator-boosting abilities.","This was to create a shock effect and let the other Dictators know that joining him would be the best decision.","Lin Yuan fused with Dark Blue and activated his mermaid emperor bloodline.","In an instant, a lithe stream of blue water descended from the sky, connecting the sky and earth with Lin Yuan at the center.","He did not unleash any astonishing aura, but the stream of water exuded an inexplicably elite bloodline.","This aura was unfamiliar to all of the Apostles and Dictators present, except for White Speak.","Nonetheless, they could not ignore how powerful and elite this bloodline was.","The strength of the bloodline caused Mountain Ridge Source, Hornless Dragon Source, and Carnage Source to feel subconsciously inferior."]},{"number":2293,"title":"Chapter 2293 Appearance!","paragraphs":["2293 Appearance!","When Evil Source sensed the bloodline power from the stream of water, she clenched her fists tightly.","At that moment, waves started to ripple across the pillar of water, and the sound of the ocean’s clarion boomed out from the waves. The sound seemed to be ushering the arrival of a sacred ruler.","As the shades of water stacked over each other, the image of a lavish underwater palace was formed.","Numerous coral adornments were hanging off of the palace that gleamed brilliantly. Ribbons of water swirled around the pearls at the center of the adornments as though they were the mouths of springs.","At that moment, a long fishtail appeared from within the water.","The beautiful and clean tail covered the foul odors of the marsh beneath it.","The scales on the tail were so blue that it was almost blinding. There were also faint specks of gold within the blue.","The gold was completely dominated by the blue and seemed to be relying on the pure blue, making the blue appear even more distinguished and pure.","When the fishtail appeared from the water, the pillar of water that connected the earth to the sky started to retreat.","The stream of water transformed into a shawl that draped over the half-armor and battle skirt that Lin Yuan was wearing.","The lake-green and lightning blue in the Blue Topaz was suspended within the water and paired exceedingly well with the blue of the fishtail.","Lin Yuan’s hair extended down to his bare feet in his merman form. The hair swished in the water and cascaded over the shawl of water.","The few small scales on his face and gold and blue scale at the center of his forehead projected his blue eyes, which seemed to contain the ocean of every person’s dreams.","At that moment, Lin Yuan’s beauty was an even more impressive weapon than his bloodline.","Not even Evil Source could avoid falling into a trance when she looked at Lin Yuan in his merman form.","Treasure Seeker gaped at Lin Yuan. His idea of beauty had been redefined.","It turned out that he had been hoping and chasing after such a countenance all along! A countenance that he could never even have dreamed up and only existed in his wildest hopes!","Previously, Treasure Seeker felt that Demon Desire was a cloud to the dirt of other Dictators. But now, this idea had changed.","Demon Desire’s regular body was like a swallow on the ground while her Dictator’s body’s appearance was like the shining moon in the sky that the swallow could only admire from far away.","Demon Desire’s glorious appearance now looked mundane in Treasure Seeker’s eyes.","Treasure Seeker’s eyes could not bear to move away from Lin Yuan’s face.","It went without saying that Demon Desire noticed this.","The moment she saw Lin Yuan’s Dictator’s body, Demon Desire knew that coming to the Banquet of Everything was the worst decision she had ever made in her life.","She had not managed to obtain even a sliver of benefit from the Banquet of Everything. One of her lapdogs had tried to open the way for her, but Lin Yuan killed him, while her other lapdog had fallen under Lin Yuan’s spell.","Lin Yuan had not done anything to her, but he had still doomed her.","As much as Treasure Seeker had cared for her, he was now going to turn away and abandon her.","Demon Desire had also stolen Treasure Seeker away from another female Dictator.","Now, Demon Desire could not find the chance to ask Lin Yuan about trading with him.","There was no way that Evil Source was going to give up.","Regardless of who ended up winning, the two Dictators were already in conflict.","Dictator Eternal Source, Vine Source, and Mist Source would not be able to keep themselves excluded.","There was no longer any opportunity for her to contribute. If she stayed there, she could not obtain any practical benefits.","With that thought, Demon Desire stood with resignation and left Marsh East Palace.","At that moment, Demon Desire learned that in order to gain the respect of others, one needed to possess authority. The only way to possess authority was to do whatever she could to increase her power.","Before Demon Desire left, she held onto the hope that Treasure Seeker would ask her to stay.","But in the end, he did not even spare her a thought.","When Demon Desire left, she took all her follower Apostles.","This exit did not attract the attention of anyone as all eyes were on Lin Yuan in his merman form.","The Fish World Sea Trump Card on his waist sensed the overwhelming mermaid emperor bloodline power flowing from Lin Yuan, and the image of a reef appeared under Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan did not waste any words and shot Evil Source a provoking expression before he raised his finger and pointed it at Everything, who was currently at a disadvantage.","Concentrated faith power poured out from Lin Yuan’s body, which then into a roaring fountain of faith that crashed down on Everything.","In front of the entire crowd, Everything’s aura shot up. It reached intermediate and then advanced Turning Wheel Realm. Even when it reached the barrier of advanced Turning Wheel Realm, the aura did not seem like it was going to be stopped.","When Everything’s aura reached pinnacle Turning Wheel Realm, uncontrollable shock spread across Mountain Ridge Source, Carnage Source, and Hornless Dragon Source’s faces.","Frankly, by the time Lin Yuan boosted Everything to advanced Turning Wheel Realm, Mountain Ridge Source, Hornless Dragon Source, and Carnage Source knew that if they were the ones taking on Lin Yuan, they would have already lost.","Although they also possessed a similar book that Evil Source had, they would still be helpless.","Although strengthening subordinates was Evil Source’s strong suit, she was not much more capable than the three of them.","Thus, Evil Source should also be aware that she had already lost even though Everything and Mite Thread had not launched a single attack at each other yet.","This realization was clear enough from Evil Source’s face.","However, Lin Yuan did not stop at boosting Everything to advanced Turning Wheel Realm and continued to boost her to pinnacle Turning Wheel Realm.","When Everything reached pinnacle Turning Wheel Realm, Mountain Ridge Source, Carnage Source, Hornless Dragon Source, and Evil Source could not help but admit that Lin Yuan was indeed stronger than them.","Furthermore, he was not going to stop at pinnacle Turning Wheel Realm. Everything even went on to subtly break through to the Samsara Realm.","If not for the fact that Everything’s source totem had not changed, the aura that exploded forth from Everything would already be comparable to that of a Samsara Realm Dictator.","Lin Yuan only stopped boosting Everything at that point.","After such a long time, Everything finally possessed an ocean of power again. She was almost drunk on this feeling.","Lin Yuan, to whom she was loyal, was in the middle of a battle with Evil Source.","Everything turned her eyes and body to Lin Yuan as she bowed.","“It’s all my fault! My body can’t accept any more of your power!”","Everything’s words caused all four Dictators who were present and had the word ‘source’ in their names to stare at Lin Yuan with astonishment."]},{"number":2294,"title":"Chapter 2294 Evil Source’s Terror!","paragraphs":["2294 Evil Source’s Terror!","Both of Evil Source’s faces had the same stern expression.","Mountain Ridge Source, Hornless Dragon Source, and Carnage Source were glad that they had chosen to side with Lin Yuan.","Evil Source must be regretting starting a fight with Lin Yuan!","Yet, there was no place where one could go to buy a cure for regret. Now that Lin Yuan’s power exceeded Evil Source’s power by such a great extent, there was no way that Evil Source would be able to back out.","There was actually no point in continuing this fight.","But given Evil Source’s temperament and character, she was going to see it through to the end, even though she knew that this could only end in defeat.","Thus, there was no other result waiting for Mite Thread other than death.","As Mountain Ridge Source, Hornless Dragon Source, and Carnage Source looked at Everything, who had just barely reached the Samsara Realm, they realized that Lin Yuan might be able to boost them as well. What kind of level would they reach if he did boost them?","Could he be able to boost a regular Samsara Realm Dictator to advanced Samsara Realm at the very least?","The more they thought about Lin Yuan’s ability, the more frightened the three of them were. They decided that regardless of who they ended up making enemies out of, they would become Lin Yuan’s allies.","The man who understands the situation is a wise man.","Although Evil Source had an arrogant, evil, and frigid aura, she had to keep her tail between her legs before becoming a Samsara Realm Dictator. She would never dare to act as recklessly as she did now.","She had been insulted and abused countless times when she had been an Apostle. Thus, she would definitely eventually still try to mend her relationship with Lin Yuan.","Those who were inflexible would not be able to survive in an environment where the law of the jungle prevailed, much less become a top expert.","However, after one had spent thousands of years struggling to climb up from the mud to reach the clouds, it would be difficult for them to stomach having to return to the mud.","The consequence that Evil Source had to face was a very good warning to Carnage Source, Mountain Ridge Source, and Hornless Dragon Source. This was the consequence of making an enemy out of Lin Yuan!","The truth was indeed as the three of them had expected. Evil Source clearly sensed that she could not beat Lin Yuan.","She did not call for a stop to the fight and bet, but she did not continue boosting Mite Thread either.","If she continued to boost Mite Thread, it would be a joke when compared to Everything, who Lin Yuan had boosted.","Evil Source only chose to continue for the sake of her pride.","Thus, the best plan was to stop boosting Mite Thread and allow her to be killed by Everything. This way, she would also be allowing Lin Yuan to win.","Mite Thread paused for a moment as she could not sense herself being boosted by Evil Source any longer. It did not take long for her to realize that Evil Source had just abandoned her.","Given the circumstances, there was no way that she would be able to continue living. All she could do was do her best to preserve Evil Source’s pride with her death. This was the only way that Evil Source would be willing to bring up her offspring.","Lifeforms had the primal desire to pass on their bloodline.","Mite Thread knew that if she did not do as Evil Source wanted, she would end up killed by Evil Source even if she did not die by Everything’s hands. If that happened, Evil Source would also end up slaughtering her offspring.","Mite Thread attacked Everything.","Everything looked at Mite Thread, who clearly knew that she had no chance of winning but was still charging forward, and her expression morphed into one of sorrow and relief.","She was relieved that she had been lucky enough to meet Lin Yuan and sorrowful that Mite Thread still had to be used as a tool by others who had no control over her life or death despite being a Turning Wheel Realm Dictator. In this way, she was no different from an Apostle.","Mite Thread ended up in such a sorry state because she had chosen to become loyal to the wrong person.","No matter how much Everything sympathized with Mite Thread, she did not show mercy.","In this fight against Mite Thread, she represented Lin Yuan. If she showed mercy, she would be humiliating Lin Yuan.","Everything understood this and started moving all ten of her ribbons with the power of a Samsara Realm Dictator.","Due to the difference in their power level, Everything did not have to trigger her source totem’s ability.","The bells on the ends of the ribbons started to spin and kicked up ten enormous vortexes.","As the ten vortexes crisscrossed, all of the transparent threads in the sky were shredded while the ten silver bells slammed into Mite Thread’s body.","The ringing of the bells signaled the end of Mite Thread’s life.","With one attack, Everything defeated her opponent and won the bet for Lin Yuan.","According to the rules of the marsh world, the winning side could take the initiative to obtain the spoils they had won.","Everything did not immediately return to Lin Yuan’s side. Instead, she walked through the air over to Evil Source and reached out her hand.","Evil Source had lost all of her formidability and no longer had a shred of pride to stand on.","After looking deeply into Everything’s eyes for a moment, Evil Source eventually handed over the book and dark green gem to Everything.","A million different thoughts coursed through Evil Source’s head during this exchange.","She had considered the option of killing Everything and then taking Lin Yuan on directly.","But if she did this, she would end up paying a much heavier price.","Furthermore, there was already no use in her regretting.","After basking in power and status for a long time, she was even more afraid of death now than when she had been a nobody.","As such, the lunatic Evil Source fell quiet and was calm.","Truthfully, Lin Yuan had been pinched by nervousness when Everything went over to Evil Source to ask for the spoils of her victory.","If Evil Source could not stand the provocation and attacked, he would have no choice but to use Begin Lady to handle the situation. But this would expose him instantly, and all the hard work he had put into keeping up his disguise would have been for nothing.","Luckily, Evil Source had managed to control herself.","As he looked at the Endless Gem and Green Field Secret Treasure, Volume 4, Sky High that Everything had handed him, Lin Yuan immediately stored them away in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","During this time, Lin Yuan decided to shock Evil Source again.","He decided to use some of the root power that Morbius had just recovered and removed Evil Source’s soul branding on the Green Field Secret Treasure, Volume 4, Sky High right in front of her.","A horrible scream did not even have the time to be ripped from Evil Source’s throat before it died between her lips.","Evil Source forcefully suppressed the agony in her soul.","Previously, she had only been fearful of Lin Yuan. But now, she was terror-stricken."]},{"number":2295,"title":"Chapter 2295 Sleeping Morbius!","paragraphs":["2295 Sleeping Morbius!","Evil Source would never have expected Lin Yuan to be able to remove her soul branding on the book.","She had only managed to place the soul branding on the book after thousands of years of slow and hard work. Even she would have struggled to remove it.","Evil Source had been waiting for Lin Yuan to ask her about the soul branding. When that happened, she would be able to take Lin Yuan with her behind closed doors to speak to him in either a humble voice or a pleading one when she requested to work together.","However, reality had floored her, and Lin Yuan had not given her a chance to do any of that.","Evil Source could be certain that not even Eternal Source could forcefully remove a soul branding!","Evil Source was terrified that Lin Yuan would come after her in the future. He even had the power to steal her book, which meant that he was more than capable of suppressing and keeping her down. How could she hope to compete with him?","Evil Source had no clue that none of Lin Yuan’s thoughts were about her. This was because Lin Yuan had sensed that the Secret of the Dead, Volume 5, Sinking Song in the fountain of faith in his divine kingdom had expressed the desire to fuse with the Green Field Secret Treasure, Volume 4, Sky High.","It was as though these two items from the dimensional world, which were clearly different, were actually part of the same entity.","The strange fight between Lin Yuan and Evil Source had come to an end by such a strange and quiet method.","Mountain Ridge Source, Hornless Dragon Source, and Carnage Source shared a look. They could tell from Evil Source’s state and expression that she no longer had any desire to continue fighting with Lin Yuan.","Thus, as long as Lin Yuan did not decide to pursue the matter, it would come to an end.","All three of them were praying that Lin Yuan left the matter where it was. Otherwise, their days of peace would be no more.","After Lin Yuan recalled the faith power from Everything’s body, he put an end to his fusion with Dark Blue.","Lin Yuan’s mind was fully preoccupied with the Endless Gem and two books. He was no longer interested in wasting any more time here.","Hence, he prepared to leave and return to his room where he could research the two books, and Morbius could unlock Green Vine after it absorbed the new Endless Gem.","Lin Yuan was curious about what Green Vine’s five abilities would be when it evolved from Silver to Sovereign.","Green Vine was already Lin Yuan’s strongest fey. Once it was unlocked, his overall power would be greatly increased.","“I don’t have any more interest in participating in the Banquet of Everything. If you have any issues, you can take them up with East Glow, and he will relay the message to me!”","No one tried to stop Lin Yuan from leaving.","If Lin Yuan told the four Dictators with the word ‘source’ at the back of their names to relay their messages to him through East Glow, they would definitely think of him as extremely rude.","But now that he had demonstrated his power, no one thought that way.","Return to Ruins and Carnage Source were both planning on seeking him out privately.","Previously, Pregnant Poison also had the same intention.","When Evil Source and Lin Yuan seemed to be evenly matched, Pregnant Poison did not have the courage to try to switch her allegiance.","But now that Lin Yuan had defeated Evil Source—as long as Lin Yuan agreed to her request to join him—there was no way that Evil Source would come after her for fear of offending Lin Yuan again.","Pregnant Poison was glad that she had not been picked to participate in the battle.","If Evil Source had picked her to represent her, she would have met the same end that Mite Thread had.","Mite Thread’s death had caused Pregnant Poison’s heart to sink.","If she did not sneak away now, there was a high chance that Evil Source would vent her frustration on her.","This was because she was the one who had told Evil Source about the news. Evil Source would never have come personally if Pregnant Poison had not made Evil Source aware.","Thus, she was also on the express lane to her death.","Before she was found by Evil Source and found herself on the business end of Evil Source’s fury, the only way she could save herself was to join Lin Yuan’s camp.","With this thought, Pregnant Poison immediately marched toward Marsh East Palace in the hopes that she would be able to bump into Lin Yuan before he reached his room.","After Everything killed Mite Thread, Lin Yuan did not instruct her to take Everything’s source totem. This was his way of giving Evil Source an excuse to meet with him.","If Evil Source dutifully handed Mite Thread’s source totem to him, it meant that she had acknowledged that he was superior and that there would no longer be any trouble from her.","If Evil Source did not do that, Lin Yuan would have to make arrangements as soon as possible.","It appeared that he had boosted Everything to easily win the bet with Evil Source. But in actuality, he did not have enough power stocked up to be Evil Source’s match.","Moreover, Lin Yuan could tell from Mountain Ridge Source, Carnage Source, and Hornless Dragon Source’s gazes during his fight with Evil Source that none of them wanted him to battle Evil Source.","Hence, there was no guarantee that the three of them would choose to side with him when he fought against Evil Source.","Lin Yuan had not come to the marsh world to disrupt the established balance but to continuously develop and store up his strength. His eventual goal was to link all the creatures of the marsh world together.","Otherwise, even if he truly managed to become ruler of the marsh world, he would not have enough subordinates to help him keep the marsh world in check.","After entering the main hall, Lin Yuan forbade anyone from following and even left White Speak at the door.","As he sat on the main seat of the main hall, Lin Yuan said softly, “Begin Lady, Celestial Sight, you will have to remain in the outside world for the next few days.”","Lin Yuan did not tell Begin Lady and Celestial Sight why they had to remain in the outside world, and neither of them asked more questions. They had the utmost trust in Lin Yuan and knew that he had to have his reasons.","Begin Lady and Celestial Sight materialized.","Begin Lady had been hibernating in the Element Well of late and had slowly stabilized itself as it constantly absorbed a large amount of pure earth- and water-elemental power and spirit qi.","Begin Lady’s power had skyrocketed, and it felt that Lin Yuan’s mysterious space had to be heaven for faeries.","Although Lin Yuan had let both of them into the Spirit Lock spatial zone, they had no clue of Morbius’ existence.","Although Lin Yuan trusted Begin Lady and Celestial Sight, he did not intend to tell them.","Lin Yuan placed the Endless Gem he had just won in one of the divots on Morbius, and the latter immediately locked the new Endless Gem in place.","Lin Yuan heard Morbius’ voice in his head. “Partner, once I absorb this Endless Gem, the Spirit Lock spatial zone will be locked for a longer time, and I will also go to sleep.”"]},{"number":2296,"title":"Chapter 2296 Triggered Memory!","paragraphs":["2296 Triggered Memory!","At this point, Morbius’ voice took on one of its rare bouts of excitement. “All of the Endless Gems in the marsh world have been combined. Once I wake up, the ancient tree on the Pure Land of Bliss that came from the previous Endless Gem will definitely transform. I have a feeling that it will become a being similar to a fey!”","Lin Yuan was shocked.","After he gained more experience and came into contact with items such as the dimensional treasures and Endless Gems, he felt that there were no obvious fences between the main world and dimensional worlds.","Humans could live in the marsh world, and the regular people Lin Yuan had brought over were the best proof.","Every time a dimensional rift opened in the main world, the dimensional lifeforms would pour into the main world and begin their slaughter. Without interference from strong feys and spirit qi professionals, the dimensional lifeforms would have continued living.","Source-type power did not come from the dimensional worlds. It could be created by the dimensional lifeforms themselves, just like faith power was.","Lin Yuan’s mind exploded.","The Class 6 dimensional rifts could link the main world and dimensional worlds by folding space.","Could a change take place that allowed the folded space to fuse the main and dimensional worlds together until they became one?","Lin Yuan did not know that his thoughts had given Morbius an idea. But no matter how hard it thought, it could not pull the idea fully together.","Each time Morbius’ grade was increased, it would regain more of its memories. It had no idea if the memory related to Lin Yuan’s new theory would be retrieved the next time it increased its grade.","After Morbius fell asleep, Lin Yuan said to Green Vine, who was standing next to him, “In a few days, you will be able to become stronger!”","As a fey that had been spirit locked by Morbius, Green Vine understood what Lin Yuan meant.","There was no fey that was not happy at the prospect of becoming stronger.","Due to the spirit lock, not even Green Vine knew what abilities it had when it evolved from Silver to Sovereign.","Green Vine also wanted to have more combat techniques.","Lin Yuan had not been sitting for long before White Speak walked in and bowed before it said, “Lord Lin Yuan, Dictator Pregnant Poison requests to meet with you!”","After passing on the message, White Speak added, “Dictator Pregnant Poison is Dictator Evil Source’s subordinate. According to Everything, Dictator Pregnant Poison is extremely selfish and cruel but also intelligent. Would you like to meet with her?”","White Speak abhorred Pregnant Poison.","Lin Yuan had a grudge against Evil Source. One did not have to think hard to see an issue with Pregnant Poison requesting to meet with Lin Yuan.","Pregnant Poison could have come on Evil Source’s behalf. Lin Yuan was not even obligated to meet with the defeated Evil Source, so it would be madness for her to still send a subordinate to meet with him at this time.","If Pregnant Poison had not come on Evil Source’s behalf, but for herself, it meant that she had betrayed Evil Source.","In a place like the marsh world where faith power held everything together, betrayal was an unforgivable crime!","Lin Yuan was slightly surprised as he could not think of a reason Pregnant Poison would come to see him. He had no ties with her.","However, he remembered how she had hidden in the shadows of the Banquet of Everything and only exposed herself for the sake of obtaining the source fruits.","It was likely that she had come to see him. With this thought, Lin Yuan’s lips curled upward.","He did not care about her goal.","The way he saw it, Pregnant Poison was a large gift basket of faith power.","He did not care if she wanted to become his follower. With her strong prioritization of profits, she would only ever be used as one of his weapons and not receive any positions of management.","There was no reason for him to turn away a willing weapon.","Before he had fought with Evil Source, Lin Yuan would have considered her feelings. But now that he had shaken her to the core and taken over the treasure that represented her authority, she would turn a blind eye even if she was truly enraged after hearing the news.","“Let her in. When you bring her in, bring East Glow and Everything in too.”","After Lin Yuan was done giving White Speak instructions, East Glow hastily walked in.","Frankly, Pregnant Poison had sought out East Glow first to ask him to relay the message. But East Glow had not immediately gone to tell Lin Yuan but told White Speak of the news first so that White Speak could be the one to tell Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan cared so much about White Speak that East Glow knew that he would only ever be White Speak’s assistant despite becoming a Dictator. As its direct superior, it was only right that he established a good relationship with White Speak.","East Glow’s actions left a positive impression on White Speak.","White Speak had yet to become a Dictator, yet East Glow was treating it in such a way. White Speak was grateful to East Glow for this.","There was no question that White Speak was closer to East Glow than it was to Everything.","The only reason that East Glow had come in with news was that Return to Ruins had also come to request to speak with Lin Yuan.","This matter involved the subjugation of a Turning Wheel Realm Dictator, so East Glow felt that it was imperative that Lin Yuan was made aware of this.","Furthermore, Return to Ruins had already publicly declared his willingness to become loyal to Lin Yuan.","If that were the case, there was a high chance that Return to Ruins would become his colleague in the future.","East Glow badly wanted to leave a good impression on a stronger colleague as it would help them to get along better in the future.","After spending so much time in Marsh East Palace, East Glow knew how to socialize and create connections.","He also knew the consequences of stabbing someone in the back after leaving an impression.","No matter how good of a temper Lin Yuan had, he had to do all he could to put his best foot forward if he wanted to attain rewards from Lin Yuan in the long run.","After hearing East Glow’s message, Lin Yuan said to White Speak, “You were hurt by Prayer Glow, who was Return to Ruins’ subordinate. When Return to Ruins enters, you can decide what to do with him.”","White Speak hurriedly shook its head and said, “Prayer Glow acted independently of Dictator Return to Ruins. He only represented himself. Moreover, you already had Lordess Begin Lady kill Prayer Glow. I have no grudges with Dictator Return to Ruins. If he wants to become loyal to you, he can also become my assistant. I will consider myself lucky if that happens!”","East Glow never expected such history between White Speak and Return to Ruins!"]},{"number":2297,"title":"Chapter 2297 Her Brain Turns Quickly!","paragraphs":["2297 Her Brain Turns Quickly!","Normally, Dictators or Apostles who were beloved by a powerful being were arrogant. This was a natural progression, and there was no way to avoid it!","However, it was clear that White Speak was not affected by this and was well aware of its position. It was no wonder that Lin Yuan thought so highly of it!","East Glow intended to properly learn from White Speak when it came to this.","Lin Yuan nodded slightly when he heard this.","White Speak and East Glow immediately moved to lead Pregnant Poison and Return to Ruins in order to meet Lin Yuan. It did not take long for them to enter the main hall.","Although Return to Ruins had chosen to become loyal to Lin Yuan and was prepared to bow to him, he did not expect Pregnant Poison to immediately fall to the ground and say in a pitifully sweet voice, “I have admired your majesty for a long time, and I want to serve you! I hope you will take me in and give me the chance to do so!”","Everything was not at all surprised by Pregnant Poison’s reaction. This fit perfectly with her idea of who Pregnant Poison was.","If Lin Yuan did not agree, she would not hesitate to do anything.","There were many Dictators who were unwilling to do such a thing even if their life was at stake.","But it had to be said that Pregnant Poison’s actions had brought her significant benefits. Otherwise, she would never have been taken in by Evil Source.","Return to Ruins looked at the seemingly pitiful Pregnant Poison with shock.","What is going on? Wasn’t Pregnant Poison loyal to Dictator Evil Source? Could she want to jump over to Lord Ten Thousand Source’s ship now that Evil Source had lost her authority?","If Evil Source found out about how Pregnant Poison was lowering herself, she would immediately reduce Pregnant Poison to ashes.","Pregnant Poison sure is daring! Could she be that confident that Lord Ten Thousand Source will take her in? She is gambling on her life! As much as Pregnant Poison wants to switch allegiances, she should not play with her life.","But it did not take long for Return to Ruins to figure it out.","Evil Source had come because of Tyrant Lizard, while Freezing Ember Hornless Dragon Source had come because of Freezing Ember and Frost Cold. They had come because they had heard of news pertaining to Lin Yuan.","Thus, Evil Source had actually been lured here by Pregnant Poison.","Given Evil Source’s recent behavior and temper, she likely placed all the blame on Pregnant Poison.","Pregnant Poison was doing this for self-preservation.","Return to Ruins was still shocked. But this time, he was not shocked by Pregnant Poison’s actions but by her brain. Her brain sure turned quickly!","If her brain had turned any slower and she had not immediately come to seek Lin Yuan out, Evil Source might have already killed her.","When Lin Yuan did not respond to Pregnant Poison, Return to Ruins learned from Pregnant Poison and went down on one knee.","If Return to Ruins had come on his own, he would never have done such a thing.","But now that he had an example in front of him, he was going to learn from it. He could do at least this much.","Pregnant Poison was waiting for Lin Yuan’s response. How Lin Yuan reacted would determine whether she lived or died.","However, she had still not received any response from Lin Yuan, and now came another competitor in the form of Return to Ruins.","Pregnant Poison had already made many nasty remarks about Return to Ruins to herself.","During this time, the expression on her face became increasingly pitiful.","Everything looked at Pregnant Poison with disdain. No one knew better than Everything what kind of character Pregnant Poison had.","Everything clearly remembered that the first Dictator she had encountered when she arrived at Marsh Abyss was Pregnant Poison.","At that time, Pregnant Poison had addressed her as ‘sister’, but only she knew of the vile thoughts that she was harboring.","Because of the way that Pregnant Poison addressed her, Everything treated her as family and did not put her guard up.","But there were numerous occasions that Pregnant Poison had forced her into danger for the sake of her own profits. These incidents had almost caused Everything to get on the wrong side of a powerful enemy.","Ever since then, Everything saw Pregnant Poison for who she truly was and decided to part ways.","After that happened, Pregnant Poison had sought her out to apologize, and she had accepted the apology. But eventually, she ended up being used by Pregnant Poison again.","Since she knew Pregnant Poison well, Everything did not believe that Pregnant Poison truly wanted to serve Lin Yuan. It was just like how Pregnant Poison had not sincerely served Evil Source.","However, Everything did not say anything.","Lin Yuan was more powerful than Pregnant Poison. With such a powerful source of support, someone as obsessed with profits as Pregnant Poison would definitely do all she could to try to make him happy.","During that time, Pregnant Poison would be much more useful than East Glow.","If Everything knew what kind of character Pregnant Poison had, there would be no way that Lin Yuan was ignorant of the truth.","Everything was glad that Lin Yuan had found her first.","Due to many issues, Second Born could not seek her out with as much fervor as she wanted.","Although Second Born had become a Dictator and her nature made her betray Everything, there was no way that she would be willing to cut off her ties of kinship with First Born and Third Born.","However, the same did not go for Pregnant Poison.","If Lin Yuan had not found her, she would have continued hiding.","Once the Banquet of Everything ended, Pregnant Poison would have sniffed her out. If that had happened, she would have eventually become a source totem in Pregnant Poison’s collection.","This was the only reason that Pregnant Poison could have come to the Banquet of Everything.","White Speak did not harp on the fact that Prayer Glow had acted in Return to Ruins’ name and almost killed it.","But there were still some things that Lin Yuan needed to remind Return to Ruins.","“Return to Ruins, do you remember teaching an Apostle named Prayer Glow?”","Return to Ruins’ expression froze.","Return to Ruins picked an Apostle every once in a while and guided them. He had taught at least 3,000 Apostles in his time, and there was no way that he could remember all of their names.","Return to Ruins did not understand why a Samsara Realm Dictator like Lin Yuan cared about a weak Apostle called Prayer Glow.","Could there be some ties between Prayer Glow and Lord Ten Thousand Source? If that’s the case, can I leverage the ties that Prayer Glow established?","Once this idea was formed, Return to Ruins pushed it out of his mind.","Return to Ruins did not believe that the Apostle by the name of Prayer Glow had the right or the ability to offend Lin Yuan.","But it was a fact that he had no memory of Prayer Glow. Since he could not remember, Return to Ruins dared not speak recklessly either.","“Lord Ten Thousand Source, I do have the habit of teaching Apostles, but I have taught at least 3,000 to 4,000 of them in my lifetime. Besides a few special ones who made an impression on me, I wouldn’t be able to recognize the rest even if they appeared in front of me again. None of the Apostles in my memory are called Prayer Glow.”"]},{"number":2298,"title":"Chapter 2298 Evil Source’s Visit!","paragraphs":["2298 Evil Source’s Visit!","Return to Ruins’ words made Lin Yuan decide to take him in.","If Return to Ruins knew Prayer Glow, he would have to shoulder the consequences.","Regardless of whether White Speak wanted to pursue the matter, White Speak was willing to die for Lin Yuan. There was no way that Lin Yuan could leave the matter alone!","While Return to Ruins was speaking, Lin Yuan took out a ball of five-colored light.","“This is Prayer Glow’s source totem. You should be glad you didn’t leave your brand on Prayer Glow. Go, you will stay with White Speak from now on and listen to its instructions. You will receive a wage of big and small source fruits monthly.”","Lin Yuan offered the big and small source fruits because he was well aware that Return to Ruins had a reason for becoming loyal to him.","Lin Yuan was never stingy when it came to his subordinates. However, the prerequisite was that they had to work well and prove their value.","Everything, East Glow, and Return to Ruins were all foundational stones that Lin Yuan needed to secure his position in the marsh world.","Return to Ruins was both afraid and excited when he heard what Lin Yuan said, and he cursed Prayer Glow repeatedly to himself.","He did not even know if he had truly taught Prayer Glow in the past or if Prayer Glow had used his name and gone around lying!","Pregnant Poison was beside herself with anxiousness.","She had expressed her loyalty to Lin Yuan first. So why did Lin Yuan address Return to Ruins first while ignoring her?","Was Lin Yuan planning on rejecting her? If that happened, she would be done for!","Just as Pregnant Poison was so panicked that she almost crumpled in her kneeling stance, she saw Lin Yuan turn his eyes onto her.","When she looked into his clear and deep eyes, Pregnant Poison felt as though she was drowning.","Lin Yuan looked at Pregnant Poison with amusement. “Does Evil Source know that you’re here?”","Her actions had defied Lin Yuan’s understanding of the structure of the marsh world.","It was definitely a smart choice on Pregnant Poison’s part to seek him out immediately after the fight ended. It was a decision made out of self-preservation.","However, this was also a signal to Lin Yuan that Pregnant Poison did not have a loyal bone in her body. If she could find it in herself to betray Evil Source, she could betray him as well.","There was no way he could rely on someone like this. She could not even be depended on as a weapon.","But ever since gaining higher status, Lin Yuan understood that no one was useless. What mattered was how that person was used.","Pregnant Poison’s attempts to curry favor informed Lin Yuan that as long as he remained sufficiently powerful, she would be willing to do anything he asked.","She could take over the tasks that needed a Dictator’s power to be done but that the other Dictators were unwilling to do.","Lin Yuan was not even thinking about whether she would secretly cause trouble because, as things stood, he was the only one who could take her in.","If he did not accept her and Evil Source found out about what she had done, there was no way she would allow Pregnant Poison to continue living.","Now that there were no longer any roads for her to escape into, Pregnant Poison could only do her best to prove her worth.","When she heard Lin Yuan’s question, Pregnant Poison replied fearfully, “Dictator Evil Source doesn’t know I came to see you. I hope you’ll accept my loyalty! I’m willing to do anything!”","Lin Yuan did not give her any respite and said with a smile, “Aren’t you afraid that Evil Source will come to me asking for you? You are still her follower. I’m sure you know better than me what will happen when she learns that you’re trying to jump ship!”","The amusement in Lin Yuan’s voice made Pregnant Poison aware that her life was not worth anything to him. She was no different from a toy to him.","After this feeling appeared, Pregnant Poison’s already shaky sense of security diminished further.","At that moment, Green Vine said softly, “Evil Source is already outside the door and is asking to meet with you. Are you willing to see her?”","Lin Yuan had already expected that Evil Source would come to see him immediately after the fight.","Although Evil Source had a perverse personality and never acted according to logic, she still knew where the lines were. Otherwise, she would not have easily handed over the Endless Gem and book.","If Evil Source wanted to retain her position amongst the seven figures, the most important thing she needed to do was to keep from making an enemy out of Lin Yuan and make him an ally instead.","Since she had lost the treasured book, the balance between the seven figures had been broken.","Furthermore, the other six figures knew that he had fought with her.","In order to build ties with him, there was no way they would make life easy for Evil Source.","As long as Evil Source was intelligent, she would know that the best way out would be to become allies with Lin Yuan.","Evil Source had come quickly enough. If she had brought Mite Thread’s source totem with her, Lin Yuan would be willing to give her a chance.","It went without saying that she would have to offer a suitable price first.","Green Vine’s words caused Pregnant Poison to start trembling.","Pregnant Poison would be reduced to a puddle of mangled flesh if Evil Source saw her kneeling there and lost her temper.","Pregnant Poison prayed that Lin Yuan would not allow Evil Source to enter.","But what Lin Yuan said burned up Pregnant Poison’s last line of defense in her heart.","“Return to Ruins, go and bring Evil Source in.”","Lin Yuan had not accepted Pregnant Poison yet because he wanted to wait and see how much more terrified and pressured Pregnant Poison would feel once Evil Source arrived. This was the only way she would work for him dutifully in the future.","Furthermore, Pregnant Poison was also Lin Yuan’s test for Evil Source. He would only be willing to give her a chance if she managed to stomach Pregnant Poison’s betrayal.","If Evil Source could not control her emotions and went mad, there was no way that Lin Yuan would associate with her in any way.","If Evil Source could not control her emotions, she would eventually become a danger. Lin Yuan would have to find a way to work with the other Samsara Realm Dictators to eliminate her.","As long as he was sufficiently sincere, there was no way that the other six figures would turn him down.","Now that he possessed the Green Field Secret Treasure, Volume 4, Sky High, he had a perfectly legitimate reason to take Evil Source’s place, and no one would be affected by the change.","When Lin YUan saw how Carnage Source, Mountain Ridge Source, and Hornless Dragon Source treated Evil Source, he knew she was not famed for her interpersonal skills.","Lin Yuan did not want to make a big deal out of this. All he wanted to do was quietly run up a fortune in the marsh world.","He could only hope that Evil Source did not charge toward death herself."]},{"number":2299,"title":"Chapter 2299 An Exchange of Blows May Lead to Friendship!","paragraphs":["2299 An Exchange of Blows May Lead to Friendship!","Evil Source never dreamed that such a day would befall her. She had never been so humiliated ever since she obtained the Green Field Secret Treasure.","If she had not come, she would not have had to suffer through all of this.","She had come because she had heard the report from Pregnant Poison.","Evil Source dared not harbor any hate for Lin Yuan.","The culture of the marsh world was always one where the strong devoured the weak, and the weak could not utter a single complaint.","Evil Source’s hatred was directed at Pregnant Poison. Not only had Pregnant Poison caused her to be humiliated and lose her treasure in the process, but she had even had the audacity to go running to Lin Yuan.","Evil Source did not have to think far to determine Pregnant Poison’s goal.","Evil Source had been confident that Lin Yuan would see her. Otherwise, he would have taken Mite Thread’s source totem with him when he left.","Evil Source forcefully suppressed her emotions as she was afraid that when she was led into the main hall and laid her eyes on Pregnant Poison, she would not be able to hold herself back from killing Pregnant Poison. If she attacked while in Lin Yuan’s presence, it would be seen as an insult to him.","Furthermore, Evil Source did not know whether Lin Yuan was going to accept Pregnant Poison. If he did take her in and she attacked her, she would be at odds with him.","She had even handed over the treasure that represented her status. There was no need to offend Lin Yuan over anything else.","But as willing as she was to take the humble stance, Evil Source hoped that Lin Yuan would not push it. Otherwise, she would find some way to retaliate and make his life miserable even if she did not clash with him directly.","Evil Source’s heart was heavy as she took the few short steps.","She was famed for acting however she pleased and could not remember the last time that she considered the feelings of another!","Soon after entering the main hall, Evil Source spotted Pregnant Poison kneeling on the ground.","Her anger flared, and she almost raised her left hand and swung it toward Pregnant Poison.","When she sensed the aura from Green Vine and the girl standing next to Lin Yuan, who had the power to take her on, Evil Source realized how strong Lin Yuan’s ability to boost Dictators was.","If he boosted this girl who was only slightly weaker than her, he might not have to attack personally, and this subordinate of his would be enough to keep her down.","Given the circumstances, Evil Source had no choice but to resign herself to reality and control her murderous rage toward Pregnant Source. This method also enabled Lin Yuan to see her attitude toward the matter.","“Ten Thousand Source, let me officially introduce myself. My name is Evil Source! We already established somewhat of a friendship by exchanging blows.”","Evil Source’s words caused East Glow and Everything who had heard of Evil Source’s mighty reputation to look shocked.","Pregnant Poison, who had been Evil Source’s subordinate for hundreds of years, widened her eyes to the point they almost fell out of their sockets. How could such words have come from Evil Source’s mouth?","Lin Yuan fixed his eyes on Evil Source and pursed his lips.","A Dictator who occupied such a high position in the marsh world was indeed far from simple!","When Evil Source had the upper hand, she could act deranged and recklessly. But she could restrain herself when she knew she had been bested. Not everyone could possess such a character.","Previously, when Evil Source used her hand to turn her head and swap her faces, she was just expressing her insanity. But at crucial times when she knew that she was at a disadvantage, she could humble herself. Lin Yuan did not believe that many people in positions of power could do the same.","Now that Evil Source recognized that she was at a disadvantage and wanted to form ties with him, Lin Yuan did not put on any airs.","“A friendship formed from exchanging blows! We are genuinely acquainted now!”","When Evil Source heard what Lin Yuan said, the way that she was looking at him changed.","Evil Source knew that she was not as magnanimous as Lin Yuan when she had the upper hand. Yet, he could accept her when he had the upper hand. This meant that he had a much better character than her!","Previously, Evil Source only hoped to connect with Lin Yuan. But now, she was truly interested in getting to know him.","“You mentioned an alliance. I would like to join it! Unlike Carnage Source, I’m not joining your alliance to trade for the big and small source fruits. I want to join because I want to be by your side!”","Evil Source’s words were only partially true.","Firstly, there was no way she was going to say no to the big and small source fruits.","She wanted to stay by Lin Yuan’s side so that the other six figures would not target her in a bid to curry favor with Lin Yuan in order to obtain the big and small source fruits.","Both of these were Evil Source’s goals.","But besides that, Evil Source did genuinely want to stay by Lin Yuan’s side.","Even if the other six decided to work with Lin Yuan, it would only be for the sake of profits. They would turn against him when he cut into their profits. In fact, being more familiar with each other, they might even team up to eliminate the wildcard that was Lin Yuan!","But Evil Source did not believe this was the case.","She always subscribed to the belief that in this world, only the capable were able to occupy positions of power.","Rather than sharing resources with the other six of them to form a bottleneck, it would be better if she struck out on her own.","Evil Source had always wanted to be the one to distinguish herself. But now, she had failed.","Evil Source would rather team up with Lin Yuan rather than Eternal Source, who was the water to her fire.","Regardless of whether Lin Yuan was willing to take her in today, the animosity between them would still decrease significantly.","When Lin Yuan saw the serious expression on Evil Source’s face, he realized that despite appearing to be off her rocker, Evil Source actually possessed an exceedingly calm heart.","This person would not make a good friend or foe. If they became friends, a person like this would not hesitate to betray him when substantial profits were offered. But as enemies, she would not be too prideful to tunnel underground to hide. Either way, a person like this did not fit with Lin Yuan’s goal of being in the marsh world.","Thus, Lin Yuan gently rapped the table with his finger and said, “You can’t stay by someone’s side just by talking. You have to show that you’re sincere. Give me all the faith power from the Dictators and Apostles who are loyal to you, and I’ll give you the chance to join the alliance. I will let the others know that you are a member of the alliance. But whether or not you’ll be able to stay by my side depends on how you act from now on.”","While he spoke, Lin Yuan did not break his gaze with Evil Source. He could see hesitation and rumination in her eyes.","He could be certain that she was not the kind to disregard her subordinates’ lives. This was evident from her attitude toward Mite Thread and Pregnant Poison."]},{"number":2300,"title":"Chapter 2300 Lin Yuan is Rich!","paragraphs":["2300 Lin Yuan is Rich!","Evil Source would not hesitate too long before she decided to trade the faith power of all the Dictators and Apostles under her for the sake of her own selfish reasons.","Evil Source still had her power. The other Apostles and Dictators would not be capable of saying no to her request.","Lin Yuan had made a promise to Evil Source. Once he received all the faith power of the Apostles and Dictators under her, he would let the other Dictators in the alliance know that she was part of the alliance.","This way, she would not be targeted by the other six.","Reality played out just as Lin Yuan expected.","Evil Source was silent for less than a minute before she nodded and said, “I can agree to your request. I will send all of the Dictators and Apostles under me to you within a month.”","While she spoke, Evil Source handed Mite Thread’s source totem to Lin Yuan.","“This is Mite Thread’s source totem. You forgot to take it with you, so I brought it to you!”","Lin Yuan gestured to Everything to receive Mite Thread’s source totem from Evil Source before he said with a smile, “You must have realized the distance between the two of us. This distance is mainly due to the difference in purity of our source-type powers and the overall quantity. You will be able to increase your power using pure source-type power.","“I’m sure you want to obtain the big and small source-type fruits from me but don’t know how to broach the subject. How about this? I’ll give you a chance. I need a large number of source totems, and it doesn’t matter if they are from Dictators or Apostles.","“For every Apostle’s source totem, you can obtain 200 small source fruits and 10 big small fruits. For every regular Dictator’s source totem, you can obtain 3,000 small source fruits and 200 big source fruits. For every Turning Wheel Realm Dictator’s source totem, you can obtain ten times the amount of a regular Dictator’s source totem.","“For every Samsara Realm Dictator’s source totem, you won’t be obtaining source fruits. I will inject 1,000 units of pure source-type units into your body directly. If you want to obtain source-type power, go and gather what I need!”","The effect that his words had on Evil Source was clear.","She could even trade for source-type power! If that were the case, the entire marsh world would become her hunting ground for the items that she could trade for source-type power. Given her power, it would be easy for her to trade for source-type power from Lin Yuan!","However, every network in the marsh world led back to her and the other six figures.","Even if she did not kill her own people while she was hunting, she could not avoid setting off the other six. Thus, she needed to find a way to cover her tracks and remain hidden.","Otherwise, she would find a way to pull some strings even if Eternal Source publicly stepped in to protect the Apostles she was targeting.","With this thought, Evil Source took out all of the source totems she had on hand.","She was not interested in the source totems of Apostles and gifted them all to her subordinates. As such, she only had 14 Turning Wheel Realm Dictators’ source totems on hand.","She did not have a single Samsara Realm Dictator’s source totem.","Once a Dictator reached the Samsara Realm, they rarely ever died during a fight and usually only departed the world when their life came to an end.","Although Evil Source was much stronger than regular Samsara Realm Dictators, but she was not willing to make such an enemy unless necessary.","In a fight with such an enemy, there was a very high chance that she would end up injured. Even if she attacked with full force, her opponent would be able to escape with ease.","It was likely that only Carnage Source and Dictator Eternal Source possessed the source totems of Samsara Realm Dictators.","Evil Source regretted giving away the source totems of Apostles because she saw them as worthless.","It was said that one small source fruit contained about 1/10 of 1 unit of source-type power while a big source fruit contained about 1/2 of 1 unit of source-type power.","The source totem of a Turning Wheel Realm Dictator could be traded for 30,000 small source fruits and 2,000 big source fruits. This would equate to 4,000 units of source-type power.","“I have 14 source totems from Turning Wheel Realm Dictators. This will allow me to trade for 56,000 units of source-type power. If I give them all to you, when can I obtain the big and small source fruits?”","Lin Yuan did not expect Evil Source to agree so readily.","Even if Lin Yuan made the army of Hundred Questions Beasts work overtime, it would take at least two months to produce such a large amount of big and small source fruits.","Morbius also happened to need about two months to set aside the root power needed to fuse the two Endless Gems.","“Come to Marsh East Palace two months later, and I’ll give you the big and small source fruits. At that time, I hope you’ll be able to summarize the 14 source totems’ origins. The resources without a known origin will only be worth half of the agreed-on big and small source fruits. Whether the trade goes through will be dependent on you.”","Lin Yuan’s expression did not change in the slightest when he spoke. Yet, he had just sealed a deal worth more than 50,000 units of pure source-type power.","This filled Evil Source with fear.","Even if she was completely drained at that moment, she would only be able to produce 30,000 units of source-type power at the most.","With that thought, a guess formed in Evil Source’s mind.","Could Ten Thousand Source have already broken through past the Samsara Realm and reached an even higher level? Is there truly a higher level above the Samsara Realm? In the thousands of years that I have been alive in the marsh world, I have never heard of such a thing!","Before Evil Source left Marsh East Palace, she glared at Pregnant Poison, and the latter trembled.","Evil Source no longer wanted Pregnant Poison dead as badly as she did previously.","In the few minutes she had spent with Lin Yuan, Evil Source understood that even if she became a Samsara Realm Dictator, she would still be pursuing power.","Power was everything. This fact had never changed.","It was just that she had been blinded by vanity and had forgotten this fact.","Once she obtained the 50,000 units of pure source-type power, her power would skyrocket.","She would not have to fear the other six even without the Green Field Secret Treasure.","With this thought, Evil Source’s back straightened again.","Evil Source spotted Carnage Source walking in the long corridor when she walked out of the main hall.","Evil Source scoffed and twisted her head as she said gruffly, “Carnage Source, where are you going in such a hurry?”","Carnage Source was in such a rush to express his congratulations to Lin Yuan and because he had heard that Evil Source had come to see Lin Yuan. Naturally, he wanted to see Evil Source embarrass herself.","Yet, before he arrived, Evil Source had walked out.","This did not seem right.","He wondered what Evil Source and Lin Yuan had discussed.","From Evil Source’s expression, she did not look to have sustained a blow. In fact, she was glowing.","Could it be that Evil Source has attracted ten Thousand Source? If that’s the case, I will have to keep my distance from Evil Source from now on!"]}]);
